window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":801,"title":"Chapter 801 - I Want All the Combat Skills","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Chu Ci sometimes used fencing to defend or attack during battle.","If Lin Yuan wanted to use the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass, he could not just learn how to fence.","Since Lin Yuan had transmigrated but still kept his memories from his previous life, he was no different from an original member of this world.","The history books about the Radiance Federation covered almost 2,000,000 years of history.","5,500 years ago, before spirit qi had appeared, humans had gained many combat skills.","These combat skills were the jewels of human intelligence that had been passed down through the generations.","After the Spirit Qi Awakening, spirit qi professionals had started battling with feys that they had formed contracts with and set aside their old combat skills.","In fact, many of the combat skills had been lost to time.","Still, the Hidden Moon Pavilion’s 67th to 82nd levels were filled with key battle skills and martial arts knowledge.","This knowledge had been stored in the Hidden Moon Pavilion, but almost no one retrieved and studied them.","However, Lin Yuan wanted this knowledge.","If he could combine all the martial arts skills, he would be able to form a powerful weapon when he paired them with Spirit Essence Explosion.","This weapon would significantly raise both Lin Yuan’s attack and defense capabilities.","That said, it was not easy to learn all 15 levels of knowledge. It would take slow and hard training.","After enough training in combat skills, the body’s muscles would be able to react on instinct.","To achieve this level of combat skills, Lin Yuan needed to train for at least a decade.","But now, with just two blades of Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass, Lin Yuan was confident that his body would be able to grasp the knowledge from all 15 levels.","His muscles would be able to absorb all 15 levels worth of combat skills, and he would be able to choose the best method to fight against his enemies.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to say that he was willing to use the two Law Crystals to trade for two Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass, the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine said, “If you would like the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine can give you two blades. We really hope to be able to trade for the Law Crystals with you this time.”","Lin Yuan was slightly shocked, but he immediately realized that the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass was not valuable to Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","It was just like how he could easily nurture the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Although he planned on using two Law Crystals to trade for two blades of Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass, now that the First Elder had said what he said, Lin Yuan did not need to use the two Law Crystals.","However, Lin Yuan still gave the First Elder what he wanted and tossed the two Law Crystals to the First Elder before saying, “The Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass is useful to me, and I can’t take them for nothing. Let’s trade two blades of Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass for one Law Crystal. The Li family can use Law Source Crystal fragments to trade for the other Law Crystal. You can decide how many Law Source Crystal fragments are worth the one Law Crystal and use this rate for future trades.”","The First Elder looked delighted when he heard Lin Yuan talk about future trades.","This opportunity was incredibly important to Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","The First Elder planned on discussing with the other main members of the Li family how many Law Source Crystals should be traded for the Law Crystal.","He also wanted to ask for Li Xuan’s opinion.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s biggest issue was that they lacked a thearch-class expert. However, they did have four pinnacle Myth III experts.","If they could obtain more Law Crystals from Lin Yuan in the future, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine would not have to worry about not having a thearch-class expert.","With a thearch-class expert, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine would be able to truly hold their heads up high in front of other top factions. They would not need to depend on dominating the avian-type fey market or always lower themselves before others.","This thought excited the First Elder the more he thought about it, and he decided that he would first store away the Law Crystals that they obtained this time.","They would not be used on the pinnacle Suzerain/Myth II feys.","He would wait until they had accumulated 10 Law Crystals before allowing the head of the family’s main fey, a pinnacle Suzerain/Myth III main phoenix-species fey, to try to see if it could overcome the Trial of World Creation to become a Creation Breed fey.","“My Lord, rest assured. We’ll definitely offer you an amount of Law Source Crystal fragments that you’ll be happy with. I will dispatch Young Master Xuan to deliver them to you,” said the First Elder.","Li Xuan froze when he heard the way that the First Elder addressed him.","The First Elder would always address him by his name or Little Xuan when he was in a good mood. He had never called Li Xuan ‘Young Master Xuan’.","This meant that Li Xuan’s position in his family had been acknowledged as a genuine Young Master of the young generation.","The First Elder was the second in command in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine behind Li Xuan’s grandfather. With the First Elder’s approval, it was possible for Li Xuan to immediately become the Young Leader when he returned home.","Li Xuan looked deeply into Lin Yuan’s eyes, and there was an ocean of gratitude and sincerity in his gaze.","After Lin Yuan settled the trades with Long Tu and the First Elder, they left.","Lin Yuan, Long Tao, and Li Xuan went to the House of Enviable Fragrance to have a meal together. Lin Yuan found out why Long Tao and Li Xuan had appeared at the Fey Observer Association together during the meal.","It was because Black had rejected Long Tao’s invitation. Hence, he had decided to invite Li Xuan, a support-type spirit qi professional, to join the Dragon Gate Guild Club’s main team.","Long Tao had planned on allowing Chen Hongfeng to become a member of the main team.","Unexpectedly, after Chu Ci had defeated Chen Hongfeng at the Allstar Match, he insisted on staying in the reserve team and training for a few more years. He would only join the main team after increasing his power.","This gave Long Tao a big headache because of next year’s Allstar Match.","After the meal, Lin Yuan returned to the mansion and saw Duan He accompanying Listen back to the mansion.","Lin Yuan rushed to Lin Yuan and gave him a Diamond fey storage box, and said, “Young Master, this is the earnings from the past week’s auction of the luxury items.”"]},{"number":802,"title":"Chapter 802 - Lin Yuans Feelings About Battle","paragraphs":["Listen held the Diamond fey storage box, his heart unable to rest at ease.","The earnings that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce had gained from the sale of luxury goods in the past week had already exceeded the amount of money that they had when they were at their prime in Indigo Azure City.","It still did not feel real to Listen that he had earned such an immense fortune on his own.","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched when he checked through the Diamond fey storage box that Listen had handed him.","He had only provided Listen with Spirit Craftsmen from Hu Quan’s Heavenly Craft Pavilion and some completely jade-textured wood fragments that had been stored away as garbage.","Lin Yuan had also given Listen some high-class luxury resources such as completely jade-textured wooden planks and heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls with external layers.","Hu Quan did not trust his subordinate Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen to create these luxury goods.","However, Hu Quan had been busy with the construction of Submerged Flood Dragon Lake and the basement and was unable to create high-class luxury goods.","Hence, Listen had been generating value out of the Return from Faraway Mansion’s garbage.","As he looked at the small pile of Radiance dollars in the Diamond fey storage box, Lin Yuan estimated that Listen had increased the value of the luxury goods by 50%.","This was Listen’s talent as a top businessman.","Lin Yuan gave Listen a thumb’s up and said, “Listen, you’re truly a genius at business.”","As Sky City expanded, Lin Yuan became busier and busier.","Lin Yuan used to pay some amount of attention to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s progress. But now, he had totally taken his hands off.","Thus, Lin Yuan did not suggest anything regarding the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s development.","Yet, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce had already progressed past Lin Yuan’s expectations.","Listen was excited by Lin Yuan’s praise. The weariness in his face dispersed and was replaced by passionate inspiration.","Listen had been working tirelessly for the past two months, and he slept only a maximum of five hours each night.","He had never forgotten about how Lin Yuan had started warring with the Zheng family because of him and how he had caused the death of two emperor-class experts outside Indigo Azure City.","Listen’s power was not strong, so all he could do was create more value for Lin Yuan by properly managing the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","He had now proven himself to Lin Yuan for the first time. After receiving Lin Yuan’s praise, he felt that all he had done over the last two months had been worth it.","Soon, Listen watched as Lin Yuan returned the Diamond fey storage box to him and said, “You should never keep Radiance dollars in a Diamond fey storage box when you’re expanding a faction. Take this hard-earned money of yours and use it as you see fit.","“Our deal was that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce would become a rising faction within half a year. But I think that you can make the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce into a business conglomerate. You might even be able to dominate a specific market with your own capabilities.","“With Sky City supporting you, you don’t need to worry about lacking power. Whether the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce can earn a solid position amongst the 50 major factions will be up to you.”","Listen’s eyes widened. He never imagined that Lin Yuan would have such high hopes for him.","With all of Lin Yuan’s hopes for him, Listen suddenly saw an even wider and more exhilarating path open up ahead of him.","Lin Yuan had said all that to Listen because he felt that Listen was capable and because he had been inspired by the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shine’s talk about the expansion of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Duan He stood next to Lin Yuan and watched his gaze. He suddenly felt that he respected Lin Yuan more and more.","It was not just Lin Yuan’s patterns or his determination in the face of his opponents that made Duan He respect him.","It was because of the 24 Hot Spring Snails that Lin Yuan had evolved for the Indigo Azure Guard.","After receiving compensation from the Indigo Azure Guard Captain, almost every Hot Spring Snail’s exclusive skill had become suitable for battle.","This meant that Lin Yuan had evolved the Hot Spring Snails to Elite/Epic.","This showed that Lin Yuan had a light that could illuminate the entire Radiance Federation in his heart.","As the disciple of the Moon Empress, the Radiance Federation was blessed to have such a light.","Duan He firmly believed that this light in Lin Yuan would be able to shine even brighter in the future.","He solemnly took out a Platinum fey storage box and gave it to Lin Yuan as he said, “Young Master, there are 500 Hot Spring Snails and 1,500 Law Source Crystals in this fey storage box. The Indigo Azure Guard Captain asked me to ask you for another deal.”","Lin Yuan received the Platinum fey storage box from Hu Quan and replied, “No problem. The current dimensional rift has reached its tail end. This is its most active and dangerous period. I will try my best to evolve the Hot Spring Snails quickly enough for them to be used in battle. Although the Hot Spring Snails are good at healing external injuries, they cannot replenish vitality well. For this deal, I will give the Indigo Azure Guard 30 Bronze/Epic quality Jasmine Lilies that will be able to work alongside the Hot Spring Snails to replenish the Indigo Azure Guards’ vitality.”","It was becoming increasingly easy for Lin Yuan to nurture high-quality Bronze feys.","But now that he had Brocade Zither to nurture Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, he no longer needed to nurture high-quality Bronze feys to trade for Law Crystals.","Lin Yuan only needed 50 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to trade for 1,500 Law Source Crystals.","It would only take Brocade Zither two days to produce 50 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Even though Lin Yuan was now a B-rank spirit qi professional, it would still take him close to four days to evolve 500 Bronze/Epic feys.","But as long as it was the Indigo Azure Guard who was approaching him, Lin Yuan would not reject him because he knew that his extra work would have a direct connection to the life of an Indigo Azure Guard.","He would be saving noble lives while earning resources at the same time.","The 30 Bronze/Epic Jasmine Lilies were a gesture on Lin Yuan’s part that was outside of the deal. He hoped that the noble lives that had to face disaster would be able to remain safe."]},{"number":803,"title":"Chapter 803 - Lin Yuan Definitely Wont Blame Chimey!","paragraphs":["When Duan He heard what Lin Yuan said, tears welled up in his eyes.","Duan He was born and bred in Indigo Azure City, but he was also a citizen of the Radiance Federation.","However, it was difficult for him to imagine that Lin Yuan would be willing to gift 30 Bronze/Epic Jasmine Lilies to Indigo Azure City to help them defend against the dimensional rift.","30 Bronze/Epic Jasmine Lilies made up a small fortune.","Calculating in terms of Radiance dollars, Lin Yuan had provided Indigo Azure City with 100,000,000 Radiance dollars worth of aid.","Lin Yuan returned to his room with the Platinum fey storage box and went into the Spirit Lock spatial zone to start evolving the Hot Spring Snails.","The moment Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he realized that he still had an important matter to attend to, which was talking to Chimey about the matter regarding the Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess.","Lin Yuan had never realized that Chimey, which had been by his side, would develop an idea like this. It had actually been live-streaming since they were back at the spirit lifeform store.","When Chimey had started live-streaming, Lin Yuan remembered that he had only given Genius and Chimey Star Web Cards for a few days.","It was not easy to start a live stream on Star Web. It would have been impossible with Chimey’s intelligence level at that time.","This meant that Chimey had to have had Genius’ help in order to start live streaming as Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess.","Lin Yuan suddenly realized why he always saw Chimey and Genius huddling together secretly. They would stick together in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree branches even when they were in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","They had to be studying how to live stream on Star Web.","The moment Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he saw the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope organizing the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Lin Yuan fed the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope a wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl every two days, and its powers had evolved from Gold I to Gold VII.","Its quality had been evolved from Flawless to Legend.","After experiencing the pure wind-type World Cleansing and being constantly nourished by pure spirit qi, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s fur had transformed from khaki to white.","Many light green patterns that were similar to that on the Celestine Elemental Shellfish had appeared on the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s fur.","These patterns were the product of the extremely high concentration of wind-type elements in the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope.","Lin Yuan had saved the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope from its serious injuries and was completely different now.","The initially hornless Wind Speed Rapid Antelope now had two round bumps growing out of its forehead. It felt like the protruding of two bones.","Lin Yuan knew that this was a sign that the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s degenerated horns had started to grow out again.","When its real horns started to grow out, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s genetic model would transform and change it into an utterly new fey.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s intelligence used to be that of a 9-year-old child, and it had been uncomfortable even after being taken care of in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","But the current Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was no longer only as smart as a child. It was now as smart as a youth of about 13 years old.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope had become accustomed to manipulating the flow of wind to sort heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls with different external layers into different wooden boxes.","Lin Yuan stroked the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s head and fed it two wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Since the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was talented at using wind elements, it would be a good idea to nurture the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope.","After some thinking, Lin Yuan said to the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope, “Once you evolve, I’ll give you your own name. From now on, you can eat wind-type elemental pearls whenever you feel that the wind element in your body has decreased.”","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was happy to hear that, but it remembered the two bones that were growing out of its head and decided not to use its head to bump Lin Yuan’s leg.","Instead, it licked Lin Yuan’s hand.","Silver Corona, Brocade Zither, and the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen were busy.","Brocade Zither was busy nurturing Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls while Silver Corona was absorbing spotted coral, and the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was absorbing Law Source Crystals.","Lin Yuan had been in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for almost five minutes, but neither Chimey nor Genius had approached him.","Since Chimey live-streamed for four to five hours daily, it should already know about how the GIF had dropped.","Lin Yuan thought about the shocking list of the top 100 contributing fans that he had seen in the information that Wen Yu had provided him about Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess.","Chimey had earned almost 400,000,000 Radiance dollars from contributions, excluding the cut that Star Web removed.","Although Lin Yuan had provided 30 Bronze/Epic Jasmine Lilies to Indigo Azure City for free, healing-type feys were generally more expensive, and 30 Bronze/Epic Jasmine Lilies could have easily fetched 2,000,000,000.","Compared to the 2,000,000,000 Radiance dollars he had just given away, Chimey’s 400,000,000 Radiance dollars did not seem much.","However, the comparison was based on perspective.","If this was one year ago when they were back in the Xia Region, Chimey’s 400,000,000 could have bought the entire Xia Region.","400,000,000 was a gigantic sum when it was earned through live-streaming.","Chimey had always been by his side, and he had always given it the best.","It ate Platinum Celery Vine and stayed in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree. Chimey basically did not need to worry about money.","Thus, Lin Yuan was truly afraid that Chimey would use this 400,000,000 to pick up bad habits on Star Web.","Lin Yuan circulated his spiritual power and shot out thousands of black feathers from the amber-button-shaped Source Sand.","The feathers joined together on Lin Yuan’s back and became six black wings.","He gently flapped the wings, flew up to the branches of the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree, and heard Genius murmuring, “Chimey, you have to tell Yuan about this because you’ve been greatly influenced by Yuan’s identity as Black. As long as you’re honest with him, he definitely won’t blame you!”","Genius’ words eased Lin Yuan.","Genius and Chimey were not just partners that Lin Yuan had formed contracts with. They were like children that Lin Yuan had watched grow up.","Genius was mature now.","Lin Yuan heard Chimey chirp out a response, and he was shocked by what it said."]},{"number":804,"title":"Chapter 804 - Chimey Became Human Prematurely","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Chimey spoke with urgency and fear. “You know that I live stream on Star Web. I like to sing and wanted to earn enough money so that Yuan and the rest could have a plate of red braised meat each, and no one would have to share.","“But I didn’t know that by the time I started receiving contributions, you and Yuan would already be able to eat red braised meat whenever you wanted. I was going to tell Yuan when I surprised him with a gift box. How was I supposed to anticipate that the GIF would drop during the competition!?”","Before Genius replied, Chimey went on to say, “I chose the beauty department when I was setting up my live-streaming room. Yuan will definitely blame me when he finds out. After all, I’m a bird and not a girl.”","Just after Chimey finished speaking, it heard a familiar and clear voice in the depths of its soul.","“Now that you’ve evolved to Fantasy Breed, you’ll look like any other girl when you change into human form. You’re already Fantasy III. Don’t you have the confidence to evolve to Myth II?”","Lin Yuan’s obvious words of comfort that lacked any tone of reprimand made Chimey hurriedly fly into Lin Yuan’s arms, where it started to sob sadly.","Chimey had been hiding its live-streaming from Lin Yuan, and this had brought it a lot of stress.","Lin Yuan sighed and touched Chimey’s head with the pad of his finger.","When he heard the conversation between Genius and Chimey, he already knew everything about Chimey’s live-streaming and that it had not picked up any bad habits.","However, he did not understand why Chimey would be so scared of his reaction.","If Lin Yuan had found out about Chimey’s hobby of live-streaming on Star Web, he would immediately have helped Chimey to set up an account on Star Web.","Naturally, he would support all of Chimey’s hobbies.","But if he had helped Chimey to set up the account, he would not have allowed it to join the beauty department.","Lin Yuan suddenly thought back to a memorable item on the Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s treasure collection catalog—the Spirit Bodhi Fruit.","The Spirit Bodhi Fruit only grew on the Spirit Bodhi Tree after decades of standing against the elements.","The Spirit Bodhi Fruit was useless to spirit qi professionals, but it could allow Fantasy Breed feys to gain human form that they should only be capable of changing into when they reached Myth II.","The Spirit Bodhi Fruit was a spiritual ingredient that was completely useless, but its utter uselessness caused Lin Yuan to remember it.","The Spirit Bodhi Fruit was a consumable that would decide on the time of the transformation according to the Fantasy Breed fey’s quality.","Chimey was now Fantasy III. Every additional level would amount to an hour of transformation time, so Chimey would be able to take human form for about three hours.","Since such an incident had occurred, it was necessary for Chimey to step in to personally settle the issue.","Chimey only stopped crying after Lin Yuan stroked its head for a while.","Lin Yuan asked Chimey, “What are you going to do now that your GIF dropped during your live-stream?”","The worry in Chimey’s eyes had disappeared, but its gaze darkened after it heard Lin Yuan’s question.","A moment later, Chimey replied, “How about I stop live-streaming on Star Web from now on?”","Chimey’s stubbornness made Lin Yuan smile.","Chimey had been so certain, yet it was running away at such a time.","However, Lin Yuan would always spoil the feys he had contracted.","“Chimey, I’ll be able to obtain one Spirit Bodhi Fruit, which should be able to allow you to transform into a human for three hours given that you’re currently Fantasy III. You can use the human form to settle the issue of the GIF dropping.","“Although Star Web doesn’t have a rule forbidding feys from live-streaming on Star Web, hiding behind a GIF gives a slight sense of trickery. As such, you will have to reveal the fact that you’re a fey while in human form,” said Lin Yuan seriously.","Lin Yuan’s words made the twinkle return to Chimey’s eyes.","When Lin Yuan noticed the gleam in Chimey’s eyes, he felt that it was even more radiant than a Twilight Rune.","Chimey flapped its wings enthusiastically and flew several rounds around the Spirit Lock spatial zone before it stopped in front of Lin Yuan and said hopefully, “Really, Yuan?”","Lin Yuan jokingly rolled his eyes and replied, “When have I ever lied?”","Chimey happily flew around the Spirit Lock spatial zone a few more times before landing in front of Lin Yuan and asking, “Can I still block my face with a GIF from now on? I want to remove it when I finally evolve to Myth II. I want to hold a concert!”","This was the first time that Chimey had revealed its dreams to Lin Yuan, who smiled and replied, “You lazy bug, you better work hard at evolving your power on the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree. Don’t forget to save a seat in the front row for me when you hold your concert.”","Chimey’s eyes shone as it said, “The front row will be reserved for you, Genius, Red Thorn, the Source Sand, the Jasmine Lily, Blackie, and the rest. Everyone else will have to go to the second row!”","Chimey’s response floored Lin Yuan because it meant that the front row would become a meeting of animals.","It was likely that Red Thorn would trumpet to give Chimey a rhythm when Chimey was singing.","Lin Yuan was stunned by this thought and suddenly remembered that the other feys would be able to change forms alongside Chimey by the time it reached Myth II.","Hence, it was highly possible that they would be able to sit at the front row of Chimey’s concert.","Lin Yuan, Chimey, and Genius sat in the bows of the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree and chatted. The atmosphere was calm and pleasant.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan remembered Chimey mentioning a surprise box and asked, “If a surprise box from Star Web contains more than 100,000 Radiance dollars, they can be revoked after sending a complaint to the officials. Chimey, you should complain! You earned the money with your talent and should get to decide how to use it. However, I don’t want you to spend it frivolously. I hope you’ll use it to do meaningful things.”","Chimey nodded, but it was not focused on what Lin Yuan had said at all.","It was too hopeful and curious about how beautiful it would look in human form."]},{"number":805,"title":"Chapter 805 - The Transformation of the Astronomical Parliaments Members","paragraphs":["Bei Xu woke up amongst the pile of rocks he had built to be his hideout. He immediately picked up on faint scraping sounds outside.","When Bei Xu heard these noises, all the hair on his body stood on end.","The scraping sounds were an urgent warning in the Grotto Continent. It was the sound of a colony of Knife Twist Line Centipedes.","The Knife Twist Line Centipedes were not considered feys. Their only means of attack was using their knife-like mouths.","If the Knife Twist Line Centipede accidentally bit an adult, they would be immediately trampled to death.","All of Bei Xu’s hair had stood on end because of a legend that came to his mind.","The Knife Twist Line Centipede did not like to feed on flesh. It liked to eat metal-type spiritual ingredients.","According to legend, subterranean dimensional rifts opened up wherever a Knife Twist Line Centipede colony appeared.","A subterranean dimensional rift would definitely spell death for the people in the Grotto Continent who did not have feys.","When Bei Xu thought back to the fey that Lin Yuan had given him during the Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting, a black figure lunged at Bei Xu’s face, and he almost jumped out of his skin.","Bei Xu refocused his eyes through the dim light and realized that the black figure was a palm-sized bat.","Bei Xu was delighted by Lin Yuan’s fey and felt that he had finally become a spirit qi professional.","But immediately after, Bei Xu fell into despair.","Even if he formed a contract with this fey, could he really take on the sea of lifeforms that flooded out of the subterranean dimensional rift with this new fey of his and live to tell the tale?","Some Knife Twist Line Centipedes had already started to crawl through the cracks in the rocks. Bei Xu shakily circulated his spiritual energy and formed a contract with the bat-species fey in his hand.","After he formed the contract, his eyes widened.","He had only requested for a fey from Lin Yuan, so he did not expect to be given such a strong fey.","Intense gratitude shone in Bei Xu’s eyes, mixed with surprise and hope.","As he sensed the Sharp Shadow Bat’s abilities, Bei Xu finally knew why Lin Yuan had told him that he could do it.","With the Sharp Shadow Bat, the ‘rock insect’ curse would no longer dictate his life.","After Bei Xu formed a contract with the Sharp Shadow Bat, he noticed through the spiritual energy connecting him to the Sharp Shadow Bat that there was a black ring with bat patterns and two crystal bottles of spirit fluid on the ground.","Bei Xu, who had been mining for his entire life, knew how rare feys were in the Grotto Continent.","He did not know how to use the black bat-shaped ring and two bottles of spirit fluid on the ground.","However, he was certain that they were part of the surprise that Lin Yuan had mentioned.","He carefully picked up the black ring and spirit fluid before standing up amongst the rocks to instruct the Sharp Shadow Bat to kill the Knife Twist Line Centipedes that were crawling in through the cracks.","As he looked at the corpses of the Knife Twist Line Centipedes on the ground, Bei Xu summoned his Willpower Rune. Unexpectedly, his Sharp Shadow Bat charged toward his Willpower Rune.","Bei Xu’s mouth gaped wider and wider, and saliva even dripped out.","In spite of his befuddlement, he noticed that his Sharp Shadow Bat was growing larger.","Bei Xu was utterly confused about the Sharp Shadow Bat’s transformation, but he knew that his Willpower Rune had disappeared after the Sharp Shadow Bat became larger.","When he sensed the Sharp Shadow Bat’s new power, he felt that he would even be able to fight his way through a Class 1 subterranean dimensional rift.","If Lin Yuan had an all-seeing eye, he would have spat out a fountain of blood when he saw Bei Xu’s situation. Actually, Lin Yuan had forgotten that Bei Xu would be completely unaware of how to use the Diamond fey storage box and spirit fluid.","The items he had given Bei Xu to increase his power became burdens he needed to protect when he brought them along with him.","Due to Bei Xu’s ‘rock insect’ curse, he did not know anything about fey grades and qualities or the relationship between Willpower Runes and Fantasy Breed feys, which was common knowledge in the Radiance Federation.","Bei Xu would not even know how blessed he was now that the Sharp Shadow Bat had accidentally triggered its emperor bloodline and transformed into the Monarch Dark Bat.","Bei Xu would definitely be able to survive in the Grotto Continent with the Bronze X/Fantasy I Monarch Dark Bat.","...","Meanwhile, Yin Lin woke up on her soft bed.","Her heart pounded the moment she woke up. She did not dare to open her eyes despite knowing that she was now able to see clearly.","After a moment, she opened her eyes to a small crack.","Yin Lin saw a familiar yet foreign world through this crack, and everything that she saw was inexplicably beautiful and real.","All of the colors, shapes, and details were unclear to Yin Lin as of now.","This world had immediately mystified Yin Lin.","Warm tears flowed out of the corner of her eyes and slid down her face.","The moment the tears flowed out, a stunning smile broke out on Yin Lin’s face.","This smile was the epitome of tears of happiness.","There was some noise at the door of Yin Lin’s room, and it was clear that someone was afraid of making noise and disturbing Yin Lin as they walked on the carpet.","Yin Lin’s mother walked through the door. She had wanted to give Yin Lin a blanket, and she was surprised to find Yin Lin already awake.","The moment she saw Yin Lin, Guan Da was stunned.","She realized that not only had azure leopard-shaped patterns appeared on the left side of Yin Lin’s face, but white lion-shaped patterns that were slightly smaller than the leopard-shaped ones had appeared on the right side of Yin Lin’s face as well.","Since she was from a Class 5 family, Guan Da could remain emotionless even in the most extreme situations. But when she saw the patterns on Yin Lin’s face, her body started to tremble uncontrollably.","Guan Da had always seen her daughter’s life as a miserable one.","But even though Yin Lin was blind, Guan Da felt that Yin Lin was the luckiest person in the world.","She did not expect that Yin Lin would be able to unlock the Yin family’s most precious Spirit White Lion spirit patterns and Guan family’s Azure Cloud Leopard spirit patterns at the same time after one afternoon nap."]},{"number":806,"title":"Chapter 806 - The Future Azure Envoy","paragraphs":["Guan Da had always hidden Yin Lin away from the world because she wanted Yin Lin’s sightless world to be calm and peaceful.","But now that Yin Lin had awakened the Azure Cloud Leopard and Spirit White Lion’s spirit patterns, she could freely move around the Guan family’s Azure Cloud Leopard and Spirit White Lion’s mystic realms.","11 of the 12 Class 5 families in the Azure Federation had younger generations that could inherit Azure inheritance beast patterns.","However, none of the Guan family’s younger generation had gained the Azure inheritance beast patterns, resulting in the Guan family’s influence weakening amongst the 12 Class 5 families.","But now, the Guan family’s beast pattern had finally appeared.","Moreover, the Guan family’s beast pattern had appeared alongside the Yin family’s beast pattern.","The two families’ beast patterns strengthened each other, and Yin Lin was now the most revered member of the Azure Federation’s younger generation.","This thought made the corners of Guan Da’s eyes grow damp.","At that moment, a pair of hands gently wiped the corners of Guan Da’s eyes, and a pleasant voice full of worry said, “Mom, why are you crying?”","Guan Da was about to instinctively deny that she had been crying.","By the time her reaction caught up to her, Guan Da asked Yin Lin incredulously, “Lin Lin, you can see clearly!?”","Yin Lin nodded and replied, “Mom, I can see the world as clearly as anyone else now.”","Now that she could see this beautiful world clearly, Yin Lin felt like she had been given a new lease of life.","Lin Yuan, who was evolving feys in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, would never have anticipated that the Yin Lin, who he was afraid would not be able to fully regain her sight due to the lack of vitality, was about to become a flourishing Azure Envoy.","...","The past few days had been the busiest in Lin Yuan’s life.","Although he had worked equally hard before, he had left the Spirit Lock spatial zone multiple times to collect the Law Source Crystals sent by Long Tao and Li Xuan besides nurturing feys.","Lin Yuan had formed a triangular long-term working relationship with Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Thus, both families had expressed their sincerity to Lin Yuan.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley had dispatched Long Tao to deliver 12,540 Law Source Crystals as well as the Suzerain/Myth III Vicious Poison Law Crystal to Lin Yuan.","The Vicious Poison Law Crystal was the first Suzerain/Myth III Law Crystal that Lin Yuan had obtained.","Law Crystals from Myth III feys were twice as strong as those from Myth II feys.","The stronger the fey was when it was still alive, the brighter the cracks in the Law Crystal.","Lin Yuan carefully studied the brightness of the Vicious Poison Law Crystal and checked it with True Data.","He was sure that the Vicious Poison Law Crystal had come from a Suzerain IX/Myth III Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python.","Li Xuan from Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had delivered 6,210 Law Source Crystals and a brocade box of Law Crystal fragments.","There were also the two blades of Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass that Lin Yuan had been looking forward to.","When Li Xuan arrived, Lin Yuan took the chance to discuss the trade of Spirit Bodhi Fruits.","Eventually, Li Xuan returned to Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s mansion in the Royal Capital and took the Spirit Bodhi Fruit from the First Elder to give to Lin Yuan.","Since Lin Yuan wanted a consumable like the Spirit Bodhi Fruit, which did not have any special meaning, Li Xuan was more than willing to give it to him to express his thanks.","Lin Yuan wanted to give Li Xuan a Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, but he was shocked by Li Xuan’s insistent refusal.","Hence, Lin Yuan kept Li Xuan’s gesture in his heart.","Lin Yuan opened the brocade box that Li Xuan gave him in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and saw that it was half-filled with Law Crystal fragments.","When he tried to grab them, his hand could not pick them all up.","Other than the Law Crystal fragments in his hands, there was still a quarter of the total number of Law Crystal fragments left in the brocade box.","Lin Yuan nodded in satisfaction at the large number of Law Crystal fragments.","Besides the quality of the Law Crystal fragments, the quantity had already surpassed Lin Yuan’s expectations.","After the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbed this box of Law Crystal fragments, it would be able to repay Lin Yuan’s efforts by 20 times, and a more complex world would be created on its skirt.","These transactions had allowed Lin Yuan to earn a windfall.","Once he checked the quality of the Law Crystal fragments, he realized that most of them came from different Myth Breed feys.","The laws were very complicated, but the types were not all unorthodox.","Every type of Law Crystal was generally widely applicable, and it was clear that the Li family had chosen them after careful consideration.","This was great for Lin Yuan.","Even though Lin Yuan possessed a large number of Law Source Crystals, he could not nurture them all into worlds.","These messy laws could be used in the Astronomical Parliament’s Star Spirit Seat or allow Lin Yuan to gain a limited resistance to their element, which would increase Lin Yuan’s power in a way.","Lin Yuan gave the Spirit Bodhi Fruit to Chimey and told it to decide for itself when it wanted to use it.","He assumed that Chimey would be eager to eat the Spirit Bodhi Fruit and start live-streaming as Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess on Star Web. Unexpectedly, Chimey looked troubled after it received the Spirit Bodhi Fruit.","It carefully hid the Spirit Bodhi Fruit in the nest in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree and chirped to Lin Yuan and Genius, “Yuan, Genius, do you think that I’ll look good in human form? Yuan, do you think that I should wear my own clothes or buy a new set when I’m live-streaming in human form? Genius, can I hug you when I’m live-streaming in human form? I want to stroke a cat like Yuan does!”","Chimey’s troubling questions made Genius and Lin Yuan look at each other—both were rendered speechless.","They could not help but sigh to themselves and wonder if the world of avian-type young girls was as complicated as it seemed.","Chimey’s last question dazed Genius.","It never thought that the Chimey that it regarded as its good friend would have the evil idea of wanting to stroke it during the live stream."]},{"number":807,"title":"Chapter 807 - Like Father Like Daughter","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","It’ll be humiliating if I end up purring in front of so many people on the live stream.","After Lin Yuan nurtured feys for a few days, he realized that the troubled Chimey had no intention of live-streaming.","He was not worried about when Chimey wanted to live-stream. He gave the 18,780 Law Source Crystals to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen that was dizzy with happiness.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen already had over 800 Law Source Crystals and could eat to its heart’s content.","But when it saw the 18,780 Law Source Crystals that Lin Yuan had given it, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was stunned.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen stuck out its fingers as it started to make mental calculations.","Given its current rate of absorbing Law Source Crystals, it would take it close to a month of continuous absorption to absorb all the Law Source Crystals.","Eating was a source of joy, and every meal was just an increment of joy.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would be able to experience the joy of continuous eating. This was peak bliss for this sacred source lifeform.","It was too incredible that it had a contactor that would feed it continuously.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen suddenly felt as though it had grown up in a short period.","It locked its fingers together and stretched, and a pair of bony hands appeared in front of it.","The hands were holding a dark green gem.","Lin Yuan could not help but be amused by the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s expression, and he felt that if it was not a sacred source lifeform that took human form, it would be a hamster-species fey based on its personality.","It was just as obsessed and took as much joy from eating.","This thought rendered Lin Yuan speechless in a second.","He seemed to be just as possessive and liked to hoard like hamsters.","Lin Yuan had always raised the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen like it was his daughter.","Lin Yuan thought,? It really is true what they say, like father like daughter.","This thought made Lin Yuan even more speechless than he already was.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen peered at the Myth III Vicious Poison Law Crystal, and its mouth twitched slightly.","As a sacred source lifeform, it felt that Law Source Crystals were more suited to its taste.","With the feast of Law Source Crystals, the Myth III Law Crystal was just a small snack to it.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen felt a little troubled by Lin Yuan’s speechless expression.","It felt that it should acquire more knowledge about laws such as the Enlightenment Law as they would make Lin Yuan smarter when they were applied to him through the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","Lin Yuan did not know what the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was thinking. If he did, he would probably have rolled his eyes at it.","“Hold on to this Vicious Poison Law first but don’t absorb it. Do it in a few days when I tell you to do so,” said Lin Yuan.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen nodded. Without Lin Yuan’s order, it would not even bother to absorb the Law Crystal when it had Law Source Crystals.","It took out a huge leather sack and gave it to Lin Yuan.","The leather sack was filled with fingernail-sized Law Crystals that came from a day’s worth of the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen tempering the Law Source Crystals.","Lin Yuan took the sack so that he could give it to Endless Summer to accelerate its increase in power.","In four days, Lin Yuan worked overtime and managed to evolve the 400 Hot Spring Snails.","He had once again evolved the Hot Spring Snails to Elite/Epic before he chose from their three possible exclusive skills and finally evolved them to Bronze X/Epic.","As for the 30 Jasmine Lilies that he would gift to Indigo Azure City, he obtained 30 Bronze low-quality Jasmine Lilies with abilities that strongly leaned toward healing from the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Jasmine Lilies with abilities that strongly leaned toward healing were rare.","The abilities allowed the Jasmine Lily to trigger the vitality in its body and allow it to inject vitality into its target through its flower head.","The one-time injection of a large amount of vitality would result in unnecessary depletion of vitality.","But this ability would be effective in emergency situations and raise the target’s vitality to its maximum in the shortest amount of time.","This exclusive skill was extremely suited for emergency situations during battles in the wild. It could significantly reduce severe injuries and save lives.","Now that he had settled both the Hot Spring Snails and Jasmine Lilies, Lin Yuan stretched.","He turned and said to Genius, “Genius, have you memorized the basic fighting strategies and moves from Star Web?”","Genius meowed and replied in a child-like voice, “Yuan, I’ve memorized all the basic fighting strategies and moves from Star Web and organized them into a system. However, there’s really a lot of them, and it was difficult to search for all of them.”","Lin Yuan patted Genius’ head. During the last few days, while he had been nurturing feys, Genius had been searching through the entire Star Web for comprehensive combat skills and fighting strategies.","It had really been hard on Genius.","Lin Yuan took the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass roots that he had prepared in advance out of the amber-button-shaped fey storage box.","He had sorted them out at the mountain behind the mansion after he received the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass child ramets.","The scent of the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass would lose its effectiveness because many people in the mansion had drunk the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar.","However, there were many feys that were uncleansed in the mansion.","Thus, the scent of the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass would greatly affect the feys in the mansion.","Lin Yuan did not want the lake full of Angelfish of Bliss to die.","He placed one of the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass roots in his mouth and fought against the bitterness to swallow it.","Since his body and soul had already been cleansed, he did not feel any discomfort.. Nonetheless, all the cells in his muscles were triggered."]},{"number":808,"title":"Chapter 808 - Chef Supreme and Bamboo Monarchs Attention","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Genius meowed and used Connected Tails to connect itself and Lin Yuan.","The system of all the fighting skills and moves that Genius had spent the last few days memorizing from Star Web was transferred to Lin Yuan’s brain.","In a flash, Lin Yuan accepted the sea of knowledge from Genius, and it was imprinted in his brain.","In his state of hyper memory, his muscles memorized all the combat skills and fighting styles that were stored in his brain.","In half an hour, his muscles memorized all the combat skills and fighting styles that were available on Star Web.","He would be able to use the information in his muscles to apply the combat skills while he was defending and attacking.","Lin Yuan had been a complete greenhorn to martial arts, but he could now be called a master of martial arts.","He felt that this seemingly coincidental achievement was actually a once-in-a-lifetime miracle.","The fact that one’s body and soul had to be cleansed by the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar from Radiant Moon Palace would already be an insurmountable obstacle for most people.","Secondly, the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass that was unique to the Li family was also required, and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had to give their approval before the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass could be obtained.","If Lin Yuan had not been able to produce Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls and Law Crystals, he might not have received the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass from the Li family even though he was the Moon Empress.","The third factor was Genius’ Connected Tails.","Compared to the other two factors, the third factor was the hardest.","Genius had transformed into the Beast that Connects Everything when it evolved to Fantasy Breed and opened up the path for the Hundred Questions Beasts.","The strength of Connected Tails did not just lie in its ability to transfer knowledge, but that Genius could memorize all the knowledge in the world.","Without the unique Genius, even if a person was able to fulfill the first two requirements, they would not be able to learn all the combat skills and fighting strategies within half an hour.","After Lin Yuan was out of the state of hyper-memory, he suddenly felt his perspective on the world shift.","The change in his muscles led Lin Yuan to feel that his body had become tens of times more agile.","He immediately instructed the Source Sand to change into a grain of sand and to toss gravel at him every ten seconds.","Lin Yuan would never be able to avoid this rate of gravel being thrown at him in the past, but his body started to move on instinct now.","He turned and dodged the rapid rain of gravel in a charismatic series of movements.","This made a sense of thrill course through Lin Yuan’s veins.","This speed of reaction to attacks was exactly what Lin Yuan wanted.","Although his body had not been improved, the increase in combat skills and fighting styles were enough for Lin Yuan to utilize Spirit Essence Explosion perfectly.","Even thearch-class experts found defense to be the most difficult during a battle.","However, Lin Yuan could now pair the combat skills and fighting strategies with Spirit Essence Explosion to make up for this weakness.","Yet, Lin Yuan was still unsatisfied.","He stored away 100 of the over 120 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls that Brocade Zither had nurtured into a Diamond fey storage box before he picked up Genius and headed to Radiant Moon Palace.","While on the way to Radiant Moon Palace, Lin Yuan contacted Duan He and arranged to meet him at a restaurant in the Radiant Moon Palace.","He gave the sack of Law Crystals for Endless Summer and the feys for the Indigo Azure Guard to Duan He.","In the past, Lin Yuan would have kept away the batch of feys for Indigo Azure City for two months before giving it to Duan He to prevent anyone from being shocked by the Creation Master resources that he possessed.","But now, Lin Yuan had already decided to reveal his identity as the disciple of the Moon Empress. Hence, Duan He would only be shocked but not think anything was strange about how he had prepared 400 Bronze/Epic Hot Spring Snails and 30 Bronze/Epic Jasmine Lilies in an hour.","Lin Yuan knew that there was a war room in the Radiant Moon Palace’s treasure trove that contained a large number of spirit fluids.","There were close to 10,000 bottles of each kind of spirit fluid.","The lowest quality of any of these spirit fluids would be able to produce a Bronze/Epic fey.","The Class 5 spirit fluids in the war room could create Bronze/Legend feys in a second or enable feys that were stuck at Diamond X/Fantasy V to evolve to Suzerain and undergo the World Cleansing.","After he gave Duan He the items, Lin Yuan used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Tentacle Node to transport himself to the Radiant Moon Palace’s entrance.","He ran into the Moon Empress, Mystic Moon, and Cold Moon walking out of the palace when he arrived.","Lin Yuan hurriedly ran up to greet them.","He bowed, and Mystic Moon and Cold Moon said, “Good day, Young Lord.”","Lin Yuan greeted them in return.","He did not expect Mystic Moon to be back from the outskirts so soon.","However, he felt that Mystic Moon was different from before.","Now, a terrifying aura seeped out of Mystic Moon’s body intermittently. Lin Yuan remembered the Moon Empress mentioning that Mystic Moon was a fey.","It seemed that Mystic Moon had just evolved, and his body was still not accustomed to controlling his new power.","A warm smile appeared on the Moon Empress’s face when she saw Lin Yuan, and she walked up to him to adjust his collar.","While she was doing so, she noticed the Flowing Cloud Beeswax pendant hanging around his neck, and her smile widened.","Shock flashed across Cold Moon’s eyes when she saw Lin Yuan. News of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl that appeared in the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association had spread throughout the Royal Capital.","It had also attracted the attention of the Class 5 Creation Masters Chef Supreme and Bamboo Monarch.","More than 30 factions had come to Leaning Moon Mountain to see the Moon Empress and ask for a Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","Cold Moon knew that this matter had nothing to do with the Moon Empress and that it was the single-handed work of Lin Yuan.","This meant that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, which could change the style of Creation Master factions, was Lin Yuan’s unique secret.","Cold Moon had always been certain of Lin Yuan’s power as a combat-class spirit qi professional, but she never expected that his power as a Creation Master would increase so exponentially in the short period of six months.","Although she had never seen the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl for herself and could not be sure if it was as amazing as the rumors said, it had to be very special for so many factions to visit Leaning Moon Mountain because of it.","It was not something that any Creation Master could nurture."]},{"number":809,"title":"Chapter 809 - The Moon Empress Ride","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Cold Moon watched as Lin Yuan handed a cloud-shaped Diamond fey storage box to the Moon Empress.","This stunned Cold Moon.","She was not alone as even the Moon Empress, and the recently returned Mystic Moon were astonished.","Mystic Moon was slightly confused.","It has always been the Moon Empress who does everything she can to give things to Young Lord. Since when did Young Lord start giving things to the Moon Empress?","The Moon Empress was about to instinctively reject Lin Yuan, but when she saw the seriousness in his face and thought about how he would feel if she did reject him, she reached out her hand to receive the cloud-shaped fey storage box.","She looked inside the fey storage box, and her expression changed from surprise to a happy smile.","The happy smile then changed to pride and amazement.","The Moon Empress never expected her disciple to have grown so much.","She immediately knew what to do with the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls that were in the Diamond fey storage box.","She saw this gift from Lin Yuan as an extremely precious treasure, and an odd feeling came over her.","It was like the apple of her eye that she had painstakingly polished had finally grown up and no longer needed her as much.","This stubborn young man in front of her not only rejected her help but was also starting to repay her. This was the first time that the Moon Empress was experiencing such a feeling.","The mixture of shock and pride made her feel like she had just successfully passed on her flame to a new spark.","The Moon Empress beamed at Lin Yuan and said, “I really like what’s inside this Diamond fey storage box. I’m headed to Midnight Palace with Cold Moon and Mystic Moon now. Why don’t you accompany me to the Moon Stable?”","Neither Mystic Moon nor Cold Moon knew what was in the fey storage box that Lin Yuan had given the Moon Empress.","But when he heard that the Moon Empress wanted to bring Lin Yuan to the Moon Stable, Mystic Moon’s eyes lit up because he knew that she was going to give Lin Yuan the fey carriage that she had put a lot of effort into preparing for him.","Mystic Moon could not help but gulp when he thought of the fey carriage that the Moon Empress had prepared for Lin Yuan.","He could not help but think about how the Moon Empress looked while she was preparing the fey carriage for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan immediately moved to the Moon Empress’ side to escort her as he said, “Let’s go, Master. I’ll accompany you.”","Lin Yuan had always had access to every nook and cranny of the Radiant Moon Palace and could even freely walk in and out of Moonbeam Corridor.","The Moon Empress had even built a breeding room for Lin Yuan in Moonbeam Corridor.","After Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress held their question-and-answer session, he would go to his breeding room in Moonbeam Corridor to organize all the information he had gained.","The first time that Lin Yuan had seen the interior of the breeding room, he had blown an internal raspberry.","All the walls in the breeding room were embedded with enormous transparent spirit wood.","Even Class 4 Creation Masters had to work non-stop for about a decade to gather enough resources to buy a fist-sized transparent spirit wood.","Transparent spirit wood was highly beneficial for Creation Masters as it could increase the purity of spirit qi.","This luxury good might be useless to Lin Yuan, but this interior element was evidence of the Moon Empress’ affection for him.","Although Lin Yuan was extremely familiar with the Radiant Moon Palace, he had not explored the entire Leaning Moon Mountain.","He only traveled between the Radiant Moon Palace and the pavilion where he stayed, as well as where Chu Ci stayed.","The Moon Stable was where the fey carriages were kept, and Lin Yuan had never been there before.","But when he had seen Li Xuan and Long Tu’s fey carriages, Lin Yuan found himself liking fey carriages more and more.","It made Lin Yuan ponder over what kind of fey carriage he should create for himself.","The choice of what kind of fey carriage to create was not an easy one. Firstly, he needed to think about what kind of protection he should use to cover his fey carriage.","There were also the blocking qualities that the interior needed to have and the strength of the feys that would be used to pull the carriage.","Lastly, there was the charisma factor to consider.","All of these considerations needed separate contemplation, and Lin Yuan was currently at a loss. Thus, he was curious about the fey carriages that were in Leaning Moon Mountain’s Moon Stable.","As he walked alongside the Moon Empress and admired the scenery around Leaning Moon Mountain and the rare feys that were all around, Lin Yuan was rather pleased.","Some time had passed since New Year’s.","There was warmth in the cold as winter shifted to early spring.","The early spring in Leaning Moon Mountain was full of the fragrance of flowers that when breathed in, it could make a person feel like their spirit was being soothed.","When they arrived at the Moon Stable, Lin Yuan saw two large figures dressed in moon-colored long robes.","They were three meters tall each, and Lin Yuan was certain that they were not human spirit qi professionals.","They had to be giant feys.","The two giant figures knelt when they saw the Moon Empress and nodded at Lin Yuan.","However, Lin Yuan realized that they did not greet Cold Moon or Mystic Moon in any way.","“Go pull out the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage. The both of you will be coming with me to Midnight Palace,” said the Moon Empress.","Lin Yuan found the Moon Empress’ words to be strange as feys always pulled fey carriages. So why did the Moon Empress tell these two enormous figures dressed in moon-colored long robes to pull out the fey carriage?","Suddenly, Lin Yuan froze, and his head snapped back to look at the enormous figures, which lifted their heads and let out a sound similar to that of snake-species feys.","The sound did not have the same cruel ferocity that snake-species feys let out. Instead, it was filled with an odd tone of magic.","When the two enormous figures cried out, Lin Yuan noticed that there were two faces below their moon-colored long robes.","Shortly after, one of the figures shot into the sky and turned into a giant snake that was almost a kilometer long.","The other figure was not far behind as it turned into a light green giant snake that was also about a kilometer long.","Lin Yuan’s nostrils contracted as he used True Data to check on the white and light green giant snakes."]},{"number":810,"title":"Chapter 810 - Flying-Serpent Bloodline","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Lin Yuan used True Data to check the white and light green giant snakes, he realized that a similar situation had arisen when he checked Auntie Zhang’s Terror Rabbit when it was in a near-death state.","He could not see any information about the two giant snakes’ attributes on True Data. All he could see were their four exclusive skills.","This made Lin Yuan aware that they were Creation Breed feys.","Two energy chains appeared out of the two giant snakes’ heads and pulled open the Moon Stable’s heavy doors. The Moon Stable trembled when the light green and white energy chains entered through the doors.","A pagoda-shaped structure with moon drawings all over it emerged from the Moon Stable.","All the moon drawings had moonbeam stones embedded in them and made the pagoda-shaped structure appear like a chilly sky in the heavens.","After the light green and white energy chain tossed the pagoda-shaped structure to the sky, the energy in the giant snakes started to pour forth.","Dorsal fins appeared on the smooth back of the snakes, while two large wings appeared on the front half of their bodies.","The wings were as translucent as fish fins, and the sky shimmered as the wings were flapped.","When Lin Yuan saw the wings, he immediately knew that these two Creation Breed snake-species feys had the flying-serpent bloodline, which was a branched out bloodline of snake-species feys.","As for the eliteness of the bloodline, the flying-serpent bloodline was as elite as the main dragon-species and main phoenix-species bloodlines.","The flying-serpent bloodline could actually suppress most main dragon-species and main phoenix-species feys.","Lin Yuan watched as both snakes lifted the back halves of their bodies and started to twist around and formed a secure base that supported the Moon Beam Treasure Pagoda that was still connected to the light green and white energy chains.","The dorsal fins on the snakes turned outward and looked like two blooming lotuses.","When Lin Yuan saw the Moon Empress’ fey carriage, he gained a completely new understanding of what fey carriages were.","The Moon Empress said to Lin Yuan, “This Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage is the Radiant Moon Palace’s emblem. If you ever need to use the Radiant Moon Palace’s name to do anything, just let White Moon and Light Green Moon know. You have just as much authority as me in Leaning Moon Mountain.”","Lin Yuan immediately realized that the Moon Empress was telling him that he could ride this Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage.","However, he felt extremely pressured to sit in the fey carriage pulled by these two Creation Breed feys.","The Moon Empress handed a Diamond fey storage box to Lin Yuan, who quickly reached out his hand to receive it.","After he received the fey storage box, the Moon Empress said, “Even if you don’t need to represent the Radiant Moon Palace, you’ll still need your own fey carriage. See if any of the feys in this fey storage box are suitable to pull your fey carriage.”","Lin Yuan was about to look through the fey storage box when the Moon Empress chuckled and said, “Summon out all the feys from inside the fey storage box.”","As such, Lin Yuan did as the Moon Empress said instead of using his spiritual energy to look through the fey storage box.","Shortly after, 12 fist-sized balls of water appeared in the air next to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan could not help but be taken aback by the balls of water.","Mystic Moon’s eyes widened when he saw the 12 balls of water that Lin Yuan had summoned.","Mystic Moon had been the one to tell the Moon Empress to prepare a fey carriage for Lin Yuan, but the Moon Empress had prepared too many items for Lin Yuan.","If Mystic Moon had not mentioned the fey carriage to the Moon Empress, she would have come up with more ways to strengthen Lin Yuan’s foundation and give him more items that would protect his life.","However, Mystic Moon was confused because the Moon Empress had not given Lin Yuan the fey carriage that she had prepared for him.","But when Mystic Moon took a closer look at the 12 balls of water, his eyes almost popped out of their sockets.","He never expected the Moon Empress to give Moving Source Water to Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan saw the 12 balls of water, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen that had been consuming Law Source Crystals in the Spirit Lock spatial zone started to move.","The Sacred Source Wielding Queen’s movements were much stronger than when Lin Yuan had first obtained the Law Source Crystals. It was similar to when Red Thorn had discovered the Source Seed.","Soon, Lin Yuan’s mouth started to twitch.","The Sacred Source Wielding Queen was moving so erratically because it wanted to eat the 12 balls of water.","Given the Sacred Source Wielding Queen’s reaction, Lin Yuan knew that the 12 balls of water would not be able to evolve it like the Source Seed did for Red Thorn.","Actually, the 12 balls of water would increase the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s growth more than the Law Source Crystals would.","There was even a chance that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would immediately mature from child to adult after it absorbed the 12 balls of water and would allow the Queen Form and Sacred Sword Form to unlock second abilities.","Lin Yuan learned through his communication with the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen what the 12 balls of water were.","However, it was because he knew what the 12 balls of water were that he would never give them to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen as much as they would increase its power.","While Lin Yuan was processing his shock about the 12 balls of water, the Moon Empress said, “In the event of the death of a sacred source lifeform’s contractor, a 7 Stars sacred source lifeform can use shooting stars to regress to its child states to survive as long as it did not form a marrow contract with its contractor.","“As you know, a Class 5 Creation Master can make a 5 Stars sacred source lifeform’s shell into a weapon. When using the pure law power in Law Crystals, the laws in a dead sacred source lifeform can be extracted and nurtured.","“The 12 balls of water that you see before you are the sacred source lifeforms that a person from an independent federation had contracted. This person’s sacred source lifeform was 9 Stars and was close to perfection. But since there was no marrow contract and the person fell out with the sacred source lifeform, he couldn’t fully cooperate with the sacred source lifeform, nor could the sacred source lifeform be evolved to perfection.","“I sublimated the person using Totem Moon, and I also later killed the sacred source lifeform that escaped. These 12 balls of water are the products of the laws that were in the sacred source lifeform Moving Source Water.”","Cold Moon and Mystic Moon breathed in deeply.. They did not expect the Moon Empress to tell Lin Yuan about what had happened a decade ago at such a moment."]},{"number":811,"title":"Chapter 811 - Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly","paragraphs":["Since the Moon Empress was willing to talk about this incident, it meant that she had made her peace with it.","Lin Yuan listened to the Moon Empress with wide eyes.","It had been increasingly difficult to evolve his Sacred Sword Wielding Queen from 1 Star to 2 Stars. He had used so many Law Source Crystals that it almost seemed to be for naught.","Although he did not know how the Moving Source Water increased its stars, it had to be difficult given that it was a sacred source lifeform.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen sensed special water-element energy in the 12 balls of water. Hence, the Moving Source Water should be a kind of water-element-type sacred source lifeform.","However, Lin Yuan was dumbfounded.","Didn’t Master say she was giving me a fey carriage? Why is she giving me these 12 balls of water?","True Data still could not check these 12 balls of water because it stated that they were water residue instead of living feys.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan sensed the Moon Empress’ aura shift, and she tossed 12 blue crystals into the 12 balls of water.","When the Moon Empress saw the way that Lin Yuan was looking at the 12 balls of water, she said gently, “You’ve already formed a contract with a sacred source lifeform. These feys nurtured from the residue of a sacred source lifeform will require you and your sacred source lifeform to form a contract through your soul together. These 12 balls of water will be useful to you no matter how you choose to nurture them in the future.”","Lin Yuan’s heart was still racing from when he used True Data to check on the 12 balls of water.","The 12 balls of water had limitless potential and could be nurtured in almost countless directions.","When they were nurtured, they could be supreme weapons or incredible shields.","He also thought that they could be nurtured with strategic intentions.","As he looked into the Moon Empress’ eyes, Lin Yuan stored the 12 balls of water back into the Diamond fey storage box and wore the fey storage box as a ring around his finger.","Mystic Moon caught the Moon Empress shooting a look at him, and he hastily coughed and said, “Moon Empress, these feys might not be suitable for pulling a fey carriage. Why don’t you prepare some that are more suitable for Young Lord?”","The Moon Empress quickly handed Lin Yuan another Platinum fey storage box and shot an appreciative look at Mystic Moon.","“My disciple, you don’t have to worry about the Moving Source Water. You can take your time to nurture them. But Mystic Moon is right in that these feys are not suitable for pulling a fey carriage. Take a look inside this Platinum fey storage box and see if the feys inside are better for pulling your fey carriage.”","Thanks to the Moon Empress’ expression, Lin Yuan immediately knew that she was trying to come up with a way to give him something.","Lin Yuan did not even try to reject her and immediately received the Platinum fey storage box this time.","He had been staunchly against receiving anything from the Moon Empress and insistent on forging his own path instead of relying on her not because he felt that he could not take anything from her.","It was almost a done deal that Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath would be able to evolve to Creation Breed, and he had proved himself for the first time by giving the Moon Empress the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","Now that he had laid out his own path for himself, he would no longer reject anything from the Moon Empress because he believed that he would one day be able to help the Moon Empress like she was helping him.","When she saw that Lin Yuan was not returning something to her like he used to do, the Moon Empress’ cold expression, due to returning feelings from the incident she had just recounted, immediately softened.","Lin Yuan looked inside the Platinum fey storage box and saw 12 Platinum V/Fantasy V Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies inside.","Lin Yuan instantly wondered if using butterflies to pull a carriage would attract too much attention.","Still, Lin Yuan immediately brushed off his concern. The Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies would only be about as large as a palm even when they reached Diamond X/Fantasy V and would not be able to pull a fey carriage.","However, the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies were undeniably valuable.","Lin Yuan would never have been able to nurture the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly on his own.","As a soul-type fey, the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly needed to absorb a large amount of soul-type spiritual ingredients when it was still a caterpillar in order to strengthen the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly’s soul.","After it absorbed a large amount of soul-type spiritual ingredients and became a cocoon, the cocoon needed to grow in an environment with concentrated spirit qi.","Lin Yuan would be able to fulfill the second requirement and would even be able to do it better, but he was helpless against the first requirement.","The only soul-type spiritual ingredient that Lin Yuan had was the roasted Cold Snow Pine resin.","He had a fair amount of the Cold Snow Pine resin, but it was not enough to feed the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly’s caterpillar for three days.","It was clear how much soul-type spiritual ingredients the Moon Empress had used to nurture the 12 Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies.","Even a small amount of a soul-type spiritual ingredient was priceless.","The Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly was the second most beautiful butterfly-species fey, the first being the Blue Light Goddess Butterfly.","Both the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly and Blue Light Goddess Butterfly were not adept at attacking.","However, the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly was extremely skilled at releasing cherry blossom petal-shaped scales to cover and block information from being transferred in a certain area.","It was also different from the Blue Light Goddess Butterfly that solely relied on its looks. Since the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly was a soul-type fey, it had the innate ability to trap souls.","The Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly could trap the souls of feys that were weaker than its own. The stronger the fey’s soul, the shorter time that the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly would be able to trap it.","While trapping the soul, the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly could manipulate the fey’s body as it pleased.","After a fey had its soul trapped by the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly once, the fey’s soul would become very resistant to the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly’s soul trapping. Hence, it was difficult for the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly to control the same fey twice.","However, the special quality of the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly’s soul trapping was that it could trap insect-species feys with weaker souls forever.","The insect-species feys’ whose souls had been permanently trapped by the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly were like men that a beautiful woman hypnotized as they were equally willing to sacrifice everything they had for the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly.","As the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly’s soul became stronger, it would have better options and could order the insects whose souls it had trapped to kill themselves to remove their souls from entrapment.","This would free up the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly to control another target.","With this thought, Lin Yuan came to a decision."]},{"number":812,"title":"Chapter 812 - Emperor Armored Martial God Insect","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Diamond X/Fantasy V Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly’s forceful entrapment of insect-species feys would even be effective on Suzerain/Myth I insect-species feys.","Insect-species lifeforms included more than just insect-species feys as they also included alien insects.","Many high-grade alien insects had imposing appearances, but their souls were weaker than insect-species feys of the same level.","It was as easy for the Diamond X/Fantasy V Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly to control a Suzerain/Myth I fey as it was to control a Class 7 alien insect.","It would even be as easy for the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly to control a Suzerain/Myth II fey as it was to control a Class 8 alien insect.","Lin Yuan badly wanted the Class 8 alien insect Emperor Armored Martial God Insect.","The Emperor Armored Martial God Insect highly resembled a transformer that was wearing an insect’s armor and would change its form into different weapons when it was fighting.","The Emperor Armored Martial God Insect could rely on its sharp and strong armor to overcome most Myth II feys that had comprehended laws.","Normally, alien insects had lower combat power than other dimensional lifeforms, but the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect was different. It could use its armor and overwhelming strength to fight against the Scythe Bone Horned Demon, one of the Class 8 Devious Devils.","It might even win against the Scythe Bone Horned Demon if it attacked first.","It was just like the Heart-Penetrating Ironline’s position amongst the alien insects of the same grade.","If the 12 Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies could be used to control 12 Emperor Armored Martial God Insects and the carriage of the fey carriage was decorated in a clean and sharp metal style, the combination would be extremely dazzling.","Unfortunately, as dazzling as it would look, it would be difficult for Lin Yuan to obtain the Emperor Armored Martial God Insects as they only appeared in Class 4 and above alien insect dimensional rifts.","Although insects usually lived in colonies, the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect was a lone wolf through and through.","It spent its life killing and fighting.","Even if a large number of Class 8 alien insects poured out with the insect tide that emerged from a dimensional rift, there might not be the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect amongst them.","After all, other Class 8 alien insects could pour out of Class 4 alien insect dimensional rifts other than the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect.","When one was in need of nothing, such things often fell into their laps.","But when one went out of their way to search for something specific, it was always nowhere to be found.","Even if Lin Yuan managed to control a Class 4 alien insect dimensional rift and stood watch over the dimensional hub to wait for the waves of insects that poured out, he might not catch a glimpse of the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect even if he waited for months.","Moreover, Lin Yuan’s current power was not strong enough to explore a Class 4 alien insect dimensional rift.","Although the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly was a Diamond X/Fantasy V fey, its strength lay in trapping the souls of other feys.","The inside of an alien insect dimensional rift would be a playground for the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies as they could all control the soul of a strong alien insect.","If they did not want to control a single insect-species lifeform, they could easily use their souls to control an entire insect tide.","However, the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly would only be able to change targets once the fey it was currently trapping died.","If something went wrong with the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly’s trapping of an alien insect or it encountered a stronger alien insect and did not have the time to kill the alien insect it was currently trapping, the weak and valuable Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterfly could die in the Class 4 dimensional rift.","Naturally, Lin Yuan did not want this to happen.","Suddenly, a lightbulb appeared above Lin Yuan’s head.","He thought back to when Long Tu had mentioned that the Long family controlled several Class 4 dimensional rifts and had collected a mountain of Law Source Crystals while they were nurturing dragon-species feys in the Class 4 dimensional rifts.","Different Law Source Crystals appeared in different high-grade dimensional lifeforms.","High-grade alien insects that had similar power to Myth Breed feys created Law Source Crystals that had the unique aura of alien insects and could be separated easily.","A third of the over 10,000 Law Source Crystals that Long Tao had brought him came from alien insects.","This meant that there were many alien insects in the Class 4 dimensional rifts that the Long family controlled.","The Long family did not have much use for high-grade alien insects other than nurturing dragon-species feys. As such, there was no reason for the Long family to reject him if he asked to trade for living Emperor Armored Martial God Insects.","Lin Yuan felt that it was highly likely that his idea of riding on a fey carriage pulled by 12 Emperor Armored Martial God Insects would come to fruition.","Lin Yuan wanted the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect so badly because he had seen a field guide on the wall of Lan Qin’s fey observation room.","The picture on the wall depicted the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect with its armor moving backward and forming three complicated armor sets on its back.","The three armor sets were in the process of opening and looked like three sets of wings.","The Emperor Armored Martial God Insect looked like an undefeated six-winged angel of carnage.","The Emperor Armored Martial God Insect’s combat power was enough to protect the fey carriage and increase its safety.","After all, the best defense was the immediate destruction of enemies.","Lin Yuan raised his head to smile at the Moon Empress, revealing a row of pearly teeth. “Master, I really like the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies.”","The Moon Empress’ mood improved greatly when she heard what Lin Yuan said, and she felt the joy of a Master being able to look after her disciple.","After the Moon Empress and Lin Yuan talked for a while more, she left with Mystic Moon and Cold Moon and entered the Moonbeam Treasure Pagoda that was being pulled by the white and light green giant snakes.","As Lin Yuan watched the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage disappear in the distance, he turned to head toward the Hidden Moon Pavilion so that he could record all the combat skills and fighting strategies from the 72nd to the 87th floor.","The combat skills and fighting strategies recorded in the Hidden Moon Pavilion could not be compared to the public ones that were available on Star Web.","All the combat skills and fighting strategies recorded in the Hidden Moon Pavilion had been passed down from before the era of the Spirit Qi Awakening.","When the Spirit Qi Awakening had come, many of the combat skills and fighting strategies were lost to time.","There was no other place in the world besides the Hidden Moon Pavilion that had collected such a comprehensive set of combat skills and fighting strategies.","Lin Yuan went to the 72nd floor of the Hidden Moon Pavilion without encountering any issues and summoned Genius."]},{"number":813,"title":"Chapter 813 - Order of Radiant Light","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan said, “Genius, we should try our best to record all 15 floors worth of combat skills and fighting strategies by the end of today.”","Genius looked at the hundreds of shelves stacked full of ancient tomes and meowed as it said, “I can memorize things quickly, but I can’t read these books as quickly.”","Genius felt that his little paws would not be able to flip through 20 books in one day, much less hundreds.","Lin Yuan massaged Genius’ head and took a Star Web Card out of a box on one of the shelves.","Although all the information in the Hidden Moon Pavilion was presented in books, a backup set had also been stored on Star Web.","Genius’ eyes lit up when it saw the Star Web Card and said in a child-like voice, “Even if there are ten times more mines of information on Star Web, I would only need half an hour to memorize and organize all of it.”","Lin Yuan and Genius started taking out all the Star Web Cards on the shelves.","Genius logged onto Star Web and rapidly memorized all the combat skills and fighting strategies in the books.","After Genius memorized all 15 floors worth of information, Lin Yuan used the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass again. Every muscle in Lin Yuan’s body went into a hyper-memory state to memorize all the combat skills and fighting strategies that had been recorded in the 15 floors worth of books with Genius’ Connected Tails.","Lin Yuan recovered from the hyper-memory state and clenched his fist half an hour later.","Lin Yuan activated Blackie’s Spirit Essence Explosion, and a ball of blustering spirit qi appeared on top of Lin Yuan’s fist.","He realized that after learning all the complicated combat skills and fighting strategies, the muscles in his body had such fine control that it was almost magical.","This allowed Lin Yuan’s control of Spirit Essence Explosion to increase even further.","The muscles and spirit qi in the body supported each other.","Lin Yuan had finally perfectly combined the power of Spirit Essence Explosion with his own, and this would allow him to use Spirit Essence Explosion freely during battle to produce the greatest explosive damage.","Lin Yuan’s trump card for victory at the Guard Ye Banquet’s Martial Arts Stage would be this.","When Lin Yuan was about to return to the mansion, Liu Jie, who had been staying at the Spirit Guards’ land, opened his eyes.","The first thing that Liu Jie saw was Night Leaning Moon, who had been standing guard over him. Liu Jie hurriedly said, “Master, my Insect Queen has finished consuming the seven insect-species carcinoma feys and used its genes to recreate them. I can now control the seven insect-species carcinoma feys as I please.”","Liu Jie could not help but sigh in amazement. He had really been granted a huge blessing after crossing an insurmountable obstacle.","The Insect Queen that Lin Yuan had saved had mutated in an advantageous direction after absorbing the Blade Queen Bee’s spiritual poison. It had actually gained all of the Blade Queen Bee’s abilities and could control the Blade Worms.","However, the Blade Worms that the Insect Queen controlled were different from those that the Blade Queen Bee had controlled.","‘Blade Worm’ was just a blanket term. The Insect Queen could control any insect-species carcinoma fey with this spiritual poison, even the Blade Queen Bee.","A carcinoma fey like the Blade Queen Bee would be described as a disastrous entity on any battleground, and the Insect Queen had gained control of eight types of such disastrous entities.","Night Leaning Moon nodded. The shawl hid her face, but it was apparent from her gaze that she was in awe of Liu Jie’s growth.","“The plan that I mentioned to you can finally be carried out. This Insect Queen has created seven insect-species carcinoma feys, and including the Blade Queen Bee, you now have eight insect-species carcinoma feys under your control.","“However, this is just a start. Over millennia, especially during the Spirit Qi Thinning period, the Spirit Guards had collected over 1,000 types of insect-species carcinoma feys.","“When your Insect Queen gains more spiritual power, I’ll pick some insect-species carcinoma feys for you. From now on, you can use the Insect Queen to control more insect-species carcinoma feys and use each of them as a unique weapon. Your Insect Queen will become an arsenal that stores these weapons. But you should only use your sacred source lifeform as your weapon of last resort.”","Liu Jie smiled and nodded as he replied, “Don’t worry, Master. I will do my best during the Guard Ye Banquet’s Martial Stage.”","“I wasn’t the one who wanted to hold the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage. Those old fellows are the ones who want to see what the younger generation of the top factions is capable of. The prize for the Arts Stage is an Island Whale that’s about to hatch,” said Night Leaning Moon.","When he heard what the prize for the Arts Stage was, Liu Jie’s heart skipped a beat because he never expected an Island Whale that was about to hatch to be the prize.","Even a strategic-class like the Island Whale would be paraded around in public, and it was clear how stiff the competition for the Arts Stage was.","As the parallel to the Arts Stage, the Martial Stage’s prize was not any less impressive.","Liu Jie did not have to guess what the prize for the Martial Arts Stage, which was even more prestigious than the Arts Stage and Martial Stage, was as Night Leaning Moon continued. “The prize for the Martial Stage is the chance to create a custom-made weapon. The sacred source lifeform that will be used to make the weapon will be at least 4 Stars but not more than 6 Stars and will be sponsored by the Bamboo Monarch. As for the Martial Arts Stage’s prize, it will be a sacred source lifeform and the Order of Radiant Light.”","Liu Jie inhaled sharply, and he could not help but exclaim, “The Order of Radiant Light!?”","The prizes for the Martial Stage and Arts Stage had already astonished Liu Jie, but it was nothing compared to how he felt about the Order of Radiant Light."]},{"number":814,"title":"Chapter 814 - My Disciple is Luckier Than Me","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Liu Jie felt that the Order of Radiant Light was even more valuable than a sacred source lifeform. This was not because it could increase a person’s power like a sacred source lifeform could.","The Order of Radiant Light was an order made from metal spiritual ingredients and did not have any uses on its own.","However, it had exceptional symbolism because it was linked to Radiance Envoys.","Radiance Envoys were not only chosen from the Radiance Hundred Sequence but also people who held the Order of Radiant Light.","From the five members of the previous generation, the people from the next generation who had the Order of Radiant Light were given the right to apply to be a Radiance Envoy.","The Order of Radiant Light came from the imperial court, and every generation of Radiance Envoys would have ten Orders of Radiant Light that were to be given out to them.","9 out of the 10 Order of Radiant Lights had been given out to the current generation of potential Radiance Envoys within the last five years.","The Order of Radiant Light that was going to be given out to the champion of the Guard Ye Banquet’s Martial Arts Stage would be the tenth and last one.","This meant that the champion of the Martial Arts Stage had the chance to become a Radiance Envoy.","There was more than one advantage to obtaining an Order of Radiant Light. Even if the person who had an Order of Radiant Light did not end up becoming a Radiance Envoy, they would be able to join an exclusive ten-member group that would protect the five Radiance Envoys known as the Radiance Riders Team.","When Liu Jie had found out that there would be a Martial Arts Stage at the Guard Ye Banquet, he had instinctively thought of Lin Yuan.","Among all the people that Liu Jie knew, Lin Yuan was the most impressive Creation Master and combat-class spirit qi professional.","However, he also felt that the Guard Ye Banquet was being held too early.","If the Guard Ye Banquet was held one year later, both the Order of Radiant Light and sacred source lifeform would be all but Lin Yuan’s.","This year, Lin Yuan had already decided to try out for the Radiance Hundred Sequence. Given Lin Yuan’s power, it would be easy for him to be accepted as a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Before the Radiance Envoy selection, the top ten Sequences of the Radiance Hundred Sequence would have the chance to become Radiance Envoys.","At that point, none of the Radiance Hundred Sequences would be hiding their power, and they would definitely engage in a ferocious battle with each other.","This would cause the Sequence to be thrown into chaos.","Previous Radiance Envoy selections had had a point-accumulation examination style, and the top five applicants with the highest points would become Radiance Envoys.","If the Order of Radiant Light was not used and one became eligible for the Radiance Envoy selection by being one of the top ten Sequences of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, the Order of Radiant Light would be equivalent to 100 points at the start of the Radiance Envoy selection. This would give all who had the Order of Radiant Light a leg up.","It would be too much of a waste if Lin Yuan missed this opportunity.","Since Liu Jie no longer needed Night Leaning Moon to watch over him, she prepared to leave the Spirit Guards’ land to head toward Midnight Palace.","Given that Night Leaning Moon was the organizer of the Guard Ye Banquet, she was already late.","Although there were still a few days before the Guard Ye Banquet, today was the day to discuss and make preparations.","By now, even Chef Supreme, who was always last to arrive, should have already reached Midnight Palace.","Just as Night Leaning Moon was turning to leave, Liu Jie called out to stop her.","She turned back to Liu Jie, who said, “Master, I want to wear the Spirit Guards’ standard mask during the Guard Ye Banquet.”","A look of shock crossed Night Leaning Moon’s face.","The Guard Ye Banquet was supposed to be for Liu Jie to declare his identity and let everyone know whose disciple he was.","Thus, if he wore a mask at such an event, half the meaning of holding the Guard Ye Banquet would be gone.","Nonetheless, Night Leaning Moon could tell that Liu Jie was not asking a question or making a request.","The moment Liu Jie and let the first words pass his lips, he became determined.","Night Leaning Moon asked Liu Jie in confusion, “Why?”","The Spirit Guards’ standard mask was a special mask that the Spirit Guards wore during missions to prevent enemies from getting a good look at their appearance.","It covered almost every inch of skin on the face.","The inner side of the Spirit Guards’ standard mask also had the skin of the Sound Shark that could alter voices.","If Liu Jie wore the Spirit Guards’ standard mask, even those who were extremely familiar with his voice would not be able to tell that it was him.","Hence, Night Leaning Moon was extremely curious about Liu Jie’s reason for wanting to do so.","Liu Jie gently placed his hand on the Class 2 Creation Master crest on his chest.","When she saw this action, Night Leaning Moon immediately understood what Liu Jie was thinking.","“Master, I’m Lin Yuan’s retainer knight, and he will be participating in the Guard Ye Banquet. I don’t want to attract more attention than him before he reveals his identity.”","Liu Jie’s words were simple, but they gave Night Leaning Moon a feeling like she had just traveled through time.","The Moon Empress and I were just like this. All I wanted was to quietly stand behind her and protect her. But she didn’t choose me. She chose Mystic Moon. My disciple is luckier than me.","Night Leaning Moon sighed and said simply, “Okay.”","She turned, walked out of the door, and disappeared like a mass of eternal night into the blazing afternoon light.","...","When Lin Yuan returned to the mansion, there was nothing he had to attend to.","There was no news from Condense Fairy Orchard or the Sea Bliss Clan.","Although they still had a trade agreement, not even Sun Ningxiang was contacting Lin Yuan as often as before.","Since Condense Fairy Orchard was a top faction, they would have to be in attendance at the Guard Ye Banquet.","There were only three main members left in the Sun family. Given that Sun Ningxiang needed the Bronze/Legend Muscle Growth Camellia, her grandmother’s injuries would definitely prevent her from traveling to the Royal Capital to attend the Guard Ye Banquet.","Sun Ningxiang’s brother was still young and oblivious.","Thus, Sun Ningxiang should be attending the Guard Ye Banquet on her own.","Since wolves were currently circling Condense Fairy Orchard, she would certainly have a hard time at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Lin Yuan had a business deal that he wanted to propose to Sun Ningxiang at the Guard Ye Banquet as the disciple of the Moon Empress."]},{"number":815,"title":"Chapter 815 - Two Bloodlines and The Queens Evolution","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan had yet to contact the Long family to ask about the Emperor Armored Martial God Insects.","He had not even properly studied the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies and 12 balls of water that came from the dead Moving Source Water.","Lin Yuan decided to push these matters until after the Guard Ye Banquet.","But the Astronomical Parliament’s weekly parliamentary meeting still took place.","Lin Yuan and Wen Yu could be more relaxed about this parliamentary meeting.","The seven-day interval between the parliamentary meetings was very short and a person like Yin Lin with her impressive background might have many things to do in a week.","But to Bei Xu, a week would just fly by. He might not even be able to completely acclimatize to the Sharp Shadow Bat within a week.","In this parliamentary meeting, Lin Yuan and Wen Yu would not be talking as much as before. Instead, they would be listening to Yin Lin and Bei Xu talk about the joys of their new lives and the things they had experienced in the past week.","Before Yin Lin and Bei Xu formed contracts with the north-south constellation seats, they were not considered members of the Astronomical Parliament.","Hence, as the contractor of the Leo throne, Lin Yuan could check their willpowers.","But they were now members of the Astronomical Parliament because they had formed contracts with the Andromeda and Perseus north-south constellation seats.","As a sign of respect, Lin Yuan could no longer check on their willpowers.","It gave Lin Yuan and Wen Yu great joy to listen to what had transpired in Yin Lin and Bei Xu’s lives in the past week.","Yin Lin’s experiences over the last week had been like a dream and she was like a princess in a fairy tale that had just woken up from a curse.","She had become her most radiant self the moment she woke up and started her life as a real princess.","Yin Lin also told Lin Yuan about how she had awakened the beast patterns.","She was sure that her awakening of the Spirit White Lion and Azure Cloud Leopard beast patterns had something to do with Lin Yuan.","Although she did not know what Lin Yuan had done to give her sight, she knew that this strength could help her to awaken the dormant beast patterns inside her.","Lin Yuan was extremely shocked by Yin Lin’s description of the beast patterns and he did not expect Yin Lin to have two kinds of fey bloodlines in her.","When feys reached Myth II, they could change into human form and start families with human spirit qi professionals.","Since their offspring could awaken beast patterns, Yin Lin’s ancestors had to be Creation Breed feys.","However, fey bloodlines were always dominating and the bloodline of different feys countered each other.","It was just like how Chimey’s original bloodline had definitely viciously fought against the luan-species bloodline when Chimey evolved.","Thus, it was rare for a situation like Yin Lin’s where two beast patterns emerged to occur.","The awakening of two different beast patterns meant that two different Creation Breed feys’ bloodlines had been unlocked.","Although spirit qi professionals had weak bodies that could not sustain the power of both beast patterns in their bodies, they would be able to apply the beast patterns onto their contracted feys that were the same species of the beast patterns’ bloodlines and improve the feys’ growth.","Yin Lin had opened her eyes and her talent at the same time and her road would be extremely smooth from now on.","As the system, Lin Yuan had found a prime main character. He would no longer need to be worried much about Yin Lin from now on.","But for Bei Xu, the more Lin Yuan listened to his experiences the more he felt that something was wrong.","Finally, Lin Yuan knew where the problem lay.","Bei Xu carried the Diamond fey storage box and two bottles of spirit fluid all the time in the perilous subterranean world but he did not use any of the items.","This action was so silly that it was a little cute.","However, Lin Yuan could not explain such simple common knowledge to Bei Xu with words.","This common knowledge was picked up naturally and slowly in life. If Lin Yuan tried to explain it to Bei Xu, it would be like he was teaching a baby.","There were many things that had to be explained from the beginning.","If Bei Xu was given an explanation based on one item, he might be even more confused.","Even if he tried to teach Bei Xu, Wen Yu’s half an hour limit that she was able to sustain the Astronomical Parliament for would not even be close to enough. It was likely that it would take Bei Xu six months to pick up all the general knowledge.","Left without any choice, Lin Yuan could only use a few laws to bring over some books with basic knowledge fey grades and qualities, Willpower Runes, Diamond fey storage boxes and their uses, the relationship between spirit qi professionals, feys, and Creation Masters.","It took a fair amount of laws for Lin Yuan to transfer over these books.","It was really true that the most valuable thing in the world was knowledge.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan felt that it was necessary to provide Bei Xu with this knowledge.","A person who wanted to fight to be at the top was not afraid of hardship but of being oblivious.","Lin Yuan wanted to remove Bei Xu’s wall of obliviousness by enabling him to understand this basic knowledge.","A few more days passed in the blink of an eye and the Guard Ye Banquet was upon them.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had tried its best to absorb all the energy in the law source crystals and generated a pile of law crystals.","The number of law crystals produced filled up a sack and Lin Yuan sent them all to Endless Summer so it could evolve to pinnacle Myth III.","But even after evolving to pinnacle Myth III and absorbing a large number of law crystals with pure law power, Endless Summer still had not evolved to Creation Breed.","The pit that separated Myth III and Creation Breed feys had trapped countless feys and it was extremely difficult to overcome.","Lin Yuan had already provided Endless Summer with more law crystals than he had originally expected.","But since he had such a large amount of law source crystals that could support Endless Summer’s use of them, all Lin Yuan had to do was continuously provide Endless Summer with law crystals to help it cross the pit.","Besides providing pure law crystals, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt had accumulated so many laws that the world it depicted was almost real.","Lin Yuan breathed in deeply and thought to himself.","Endless Summer hasn’t evolved to Creation Breed before the Guard Ye Banquet as per my expectation. I wonder if the Dark Death Law on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt will be able to successfully transform to Dark Death World before the Guard Ye Banquet?","Lin Yuan ordered the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, “Queen, inject all the law source energy that you absorbed into the Myth III Dark Death Law.”"]},{"number":816,"title":"Chapter 816 - Laws Into Worlds","paragraphs":["When Lin Yuan issued the order to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, his face was full of austerity rather than confidence.","As Endless Summer used up more and more Law Crystals, it told Lin Yuan that although it had already anticipated an extremely high obstacle to cross in the evolution from Myth Breed to Creation Breed, it had still underestimated the difficulty.","Although it had not been long since Endless Summer had evolved to Myth III, its foundation was much weaker than veteran Myth III feys.","However, Endless Summer’s double cores allowed it to make up for its deficiency.","Given its talent, Endless Summer only had to keep accumulating resources, and it would eventually have enough to overcome the Trial of World Creation and evolve into Creation Breed.","The talented Endless Summer had already used up close to 3,000 of Lin Yuan’s Law Crystals over the last few days, and more than 4,000 if the previous Law Crystals were also included.","Even with the sea of Law Crystals being invested in it, Endless Summer still did not show any sign of a breakthrough to Creation Breed.","Using Endless Summer’s example as a base, it would take much longer than Lin Yuan anticipated for the Dark Death Law on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt to transform into the Dark Death World.","This thought caused Lin Yuan’s mood to plunge.","The Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage at the Guard Ye Banquet only allowed one person to participate in one event.","Without Dark Death World, even if Lin Yuan had surpassed martial arts experts using the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass and could produce the same amount of damage as a Diamond X/Fantasy V fey using Spirit Essence Explosion, he could not confidently say that he would be able to emerge victorious at the Martial Arts Stage.","If the Dark Death Law did not transform into the Dark Death World before the Guard Ye Banquet, Lin Yuan decided he would give up on the Martial Arts Stage and set his sights on the Arts Stage instead.","However, Lin Yuan would still have to take a gamble if he wanted to win the Arts Stage.","If the Arts Stage coincidentally involved the evolution of fey grades, Lin Yuan would be helpless.","Although the Guard Ye Banquet’s Arts Stage would definitely provide an undisturbed environment for the Creation Masters to concoct spirit fluids, Creation Masters could also use their feys as support while they were concocting the spirit fluids.","This meant that Lin Yuan could still bring along Genius.","Even though Genius could use its spiritual power to concoct Grade 3 spirit fluids, it still had not mastered how to use its soul to concoct Grade 4 spirit fluids.","The younger generation in the Radiance Federation had to be people who were below 30 years old. This meant that all the Creation Masters from top factions who were below 30 years old could participate in the Arts Stage.","It might be difficult to become a Class 4 Creation Master before 30, but it was possible to become a pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master.","Long Tao was only 26 years old, but he was already a Class 3 Creation Master.","Given his talent, it was almost guaranteed that he would become a pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master before he was 30 years old.","The younger generation of Creation Masters from other top factions was definitely not more talented than Long Tao, but they could be equally talented.","In this battle of the great, Genius’ ability as a Class 3 Creation Master was far from being impressive.","Moreover, both Bamboo Monarch and Chef Supreme had disciples who were within the age group and had higher power than Long Tao.","Lin Yuan felt the pressure on his shoulders grow heavier.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had stopped absorbing the Law Source Crystals ever since it received Lin Yuan’s order.","As it sensed the power from over 4,000 Law Source Crystals that it had absorbed, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen felt eagerness rise up within it.","The main way for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to increase its Stars was to absorb the law power inside Law Source Crystals and use the source-type power inside to strengthen the laws on its skirt.","The Sacred Source Wielding Queen had absorbed so much source power, but Lin Yuan had told it not to use any of it, meaning that its Stars had yet to increase.","It would take a large amount of source-type power to evolve the Dark Death Law.","This would also increase the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s power and Stars.","The source-type power from the Sacred Source Wielding Queen’s skirt had spread throughout its entire body and caused its pale skin to glow.","The highest area of the world depicted on the skirt was made out of the Dark Death Law and Dead Dream Law.","These two different dark-type laws formed the cloudy dark sky that was full of withered death and perplexity on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","At this moment, the Night Calamity Crow formed from the Dark Death Law in the vivid world on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt was tangled up with the source-type power.","The source-type power continuously poured into the Night Calamity Crow’s body and caused the aura in its body to expand.","This caused a change in the status between the Dream-Eating Bat and Night Calamity Crow.","Instead of both competing on equal ground, the Night Calamity Crow was hunting while the Dream-Eating Bat was running.","As the Night Calamity Crow continued to grow stronger with the increasing amount of source-type power in its body, the Dream-Eating Bat that was formed from the Dead Dream Law dared not fight back even as it was attacked.","The Dream-Eating Bat had no choice but to fly down toward the sea.","Time passed, and the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen continued to use the source-type power it had accumulated.","With every passing minute, the power from about 50 source-type crystals was used and injected into the Night Calamity Crow that had been formed from the Dark Death Law.","An hour passed and the source-type power from over 3,000 Law Source Crystals resulted in the Night Calamity Crow’s aura rising to its peak.","The Night Calamity Crow was like a strong balloon, and the source-type power was the air. This balloon could no longer take any more air.","Lin Yuan knew that he just needed to inject more source-type power into the Night Calamity Crow to enable it to cross over that seemingly insurmountable obstacle.","Once it crossed the obstacle, the Night Calamity Crow would become the Dark Death World.","After he sensed the Dark Death Law’s situation, Lin Yuan ordered the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, “Inject the source-type power from 500 Law Source Crystals into the Dark Death Law.”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen hesitated before saying, “Master, I think the Dark Death Law has already reached its limit. I think the source-type power from another few hundred Law Source Crystals won’t cause the Dark Death Law to change into Dark Death World.”","Lin Yuan said firmly in a low voice, “Just use the source-type power from 500 Law Source Crystals.”"]},{"number":817,"title":"Chapter 817 - Dark Domination and the Power to Wither","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan paused for a moment before saying, “Actually, just go ahead and use the source-type power from 700 Law Source Crystals.”","He could not help but think of his conversation with Endless Summer.","According to Endless Summer, laws did not need to absorb more power to transform into worlds.","Endless Summer needed a large number of Law Crystals not because it needed to strengthen its Enlightenment Law but because it needed the pure law power to act as an energy source for the Enlightenment Law so that it could tear away from its mold to open the door to Creation Breed.","Since it needed a breakthrough, the more power it had, the higher chance of success it would have.","Lin Yuan equated this to flushing a toilet.","If a toilet was clogged, not even pouring in hundreds of cups of water individually would help to unclog it.","But if 500 cups’ worth of water were poured in together, the high volume of fast-flowing water would likely be able to unclog the toilet.","After the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen received Lin Yuan’s orders and understood his intention, it stopped hesitating and combined the source-type power from 700 Law Source Crystals to inject it into the Night Calamity Crow that was formed from the Dark Death Law.","The influx of such a large amount of source-type power caused the Night Calamity Crow’s body to expand.","When the Night Calamity Crow’s body expanded to its limit, it exploded into pieces that flew out in every direction.","Dark shadows appeared where the pieces landed and formed endless darkness.","The darkness stacked together and formed a dark world full of murder.","This world spread out like ink in water, and it seemed to be consuming every inch of the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen closed its eyes and started to sway its skirt.","The other laws and willpowers in the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt lunged toward the Dark Death World but seemed to be missing a layer of metaverse that prevented the Dark Death World from expanding.","Rather, this made it easier for the Dark Death World to absorb them.","Just as the Dark Death World was about to refine these laws and willpowers, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen removed its crown and tossed it into the world in the skirt.","An enormous crown that took up almost the entire sky in the world in the skirt appeared.","The crown spun around and radiated with limitless power that pulled the Dark Death World into the foreground.","As the crown absorbed the newly transformed Dark Death World, it became a large and pure black gem that embedded itself in one of the notches on the crown.","The black gem was so pure that it was transparent, and one look would be enough to see the swirling world full of death that was inside.","A small black crow appeared at the center of the Dark Death World and flapped around like it was the heart of the Dark Death World.","When Lin Yuan saw this, he knew that the Myth III Dark Death Law had successfully transformed into the Dark Death World.","The price had been the source-type power from 3,700 Law Source Crystals.","The Sacred Source Wielding Queen’s Stars had also increased from 1 Star to 2 Stars after the Dark Death Law evolved to Dark Death World.","Lin Yuan was delighted yet slightly crestfallen by the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s evolution to 2 Stars.","He had been keeping track of the Law Source Crystals, and Law Crystal fragments that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had absorbed.","Although the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had only taken one month to increase its Stars, it had used up almost 500 grams of Law Crystal fragments and 5,000 Law Source Crystals.","Luckily, Lin Yuan had Brocade Zither to continuously produce Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Otherwise, Lin Yuan’s feys that produced heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls would have to work to the bone to produce enough elemental pearls for the Sacred Source Wielding Queen to increase its Stars.","Lin Yuan had been full of confidence that his 16,000 Law Source Crystals would be enough to sustain the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen for some time and enable it to evolve to 4 Stars and gain a second ability.","However, he was only left with about 10,000 Law Source Crystals. It would be difficult for the Sacred Source Wielding Queen to evolve to 3 Stars using only these.","But at least the Dark Death Law had evolved to the Dark Death World and met one of Lin Yuan’s expectations.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was holding up its crown and peering closely at the black gem.","It looked a lot like Endless Summer when it had just bought new accessories.","Lin Yuan stared at the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen who still showed no sign of placing the crown back on its head after ten minutes.","He could not help but let out a sigh.","Lin Yuan did not know how other sacred source lifeforms were nurtured, but the process of using so many Law Source Crystals and Law Crystal fragments to evolve the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen felt like an expensive dress-up game to him.","He did not interrupt the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s admiration of the Dark Death World. Instead, he sensed the Dark Death World through his soul.","Joy and excitement broke out on Lin Yuan’s face.","From the power of the Dark Death Law, Lin Yuan knew why it was difficult for Myth Breed feys to evolve to Creation Breed feys and why Creation Breed feys were so much stronger than Myth Breed feys.","It was because Creation Breeds attained the ability of worlds that could not be compared to the power of laws.","Lin Yuan tested the power of the Dark Death World, and a terrifyingly intimidating power rose from his body.","It was like the domination of a dark world.","He had noticed that the laws on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt could not produce the special strengths in the feys like how Endless Summer’s Enlightenment Law could enlighten a plant every five years.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s Blood Law could extract essence blood from other feys without the help of Creation Masters.","These were all special abilities of laws.","Now, the Dark Death World had also given Lin Yuan a new ability, the ability to wither."]},{"number":818,"title":"Chapter 818 - Sword Skill: Night Crow Wither Attack","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The power to wither was aimed at plant-type feys.","When the dark death power was applied onto plant-type feys, it would cause the plant-type fey to rapidly wither and wilt.","The ability to wither that came from the Dark Death World was not very important to Lin Yuan, but it was still better to have it than to not have it.","Lin Yuan sensed the Dark Death World and noticed that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s Sacred Sword Form could use the Dark Death World to attack like it did with other laws.","There was also an additional line that was something of an ability that appeared under the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s Sacred Sword Form.","This ‘ability’ was formed from the Dark Death World.","Sword Form (Dark Death World): Night Crow Wither Attack: Inject all the power from the Dark Death World into the sacred sword. The sacred sword’s blade will change into 28 Night Crows with dark death power. The contractor can attack with the sacred sword 28 times. If the attacks are launched consecutively, every attack will have an additional withering effect. Every 14 layers of withering effects will be released toward the target, and the 56 withering effects from the 28 consecutive attacks will cause the target to truly start withering.","When he saw the new information about Dark Crow Wither Attack, Lin Yuan asked the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, “What does the new Sword Form that appeared under the Sacred Sword Form mean?”","“Master, every time I gain a new world now, a new Sword Form will appear under the Sacred Sword Form. They are different from the attacks that come from law power. Although they are utilized in the same manner, the Sword Forms that represent the world power need to be recharged with world power each time they are used.","“However, the Sword Form can trigger the effects of the world power and will be much stronger than if the world power itself was used. Unfortunately, the Sword Form is very challenging. Very strong combat skills and fighting strategies are required to use the Sword Form,” replied the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","Lin Yuan looked eager and excited after hearing what the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen said.","When it came to combat skills and fighting strategies, Lin Yuan knew that there were always more talented people out there, but he highly doubted that any of them could beat him.","If even he could not use the Sword Form consecutively, it would be unlikely that anyone else would be able to.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s Sword Form might as well have been made for him specifically.","Lin Yuan asked the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, “After each use of the Dark Crow Wither Attack, how long does it take for the Dark Death World’s energy to be replenished?”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen twiddled its fingers before saying, “If you don’t replenish the source-type power with Law Source Crystals, it’ll take a month for the Dark Death World’s energy to be replenished naturally. If Law Source Crystals are used, it’ll take four weeks to be replenished.”","Lin Yuan’s expression seemed to be asking, “Are you kidding me?”.","What was the difference between four weeks and a month?","Four weeks added up to 28 days, while a month was 30 days.","The use of source-type power only shortened the time by two days and seemed insignificant amongst the 30 days.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan asked the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, “How much source-type power is needed?”","A pained expression came over the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen as it said, “Master, the two-day difference requires the source-type power from 600 Law Source Crystals.”","Lin Yuan immediately decided that he would never use source-type power to replenish the Dark Death World’s energy.","He did have any other complete laws that could evolve into worlds.","With so many extra laws, Lin Yuan might as well nurture more law worlds to increase the number of Sword Forms. With more Sword Forms, the time for replenishment for each Sword Form would be shortened in a way.","Since the Sword Form had such a long interval between each use, the enthusiastic Lin Yuan decided not to test out the Dark Crow Wither Attack once and to use it only when necessary.","Through the information on True Data, Lin Yuan noticed that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s sacred source type did not mention dark-type/mixed-type.","[Sacred Source Name]: Sacred Sword Wielding Queen","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 2 Stars","[Sacred Source Type]: Dark (Main)/Mixed","Abilities:","[Queen Form]:","1. Queen’s Skirt Hem: Able to absorb the Willpower Runes from the bodies of dead feys or source-type items. The Willpower Runes or Law Runes from Myth Breed feys’ Law Crystals will be carved on the queen’s skirt. The Law Crystals which have their laws absorbed will become Law Crystals that possess pure law power.","[Sacred Sword Form]:","1. Blade of Sacred Sword: When the spirit qi in the body is depleted, the blade will pierce the skirt hem to unleash all the laws and willpower stored within.","Sword Form (Dark Death World): Night Crow Wither Attack: Inject all the power from the Dark Death World into the sacred sword. The sacred sword’s blade will change into 28 Night Crows with dark death power. The contractor can attack with the sacred sword 28 times. If the attacks are launched consecutively, every attack will have an additional withering effect. Every 14 layers of withering effects will be released towards the target, and the 56 withering effects from the 28 consecutive attacks will cause the target to truly start withering.","The change in the data only appeared after the Dark Death Law evolved to Dark Death World.","The law world type determined the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s sacred source type. Since mixed-type was mentioned, it meant that the more sacred source types could appear as the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen acquired more law worlds.","It could also mean that other types could replace dark-type.","Lin Yuan checked the time and realized that it was already 6:00 a.m.","There were only 12 hours to go before Lin Yuan and Liu Jie were supposed to go to the Guard Ye Banquet.","Lin Yuan did not plan on being idle during the 12 hours. He planned on using the time to improve himself.","He first told the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to absorb the Myth III Vicious Poison Law Crystal.","Since the Dark Death Law had transformed into the Dark Death World and was embedded as a gem on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, the Night Calamity Crow had disappeared from the world in the skirt."]},{"number":819,"title":"Chapter 819 - Two Brocade Boxes and Early Before the Guard Ye Banquet","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Now, the Dream-Eating Bat made from the Dead Dream Law would be at the top of the pecking order.","Unfortunately, an enormous python covered in verdant green scales appeared in the sky before the Dream-Eating Bat could enjoy being at the top.","This enormous python with green scales was the Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python from which the Vicious Poison Law Crystal had come.","As the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbed the Vicious Poison Law, the Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python’s body started to become more solid.","Once the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen finished absorbing the Vicious Poison Law, the Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python let out a roar before charging toward the flying Dream-Eating Bat.","It clashed with the Dream-Eating Bat a few times, but since the Dream-Eating Bat and Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python were both about Myth III, they could not gain the upper hand against each other.","The fight did not seem to be coming to an end, so the Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python flew to the ground to rule over the land and sea while the Dream-Eating Bat ruled over the sky.","This caused the feys on land and sea made from willpowers and laws to tremble in fear,","Lin Yuan was extremely curious about what changes would take place to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen once it finished absorbing the Vicious Poison Law.","Anytime that a law in the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt had dominating power, the world in the skirt would undergo tremendous changes.","After the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbed the Vicious Poison Law, Lin Yuan’s resistance against poison was raised significantly.","With the Myth III Vicious Poison Law applied on Lin Yuan’s body, he could drink the venom of a Normal/Platinum poison-type fey, and his body would not be damaged in any way.","However, he might not be as safe if it was the venom of a Platinum/Fantasy poison-type fey. After all, some of the venom of Platinum/Fantasy poison-type feys contained spiritual poison or soul poison.","The Vicious Poison Law would not be able to protect Lin Yuan from spiritual poison or soul poison.","Still, the resistance to poison that the Vicious Poison Law provided Lin Yuan would allow him to not have to be so cautious when he fought against high-grade poison-type feys.","Even if an attack landed on him, Lin Yuan’s life would not be in any immediate danger.","Lin Yuan ordered the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to inject the rest of the source-type energy in its body into the Cold Flames Law, which could provide Lin Yuan with resistance against both fire and ice.","Although the Cold Flames Law was of lower quality than the other two complete laws, it took precedence over the Dead Dream Law and Vicious Poison Law.","There was still about 800 Law Source Crystals’ worth of source-type energy left in the Sacred Source Wielding Queen’s skirt after the Dark Death Law evolved to the Dark Death World.","It was much easier to evolve a law than it was to transform it into a world.","Only about 400 Law Source Crystals were required to evolve the Myth II Cold Flames Law to Myth III.","The Sacred Source Wielding Queen injected source-type energy into the Cold Flames Law and quickly evolved it to Myth III.","The remaining source-type energy enabled the Cold Flames Law to evolve to pinnacle Myth III.","While the Cold Flames Law was evolving, the Cold Snow Pine in the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt started to grow rapidly.","The flourishing pine branches extended outward like the spine of a dragon and quickly grew to take up a third of the Dream-Eating Bat’s territory.","The Cold Flames’ aura spread throughout the world on the skirt like a song of fire and ice and deterred even the Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python that was about to rest on the branches of the Cold Snow Pine.","The world in the skirt changed from equal jurisdiction between the Dream-Eating Bat and Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python to three combating forces between the Dream-Eating Bat, Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python, and Cold Snow Pine.","The feys formed from the shattered laws and willpowers joined the three camps and immediately breathed more life into the world in the skirt.","Lin Yuan was about to test his resistance to fire and ice by asking Chu Ci to use the Burning Sunflower to burn him. Thus, he checked the time and realized that 12 hours had passed unknowingly. There were only 12 minutes left till he and Liu Jie were supposed to head off.","He hurriedly left the Spirit Lock spatial zone and changed into elegant but not overly attention-grabbing blue and white spirit qi clothes before leaving his room.","Lin Yuan walked downstairs and saw Wen Yu, the Mother of Bloodbath, and Chu Ci sitting on the water rhinoceros leather sofa.","There were two brocade boxes on the table in front of the water rhinoceros leather sofa.","One of the boxes was moon-colored with apricot patterns and moon images, while the other was ink-colored with the patterns of hundreds of ferocious beasts.","The beasts seemed to be lurking in the darkness and were ready to pounce at any moment.","Lin Yuan was confused when he did not see Liu Jie downstairs. He was already late by only coming downstairs 12 minutes in advance,","Could the always-punctual Liu Jie have forgotten the time?","Liu Jie was going to be the main character in the Guard Ye Banquet.","While Lin Yuan was thinking, he heard the faint sound of the door closing and soon saw Liu Jie appear on the stairs behind him.","When Liu Jie saw Lin Yuan, he scratched the back of his head awkwardly and said, “I was testing the Insect Queen’s new combat style in the training room. I had only intended on training for a while, but the time got away from me, and I ended up being late.”","Lin Yuan realized that he and Liu Jie had encountered the same situation.","Although the time was tight, they could still make it to Midnight Palace if they rushed.","Wen Yu saw Lin Yuan and Liu Jie come down together and hastily said, “Young Master, Big Brother Liu, Master and the Spirit Guards’ left- and right-hand men sent over two sets of clothes. They said that the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye had sent them over specially so that the both of you can put them on before the Guard Ye Banquet started.”","Wen Yu placed the moon-colored brocade box into Lin Yuan’s hands and the ink-colored brocade box into Liu Jie’s hands.","Chu Ci bounded up to them with curiosity and asked, “Lin Yuan, Big Brother Liu, what kind of clothes are in the boxes?”"]},{"number":820,"title":"Chapter 820 - Hehe, Angry","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Lin Yuan heard the way Chu Ci called Liu Jie, he could not help but think,? She calls Liu Jie Big Brother Liu but calls her actual brother by his given name.","However, he was already used to this. After so many years together, Lin Yuan and Chu Ci had already found the most comfortable way to interact with each other.","Lin Yuan and Liu Jie opened their brocade boxes and were almost blinded by the shining clothes inside.","Using True Data, Lin Yuan found out that more than 900 types of spiritual materials were on the clothes inside the box.","The Return from Faraway Mansion’s Submerged Flood Dragon Lake, basement, and main building were all decorated opulently. But even if the entire Return from Faraway Mansion was sold, it would not even be worth one of the sleeves of the clothes inside the box.","The Mother of Bloodbath peered inside the boxes and exclaimed, “The Moonbeam Coronation and Night Clear Water Coronation Costume. Shouldn’t the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye be the ones to wear the Moonbeam Coronation Costume and Night Clear Water during an event like the Guard Ye Banquet?”","The Mother of Bloodbath had always known that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’s disciple, but it was only when the Spirit Guards’ right- and left-hand men arrived that the Mother of Bloodbath realized that Liu Jie was the Spirit Guard Chief’s disciple.","While the Mother of Bloodbath was surprised about Liu Jie’s new identity, it always felt that both Liu Jie and Lin Yuan kept an extremely low profile.","The Mother of Bloodbath carefully studied the clothes that it had identified as the Moonbeam Coronation Costume and Night Clear Water Coronation Costume. A moment later, it became certain that its identification had been wrong.","They were just clothes made specifically for Lin Yuan and Liu Jie that were made out of the same materials as the Moonbeam Coronation Costume and Night Clear Water Coronation Costume.","These two sets of clothes did not have the patterns that signified the authority of the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye.","Other than this, the clothes were identical to the Moonbeam Coronation Costume and Night Clear Water Costume. It was no wonder that the Mother of Bloodbath had initially identified them to be so.","Even Wen Yu, who used to be a spirit attendant in the Radiant Moon Palace, wrongly assumed Lin Yuan’s brocade box clothes to be the Moonbeam Coronation Costume.","When they heard what the Mother of Bloodbath said, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie looked at each other.","The clothes in the brocade box were so decked out and intricate that it would not be convenient to wear them to compete in the stages.","Luckily, the Guard Ye Banquet only took place after the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage.","He could change into the clothes that his Master had sent him after the competition was over.","Lin Yuan and Liu Jie stored the clothes away in Diamond brocade boxes and bade farewell to Wen Yu, Chu Ci, and the Mother of Bloodbath before they left the Return from Faraway Mansion and headed to the Midnight Palace.","Lin Yuan was going to declare his identity at the Guard Ye Banquet, but he was in no rush to add on the title of the Moon Empress’ disciple.","The Guard Ye Banquet would be Lin Yuan’s chance to interact with the younger generation of top factions. Even the Zheng family and Miao family, who were his enemies, would be in attendance.","There was no chance of him showing mercy as he crushed his enemies.","...","Beautiful paintings hung on the walls in a lovely house, the gems embedded in precious weapons placed around the house sparkled, and the bamboo garden outside jutted elegantly from the ground.","Inside Langya Pavilion, a woman’s head was lowered as she touched a stem of purple bamboo.","With her gaze lowered, her rose-like face had a guilty expression, and it was clear that the Defined Life earring that hung from her ear had lost its brilliance.","At that moment, the sound of footsteps could be heard outside her door.","When the woman turned to look toward the door, she saw a short-haired middle-aged woman with a face that said she had experienced her fair share of life walk in and say, “Master, from my investigation, I discovered that the pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master from Connected Beast Park who will be attending the Guard Ye Banquet is Miao Qi.”","The woman with the guilty expression frowned, and a predatory aura rose from her body.","“There are so many members of Connected Beast Park’s older generation that can participate in the Guard Ye Banquet. Yet, they choose Miao Qi out of all of them. They’re clearly targeting me!”","The short-haired middle-aged woman lowered her head, her eyelid twitching, as she thought,? I knew uttering Miao Qi’s name would spell trouble. Master gets angry every time she hears Miao Qi’s name. But it’s no wonder she reacts like that. Lord Bamboo Monarch adored Master for so long, and she rejected him every time because she thought that her life was cursed.","Miao Qi took advantage of the situation to put on a nice act in front of Lord Bamboo Monarch while publicly provoking Master. She even said that Master and Lord Bamboo Monarch could never end up together. This caused Master to forget her place and agree to be together with Bamboo Monarch, which led to him being wrapped up in bad luck.","Master is still troubled over this, but Miao Qi chose such a time to appear at the Guard Ye Banquet. Miao Qi is a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master. Could she be planning to do something at the Guard Ye Banquet? If so, Master might end up doing something in retaliation.","While the short-haired middle-aged woman was deep in thought, Wang Fuxiang said, “Ah Jing, go and pick a few nice clothes out of those that the Bamboo Monarch gave me. You’ll be taking my place, representing Langya Pavilion at the meeting.”","Ah Jing lifted her head and asked Wang Fuxiang in surprise, “Master, don’t tell me you’re going to—”","Wang Fuxiang gnashed her teeth and hissed before Ah Jing could finish speaking. “I didn’t want to make a spectacle at the Guard Ye Banquet because there are already enough rumors flying around me. But since Miao Qi wants to humiliate me at the Guard Ye Banquet publicly, she has crossed the line. Hehe, since she’s bent on humiliating me, I’ll launch an attack that they will need two generations to fend off.”","Ah Jing was about to urge Wang Fuxiang to calm down, but she remembered that Wang Fuxiang could never calm down about such matters.","“Master, Lord Bamboo Monarch said that he likes your purple clothes best. I will bring over the purple clothes that were a gift from Lord Bamboo Monarch,” said Ah Jing hurriedly.","Ah Jing hurried off to retrieve the purple clothes that were a gift from the Bamboo Monarch out of Wang Fuxiang’s almost 1,000 sets of clothes.","Luckily, her Master only had close to 1,000 sets of clothes.","If there were any more, Ah Jing probably would not be able to find the purple clothes before the Guard Ye Banquet started.","At the same time, Ah Jing felt bad for Wang Fuxiang.","Her Master was a romantic but fate had cursed her to only be able to experience facades of love.","If not for Lord Bamboo Monarch’s strong powers and that he was a Class 5 Creation Master that could concoct spirit fluids to counter the bad luck, Wang Fuxiang could have killed him with one kiss."]},{"number":821,"title":"Chapter 821 - Beast Head Forest","paragraphs":["Wang Fuxiang lowered her head again after Ah Jing left and gently caressed the purple bamboo.","A single teardrop fell from her eye and splashed onto the leaf of the purple bamboo.","It was as though the bamboo leaf could not bear for the teardrop to fall as it gently held the drop up and allowed it to slide down the stem where the tear was finally hidden in the roots.","“If only I could tear myself away from this bad luck,” murmured Wang Fuxiang.","A look of inexplicable bitterness appeared on Wang Fuxiang’s face.","...","At that moment, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie arrived at the Midnight Palace.","The Midnight Palace was different from the Radiant Moon Palace as the Midnight Palace was situated in the Royal Capital.","The Beast Head Forest surrounded the Midnight Palace, and all the beast heads were carved from stone.","The combination of the over 10,000 stone-carved beast heads with the night irises that covered the floor of the forest made the area surrounding the Midnight Palace look like a piece of night juxtapositioned against the daytime.","It was already after 6:00 p.m., and the sky was only beginning to darken, but as he walked into Beast Head Forest, Lin Yuan felt that he was walking through an illuminated path in the dead of night.","The stone-carved beast heads’ mouths had a glowing gem inside each of them.","The light from the glowing gems was different from sunlight, and the night irises could not absorb the light from the gems at all.","This was why the light from the gems could illuminate the path through the Beast Head Forest to the Midnight Palace.","As he walked along the path in Beast Head Forest, Lin Yuan realized that there were many people around him, their auras exuding elitism as they were dressed in spirit qi clothes.","There were normally no attendants in the Midnight Palace. Thus, the people with the lowest status that would appear at the Midnight Palace came from the veteran factions, while those of a higher status came from the top factions.","The people of the highest status were the true bigshots that could almost be called royalty.","“The grades of the stone-carved feys’ heads are becoming higher. These feys are already Diamond grade. If we walk forward more, we should be out of the Beast Head Forest,” said Liu Jie.","Liu Jie could not help but sneer. “Who designed Master’s Beast Head Forest? Why does it feel like we’re walking through a fey graveyard?”","Lin Yuan nodded instinctively.","But a moment later, he looked at Liu Jie in shock due to how Liu Jie looked when he was complaining and why Liu Jie was not complimenting his Master’s residence instead.","After they walked out of the Beast Head Forest, Lin Yuan was met with another stunning sight.","The entire Midnight Palace was built from stone and exuded a stern and rough beauty.","The pillars and beams had various spirit beasts carved on them.","Lin Yuan peered at the carvings on the pillars and beams and noticed that there were no dragon species feys.","Did Chief Guard Ye not like dragon-species feys, or was there some special reason?","Since the Guard Ye Banquet started at midnight, the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage took place beforehand.","Those who came to attend the Guard Ye Banquet could choose not to participate or watch the competition.","Liu Jie was the main character of the Guard Ye Banquet, so it was slightly late for him to arrive at the Guard Ye Banquet at 6:00 p.m.","But it was just the right time for the veteran factions and top factions.","At that moment, the leaders and disciples of the veteran and top factions who came to attend the Guard Ye Banquet simultaneously held their breaths.","They noticed an elderly man with average features dressed in a black robe standing at the entrance of the Midnight Palace.","However, this elderly man was not average in the eyes of the veteran factions and top factions.","This elderly man was Lordess Night Leaning Moon’s right-hand man, Lord Zuo Ming.","From Lord Zuo Ming’s straight posture and how his hands were behind his back, he seemed to be waiting for someone.","The younger generation of the veteran factions and top factions did not think much about it, but the leaders immediately started to ponder.","Who was so important that Lord Zuo Ming would stand out here waiting for them?","Those who were considered royalty should have arrived at the Midnight Palace a few days ago.","This meant that it was highly possible that Lord Zuo Ming was waiting for someone from the younger generation.","Meanwhile, Sun Ningxiang had just stepped out of the Beast Head Forest. Although she felt unbelievably melancholic, she kept her expression calm and unbothered.","When Condense Fairy Orchard had received the invitation for the Guard Ye Banquet, Sun Ningxiang had anticipated that she would run into Connected Beast Park.","Besides Connected Beast Park, who intended to subsume Condense Fairy Orchard, there were other top factions who could also be after Condense Fairy Orchard.","Sun Ningxiang hated the feeling of being hunted, but she could not avoid the situation because there was no one else in the Sun family who could attend the Guard Ye Banquet.","However, there was a hint of hopefulness laced into the melancholy.","After her grandmother had received the Legend Muscle Growth Camellia from Sky City, the decaying of her muscles had slowed.","This significantly reduced the amount of stress on her grandmother.","Her grandmother usually used spirit qi to counter the decaying of her muscles.","Now that she had the Legend Muscle Growth Camellia to counter the decaying of her muscles, the addition of the spirit qi led to new muscles starting to grow.","Her grandmother used to only have a year to live, but the new muscle growth would allow her to live for two more years without any problems as long as she did not do anything that would lead to a soul injury.","Sun Ningxiang started to make silent plans.","Given their plethora of Creation Master resources, there’s no way that Sky City will not have received an invitation to the Guard Ye Banquet.","Although Condense Fairy Orchard only had a trading relationship with Sky City, Sun Ningxiang was still incredibly grateful to Sky City and that strange mask-wearing young man.","Given Condense Fairy Orchard’s perilous situation, Sky City was the only faction that not only did not take advantage of Condense Fairy Orchard but was even willing to help them.","While Sun Ningxiang was deep in thought, she caught sight of two figures walking ahead of her.","The sight of these two figures made Sun Ningxiang’s eyes narrow."]},{"number":822,"title":"Chapter 822 - Zong Ze and Gu Lang","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Sun Ningxiang watched as the two tall and well-proportioned men climbed the stone steps up to the Midnight Palace.","One of the men was dressed in purple clothes with bamboo embroidery.","The other man was dressed in a crimson half-armor that was full of scratches.","The man in purple clothes had bushy eyebrows and looked extremely handsome. There was a ghost of a smile that played on his lips.","The other man dressed in crimson half-armor had deep-set eyes and a grim face.","However, the mole on the tip of his nose made the solemn man look obedient and an easy target.","A smile appeared on Zuo Ming’s face, and he welcomed the man in purple and the man in crimson half-armor as he said, “Lord Gu Lang, Lord Zong Ze, Lord Bamboo Monarch, and Lord Chef Supreme are still in a meeting. If you don’t want to be bothered by the noise, I can lead you to the Night Words Pavilion to have some refreshments or to the training room next to the Night Rain Pavilion to wait for the competition to start.”","When Gu Lang heard what Zuo Ming said, he bowed respectfully.","Zong Ze nodded at Zuo Ming and cooly greeted him.","Since his Master, the Bamboo Monarch, was still in a meeting and after he had peered around at the younger generation of the top factions, he thought to himself that he would be able to get a good look at the action from outside the palace.","He was about to say that he would prefer to wait for the competition to begin when he heard Zong Ze say, “Senior Zuo Ming, please lead the way. Gu Lang and I can make use of the training room to spar for a bit.”","Gu Lang and Zong Ze were old friends, and he knew Zong Ze well.","Zong Ze had almost killed a Path Protector and was obsessive about fighting.","If he sparred with Zong Ze in the training room and Zong Ze got too into it, Gu Lang might not be able to use any of his secret weapons during the Martial Arts Stage.","He was about to reject Zong Ze when he felt Zong Ze’s hand land on his shoulder and Zong Ze’s eyes boring into his own with a wild gaze.","“Don’t worry, Zong Ze. Master has given me some special training. He taught me how to control my emotions during battle. We’ll limit our sparring so as to not affect our performance during the competition. Let’s fight properly on the Martial Arts Stage,” said Zong Ze.","Gu Lang shot a look of suspicion at Zong Ze.","Gu Lang felt that Zong Ze’s assurance was unreliable when he saw the overwhelming wild look in Zong Ze’s eyes.","But since Zong Ze had urged him repeatedly, Gu Lang could not say no.","He decided to forget about watching the action and went with Zong Ze to the training room to spar for a few rounds.","Zuo Ming led Zong Ze and Gu Lang through the Shadow Night Corridor that the other veteran factions and top factions were not allowed to access and brought them to the Night Words Pavilion.","Sun Ningxiang noticed that Zuo Ming had turned back to look around.","This made Sun Ningxiang raise her eyebrow in surprise.","Zuo Ming was the Chief Guard’s right-hand man and did not hesitate in his actions.","Since he turned back after leading Gu Lang and Zong Ze to the Night Words Pavilion, it meant that they were not the people that he had been waiting for.","Although the people he was waiting for had yet to arrive, he could not ignore Gu Lang and Zong Ze’s status and knew that he had to attend to them.","This meant that the people that Zuo Ming was actually waiting for had to be extremely influential.","The Chief Guard was holding the Guard Ye Banquet because of her disciple, and there were rumors that the Moon Empress had also accepted a disciple.","It was probable that Zuo Ming was actually waiting for his Young Lord and the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Sun Ningxiang kept her gaze locked on Zuo Ming and realized that he had stopped sweeping the crowd once he spotted someone.","When Sun Ningxiang hurriedly followed his gaze, her eyes landed on a man wearing a standard Spirit Guards mask.","She saw the masked man shake his head lightly when he saw Zuo Ming looking at him.","Zuo Ming turned back and went back to leading the way for Zong Ze and Gu Lang.","Almost every person’s attention was on Gu Lang and Zong Ze. They were the apples of Lord Chef Supreme and Lord Bamboo Monarch’s eyes, and they were not seen publicly on a regular basis.","Many women from the veteran factions and top factions leered after Gu Lang and Zong Ze.","If not for their fear of offending such elite individuals, those women would have stampeded the two men.","However, Sun Ningxiang was not paying attention to the two men at all. When she had noticed Zuo Ming’s actions, her gaze remained locked on Liu Jie and Lin Yuan.","The people who could signal to Zuo Ming with only a shake of their head could only be Chief Guard Ye or Chief Guard Ye’s disciple.","Zuo Ming was loyal to Chief Guard Ye and represented her will. Not even Chef Supreme or the Bamboo Monarch could order Zuo Ye around.","Thus, after some thinking, Sun Ningxiang became certain of who the man wearing the standard Spirit Guards’ mask was.","As for Lin Yuan, who was beside Liu Jie, Sun Ningxiang found his figure slightly familiar, and her gaze lingered on him.","She was sure that Lin Yuan was not one of the younger generation members from the top factions but could not be certain of who he was.","Since she could not ascertain who he was, Sun Ningxiang decided to disregard him and inhaled deeply as she started to climb the steps to the Midnight Palace.","She steeled herself for the spectacle that she was about to create.","With so many willpowers and laws applied to his body, Lin Yuan’s senses were exceptionally sharp. Hence, he had noticed Sun Ningxiang’s eyes on him.","He smiled when she saw her and turned to say to Liu Jie, “Big Brother Liu, why don’t we stay outside the Midnight Palace before the Martial Arts Stage begins?”","Liu Jie nodded and issued a curt agreement.","He placed his hand on where the Creation Master crest usually was.","Due to the Guard Ye Banquet and a request from Lin Yuan, Liu Jie had removed the Creation Master crest.","From Liu Jie’s understanding of Lin Yuan, the latter was not one who liked to gawk.. Hence, he had to have his reasons for wanting to stay outside the Midnight Palace."]},{"number":823,"title":"Chapter 823 - The Main Show Begins","paragraphs":["This motive had to have something to do with Sky City’s expansion, but Liu Jie was not familiar with the faction society.","He had not been analyzing Sky City’s expansion like he used to. Instead, he had been spending all his time outside of training working on the white-clothed followers plan.","Since he would not be able to help Lin Yuan with anything later outside the palace, Liu Jie decided to perform his role as Lin Yuan’s shield and sword to protect him during the Guard Ye Banquet.","Liu Jie and Lin Yuan followed Sun Ningxiang through the stone pillars to enter the area outside of the Midnight Palace.","Lin Yuan knew about Condense Fairy Orchard’s dangerous situation, but he did not expect someone to jump Sun Ningxiang the moment she stepped foot into the area outside the Midnight Palace.","Every faction that participated in the Guard Ye Banquet wore clothes that had icons of their factions. It was rare to see someone like Lin Yuan whose clothes did not have the icons of any factions.","Lin Yuan recognized who the two men in front of the Sun Ningxiang were from the icons on their spirit qi clothes.","These two men had very similar appearances and had distinctive noses and eyebrows.","Lin Yuan could tell that they were either brothers or cousins from their appearances. But given the way they stood, it seemed that the two similar-looking young men had completely different status rankings.","Lin Yuan could not help but touch his chin.","The show is starting so quickly! The main character has also stepped onto the stage. That’s quick.","The two men standing in front of Sun Ningxiang and the man that Sun Ningxiang had bumped into were wearing purple spirit qi clothes.","Lin Yuan had seen the purple spirit qi clothes before. It was Connected Beast Park’s famous standard Hundred Beasts New Sprouts uniform.","The full collar of sprouts on the man’s Hundred Beasts New Sprouts uniform indicated that the man was one of the main members of the Miao family’s younger generation of direct descendants.","The young man next to the man wearing the Hundred Beasts New Sprouts uniform was wearing a standard Creation Master uniform.","The man’s Creation Master long robes had a small ‘Zheng’ written on the collar. From the information about the Zheng family that Wen Yu had collected, it was clear that this young man was the Second Young Master of the Zheng family with whom Lin Yuan was currently feuding.","The area outside the Midnight Palace had different arches, and the various leaders of the veteran factions and top factions headed into the palace while the younger generation remained outside to mingle.","Thus, the young man wearing the Hundred Beasts New Sprouts uniform did not bother to filter his speech.","“Hehe, Sun Ningxiang. You’ve been avoiding me and the discussion about the collaboration between Connected Beast Park and Condense Fairy Orchard. Now that we’re standing face to face, I don’t think you can avoid me anymore.”","He whistled softly and looked extremely cavalier.","Most of the younger generation that remained outside the Midnight Palace had come to make connections.","After all, there were not many chances for the younger generation of major factions to gather.","However, some of them came to join in the excitement.","When they saw a commotion occurring, many disciples of veteran factions rushed up.","It was rare to be able to see the direct descendants of top factions being made fun of.","Lin Yuan saw that one of the people who had rushed up to join the crowd was the Young Master of the Sea Bliss Clan, Qi Haitao.","Lin Yuan had thought to himself that the show’s main character had appeared, but now, the supporting characters had also appeared.","Sun Ningxiang watched the throngs of disciples from veteran factions and some direct descendants of top factions who wanted to gawk at the commotion approaching her. She breathed in deeply and said, “Miao Zhuo, Condense Fairy Orchard has always conducted ourselves by our principles. If anyone sincerely wants to work with us, we definitely won’t say no.”","Miao Zhuo’s face fell.","Although Sun Ningxiang had been indirect about it, her words clearly meant to say that Condense Fairy Orchard had been avoiding a discussion because Connected Beast Park was not sincere about wanting to work with Condense Fairy Orchard.","When it came to such matters, people usually kept their actual feelings to themselves instead of saying so directly.","By saying it directly, Sun Ningxiang had announced that Connected Beast Park was not sincere when it came to their collaborations.","With so many disciples from veteran factions and top factions around, Sun Ningxiang’s words had shot a hole in Connected Beast Park’s public reliability.","Just as Miao Zhuo was about to launch a rebuttal, Sun Ningxiang continued, “I, Sun Ningxiang, am the head of Condense Fairy Orchard. I’m the leader of an elite faction. You are just one of the more favored members of the Miao family’s younger generation. Can you decide on the direction in which Connected Beast Park will progress from now on? Or can you decide how Connected Beast Park’s Creation Master resources are allocated? If not, what right do you have to stand before me to discuss a collaboration? Your father should be the one to seek me out for negotiation personally.”","Sun Ningxiang’s words made Miao Zhuo’s expression darken tremendously.","He glared fiercely at Sun Ningxiang and sneered. “As a faction, Condense Fairy Orchard is on its last legs. You can’t even compare to veteran factions at this point. You—”","Sun Ningxiang sternly cut in before Miao Zhuo could finish speaking. She sharply swept her surroundings before exclaiming, “Did you just say that my Condense Fairy Orchard can’t even compare to a veteran faction? With so many people from veteran factions here, you can ask any of them. See if any of them dare to say that their faction is stronger than Condense Fairy Orchard. Or why don’t you ask if the Zheng family thinks of themselves as more powerful than the Sun family?”","Sun Ningxiang had turned her charisma to the maximum and was firmly standing toe to toe against Miao Zhuo.","But while she spoke, Sun Ningxiang’s fist remained clenched as tightly as a vice as she willed herself to maintain the charisma she was exuding.","If she allowed her charisma to weaken, the top factions that were watching would think that she was incapable and Condense Fairy Orchard would be in even greater danger.","At that moment, Miao Zhuo felt that Sun Ningxiang had cornered him.","After all, Condense Fairy Orchard still had a thearch-class expert, which was why Connected Beast Park had not dared to come down strongly on Condense Fairy Orchard.","Condense Fairy Orchard would remain above veteran factions regardless of what happened to them with a thearch-class expert.","Miao Zhuo was not stupid enough to drag his cousin Zheng Kaiyuan down with him in such a situation.","Miao Zhuo’s eyes suddenly lit up, and he pointed toward Lin Yuan."]},{"number":824,"title":"Chapter 824 - Drag Down","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan was the only person standing around the commotion who did not have an obvious icon on his body. Miao Zhuo asked him, “That boy over there, which do you think is stronger? Connected Beast Park or Condense Fairy Orchard?”","Miao Zhuo’s words made everyone’s gaze focus on Lin Yuan.","Many people were shocked when they got a clear look at his face.","Lin Yuan and Liu Jie had walked behind Sun Ningxiang, and Miao Zhuo immediately targeted her when she stepped into the area outside the Midnight Palace.","Thus, no one had paid attention to Lin Yuan, who was behind her.","Lin Yuan’s performance had been brilliant at the Allstar Match since he had defeated a member of Savage Snake Guild Club’s main team without even summoning any feys.","He had become the hot topic of discussion on Star Web.","The disciples of veteran factions and top factions of similar age to Lin Yuan had recognized Lin Yuan. Many of them had even tried to find out information about him previously.","However, their investigations came up with nothing. It was as though Lin Yuan had materialized out of thin air.","This created even more curiosity surrounding him.","In this era where power equated to resources, even if a spirit qi professional was exceptionally talented, there were many feys available to form contracts with, and it was easy for them to comprehend Willpower Runes.","But without sufficient resources, a spirit qi professional would never be able to become strong. This meant that Lin Yuan had to be sitting on a mountain of resources.","This was proved by Lin Yuan’s right to appear at the Guard Ye Banquet.","When he saw Miao Zhuo pointing at him, a look of amusement appeared on Lin Yuan’s face.","Almost all the main characters had entered the stage, but he had not had the chance to go up yet.","Lin Yuan had been trying to come up with a way to enter the stage as well, but now, without him having to lift a finger, Miao Zhuo had offered him that opportunity.","Sun Ningxiang looked at Lin Yuan and the masked Liu Jie.","Strong tense energy radiated from Sun Ningxiang.","Since Lin Yuan had come with the man wearing the Spirit Guards’ standard mask, it meant that they were friends.","No matter what Lin Yuan’s identity was, Miao Zhuo had also dragged in the masked man by singling Lin Yuan out.","It was not strange that a commotion had broken out between the younger generation of disciples at the Guard Ye Banquet.","But if the main character of the Guard Ye Banquet was involved as well, it would be a huge mistake.","Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother had gotten on the wrong side of Chief Guard Ye by killing three pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters.","If Chief Guard Ye tried to assign blame for this ruckus, the Miao family’s thearch-class experts could ask for forgiveness on Miao Zhuo’s behalf, but her grandmother was still in no shape to make a public appearance. Otherwise, Condense Fairy Orchard’s biggest secret would be exposed.","The Condense Fairy Orchard that she was fighting to keep afloat was about to be torn to pieces by the other factions.","Sun Ningxiang felt that her charisma was waning at that thought.","At that moment, the clear voice of a young man sounded out. “Naturally, there aren’t any veteran factions that can compete with Condense Fairy Orchard. Otherwise, they would have already been promoted to elite factions. Veteran factions are not idiots, and they care about their reputation. They definitely would prefer not to be compared so casually.”","This voice stunned Miao Zhuo, Sun Ningxiang, Zheng Kaiyuan, and the rest of the gawkers from the veteran factions and top factions.","They started looking at him strangely, and more people joined the crowd.","A discerning person would have noticed that Miao Zhuo had purposely chosen a person without any icons on their body.","This was so that he would not offend and start a feud with any veteran faction.","Moreover, when Miao Zhuo spoke, he turned Sun Ningxiang’s words and changed the comparison from Condense Fairy Orchard and veteran factions to between Connected Beast Park and Condense Fairy Orchard.","At their prime, Condense Fairy Orchard had no need to be fearful of Connected Beast Park as both factions ranked amongst the top 20 of the 50 top factions.","However, Condense Fairy Orchard had used up almost all of their Creation Master resources, and they were close to dropping out from the ranks of top factions. It was now impossible for them to compete with Connected Beast Park.","Connected Beast Park’s role had led to an increase in their Creation Master resources, and the general consensus was that Connected Beast Park had slightly more influence than other top factions.","But Miao Zhuo would never have expected that the person he picked not only did not respond to his line of questioning but even responded to the question that he had been trying to avoid.","Additionally, the person he had picked had even strangely brought up that veteran factions would prefer not to be casually compared.","Now, it seemed as though Miao Zhuo was disrespecting veteran factions and was about to lead to a feud with them.","Miao Zhuo’s blood boiled.","Miao Zhuo would have grabbed Lin Yuan’s collar and slapped him if they were not outside the Midnight Palace.","It was a simple question, how dare he be so disrespectful!?","Miao Zhuo had to be considerate of Sun Ningxiang, but for someone who was not even wearing any icons, Miao Zhuo did not plan on being cordial.","He looked at Lin Yuan and said in a low voice, “Since you’re aware that veteran factions care about their reputation, you should be aware that Connected Beast Park cares about our reputation even more.”","Miao Zhuo watched at the young man who looked in a certain direction and said in a voice that was neither rushed nor slow, “It seems that Connected Beast Park isn’t doing a very good job of taking care of your reputation. Even the veteran factions that you spoke lightly of aren’t showing you respect. Some of them have presented the violation of contracts to the Spirit Guards. As much as Connected Beast Park cares about your reputation, you’ll probably still have to cough up a hefty sum.”","Miao Zhuo followed Lin Yuan’s gaze, and his eyes landed on Qi Haitao.","When he saw Qi Haitao, Miao Zhuo saw red.","Miao Zhuo’s anger scared Qi Haitao.","The dispute between the Sea Bliss Clan and Connected Beast Park was an insult to Connected Beast Park.","The Sea Bliss Clan had spent a large sum to form a collaboration with the Five Thearch Soldiers.","The Five Thearch Soldiers had bought several islands with Sea Bliss Clan’s support, and they were in charge of ensuring the safety of the Sea Bliss Clan members and their business on the island."]},{"number":825,"title":"Chapter 825 - Have Some Fun at the Combat Ground","paragraphs":["Connected Beast Park could not lay a hand on the Sea Bliss Clan with the Five Thearch Soldiers around.","Hence, the Sea Bliss Clan was still able to receive an invitation to appear at the Guard Ye Banquet as one of the veteran factions.","Miao Zhuo looked at Qi Haitao and said coldly, “Instead of holing up in your islands, is the Sea Bliss Clan here at the Guard Ye Banquet to try to strike up some collaborations for Creation Master resources?”","Although Miao Zhuo’s expression was hard, his tone was level, and he also retracted some of his malicious aura while he spoke.","But everyone present could sense his menacing intention from his level tone and knew that the commotion had turned into a fight from the moment the young man mentioned Qi Haitao.","When he saw Miao Zhuo’s reaction, a satisfied gleam appeared in Lin Yuan’s eye.","Now, after being incited by Lin Yuan, Qi Haitao had no choice but to perform on stage.","Lin Yuan did not do this to force the Sea Bliss Clan to enter the fight to exert pressure on the Miao family because the Sea Bliss Clan was incapable of doing so.","He did this to trigger the fight and to cause the Sea Bliss Clan to feel more pressure from Connected Beast Park.","The stronger the pressure that the Sea Bliss Clan felt, the more pressed they would be to work with Sky City and the more urged they would be to inject resources into the nurturing of the Angelfish of Bliss.","This would enable Lin Yuan’s action of buying up all the Aurora pollen in the market to leave a bigger impact.","A spark of courage flickered to life in Sun Ningxiang while she listened to the young man speak.","This led to her gaining control of her waning charisma.","She had felt that Lin Yuan seemed familiar when she saw him outside the Midnight Palace. Later, she realized that he was the young man she had seen at the Allstar Match.","However, doubt crept up in Sun Ningxiang.","She had seen the Allstar Match, but it was not enough for her to gain a sense of familiarity from him.","She had definitely met this young man by the name of Lin Yuan before.","When she heard what Lin Yuan had said, Sun Ningxiang suddenly felt that Lin Yuan’s voice was extremely similar to that of the young man from Sky City.","Their physiques were also very similar.","While Sun Ningxiang studied Lin Yuan’s chin, she started to form a mental image.","She tried to imagine that strange mask on Lin Yuan’s face and compared her memory of the young man from Sky City with this new image of a mask-wearing Lin Yuan.","Sun Ningxiang’s eyes lit up because both were a perfect copy of each other.","Although doppelgangers existed, it was absurd for two people to have the same appearance and the same voice.","Sky City had clashed with Connected Beast Park because of Condense Fairy Orchard, and Connected Beast Park had tried to make a move on Sky City several times already.","If this young man was really a member of Sky City, it made sense why he would be targeting Connected Beast Park.","Sun Ningxiang was an expert at analyzing speech. The first time she was at Sky City and was negotiating a deal, she noticed animosity between the mask-wearing youth and the Sea Bliss Clan.","It would explain why Lin Yuan was pulling Qi Haitao into the fray now.","One point of contention could be a coincidence, but if every point of contention and evidence pointed in the same direction, that direction was highly likely to be accurate.","Sun Ningxiang instinctively took a step toward Lin Yuan and calmed herself to observe and decide her next move.","Qi Haitao knew that he was in trouble now that Miao Zhuo had called him out.","Since the Sea Bliss Clan had taken the contract to the Spirit Guards to request compensation from Connected Beast Park, it was inevitable that they were burning the bridge between them and Connected Beast Park.","Given that there was no way out and it would be useless to pretend to be meek because it would only result in humiliation, Qi Haitao steeled himself and looked Miao Zhuo in the eye as he said, “The Sea Bliss Clan has always conducted business by the book. It was Connected Beast Park that violated the contract first. All we want is some compensation. As for Creation Master resources, we have no need for them. After partnering with Sky City, we’re filled to the brim with Creation Master resources. But you were right about collaborations. After increasing our stock of Angelfish of Bliss, we’ll start holding auctions. If any faction wants to work with us and establish trade deals, they can approach me directly.”","Qi Haitao spoke loudly and was basically advertising for the Sea Bliss Clan in an attempt to pull in a partnership.","Connected Beast Park was pressuring the Sea Bliss Clan, and many factions that they had worked with in the past had pulled away from them after being warned by Connected Beast Park.","They had all but cut off all communication with the Sea Bliss Clan.","Qi Haitao would have been very conscious of this serious loss in connections in the past.","But even though there were no factions who were currently on friendly terms with the Sea Bliss Clan, as long as the Sea Bliss Clan could maintain their collaboration with Sky City, their expansion could proceed as normal.","After all, the Sea Bliss Clan had dominated the market on Angelfish of Bliss.","Although spiritual-type feys were rare, there were many of them in the Radiance Federation.","If one had spiritual-type feys, the fish coats of Angelfish of Bliss would be required.","Thus, now that they had settled their Creation Master resource issues, the Sea Bliss Clan did not need to be afraid of Connected Beast Park’s pressure of their loss in connections.","Naturally, Qi Haitao’s words added fuel to the fire of Miao Zhuo’s rage.","Miao Zhuo’s gaze snapped to Lin Yuan, and he looked Lin Yuan and Qi Haitao over before saying, “There’s still some time before the Martial Stage begins. How about the three of us have some fun at the combat ground there according to the rules of the Martial Stage?”","The gawkers knew that Miao Zhuo could no longer hold himself back and was making a move.","The Martial Stage’s rules stated that as long as the opponent was not killed, any attacks could be launched until the other party admitted defeat.","When the Martial Stage officially began, there would definitely be some experts who would try to control themselves and not cause their opponent serious injuries while still gaining the upper hand for themselves.","If they agreed to Miao Zhuo’s proposition, he would definitely fight as savagely as he could."]},{"number":826,"title":"Chapter 826 - Lin Yuan is my Brother","paragraphs":["The people who were looking around did hope that the fight that Miao Zhuo proposed would take place.","The scuffles between Connected Beast Park and the Sea Bliss Clan were old news, and the crowd was barely interested in them.","However, they were extremely curious to find out what Lin Yuan’s true powers were.","Since Miao Zhuo was one of the favored main disciples, he was definitely more powerful than Meng Xu.","Given that Miao Zhuo was a B-rank spirit qi professional, he should have already used Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds to roll his feys’ grades.","This meant that Miao Zhuo’s strongest fey had reached Diamond/Fantasy.","Lin Yuan would have to summon the fey that he had kept hidden at the Allstar Match in a fight with Miao Zhuo.","At that moment, Zheng Kaiyuan reached out to tug at Miao Zhuo and whispered, “My mother said that you’ve been by Grandfather’s side for the last few months, increasing your Creation Master powers. She said you’re a stone’s throw away from becoming a Class 4 Creation Master. You might not be aware, but this young man was the one who injured one of the main members from our cousin’s guild club.”","Miao Zhuo frowned slightly.","He had shut himself off for a few months and had rushed to the Royal Capital directly after without checking Star Web.","He liked to read through the posts and had heard of Lin Yuan.","However, he had not watched the Allstar Match and had not seen how Lin Yuan looked. Otherwise, he would not have singled out Lin Yuan.","Suddenly, a figure stepped forward and wrapped Lin Yuan in a bear hug.","Gao Feng looked at Lin Yuan and said, “I sent you a few messages, but you didn’t reply. It turns out you’ve started some trouble here.”","Gao Feng naturally took his place by Lin Yuan’s side and frowned at Miao Zhuo as he said, “Miao Zhuo, Lin Yuan is my brother. If you want to come after him, I’ll consider it a personal insult.”","It was clear from Gao Feng’s actions that he was extremely close to Lin Yuan. Otherwise, he would not have immediately inserted himself between Lin Yuan and Miao Zhuo and stood by Lin Yuan’s side.","Gao Feng’s actions warmed Lin Yuan’s heart.","When Lin Yuan interacted with others, he was sincere with anyone that he was certain was his friend or family.","Gao Feng’s actions proved that he had been genuine when he called Lin Yuan his brother.","Gao Feng truly regarded Lin Yuan as his brother in his heart.","Otherwise, Gao Feng would not have stood by Lin Yuan against a top faction that was ranked even higher than the Gao family.","Gao Feng did not know that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","The top and veteran factions were all shocked by Gao Feng’s sudden appearance.","They could not help but think,? It’s never been heard of that there was any dispute between the Gao family and the Miao family!","However, it was clear from Gao Feng’s familiarity with Lin Yuan that the latter had to be of high status.","The younger generation of the top 50 factions that were present more or less knew each other. Yet, none of them had heard of Lin Yuan.","Miao Zhuo’s brow furrowed even tighter after Gao Feng’s sudden appearance. He wondered whether Gao Feng had stood up for Lin Yuan because of Condense Fairy Orchard.","But now that he had clashed against two top factions, a veteran faction and the unknown Lin Yuan, Miao Zhuo could not back out.","At that moment, two voices sounded out from near Lin Yuan.","Miao Zhuo was extremely familiar with one of the voices, and it was one that disgusted him to no end.","Long Tao and Li Xuan walked up to Lin Yuan and greeted him in a friendly manner.","Apparently, they were good friends with Lin Yuan.","Numerous gawking veteran factions’ disciples let out gasps of shock.","They felt that it was already rare that someone like Lin Yuan was friends with someone like Gao Feng, who was the disciple of a top faction. But it was even more astonishing that Lin Yuan was friends with Long Tao and Li Xuan as well.","From Gao Feng’s reaction, it was clear that he was not close to Long Tao and Li Xuan. This meant that Lin Yuan had not been introduced to Long Tao and Li Xuan through Gao Feng.","Li Xuan aside, although Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had expanded quickly, they still had no thearch-class experts and were considered a lower-middle top faction.","However, Long Tao was different because he was the sole direct descendant of Coiling Dragon’s Valley and held the title of Young Leader.","Just like Gao Feng, Long Tao’s words could be considered to represent the wishes of his faction.","Not only was Long Tao the Young Leader of Coiling Dragon’s Valley, but he was also Sequence #3 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Long Tao always had a sharp tongue, and many disciples of top factions had been disgusted by him before.","He did not care about them.","Yet, he was now naturally placing his hand on Lin Yuan’s shoulder, and everyone present was utterly bowled over in shock.","Moreover, Li Xuan was looking at Lin Yuan with obvious gratitude.","This added a thicker shroud of mystery around Lin Yuan.","Since Long Tao and Li Xuan had approached him, Lin Yuan knew that unless Miao Zhuo was stupid, this commotion would be coming to an end.","Lin Yuan let out a breath. Although he had used Connected Beast Park to pressure the Sea Bliss Clan, Lin Yuan’s plan would have lost some of its interest without this commotion.","After greeting Lin Yuan, Li Xuan looked at Miao Zhuo and said coldly, “If you come after Lin Yuan, you’ll have to deal with me too.”","Although Li Xuan spoke simply, he had an extremely imposing manner.","Next, Long Tao took over and said, “I heard that Master Miao Qi invited you specially. If she finds out that you’re causing trouble here and angering people who you can’t afford to anger, will she regret bringing you and replace you with Miao Jue or Miao He instead? Frankly, they are much stronger than you.”","When he heard what Long Tao and Li Xuan said, Miao Zhuo’s face turned pale, and he scoffed while silently comforting himself,? Long Tao is such a big mouth!","He forced his anger down and pointed at Qi Haitao as he said, “Qi Haitao, we’ll settle things after the Guard Ye Banquet.”","Next, Miao Zhuo pointed at Lin Yuan and was about to address him when a shadowy figure that seemed to be wrapped in a soul shot toward Miao Zhuo’s finger that was jutting toward Lin Yuan.","When the shadowy figure made contact with the finger, Miao Zhuo’s fingers started to tangle around his hand."]},{"number":827,"title":"Chapter 827 - Liu Jies Powers Increased","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","With his hand and fingers tangled together, a crisp crack whipped through the air, followed by blood-curdling sounds of grinding.","The insufferably arrogant Miao Zhuo let out an ear-splitting howl of pain.","With the fingers wrapped together, any force exerted on them would lead to excruciating pain.","Miao Zhuo’s fingers were forcefully pushed against his palm and formed a helix.","From the way Miao Zhuo’s hand looked, people with sharp eyes would have known that the bones had to be broken.","It was impossible for the bones to bend to such a severe curve.","When Miao Zhuo let out his agonizing wail of pain, dreamy cloud-like orchid petals landed on Miao Zhuo’s shoulder.","An elegant praying mantis with orchid-petal-shaped raptorial legs shrouded in strange shadows appeared on Miao Zhuo’s neck.","The small and charming praying mantis looked to only be about seven or eight centimeters long, but it radiated powerful soul energy.","The praying mantis gently sucked on Miao Zhuo’s neck, and it seemed as though something was pulled out of Miao Zhuo’s body.","Miao Zhuo stopped wailing in pain as the new pain from his soul was so acute that he could only spasm silently.","A faint golden light lit up around Miao Zhuo’s body, and the figure that was being pulled out of his body slowly returned back into him.","Before the small praying mantis started fighting against the golden light, the praying mantis’ raptorial legs sliced across the golden light and cut off a piece of it.","After the praying mantis happily absorbed the piece of light it had cut off, it turned into an orchid petal and landed on Liu Jie’s shoulder.","When the small praying mantis attacked Miao Zhuo, Lin Yuan used True Data to check on it.","[Fey Name]: Orchid Petal Knife Mantis (Dead Soul Demon Insect)","[Fey Species]: Demon insect-species/ flightless-insect species","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Soul","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Soul Suck]: Suck the soul that is hiding in the target’s mind out of its body.","[Parasitic Soul Dead Seed]: Leave a soul seed in the living creature’s mind that will combine with the soul. When the target dies, the target’s soul can be absorbed through the parasite, leaving the body empty to be possessed.","[Exploding Soul Dead Bullets]: Trigger a mutation in the target’s body. When the target’s empty body is possessed, it will explode, and the pieces will be spread out as seeds.","[Demon Soul Training]: Absorb the target’s soul to increase the strength of its own soul. After completely possessing the target’s body and gaining full control of it, the strength of the soul will determine the power of the target’s body.","[Dead Soul Ferry]: A low soul noise will be produced that can be used to control the soul of the target. Strong soul tremors will destabilize the target’s soul, making it easier to be absorbed.","[Soul Jade Attachment]: When the soul power explodes, the soul will turn into jade that, when shattered, will result in a soul attack that is stronger than the original strength of the soul. The shattered jade will turn into soul mist that will surround all the living creatures in an area, and a soul seed will be implanted in all the living creatures.","Exclusive Skill:","[Dead Soul Immortality]: When the body is killed, and there is no soul seed to utilize, the Dead Soul Demon Insect’s soul will leave the body and float around in a designated space. After enough deaths occur in the designated space, the Dead Soul Demon Insect’s soul will absorb the dead souls and come back to life.","Lin Yuan nodded slightly when he saw the Orchid Petal Knife Mantis or Dead Soul Demon Insect’s True Data.","After Liu Jie’s Insect Queen mutation, Lin Yuan had not had the chance to spar with Liu Jie.","But Lin Yuan had seen the Insect Queen’s True Data and knew that it could use the spiritual poison from the Blade Queen Bee to control other insect-species feys.","Due to the Insect Queen’s characteristics, Liu Jie had been unable to form contracts with other feys, and it caused him to lack variety during combat.","Now that the Insect Queen had gained the Blade Queen Bee’s spiritual poison, Liu Jie had overcome this limitation.","The Insect Queen was now like a contractor that could use the Blade Queen Bee’s spiritual poison to form contracts with insect-species feys.","However, the Insect Queen could not form contracts with insect-species feys that had greater spiritual power than it did. Otherwise, the Insect Queen would experience recoil and die.","As such, Liu Jie could instruct the Insect Queen to contract tens of insect-species feys without problems.","As a spiritual-type fairy-type source-type lifeform, the Insect Queen had a stronger spirit than regular feys and source-type lifeforms.","But compared to regular insect-species feys, insect-species carcinoma feys were undoubtedly a better choice for Liu Jie because of their messy spirits.","In spite of this Dead Soul Demon Insect’s exceptionally strong soul, it still had weaker spiritual power than the Insect Queen’s Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects.","If Liu Jie was not the Chief Spirit Guard’s disciple, even if Lin Yuan had figured out that insect-species carcinoma feys were the best choice for the Insect Queen to contract, he would not have been able to find any.","Lin Yuan’s only carcinoma fey, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower, had been obtained through a coincidence.","The Spirit Guards controlled carcinoma feys strictly.","Liu Jie had always been upfront about his growth with Lin Yuan and had never forgotten about his position as Lin Yuan’s retainer knight.","Lin Yuan knew that Liu Jie already had eight extremely strong insect-species carcinoma feys under his control, and every kind had the potential to generate a disaster.","The Orchid Petal Knife Mantis was an insect-species carcinoma fey that the Insect Queen had taken control of.","The Orchid Petal Knife Mantis had used Soul Suck on Miao Zhuo, and the golden light should have been an item that Miao Zhuo’s seniors had given him to protect his soul.","But after being attacked by the Diamond X/Legend Dead Soul Demon Insect, the item could not fully protect Miao Zhuo. Hence, Miao Zhuo’s soul had still been injured.","Everything had taken place in the blink of an eye.. Everyone present, including Long Tao, Li Xuan, and Gao Feng, were dumbfounded by Liu Jie’s sudden attack."]},{"number":828,"title":"Chapter 828 - Theres Nothing I Cant Handle","paragraphs":["No one expected that someone would dare to make a move right outside the Midnight Palace.","When Liu Jie made his move, he did not seem to care at all that Miao Zhuo had the support of Connected Beast Park or that they were currently at the Midnight Palace.","Although Long Tao and Li Xuan knew who Lin Yuan was, it was not appropriate for him to make a move right outside the Midnight Palace.","The Midnight Palace belonged to Chief Guard Ye, and it was essentially her home.","Even if Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple, it was extremely disrespectful for him to attack right outside Chief Guard Ye’s home.","However, Lin Yuan had not been the one to make a move. Instead, the man wearing the standard Spirit Guard mask that was standing next to Lin Yuan had done it.","Neither Long Tao nor Li Xuan was dumb. They shared a look and made a guess who the man wearing the standing Spirit Guard mask was.","However, those who did not know who Lin Yuan was did not share their thoughts.","Qi Haitao, who had been embroiled in the middle of the fight, started to tremble and called Liu Jie an idiot to himself.","The issue had already passed, but Miao Zhuo had growled that they would settle their issue after the Guard Ye Banquet. This was a slap across Qi Haitao’s face.","The experts from the Five Thearch Soldiers were stationed outside the Midnight Palace to protect him, so they would stop Miao Zhuo if he launched an attack against him.","After all, the Sea Bliss Clan had used a large number of resources to buy the Five Thearch Soldiers’ protection.","Qi Haitao had already prepared himself to be hit, but he did not expect the new incident to develop in the blink of an eye.","He glared fiercely at Liu Jie and fought the urge to lunge at him and scream, “How dare you make a move right outside the Midnight Moon Palace? Know your place!”","Including Sun Ningxiang, everyone involved was doomed.","Normally, a person should have fainted after receiving a soul injury. But Miao Zhuo managed to stay conscious thanks to the item that protected his soul.","Miao Zhuo, whose face was as white as a sheet, croaked to the dazed Zheng Kaiyuan, “Help me up.”","Zheng Kaiyuan regained his senses, pulled Miao Zhuo up from the ground, and whispered, “Let’s go into the palace to find Master!”","Now that Miao Zhuo’s soul was injured, Zheng Kaiyuan was a mess.","As the Zheng family’s Second Young Master, Zheng Kaiyuan was used to being arrogant. However, the lowest-ranked people present were still from veteran factions.","Zheng Kaiyuan’s haughtiness as the Second Young Master of the Zheng family had all but dissipated.","Miao Zhuo ignored Zheng Kaiyuan and glared ferociously at Liu Jie.","Even at this moment, he asked, “How dare you attack me!?”","When Miao Zhuo felt the bone-crushing pain of his soul injury, he was confused.","He already had to control and suppress himself because of where he was, so how could this person be so daring?","How could he have actually launched an attack?","Did he have a death wish?","Miao Zhuo had already been looking for a segway to extract himself from the situation, so how did he still end up getting attacked?","Liu Jie looked like a stoic bodyguard standing next to Lin Yuan.","Due to the voice-altering effects of the Spirit Guards’ standard mask, Liu Jie’s voice sounded rather strange.","However, this strange voice still carried significant determination and severity.","Liu Jie’s words made everyone present inhale sharply. “You should not have pointed at his nose. Next time, you’ll lose your life.”","Miao Zhuo was slightly stunned by how ludicrous Liu Jie’s response was.","If anyone else had said this to him at any other place, he would have gone after their life in retaliation.","But they were at the Midnight Palace!","The disciples of veteran and top factions were astonished by Liu Jie’s response, and many cursed in amazement.","It seemed insane to them that Liu Jie did not care that they were at the Midnight Palace at all.","At that moment, two figures appeared behind Miao Zhuo, and one of them coldly snapped at Liu Jie. “How dare you act this way in the Midnight Palace? Although there are no spirit attendants here, Chief Guard Ye’s right- and left-hand managers are still present.”","The other figure checked Miao Zhuo’s injury and was about to summon a fey to heal Miao Zhuo’s hand when he remembered that he was at the Midnight Palace and stopped himself.","It was against regulations to summon feys at the Midnight Palace without permission, even if it was just a healing-type fey.","Miao Zhuo weakly nodded at the two figures, and Zheng Kaiyuan anxiously greeted them.","One of the figures nodded in response to Zheng Kaiyuan while the other completely ignored him.","Long Tao said to the man who had spoken, “Du Shuo, Fang He, it’s not always good to stick your nose into others’ business. Don’t end up falling after sticking your head out too far.”","Du Shuo was Furnace Stone Metal’s main disciple.","Furnace Stone Metal was also one of the top ten factions amongst the top 50 factions, just like the Long family.","They had a large store of metal spiritual ingredients and always operated in a low-profile manner.","Fang He was from Four Beast Territory. Although Four Beast Territory could not compare to the Long family, they still had an enormous store of beast resources.","When it came to power, Four Beast Territory was much stronger than Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Long Tao had heard that Du Shuo was close with Fang He, and they were basically joined at the hip.","However, he did not know what relationship Du Shuo had with Miao Zhuo.","But from the way that Du Shuo and Fang He were standing behind Miao Zhuo, it seemed that Furnace Stone Metal and Four Beast Territory were about to start working with Connected Beast Park.","Long Tao felt that Du Shuo and Fang He were extremely unlucky.","If Lin Yuan announced his identity, Du Shuo and Fang He would be severely reprimanded by their seniors because they had helped Miao Zhuo.","But if Four Beast Territory and Furnace Stone Metal were working with Connected Beast Park, it was worth considering the repercussions of this commotion.","Du Shuo’s face fell when he heard what Long Tao said, and he retorted contemptuously, “Long Tao, you better watch yourself.”","Du Shuo proceeded to ignore Long Tao and said to Liu Jie in derision, “Impulsivity comes with a price. You better consider carefully if you’ll be able to afford this price.”","Liu Jie took a step forward and said to Du Shuo in a low voice, “With nasty guests, there’s nothing I can’t handle in my own house.”"]},{"number":829,"title":"Chapter 829 - Who Should be the One Paying Respect?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","At first, Liu Jie’s words did not trigger any reaction. But when everyone present read in between the lines of Liu Jie’s words, they realized who this standard Spirit Guards’ mask-wearing man that had just called the Midnight Palace his house was.","He could only be Night Leaning Moon’s disciple.","No one else would dare to pretend to be Chief Guard Ye’s disciple right in the Midnight Palace.","Li Xuan and Long Tao had already made a guess, but they still looked shocked and could hot help but steal glances at Liu Jie.","Gao Feng had been about to seek out his father to ask Chief Guard Ye for forgiveness on behalf of Lin Yuan, but his jaw fell open now.","He did not expect the main character of the Guard Ye Banquet to be standing right next to him, yet he had been none the wiser.","Gao Feng also looked at Lin Yuan in disbelief. Not only had Lin Yuan traveled with the disciple of Chief Guard Ye’s disciple, but Chief Guard Ye’s disciple had even stood up for Lin Yuan.","Just who was Lin Yuan?","In spite of Gao Feng’s bewildered state of mind, he realized that Lin Yuan was completely different from who he initially thought he was.","The people that were gawking at Liu Jie were looking at him differently now that they knew who he was.","None of the disciples of the veteran or top factions expected that someone they initially thought was too brave for his own good was actually a dragon in disguise.","Most of the people’s attention was focused on Liu Jie as they tried to come up with a way to strike up a connection with him.","There were also some people that were still gawking in spite of their shock.","However, they were now gawking at Miao Zhuo, Du Shuo, and Fang He.","The injury that Chief Guard Ye’s disciple had inflicted on Miao Zhuo could not even be brought up at this point.","Chief Guard Ye’s disciple had called Miao Zhuo a nasty guest, and everyone was thinking about what this term would entail.","Usually, nasty guests were chased out.","If Miao Zhuo was kicked out of the Guard Ye Banquet, it might affect the Miao family’s main representative, Master Miao Qi.","Du Shuo and Fang He, who had spoken up for Miao Zhuo, were as pale as ghosts now that they knew who Liu Jie was, and they took large steps to put distance between themselves and Miao Zhuo.","The relationship between Furnace Stone Metal and Four Beasts Territory was very similar to the one between Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Furnace Stone Metal had been supporting Four Beasts Territory just like what Coiling Dragon’s Valley had been doing for Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Du Shuo and Fang He also shared a similar relationship to that of Long Tao and Li Xuan. In fact, Du Shuo and Fang He were much closer because Fang He had grown up in Furnace Stone Metal.","Ever since they were children, Fang He had been playing with Du Shuo.","Du Shuo contracted feys that excelled at attacking while Fang He followed behind him to heal him when needed.","The two of them were even closer than real brothers.","Furnace Stone Metal had discovered a secret when they ventured into a subterranean dimensional rift and needed a large amount of Creation Master resources. Hence, they had approached Connected Beast Park with the intention of working together.","However, the transaction was so large that both parties had yet to come to an agreement.","During this time, when all the top factions were gathered in the Royal Capital, Du Shuo and Fang He had secretly met up with Miao Zhuo.","Miao Zhuo could not be described as their friend, but they had helped him so that Connected Beast Park would be more compromising during their business negotiations.","A bitter smile spread across Du Shuo’s face. He had been the one to warn Liu Jie about having to pay the price, but now he was the one who would have to pay it. Not even karma worked this fast.","Now that they had been dragged into the mess, Du Shuo and Fang He’s eyes were full of resentment for Miao Zhuo.","They felt that Miao Zhuo was a small fry, yet he had well and truly affronted Chief Guard Ye’s disciple.","When he thought of his strict seniors back home, Du Shuo instinctively placed his hand on his backside.","He prayed that the two globes of flesh would not be beaten too badly by his father so that he would not have to trouble Fang He to heal him.","A fierce pressure swept across the area outside the Midnight Palace, and that felt like a floating flame in the frigid night.","With his soul injury, Miao Zhuo could not hold himself steady against the pressure even with Zheng Kaiyuan supporting him and collapsed on the ground.","The pressure stopped short in front of Liu Jie and Lin Yuan.","A man with average features walked out to the area outside the Midnight Palace, his face ashen.","Du Shuo cursed under his breath.","The Spirit Guards’ right-hand manager had a much better temperament than the left-hand manager. The left-hand manager had always been in charge of managing the Spirit Guards’ Sin Cleansing Pool and could be called the Demon King of the Spirit Guards.","If the left-hand manager came to settle the commotion, it would spell trouble for Du Shuo and the rest.","There was even a chance of his seniors inside the palace being affected.","The left-hand manager was merciless. It would be fine if only he was tossed out of the Midnight Palace, but it would be utterly humiliating if his seniors were chased out alongside him.","Although Du Shuo was the only son, he had a feeling that his father would beat him to death then have another son to take Du Shuo’s place if they were tossed out of the Midnight Palace because of Du Shuo.","Miao Zhuo thought that he had fainted and died after being struck by the pressure.","However, the pressure had tightly grabbed hold of his soul and kept his consciousness awake under excruciating pain.","As a Creation Master, Miao Zhuo was immediately in despair. He knew that the left-hand manager had used law world power to quake his soul.","If it were his previous soul injury, he would be fine if his aunt immediately used spiritual ingredients to heal him.","But now that the law world power had shaken up his soul, his injured soul was chipped away.","This was irreversible damage.","Ashes appeared before Miao Zhuo’s eyes, and he knew that he would never be able to become a Class 4 Creation Master.","The irreversible damage to his soul meant that he would never be able to use the power of his soul to concoct spirit fluids.","The pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master Miao Zhuo knew that his life was finished.","The left-hand manager walked up to Liu Jie and bowed to him.","The crowd found the left-hand manager’s show of respect to be odd because he was not standing directly in front of Liu Jie but rather between Liu Jie and Lin Yuan.","It was confusing whether he was bowing to Liu Jie or Lin Yuan."]},{"number":830,"title":"Chapter 830 - Unforgivable!","paragraphs":["Realization dawned on Long Tao and Li Xuan.","Sun Ningxiang, who had already guessed Liu Jie’s identity, looked both shocked and confused.","While she contemplated her doubts, the other disciples of the veteran and top factions were also wondering what was going on.","Zuo Ming was an important person.","Even in their prime, Sun Ningxiang’s grandfather still needed a month’s notice before visiting Zuo Ming. Even then, the meeting was not guaranteed.","Important people always cared about their reputation.","Since the man wearing the standard Spirit Guards mask was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple, it was only right that Zuo Ming bowed to him.","But if Zuo Ming only wanted to bow to Liu Jie, he could have stood directly in front of Liu Jie. He would definitely not have stood between Liu Jie and Lin Yuan like he was doing now.","Since Zuo Ming was facing Lin Yuan and Liu Jie, the others could only see Zuo Ming’s back and not his face.","The people present had all lowered their heads because of Zuo Ming’s arrival and his terrifying aura. None of them dared to gaze upon Zuo Ming’s face.","But when Sun Ningxiang saw the way Zuo Ming was standing, she lifted her gaze to glance at Zuo Ming’s expression.","She realized that he had nodded almost imperceptibly at Lin Yuan.","This meant that Zuo Ming had not stood in the wrong position and was genuinely bowing to Lin Yuan.","It proved that Zuo Ming held Lin Yuan in the same regard as he did the disciple of Chief Guard Ye.","From Lin Yuan’s physique, his chin’s curve, speech style, charisma, and voice, Sun Ningxiang had already ascertained that he was that strange mask-wearing young man from Sky City.","She knew that there was more to his identity than a mere member of Sky City.","Lin Yuan had to be of similar status to Liu Jie.","Sun Ningxiang thought back to Lin Yuan’s bottomless well of Creation Master resources, and she suddenly recalled the rumor she had heard about the Moon Empress also accepting a disciple and that the disciple was likely to make an appearance at the Guard Ye Banquet.","All the doubts that Sun Ningxiang had about Sky City and Lin Yuan’s identity cleared.","She had initially entertained the possibility that there could be a Class 5 Creation Master supporting Sky City. Otherwise, it was impossible for them to evolve fey qualities so quickly.","But now, she knew that she had been wrong. A new Class 5 Creation Master couldn’t appear out of nowhere so easily.","If it was so easy for pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters to break through to Class 5, there wouldn’t only still only be three Class 5 Creation Masters in the Radiance Federation after so many years.","Although Sun Ningxiang could not be certain that she was right about Lin Yuan’s identity, she felt that she was likely to be right.","Her shock aside, Sun Ningxiang felt her tightly wound heart start to relax.","Regardless of whether or not Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple, his position gave him the right to receive a nod of greeting from Zuo Ming.","Condense Fairy Orchard and Sky City were working closely. All she needed to do was to cling onto him, and Condense Fairy Orchard would quickly be able to replenish their lack of Creation Master resources.","However, it was not enough for her to just cling to Lin Yuan. She also needed to deepen the relationship between Condense Fairy Orchard and Sky City.","It was even fine if Condense Fairy Orchard relied on Sky City for its expansion.","It was only in such a situation that Lin Yuan would be willing to help Condense Fairy Orchard in the event of an overwhelmingly dangerous circumstance.","Over the years, as Sun Ningxiang continued to hold up Condense Fairy Orchard on her own, it had become harder with time.","With a lack of Creation Master resources and strong combat power, it would be impossible for a top faction to maintain its influence.","It was becoming harder for Condense Fairy Orchard to maintain their domination of some plant-type fey markets.","Otherwise, the Miao family would not have brazenly schemed against Condense Fairy Orchard and attempted to consume them under the pretense of collaboration.","When she saw Lin Yuan’s resolute and calm expression, Sun Ningxiang felt that she could consider leaving the fate of Condense Fairy Orchard in his hands.","Before any further speculation took place, Zuo Ming said to Liu Jie apologetically, “Young Liege, I didn’t expect there to be people here who dare to disregard the rules and offend you. They are supposed to have come to the Guard Ye Banquet to celebrate you, yet they disrespect you. Please advise me on how I should handle them.”","Zuo Ming’s gaze did not go anywhere near the ghostly pale Miao Zhuo, Zheng Kaiyuan, Du Shuo, Fang He, and Qi Haitao.","It was as though they were specks of dust on his shoe that were not worth paying a hint of attention to. Once Liu Jie issued his order, they would be ejected without hesitation.","Rage boiled within Zuo Ming.","Before","Liu Jie had used the Insect Queen to create a sea of insects that defended Cold Frost City for half an hour before becoming a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","By the time the Spirit Guards arrived, Liu Jie had fainted and had been unaware of how many citizens and spirit qi professionals he had protected.","Although Zuo Ming had not been the one to lead the team to aid Cold Frost City, he had gained respect for Liu Jie because of this matter.","Not even the Guard Envoys would be able to stand up to an invincible enemy like Liu Jie had done.","When Zuo Ming had heard that Chief Guard Ye had accepted Liu Jie as her disciple, he had immediately acknowledged Liu Jie.","After spending time together, Zuo Ming had completely accepted Liu Jie as his junior.","He felt that he understood Liu Jie’s character well and that Liu Jie was extremely amicable.","It was not easy to stir up Liu Jie’s ire.","Before the Guard Ye Banquet began, Zuo Ming was in charge of the area outside the Midnight Palace, while the right-hand manager was in charge of the area inside the Midnight Palace.","He had just been called away to accompany Zong Ze and Gu Lang to the Night Words Pavilion, and someone had dared to anger Liu Jie in his absence.","It was unforgivable!","A fresh batch of Sin Cleansing Weeping Willows from the Sin Cleansing Pool had been nurtured but had yet to be bathed in blood.","Zuo Ming felt that this newly nurtured batch of Sin Cleansing Weeping Willows could teach these people who had broken the Midnight Palace’s rules and insulted his Young Liege a lesson they would never forget.","Du Shuo yanked Fang He’s hand and lowered his head. He felt that his impulsivity had burdened Fang He.","Otherwise, Fang He’s peaceful nature would not have let him involve himself with Miao Zhuo’s issues.","If the right-hand manager had been the one to come to settle the scuffle, Du Shuo might have dared to argue.","However, if he uttered one wrong word in front of Zuo Ming, it would only lead to worse consequences."]},{"number":831,"title":"Chapter 831 - Beast Head Manifestation","paragraphs":["Liu Jie’s words made Du Shuo abruptly snap his head up.","“Uncle Zuo, it’s not that serious. I just don’t want that person lying on the floor to appear at the Guard Ye Banquet.”","Liu Jie was not a wicked person and did not even care about the disrespectful way that Du Shuo had just spoken to him.","However, he would not spare anyone who pointed at Lin Yuan insultingly because it not only violated his duty as a retainer knight but also trampled on his faith.","As long as it concerned Lin Yuan’s pride and Liu Jie’s faith, Liu Jie would sacrifice his life at any time, any place, and no matter who it was in front of him.","Liu Jie, who had been rescued by Lin Yuan and had been by his side all this time, knew what consequences awaited Miao Zhuo if he was tossed out of the Midnight Palace.","However, he refused to go easy on Miao Zhuo.","This was Liu Jie’s determination.","Zuo Ming was already boiling with rage and had already decided to use the new batch of Sin Cleansing Weeping Willows to teach these people who had insulted Liu Jie a lesson.","But after he heard what Liu Jie said, Zuo Ming paused for a moment before smiling in resignation.","Why would someone who was willing to stand up in the face of a disaster bother with a few words of disrespect?","Despite gaining a status almost akin to royalty, Liu Jie’s character was unchanged.","Naturally, Zuo Ming would not act against Liu Jie’s virtuous character.","“Then, it shall be done as you said, Young Liege.”","Zuo Ming’s gaze flew to Du Shuo, Fang He, Qi Haitao, Zheng Kaiyuan, and the disciples of the veteran and top factions who were standing nearby and barked, “Thanks to the kindness of Young Liege, all of you are saved from repenting under the Sin Cleansing Weeping Willows.","“Usually, outsiders aren’t allowed to enter the Midnight Palace, but the Guard Ye Banquet is being held to celebrate Young Liege. Do not forget the manners imparted on you by your elders. If you cautious elders find out that you’ve slighted Young Liege, it won’t be me who you’ll be receiving punishment from. Your elders will drag you to the Sin Cleansing Pool themselves.”","Zuo Ming’s words caused shivers to go up the spines of everyone present, and the disciples of veteran and top factions who were standing slightly closer to Miao Zhuo felt a streak of terror shoot through their veins.","We’re innocent! All we did was stand a bit nearer so we could get a better look at the action!","But Zuo Ming’s gaze made the gawkers feel as though they had participated in the commotion.","From the rumors surrounding Zuo Ming, it was possible that those people who were only guilty of standing slightly nearer to Miao Zhuo could have also been punished.","The people who had not participated in the commotion looked at Liu Jie with respect and extreme gratitude.","They also looked at the fallen Miao Zhuo with disgust and hate.","Many of them were cursing Miao Zhuo to themselves.","It’s all your fault! I was almost locked up in the Sin Cleansing Pool!","After spending one night under the Sin Cleansing Weeping Willows, one would still have to spend five years in recuperation, and that was if they survived the night.","Five years were far too precious for everyone present.","Not every top and veteran faction was like the Gao family, the Long family, or the Sea Bliss Clan.","Many of the younger generation of disciples of veteran and top factions had around five or six direct descendants.","Those who were chosen to attend the Guard Ye Banquet were the favored disciples.","But if Zuo Ming punished them, their position in the faction would plunge precipitously. If they had to spend another five years recuperating, they would never be able to make a comeback.","Du Shuo held Fang He’s hands tightly. Fang He subtly signaled to Du Shuo, and they turned to Liu Jie together to bow to him and said, “Thank you for your kindness.”","Du Shuo and Fang He’s words were like a prompt, after which the people present started to echo their words of thanks toward Liu Jie.","Zuo Ming had arrived in time to hear what Du Shuo had said to Liu Jie.","Even if Liu Jie had said to let Du Shuo go, Zuo Ming had planned on teaching Du Shuo a good lesson later on.","But now that Du Shuo seemed to understand the situation, Zuo Ming decided not to cause trouble for Furnace Stone Metal.","With everyone’s gazes on him and thanking him, Liu Jie did not react. Instead, he said, “Let the person on the floor be an example. I hope no one makes the same mistake of pointing at Lin Yuan in a similar manner again.”","Liu Jie’s words shifted the attention onto Lin Yuan.","Ever since Zuo Ming bowed, the crowd had been guessing about Lin Yuan’s identity.","Zuo Ming stretched out his hand, and the spiritual power that flowed from his palm plucked Miao Zhuo from the ground like a ragdoll.","Zuo Ming disappeared from the area outside the Midnight Palace in a flash and reappeared in front of an enormous snakehead in Beast Head Forest.","The moment Zuo Ming’s feet touched the ground, the snake came to life and turned into a giant eight-meter-long python.","Zuo Ming said to the giant python, “Old Gang, this fellow crossed Young Liege, Drag him to the Sin Cleansing Pool for me, and some people from Connected Beast Park will collect him later.”","A look of hostility came over the giant python.","Shortly after, it seemed as though all the beast heads in Beast Head Forest were coming to life as Old Gang said in a raspy voice, “Someone actually crossed someone as nice as Young Liege, and in the Midnight Palace on top of it. Apparently, the Miao family has a third thearch-class expert this year. It looks like Connected Beast Park is thriving.”","Zuo Ming’s unassuming face had been cold, but he rolled his eyes when he heard what Old Gang said.","“Old Gang, stop making this about combat power. Even if the Miao family had 100 thearch-class experts, they wouldn’t dare to disrespect Lordess Chief Guard. The person leading the Miao family at the Guard Ye Banquet is Miao Qi.","“I wonder if Miao Qi is actually stupid or if the Miao family really has such intentions. Lord Bamboo Monarch is horrible at rejecting women. I heard You Zhe say that Lanya Pavilion had not intended on attending the Guard Ye Banquet, but word was just received that they have already arrived inside the palace.”"]},{"number":832,"title":"Chapter 832 - Li Changlin! All You Do is Eat!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Old Gang was clearly not paying attention to Zuo Ming and was looking at him with slight vexation.","Zuo Ming, who was usually stoic, was always nosy when he was with friends.","Old Gang did not respond to Zuo Ming. If that person from Langya Pavilion was really here, the matter was serious.","Lord Bamboo Monarch was in deep trouble.","If trouble broke out in the Midnight Palace, no one could do anything about it unless Lordess Chief Guard stepped in personally.","Given Lordess Chief Guard’s temperament, she would definitely stay out of such matters.","Old Gang glanced at the unconscious Miao Zhuo and said to Zuo Ming, “Summon the Soul Song Zither Bird and check on this boy’s soul. Why did he have to get on the wrong side of Young Liege? Even if his soul is injured severely, he’ll wake up after being whipped by the Sin Cleansing Weeping Willows. Let me see how many Sin Cleansing Weeping Willows I should use to teach this boy a lesson.”","Zuo Ming shot a look of annoyance at Old Gang. It could have just asked directly instead of questioning how many Sin Cleansing Weeping Willows it would need to teach Miao Zhuo a lesson.","Given the state of Miao Zhuo’s soul injury, it would not be able to survive two days under one Sin Cleansing Weeping Willow.","But frankly, Zuo Ming was also curious about what had gotten the well-mannered Liu Jie so furious.","An avian-type fey with a zither-like tail and beautiful colorful crystal feathers was summoned with a wave of Zuo Ming’s hand.","There was nothing special about the bird’s body, and its white down feathers had no shine to them. However, the beautiful colorful crystal feathers that grew on the bird’s zither-like tail looked like multi-colored gems on a pipa.","The Soul Song Zither Bird moved its tail feathers, and a strange and ear-piercing tune was played.","A look of anguish appeared on Miao Zhuo’s face, and Zuo Ming used the song to check on the state of Miao Zhuo’s soul.","Only Night Leaning Moon knew that Liu Jie was Lin Yuan’s retainer knight.","Although Night Leaning Moon did not purposely hide that Liu Jie was Lin Yuan’s retainer, she also did not tell Zuo Ming about it.","Thus, Zuo Ming was confused as to why Liu Jie was so protective of Lin Yuan.","Liu Jie’s anger was solely because Lin Yuan had been insulted by Miao Zhuo.","Cold sweat started to drip down Zuo Ming’s back.","Luckily, Cold Moon and Mystic Moon had accompanied the Moon Empress to the main area inside the Midnight Palace for a meeting. Otherwise, if Cold Moon or Mystic Moon found out that their Young Lord had been insulted, Miao Zhuo would face consequences that were ten times more severe.","The Guard Ye Banquet would not be able to proceed as planned.","Since Miao Zhuo had not just insulted Liu Jie but also the Radiant Moon Palace’s Young Lord, Zuo Ming said to Old Gang, “You don’t have to send Miao Zhuo to the Sin Cleansing Pool. Just take him to Connected Beast Park’s residence in Circle Beast City and tell his grandfather that our Young Liege put his grandson in this state because he had insulted the Radiant Moon Palace’s Young Lord. He can decide for himself what happens to his grandson.”","Old Gang was slightly surprised as it did not expect the boy on the ground to also have implicated the Radiant Moon Palace.","This was an extremely serious issue.","The giant python swallowed Miao Zhuo and disappeared in a flash.","...","At that moment, You Zhe’s forehead broke out in a sweat.","Even when he was facing powerful dimensional lifeforms or surrounded by a sea of dimensional lifeforms, he had never experienced the emotions that he was feeling now.","He did not know what to do in the situation he was currently in and dared not act rashly.","All the truly important people were in a meeting in the main area of the Midnight Palace, while the people in the inner area of the Midnight Palace were from top factions and veteran factions.","After winning a game of scissors-paper-stone with Zuo Ming, You Zhe had chosen to manage the inner area of the Midnight Palace because he thought it would be an easier task.","However, he did not expect that person from Langya Pavilion, who had initially rejected the invitation, had decided to attend in the end,","A woman dressed in traditional purple clothes with beautiful purplish-gold bamboo patterns and golden peony embroidery was standing at the entrance to the inner area of the Midnight Palace.","She had demure features and pearls that seemed to encapsulate life adorned her earrings.","A string of pearls with the color of dreamy clouds hung around her neck.","It was the appearance of this woman that had led to sweat breaking out on You Zhe’s forehead.","The fashionable woman stole everyone’s attention from the moment she arrived.","Previously, the people from veteran factions saw Wang Fuxiang as only the mysterious owner of Lanya Pavilion. There were only a few top factions that knew about Wang Fuxiang and Lord Bamboo Monarch.","Ever since Lord Bamboo Monarch had been stained with bad luck and stopped creating Law Crystals for the major factions, the secret between Wang Fuxiang and Lord Bamboo Monarch had been blown out into the open.","Even the people from veteran factions knew.","Now that the secret was exposed, even the top factions dared not look down on Wang Fuxiang.","Whether it was real or feigned, the leaders of the top factions were all looking at Wang Fuxiang with respect.","Their eyes also looked toward someone else dressed in purple.","This set of purple clothes that Miao Qi was wearing had two red trees with red fruits embroidered on them. There were some faint images of bamboo next to the red trees.","The leaders of the top factions started to grow nervous. What good could come from Wang Fuxiang and Miao Qi clashing against each other?","They did not imagine that the day would come where they could gawk at the Bamboo Monarch.","Long Tu, who was sitting with Li Zhen, checked the time. The meeting that was happening in the main area of the Midnight Palace should have ended by now.","He wondered what expression Lord Bamboo Monarch would have when he came and saw Wang Fuxiang and Miao Qi.","However, this was Lord Bamboo Monarch’s personal matter, and it would be up to him to handle the issue.","At that moment, a woman pushed a middle-aged man out of his seat and walked toward Wang Fuxiang.","The middle-aged man was distractedly eating a piece of steamed gyokuro date shortcake while the woman furiously pulled his ear and said, “Li Changlin, all you do is eat! You eat wherever you go! Come with me to greet Sister Xiang now!”"]},{"number":833,"title":"Chapter 833 - Tit for Tat","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Li Changlin hurriedly stuffed the rest of the gyokuro date shortcake into his mouth and said in a meek voice to the woman pulling him by his ear, “Yingying, you were the one who said that this gyokuro date shortcake tasted pretty good. I wanted to see if I can figure out how it’s made so I can make it for you back home!”","On top of his meek and sad tone, Li Changlin deliberately blinked a few times at the woman.","The woman did not buy it and spat, “That was how I was tricked by you all those years ago! If you hadn’t blinked at me like that, I wouldn’t have run away with you 20 years ago. Don’t bother trying this with me. Let’s go!”","A clever-looking chubby man overheard the woman’s words and thought,? Thank God I’m smart. Nothing good can come out from Senior Brother and Junior Sister being together. Nothing beats how comfortable I am running the Spirit Food Pavilion! Women are the scariest creatures! They can never make me as happy as an iron wok can!","When he heard what his wife said, Li Changlin’s mouth twitched.","How is it the same? I only blinked this time, but I also pouted 20 years ago.","But when he heard that his wife wanted to chat with Wang Fuxiang and even addressed her as Sister Xiang, Li Changlin felt slightly uncomfortable.","Wang Fuxiang was at least 70 years old, while his wife was not even 40 years old yet. She should be calling Wang Fuxiang Auntie Xiang.","But when they approached Wang Fuxiang, Li Changlin still addressed her as Sister Xiang while thinking,? I’ll probably get beat up if I call her Auntie Xiang! On the other hand, calling her Sister Xiang makes it seem like I’m of the same generation as the Bamboo Monarch. Hehe! This feeling is pretty good!","Li Changlin immediately proceeded to call Wang Fuxiang Sister Xiang a few more times.","Zhang Yingying immediately knew that Li Changlin was up to something and quickly pinched his side.","She had heard from her father that the Bamboo Monarch had been courting Wang Fuxiang.","If not for Wang Fuxiang’s predicament, she would have become the Purple Bamboo Forest’s mistress long ago.","Before Zhang Yingying eloped with Li Changlin, she was the princess of the Kitchen Fragrance Pavilion and often visited Langya Pavilion to buy accessories.","She had met Wang Fuxiang 20 years ago when she was still a young girl.","If not for the advice she had received from Wang Fuxiang at that time, Zhang Yingying would never have eloped with Li Changlin.","It could be said that Wang Fuxiang had been Zhang Yingying and Li Changlin’s matchmaker.","However, Zhang Yingying had never told Li Changlin about this.","Not even Wang Fuxiang knew that her words would have such a big influence on Zhang Yingying.","Zhang Yingying greeted Wang Fuxiang in a friendly manner.","When Wang Fuxiang saw Zhang Yingying, her ashen face broke out into a bright smile.","Her smile was so stunning that it was as though a flurry of cherry blossoms had floated into the Midnight Palace’s inner area.","A look of nostalgia came over Wang Fuxiang, but her face quickly fell as she said to Zhang Yingying, “Sister Ying, I need to attend to something. I’ll catch up with you soon.”","Wang Fuxiang strode toward Miao Qi, who was trying her best to put on a strong front.","No one knew better than Miao Qi what the relationship between Wang Fuxiang and the Bamboo Monarch was.","Hence, the pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master Miao Qi was panicking.","When she thought of Wang Fuxiang’s bad luck and its impact on the Bamboo Monarch, Miao Qi immediately regained her composure.","Wang Fuxiang trod lightly, and when her skirt swayed, the peony petals seemed to fall onto the floor of the bamboo forest.","She approached Miao Qi calmly, and Miao Qi felt a hint of shame.","No matter what reasons there were, she definitely had less moral ground to stand on than Wang Fuxiang.","Despite being a Class 4 Creation Master or that she was a part of Connected Beast Park, Miao Qi could not start arguing with Wang Fuxiang.","It was not because Wang Fuxiang’s Langya Pavilion had a mountain of resources.","When it came to resources, the Miao family still had more than Langya Pavilion.","Miao Qi was afraid because of the adoration that Wang Fuxiang received from the Bamboo Monarch.","Miao Qi could not move freely with Wang Fuxiang around, as the latter had the right to gain the respect of everyone here.","Thus, Miao Qi could only strike first for Wang Fuxiang’s weak spots.","“Do you know that after being trapped by your bad luck, Lord Bamboo Monarch can’t even create Law Crystals anymore?”","Miao Qi’s words caused everyone’s gazes to shift.","It was because of Wang Fuxiang that many people were rejected when they asked the Bamboo Monarch to create Law Crystals for them.","A sweet yet stern voice sounded before the crowd could speculate further. “Fu Wenzhu was affected by me and is now trapped by my bad luck. You’re right about that.”","Miao Qi was delighted by Wang Fuxiang’s admittance, and she was about to continue hitting Wang Fuxiang’s weak spots when the latter went on to say, “But no matter what, I’m a citizen of the Radiance Federation. If Fu Wenzhu has become a powerless Class 5 Creation Master because of my bad luck, I’m willing to give up my life. His bad luck will be gone after my death.”","The leaders of top factions who had negative opinions on Wang Fuxiang now looked at her in astonishment. They did not expect the sweet Wang Fuxiang to be so steel-willed that she would even say that she was willing to die to remove Lord Bamboo Monarch’s bad luck.","Fu Wenzhu was Bamboo Monarch’s name, and no one, not even Lord Chef Supreme’s daughter Zhang Yingying would dare to call him by it.","Since Wang Fuxiang was willing to die for the Bamboo Monarch, she definitely respected him.","This meant that their relationship had progressed to a certain extent.","Miao Qi did not expect that Wang Fuxiang would rebuke her even after she struck first.","If it was anyone else, Miao Qi would have replied mockingly, “It’s easy to talk about death, but not everyone has the courage to go through with it.”","However, Miao Qi would not dare to say that now.","If she really did say it and Wang Fuxiang ended up dead, Bamboo Monarch would certainly come after her.","He would also go after Connected Beast Park.","While Miao Qi was trying to come up with a way to turn the tables on Wang Fuxiang, the latter said, “Banquets have their own rules. You should be aware of that since you’re from a top faction, right?”"]},{"number":834,"title":"Chapter 834 - Hello, Master","paragraphs":["Wang Fuxiang looked around at the people before saying, “One of the rules of the Guard Ye Banquet is that no one’s clothes or accessories can have snake or snake-like patterns. Every guest has to follow this rule. But besides this special rule, have you forgotten about the other rule of this banquet?”","Miao Qi’s expression changed.","At that moment, an elegant man took a deep breath and walked through the crowd to Wang Fuxiang. He bowed and said, “Hello, Master.”","Xia Chen had seen Wang Fuxiang but did not intend on greeting her.","As the Bamboo Monarch’s first disciple, Xia Chen knew that the Bamboo Monarch had been courting Wang Fuxiang.","But as the Bamboo Monarch’s disciple and because the Bamboo Monarch’s bad luck had come from Wang Fuxiang, Xia Chen, who viewed the Bamboo Monarch as a father, did not like Wang Fuxiang.","Moreover, Wang Fuxiang had been coming up with ways to reject the Bamboo Monarch and never agreed to be together with him.","If Wang Fuxiang denied him when Xia Chen called her Master, she would not be embarrassing Xia Chen but the Bamboo Monarch.","However, Xia Chen knew his Master well and knew that he had to stand up for Wang Fuxiang no matter what.","It was his duty as a disciple.","The way Xia Chen addressed Wang Fuxiang caused a big reaction in the crowd. Even Long Tu and Li Zhen looked shocked.","Xia Chen had always been solemn and helped the Bamboo Monarch to manage the Purple Bamboo Forest.","Now, Xia Chen’s words had essentially branded Wang Fuxiang.","He was basically announcing that Wang Fuxiang was the mistress of the Purple Bamboo Forest.","Xia Chen’s appearance made Miao Qi’s sour countenance drain of color.","Before Wang Fuxiang responded, Xia Chen went on to say, “There are a total of 18 coronation costumes in the Radiance Federation, 13 of which belong to the royal family. The remaining 5 belong to the five Radiance Envoys. Every coronation costume has unique patterns that represent the owner’s identity and authority.","“For example, Chief Guard Ye’s Night Clear Water Coronation Costume has a body of clear water at night that represents the eternal night. I believe everyone is aware of this. Thus, no one wears clothes with patterns similar to the Night Clear Water Coronation Costume at banquets like the Guard Ye Banquet. Moreover, as a show of respect to Chief Guard Ye, no one tries to recreate the Night Clouds Hundred Beasts patterns on the Night Clear Water Coronation Costume. In fact, everyone stays clear of it.”","Xia Chen’s words made Miao Qi’s face turn even paler.","Every single leader of veteran and top factions looked absolutely astonished.","They all knew why Xia Chen was mentioning this. Initially, they thought that Xia Chen had appeared to brand Wang Fuxiang with her identity as the mistress of the Purple Bamboo Forest.","No one expected that Xia Chen would go on to help Wang Fuxiang fight against Miao Qi.","This move made Miao Qi seem extremely insolent.","Xia Chen stole a look at Wang Fuxiang and noticed that she did not seem to be rejecting the title he had given her. With his worries rested, Xia Chen continued. “Master’s coronation costume is the Bamboo Perch Coronation Costume, and the patterns are called the Purple Bamboo coronation patterns. Miao Qi, are those purple bamboo embroidered behind the two goji trees on your purple spirit qi clothes?”","At this point, Xia Chen felt that he had laid good groundwork for Wang Fuxiang and stepped back behind her.","This action made everyone see it as him acknowledging Wang Fuxiang as his elder. Otherwise, the first disciple of the Bamboo Monarch who managed the Purple Bamboo Forest would not have to act in such a humble manner in front of Wang Fuxiang.","Wang Fuxiang felt uncomfortable when Xia Chen called her Master, but she was comforted by what he did for her.","When she had decided to attend the Guard Ye Banquet, she had settled on the status of her relationship with the Bamboo Monarch.","She was now ready to face the feelings between her and the Bamboo Monarch.","She was already old and was no bouncing young girl.","It was extremely difficult to find a real relationship.","The Bamboo Monarch had also said that he would find a way to remove her bad luck and had definitely brought up this issue with the other members of royalty to ask for a solution.","Wang Fuxiang’s mind was set. If she could not find a way to remove her bad luck, she would happily sacrifice her life for the Bamboo Monarch.","She was going to wear her favorite jewelry and jump into the Bamboo Monarch’s arms.","If she died for him, he would definitely remember her for the rest of his life.","Now that her troubles had cleared, Wang Fuxiang had accepted Xia Chen calling her Master.","She put on a charming smile, turned to the deathly pale Miao Qi who looked pathetic in comparison, and said, “Fu Wenzhu gave me this set of clothes. The large patch of purple bamboo embroidery below the yellow peony patterns used the gold thread from Golden Therach Bamboo. It’s the same thread used in the embroidery on Fu Wenzhu’s Bamboo Perch Coronation Costume is made from.","“Miao Qi, the faint bamboo stitched on your clothes are so detailed that they’re also made from the gold thread from the Golden Therach Bamboo. You must have spent a tidy sum on this set of clothes!","“You actually managed to find Myth Breed Golden Therach Bamboo and extract gold thread from it to embroider purple bamboo that is so similar to those on the Purple Bamboo Coronation Costume.","“Did Fu Wenzhu give you permission to copy the Purple Bamboo Coronation Costume? Or do you hold the coronation patterns in such low regard that you are fine with casually recreating the coronation patterns on the spirit qi clothes that you wear to the Guard Ye Banquet?”","Miao Qi lowered her head, and not a peep was heard from her.","She was well and truly humiliated.","As a Class 4 Creation Master that also came from Connected Beast Park, she even received respect from top factions. Even the leaders of veteran factions had to lower their heads in front of her. Yet, she was now a public joke.","She never expected Wang Fuxiang to attend the Guard Ye Banquet.","It had been a secret that she was the one representing the Miao family at the Guard Ye Banquet, and the decision had only been made after the Miao family had discovered that Wang Fuxiang had rejected the invitation to the Guard Ye Banquet.","Miao Qi knew that if not for Wang Fuxiang, Xia Chen would never have bothered with her."]},{"number":835,"title":"Chapter 835 - The Most Elite Group","paragraphs":["Miao Qi was at a complete loss for words. She dared not take on the crime of disrespecting the coronation patterns.","She had put a lot of effort and money into the spirit qi clothes that she was wearing.","She had done this to make herself seem more esteemed, but it had backfired on her instead.","The meeting that was taking place in the main area of the Midnight Palace was about to end. In order to prevent further commotion from taking place in the inner area of the Midnight Palace, You Zhe quickly walked up to Wang Fuxiang and bowed to her before saying, “Lordess, the meeting in the main area is about to end. Miao Qi has broken the Guard Ye Banquet’s rules by disrespecting the coronation patterns. I will eject her from the premises so the Guard Ye Banquet can proceed smoothly. I will inform the leader of the Miao family of this incident and ensure that they make it up to you.”","Although You Zhe knew about Wang Fuxiang and the Bamboo Monarch, he did not have to address her as Lordess.","Since Xia Chen had branded Wang Fuxiang with the title of the mistress of the Purple Bamboo Forest, You Zhe now had to address her as Lordess even though Bamboo Monarch had not personally confirmed Wang Fuxiang’s identity.","You Zhe felt that Miao Qi deserved the consequences she was facing.","The Bamboo Monarch would certainly learn about this incident. He had already been irked by Miao Qi’s repeated attempts to court him as well as Connected Beast Park’s hinting.","Even if the Bamboo Monarch decided to look upon this incident of Miao Qi insulting Wang Fuxiang kindly, he would still end up unleashing his fury on Connected Beast Park.","Wang Fuxiang was not an unreasonable person, and she had to have her reason for targeting Miao Qi.","There was no way that Wang Fuxiang would rebuke You Zhe, and she never intended to disrupt the Guard Ye Banquet in the first place.","“Sorry for the inconvenience, Manager You,” said Wang Fuxiang.","Wang Fuxiang turned and walked toward Zhang Yingying so they could talk and catch up.","Xia Chen followed behind Wang Fuxiang.","At that moment, Li Changlin met Xia Chen’s eyes.","Li Changlin casually winked at Xia Chen, and the latter immediately flushed as he suppressed his anger.? Damn Li Changlin! How are you still so annoying as a middle-aged man?","Xia Chen purposely turned his head away from Li Changlin.","When he saw Li Changlin, Xia Chen could not help but think back to when they were children, and Li Changlin had shaved Xia Chen’s head before ordering him to use his spiritual power to fry an egg on his head.","Li Changlin had even complained that Xia Chen’s spirit qi was so weak that the egg did not taste good.","What a bully!","Regardless, Miao Qi was a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master, so You Zhe did not use force on her.","Miao Qi followed You Zhe out of the Midnight Palace through a special tunnel.","As they walked, Miao Qi tried to strike up a conversation with You Zhe several times, but he did not entertain her at all.","Miao Qi thought,? It’s already a done deal that I’m being chased out of the Guard Ye Banquet. I’ll inevitably be punished when I return home. I can only hope that Miao Zhuo does well and wins one of the top three positions at the Arts Stage. At least, that’ll earn Connected Beast Park some glory.","She thought back to the advice she had given Miao Zhuo and felt that he should have no problem winning one of the top three spots at the Arts Stage since he had the item she had given him.","The main events of the Guard Ye Banquet were the Martial Stage and Martial Arts Stage. Most Creation Masters had impressive fighting abilities.","Thus, most people who even had a shadow of a chance would choose to participate in the Martial Arts Stage to prove themselves.","The younger generation without Creation Master powers but had strong fighting abilities would participate in the Martial Stage.","As a result, the Arts Stage became the weakest of the three Stages.","Miao Zhuo was already a pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master. The precious item that his father had given him to protect his soul could also enable the soul to be used in the concoction of spirit fluids for a short amount of time.","A look of ease came over Miao Qi’s face.","...","After Zuo Ming picked up the unconscious Miao Zhuo and left the Midnight Palace, Gao Feng patted Lin Yuan’s shoulder forcefully and said, “Damn, Lin Yuan, what’s up with you? Why didn’t you tell me about your identity?”","Gao Feng’s actions made Long Tao, Li Xuan, and Liu Jie’s eyelids twitch.","Liu Jie would have made another move if anyone else had hit Lin Yuan’s shoulder so forcefully. However, Liu Jie knew about the relationship between Gao Feng and Lin Yuan.","Whenever Gao Feng was with Lin Yuan, he would slap Lin Yuan’s shoulder constantly.","Lin Yuan laughed and said, “You didn’t ask.”","Lin Yuan really liked Gao Feng’s true personality as he was always forthright and straightforward.","Even when Gao Feng called him, Lin Yuan would listen to Gao Feng complain about the expansion of his faction and the things that happened in his life with a vexed face. However, he was never bored because of how honest Gao Feng was.","Frankly, Lin Yuan had not intended on revealing his identity to Gao Feng, and the latter also had not asked.","When Gao Feng heard what Lin Yuan said, he rolled his eyes in a way that seemed to say, “I want to know now, tell me now.”","Lin Yuan looked around and pointed at an empty area not far off, and said, “Why don’t we sit there and chat. We can have something to eat too.”","By the time Lin Yuan and Liu Jie had arrived, it was already 6:00 p.m., and they had not had time to have dinner.","Lin Yuan was starting to get hungry.","Soon, Liu Jie would have to participate in the Martial Stage and Lin Yuan the Arts Stage. They could not participate in such serious competitions on empty stomachs.","Long Tao, Li Xuan, Liu Jie, Gao Feng, and Lin Yuan walked to the empty area.","Everyone around wanted to follow the group but dared not take a step.","They had all seen what had happened to Miao Zhuo, and taking a step forward now might be seen as an insult that would result in them also being thrown out.","Sun Ningxiang walked up to Lin Yuan and whispered into his ear, “Hello, we meet again. I didn’t expect you to look so young without your mask.”","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows and looked at Sun Ningxiang’s expression of certainty. He was about to deny what she said but said instead, “Why don’t we go over there to chat?”","Sun Ningxiang’s eyes lit up. The group consisting of Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Long Tao, Li Xuan, and Gao Feng was the most elite one currently standing outside the Midnight Palace."]},{"number":836,"title":"Chapter 836 - Fate Sealed With a Few Words","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple, while Liu Jie was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple.","The two disciples of royalty and the two sole descendants of top factions were destined to take over their families, while Li Xuan was the favored oldest son of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Any casual acquaintance made with this group would bring great benefits for Condense Fairy Orchard.","One of these people might have the item that would heal her grandmother’s injuries.","By the time they arrived at the empty area, Li Xuan and Long Tao had already informed Gao Feng of Lin Yuan’s identity.","However, Gao Feng did not look at Lin Yuan any differently. He just felt as though he was in a dream.","His brother was so amazing!","But now, Gao Feng knew how Lin Yuan was able to produce Bronze/Epic feys and nurture spotted coral jades that could only be nurtured by pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters so easily.","After chatting for a while, in the name of his identity as Chief Guard Ye’s disciple, Liu Jie became acquainted with Long Tao, who he already knew, Gao Feng, and Li Xuan.","This introduction to someone you already knew based on a new identity felt exceedingly odd.","As he thought of Lin Yuan’s three distinct identities, Liu Jie suddenly realized why Lin Yuan found it fun.","Sun Ningxiang was not out of place with the five men and quickly joined in their conversations. She even established a collaboration with Li Xuan and Long Tao.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine nurtured avian-type feys while Coiling Dragon’s Valley nurtured dragon-species feys. Both factions required plant-type feys either as fertilizers or spiritual ingredients.","It would also greatly benefit Dark Clouds Bird Shrine and Coiling Dragon’s Valley to collaborate with Condense Fairy Orchard.","While talking to Sun Ningxiang, Gao Feng also decided to work with her privately.","Gao Feng could provide a sea region for Condense Fairy Orchard to expand their aquatic plant-type fey cultivation while Condense Fairy Orchard would supply all the plant-type feys needed to nurture Gao Feng’s aquatic feys.","With three collaborations secured and a significant expansion in Condense Fairy Orchard’s business, Sun Ningxiang was over the moon.","She felt that being by Lin Yuan’s side was almost too incredible as she seemed to have endless benefits as long as she was with him.","Lin Yuan suddenly thought back to what Wen Yu had discovered in her investigation into the Aurora pollen. She had found that Condense Fairy Orchard produced 40% of the Aurora pollen on the market.","Hence, Lin Yuan said to Sun Ningxiang, “Sun Ningxiang, has your Aurora pollen matured yet this year?”","Sun Ningxiang nodded and replied, “The Aurora pollen will be at its cheapest in another two or three months and when the greatest amount will be harvested.”","While she spoke, she remembered the collaboration between Lin Yuan and the Sea Bliss Clan.","Sun Ningxiang had noticed Lin Yuan’s hostility toward the Sea Bliss Clan and thought about the Aurora pollen. Thus, she had stopped Condense Fairy Orchard’s external sale of Aurora pollen.","She had also started to collect Aurora pollen from the over 10,000 stores in the 36 major cities at a steady rate.","This led to a tightening of the supply of Aurora pollen on the market.","In response to this, Sun Ningxiang had injected a large amount of Aurora pollen into the market whenever the price was about to inflate significantly.","If Sun Ningxiang stopped providing Aurora pollen to the market, the almost empty supply of Aurora pollen in the market would immediately lead to high inflation.","Sun Ningxiang had done all this for Lin Yuan as a small gesture.","Lin Yuan had intended to ask Sun Ningxiang to reduce the supply of Aurora pollen she provided to the market. He would compensate Condense Fairy Orchard for the losses they incurred from the loss of sales.","He did not expect Sun Ningxiang to have come to such a decision after overhearing the conversation between him and the Sea Bliss Clan.","Now, Sun Ningxiang had become the weapon that would deliver the final blow to the Sea Bliss Clan.","Sun Ningxiang already controlled 40% of the market on Aurora pollen, and now that she was buying up the remaining 60%, they already controlled about 70% of the market.","Lin Yuan could use the trading of Flower Brocade Pearls to obtain the remainder.","Aurora pollen, which already existed in small supply on the market, had now almost been sucked dry from the market.","Soon, the positive image of Aurora pollen would be ruined, and its price would skyrocket. At that point, the Sea Bliss Clan would be doomed.","Lin Yuan and Sun Ningxiang exchanged knowing looks that sealed the fate of the Sea Bliss Clan.","Lin Yuan looked at Long Tao and asked, “Big Brother Long, is it possible to get eight Emperor Armored Martial God Insects from the four dimensional rifts under Coiling Dragon Valley’s control?”","Lin Yuan did not have an immediate answer. Instead, he said, “I’ll go and ask.”","Long Tao called his elder that was in charge of the dimensional rifts.","Lin Yuan had to have his reasons for mentioning the Emperor Armored Martial God Insects. Thus, Long Tao could not make casual promises.","After talking to his elder, Long Tao said to Lin Yuan, “There are some complete Emperor Armored Martial God Insect corpses in storage as well as Law Source Crystals that were extracted from the bodies of Emperor Armored Martial God Insects.”","Lin Yuan hurriedly shook his head. He could not use corpses to pull his fey carriage.","Although Lin Yuan needed Law Source Crystals, there was no difference between the Law Source Crystals from the bodies of Emperor Armored Martial God Insects and other Class 8 dimensional lifeforms.","Lin Yuan wanted living Emperor Armored Martial God Insects.","He asked Long Tao seriously, “Is it possible for me to get 12 living Emperor Armored Martial God Insects from Coiling Dragon’s Valley?","Long Tao’s mouth fell open as he tried to figure out why Lin Yuan needed living Emperor Armored Martial God Insects.","The Emperor Armored Martial God Insect was Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s most disliked Class 8 alien insect.","Their fighting power was too strong, and a pinnacle emperor-class expert was always needed to deal with the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect.","This wasted a significant amount of Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s top expert resources."]},{"number":837,"title":"Chapter 837 - The Power Lin Yuan Held","paragraphs":["Even dead, the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect’s armor was extremely solid and could not be used as a metal-type spiritual ingredient.","Its flesh was also so tough that even dragon-species feys had indigestion after eating it.","When expelled as waste, the flesh still maintained its form.","There was a chance for Coiling Dragon’s Valley to obtain the living Emperor Armored Martial God Insects that Lin Yuan wanted.","Since there was a chance for him to encounter them, there was no reason for Long Tao to reject Lin Yuan.","“It is possible to get our hands on the living Emperor Armored Martial God Insects, but I can’t be sure when they’ll appear.”","A troubled look came over Long Tao’s face.","Although the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect did appear in the Class 4 alien insect dimensional rifts that Coiling Dragon’s Valley controlled, and pinnacle emperor-class experts could kill the Emperor Armored Martial God Insects, these insects excelled at fighting and inflicting damage.","It was impossible to control living Emperor Armored Martial God Insects for long. Not even pinnacle emperor-class experts could guarantee that the Emperor Armored Martial God Insects they were controlling would remain unharmed.","Thearch-class experts were required in order to capture a complete and unharmed Emperor Armored Martial God Insect.","Long Tao’s grandfather was a thearch-class expert. Still, it was inappropriate for his grandfather to go into a dimensional rift to capture the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect just for Lin Yuan.","Hence, Long Tao said pragmatically, “It’s difficult to capture a living Emperor Armored Martial God Insect. Will injured ones do?”","Lin Yuan shook his head and said, “Big Brother Long, if it’s convenient, can you notify me when you encounter the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect in a Class 4 alien insect dimensional rift? I’ll immediately send someone to capture it.”","Lin Yuan felt that although Endless Summer had not transformed into a Creation Breed before the Guard Ye Banquet as per his expectation, it should be able to evolve to Creation Breed within the next few days if he continued to provide it with Law Crystals.","Endless Summer had comprehended the Enlightenment Law that could control the mind. Thus, when the Enlightenment Law turned into the Enlightenment World, the Creation Endless Summer would be able to control the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect easily and bring it back to the Return from Faraway Mansion.","From Lin Yuan’s words, Long Tao felt that there was more to Lin Yuan than just being the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Although Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple, he should not be able to order thearch-class experts around casually.","But from the way Lin Yuan spoke, it was clear that he could order thearch-class experts around easily.","Whether this was because the Moon Empress showered love on Lin Yuan or because Lin Yuan himself wielded the power of thearch-class experts, it was absolutely astonishing.","When Gao Feng had heard Lin Yuan and Sun Ningxiang talking about Aurora pollen, he thought back to his conversation with Lin Yuan about buying up all the Aurora pollen on the market.","At that time, Gao Feng had been confused by what Lin Yuan meant, but he had to have had his reasons for talking about it.","Hence, Gao Feng had also bought up a significant amount of Aurora pollen.","Now that Gao Feng had the spotted coral jade Lin Yuan had given him, he could nurture the Angelfish of Bliss in water of better quality and would require a high amount of Aurora pollen.","However, Gao Feng did not expect there would be such serious implications to him buying up Aurora pollen.","Gao Feng could not help but think back to his phone call with Lin Yuan, where they had talked about getting back at the Sea Bliss Clan.","Gao Feng had been enraged ever since he was kicked out of the Sea Bliss Clan’s private territory on Star Web.","The role of Gao Feng’s private faction overlapped with that of the Sea Bliss Clan. If he ended up fighting with the Sea Bliss Clan, it would not be easy for him because he did not rely much on the Gao family’s resources.","But his word of passing to Lin Yuan had resulted in Lin Yuan helping him to fight against the Sea Bliss Clan.","This touched Gao Feng, and he took out the Diamond fey storage box he had prepared and gave it to Lin Yuan.","“Brother, here are the four Titan Giant Boas that you wanted. My elders discovered that besides the benefits I told you about, the Titan Giant Boa also has powerful fighting abilities underwater, almost twice as strong than when it fights on land.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up in delight when he heard what Gao Feng said.","Lin Yuan intended for Zhang Xiaobai, Tan Ran, Xin Ying, and Lu Pinru to contract the Titan Giant Boas.","The stronger the Titan Giant Boas were, the better it was for the four of them. It would also increase the power of the Dome Guild Club’s reserve team.","The improved underwater fighting abilities raised the Titan Giant Boas’ value.","Gao Feng must have had invested a fair amount of effort to obtain the four Titan Giant Boas from his family.","Lin Yuan handed Gao Feng a Diamond fey storage box.","Compared to the square Platinum fey storage box, the Diamond fey storage box could be made into a variety of accessories to increase its convenience of use. Hence, Lin Yuan had ordered a large batch of Diamond fey storage boxes from Ostrich Logistics.","Nowadays, Lin Yuan chose to use Diamond fey storage boxes to carry goods whenever he was trading a large number of goods.","Lin Yuan said to Gao Feng, “This is what we agreed on.”","When Gao Feng looked inside the fey storage box, he discovered that besides the spotted coral jade that he and Lin Yuan had agreed on, there were also two jade-textured wooden planks and a heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl with an external layer.","Gao Feng knew that this was Lin Yuan’s compensation to him.","When Gao Feng had learned that Lin Yuan needed the Titan Giant Boas, he had immediately called his grandfather.","During the call, his family had already discovered the Titan Giant Boas’ underwater fighting abilities, and it took a lot of convincing for his grandfather to let the Titan Giant Boas go.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan’s compensation was too high.","In spite of the Titan Giant Boas’ underwater fighting abilities, the combined value of the four Titan Giant Boas were only worth one heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl with an external layer.","The other two jade-textured wooden planks were an unwarranted gift from Lin Yuan.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had prepared these before he found out about the Titan Giant Boas’ underwater fighting abilities."]},{"number":838,"title":"Chapter 838 - Lychee Husband","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","At that moment, it hit Gao Feng again how thorough Lin Yuan was.","Gao Feng was a sensitive person. He wanted to drag Lin Yuan away immediately to have a few cups of wine, but he was unsure if Lin Yuan wanted to participate in the competitions. Hence, he gave up on the inclination to drink.","Instead, he picked up a snack from the tea tray and bit into the soft confection.","His mouth was flooded with a deliciously sweet and sour taste.","Gao Feng felt as though he had been transported to another world as he exclaimed excitedly, “These snacks are so yummy! It looks like something that’s made at the Spirit Food Pavilion, but it tastes so much better!”","The group had been busy talking from the moment they sat down and had not had time to eat.","But after hearing Gao Feng’s exclamation, the group picked up a piece of the snack that Gao Feng had complimented.","When Lin Yuan bit into it, he felt as though an entire lychee grove had exploded in his mouth, and every tooth in his mouth had become a lychee tree.","His saliva flowed continuously, spurred on by the sweetness and sourness.","But as delicious as it was, it did not impress Lin Yuan to a great extent.","Due to his connection to Auntie Zhang and Uncle Li, Lin Yuan had been eating Kitchen Fragrance Palace quality food ever since he was young.","The secret recipes of Kitchen Fragrance Palace could not be compared to the dishes made by the Kitchen Fragrance Pavilion.","As difficult as those days had been, Lin Yuan’s palate had been significantly elevated by Uncle Li’s cooking skills.","Afterward, Lin Yuan had moved on to eat Liu Jie’s cooking. Now that he was accustomed to Liu Jie’s cooking, Lin Yuan did not find anything special about the Spirit Food Pavilion’s food.","Long Tao, Li Xuan, and Sun Ningxiang all found the snack to be delicious.","Although the three of them had already had dinner, this snack had whetted their appetites anew.","“The Kitchen Fragrance Palace made all the refreshments in the Guard Ye Banquet after Lord Chef Supreme arrived at the Midnight Palace. Otherwise, Chief Guard Ye had not intended on serving snacks at all. She had only prepared some fruits. The snack you guys just ate is called Lychee Husband,” explained Liu Jie.","Lin Yuan did not think anything of Liu Jie’s explanation until he heard the name Lychee Husband and he raised his eyebrow.","He found the name strange.","Gao Feng continued to pop Lychee Husbands into his mouth as he looked at Liu Jie curiously.","Liu Jie coughed and said, “Before I came, Master allowed me to look at the itinerary for the Guard Ye Banquet. I also got to take a look at the list of refreshments. Apparently, red lychees from Platinum Crystal Clear Lychee trees were used to make these Lychee Husbands.","“The red lychees are dried over a strange flame then marinated in the sap of the Crystal Clear Lychee tree for a year before it’s used as filling in the Lychee Husbands. Rumor has it that Lord Chef Supreme’s only daughter was the one who named this snack. She felt that the sweet and sour taste was like a kiss from a husband, and the softness of the wrapping is to represent the tenderness of the moment.”","Lin Yuan thought back to Auntie Zhang, who would bring the Terror Rabbit along with her every day as she did laundry.","He did not expect her to be such a romantic when she was young.","Gao Feng’s hand halted as it was about to place another Lychee Husband in his mouth, and a strange feeling came over him.","It was no secret that Chef Supreme’s only daughter had married his first disciple.","Since he had eaten about ten pieces of Lychee Husbands, did that mean that he had kissed Chef Supreme’s first disciple about ten times?","All of a sudden, Gao Feng lost all appetite for this snack.","When he thought about how his father was forcing him to participate in the Martial Stage, Gao Feng felt that he led an extremely difficult life.","He looked at Lin Yuan and lamented, “Are any of you participating in the Martial Stage? At least, I’ll be able to surrender if I face off against any of you.”","Gao Feng knew that besides him, every person who stepped onto the Martial Stage wanted to show off their power.","He would only be in for a beating if he participated in the Martial Stage.","There was one rule to the Martial Stage that Gao Feng simply did not understand, which was that the person who wanted to surrender could only truly admit defeat with the victor’s agreement.","Otherwise, the fight would have to go on until the emergency helper stepped in.","This was too disadvantageous for Gao Feng!","Luckily, one was completely out of the Guard Ye Banquet’s competitions after a single loss.","This meant that Gao Feng only needed to endure one beating.","“I’m participating in the Martial Arts Stage while the Young Liege is participating in the Martial Stage,” said Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan spoke naturally, but Liu Jie’s expression turned into one of embarrassed shock.","Liu Jie never expected that the day would come where Lin Yuan would address him as Young Liege.","On the other hand, if Lin Yuan called him by any other name while he wore this mask, it would expose his identity.","Liu Jie hastily coughed and said, “I’m not a Creation Master, so I’m participating in the Martial Stage.”","“I want to see if the prize for the Arts Stage will be announced before the competitions begin. If the prize for the Arts Stage is decent, I’ll participate in that instead of the Martial Arts Stage,” said Long Tao.","While Long Tao was speaking, his gaze remained solemn.","He understood that the Guard Ye Banquet was not his chance to prove his power to the other disciples of top factions.","Although he was Sequence #3 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, he continued to hide his power.","If those two people were serious, there was no chance of him lasting more than a minute.","Since he had had the chance to fight against them at the Radiance Sacred Hall, the proud Long Tao had truly realized that there were always more powerful people somewhere.","It had been announced in advance that the prize for the Martial Arts Stage was a sacred source lifeform, but the prizes for the Arts Stage and Martial Stage had yet to be announced.","Hence, Long Tao decided to hold off his decision until he saw the prizes.","“The prize for the Arts Stage is a recently hatched Island Whale while the prize for the Martial Stage is the opportunity to receive a custom-made weapon from Lord Bamboo Monarch,” said Liu Jie.","Liu Jie left out that the prize for the Martial Arts Stage was also an Order of Radiant Light."]},{"number":839,"title":"Chapter 839 - Blazing Sun Strange Flame and the Beginning","paragraphs":["Liu Jie still hoped that the Order of Radiant Light would end up in Lin Yuan’s hands, and his wish for the Guard Ye Banquet to take place a year later had crossed his mind more than once.","Liu Jie’s words led Long Tao to make a decision. “If so, I shall participate in the Arts Stage.”","The Island Whale that was the prize for the Arts Stage could not compare with the value of a sacred source lifeform. Hence, there had to be many people who would choose to participate in the Martial Stage because of the sacred source lifeform.","As such, the competition for the Arts Stage would not be as stiff, and most importantly, those two people should be competing in the Martial Arts Stage.","Long Tao asked Lin Yuan in a low voice, “Brother, have you heard of Gu Lang and Zong Ze?”","Lin Yuan shook his head, so Liu Jie started to explain, “Zong Ze and Gu Lang are Lord Chef Supreme and Lord Bamboo Monarch’s youngest disciples, respectively. They will be the strongest participants in the Martial Arts Stage.”","Lin Yuan noted the names.","Only 13 people in the Radiance Federation could be deemed royalty, and 11 of them already had disciples.","Lord Cicada Song and Lord Iron Prison were the only ones left without a disciple, and they usually stayed in the imperial court.","Meanwhile, the other members of royalty had disciples that were already older than 30 years old.","There were only four disciples of the members of royalty who could still be considered a part of the younger generation.","The four were Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Lord Chef Supreme’s youngest disciple, and Lord Bamboo Monarch’s youngest disciple.","Lin Yuan had seen them as his biggest competitors in the Martial Arts Stage from the beginning.","He had insisted on evolving the Dark Death Law to Dark Death World before the Guard Ye Banquet because of these two people.","Neither Li Xuan nor Sun Ningxiang planned on participating in any of the stages.","Li Xuan was a support-type spirit qi professional like Gao Feng and was not a Creation Master. Hence, there was no point in him participating.","Sun Ningxiang had forced herself to attend the Guard Ye Banquet. Even if she was confident in her powers, she did not plan on making any big waves at such competitions while Condense Fairy Orchard was still in such a precarious situation.","Now that Gao Feng knew what the group had in mind for the rest of the night, his expression immediately turned sour.","There would be innumerable people participating in the Martial Stage, and it was impossible for him to face off against Liu Jie right from the beginning.","At that moment, Gao Feng felt that he was not his father’s biological son. He had to have been picked up from a trash can.","For the sake of the competition later on, the group ate the snacks other than the Lychee Husband while they chatted.","Suddenly, 12 chimes sounded from deep inside the Midnight Palace.","Lin Yuan checked the time and realized that it was already 9:00 p.m.","This was the time that the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage was set to begin.","At that moment, six lights hanging from the ceiling of the Midnight Palace were extinguished, and the area outside the Midnight Palace lit up.","A blazing white flame wrapped in a transparent crystal lit up in the center of a suspended ceiling in the area outside the Midnight Palace.","The moment the white flames ignited, the area outside the Midnight Palace seemed to turn white.","Lin Yuan realized that although the white flames did give the semblance of sunlight, it was not blinding.","Rather, overwhelming energy could be sensed from the white flames.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the white flames and discovered that it was a top-grade Blazing Sun Strange Flame.","The strange top-grade strange flame came from Class 5 abyss dimensional rifts, but it did not appear in every one.","Once the strange flame reached top-grade, it became priceless.","Every top-grade strange flame was extremely precious, and there was mostly only one of each kind.","It seemed too luxurious to use such a precious item as a hanging light to illuminate the area outside the Midnight Palace.","Lin Yuan caught sight of Zuo Ming walking nearer with a man that had an odd expression walking alongside him.","The man looked as though he had just heard something unbelievable and was trying his best to compose himself.","You Zhe had just sent Miao Qi back to the Miao family’s residence, but he did not expect to see that Miao Zhuo had already arrived before them.","Had everyone from Connected Beast Park gone crazy?","Why did they all start trouble at the Guard Ye Banquet? Not even the young one knew not to cross the line.","After You Zhe returned, he sought out Zuo Ming and found out why Miao Zhuo had just been sent away. This was when he realized that both aunt and nephew were out of their minds.","Zuo Ming coughed when he saw the crowd of young people and said, “Next, the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage are about to begin in that order. Both the Arts Stage and Martial Arts Stage involve Creation Master powers and will take place in the breeding rooms that have been cleaned out.","“Since the concoction of spirit fluids is special and cannot be exposed to outsiders, only the final results will be considered.","“As for the Martial Stage and Martial Arts Stage that involve combat-type spirit qi professionals, the competitions will take place in the palace in front of the members of royalty and your elders.”","When the Midnight Palace had been constructed, the area outside the palace was built lower. After the Blazing Sun Strange Flame was ignited, the walls made of radyx crystal would become one-directionally transparent where everyone inside the palace would be able to see out into the area outside the palace but not vice versa.","The disciples of top and veteran factions who were confident in themselves all intended on participating in either the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, or Martial Arts Stage.","The disciples of veteran factions wanted to prove themselves to earn the approval of their elders and for the sake of their faction.","If the disciples of veteran factions could prove that they had incredible talent and strong powers, it would be indicative of the veteran factions’ potential for the next few decades.","Such veteran factions always received support from top factions.","It was for this reason that Coiling Dragon’s Valley supported Dark Clouds Bird Shrine and Furnace Stone Metal supported Four Beasts Territory.","Both Dark Clouds Bird Shrine and Four Beasts Territory were veteran factions that had gained the support of Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Furnace Stone Metal a few decades ago because of the strength of their younger generation.","All of the veteran factions present were gunning for the same result."]},{"number":840,"title":"Chapter 840 - The Fiery Sky Hou and Cuttlefish of Days Past","paragraphs":["Meanwhile, the disciples of top factions only had one goal—to prove themselves to their elders to secure their positions.","They would be using their own power to demonstrate their faction’s strength and honor.","There was also the rumor that one of the members of royalty was looking to accept a disciple.","Regardless of whether the rumor was true, the younger generation of the veteran and top factions present were all set on performing to the best of their abilities.","What if the rumor was true?","All of them hoped to be noticed by that member of royalty.","If they really became the disciple of a member of royalty, their status would be elevated to the same level as Chief Guard Ye’s disciple.","The young man wearing the standard Spirit Guards mask was the best example.","All the disciples that were outside the Midnight Palace knew that if they became the disciple of a member of royalty, their lives would be changed forever.","It was said that one opportunity did not guarantee success, but this was exactly what would happen when one became the disciple of a member of royalty.","...","At that moment, in a room with walls made of Diamond radium and numerous black crystals embedded in them, a man dressed in purple clothes with purple bamboo embroidered on it was panting raggedly.","The man was usually charismatic, but he was clenching his jaw and yelling with wide eyes, “Zong Ze, are you mad!? If you use that move, does that mean that you don’t want to fight in the Martial Arts Stage anymore?”","Gu Lang felt that he had been an idiot to believe Zong Ze, the battle fanatic, when he said that they would only be sparring.","Initially, when they clashed, Gu Lang felt that everything had been normal.","But the moment he had slightly gained the upper hand, Zong Ze started to instruct his fey and unleashed a huge attack.","At that point, Gu Lang could not stop Zong Ze, so he could only use his defensive fey to sustain the damage from the attack. Otherwise, he would have been injured.","Although Gu Lang was a combat-class spirit qi professional, he chose to fight in a series of waves.","After sending out waves of attacks, the feys that he had contracted needed a period of time to heal before they could fight again.","This technique could allow Gu Lang to inflict the greatest damage, but it was only sustainable for a short time.","Due to this technique of sending out waves of attacks, Gu Lang had been able to defeat Zong Ze in battle.","A crazy glint appeared in Zong Ze’s eyes as he said, “I was going to use my year’s worth of training to show you how you won’t overcome me like in the past, but I did not expect you to have grown so quickly.”","Zong Ze ordered his Fiery Sky Hou, “Fiery Sky Hou, use Strange Fire Eight Refinement.”","The small adorable orange palm-sized mouse on Zong Ze’s shoulder started to squeak, and hard golden fur started to grow out of its back. It was then set alight with eight colored flames.","When Gu Lang heard the order that Zong Ze issued to the Fiery Sky Hou, he had a bad feeling and waved his hand to summon all the black figures that covered the training room.","Gu Lang sighed to himself and murmured, “Cuttlefish of Days Past, use Old Days Degeneration and Flood Cage.”","With Gu Lang’s order, several large tentacles appeared out of the giant black figure.","Each tentacle manipulated water elements in the air and formed heavy water, which was even harder than metal.","The black heavy water formed pillars of water that crisscrossed each other to form a prison.","However, the prison was not meant for Zong Ze but closed around Gu Lang instead.","The Fiery Sky Hou spat out eight balls of flames that contained eight different burning characteristics.","Every flame was a high-grade strange flame that came from Class 4 dimensional rifts.","The eight high-grade strange flames turned the Night Words Pavilion into a scorching steamer.","Additionally, Zong Ze stretched out his hand to touch the eight high-grade strange flames.","The moment he touched the high-grade strange flames, the center of Zong Ze’s palms turned crimson, and the color spread to cover the light from the right high-grade strange flames and the glow of the half-armor that Zong Ze was wearing.","When Gu Lang saw the crimson color, he could not help but roar in rage, “Zong Ze! We agreed not to use our sacred source lifeforms! If you use it with me now, what will you use to fight against the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye’s disciples at the Martial Arts Stage later on?”","While Gu Lang was speaking, a green image lifted from his collar.","The green image changed rapidly, and just when it was about to become an enormous tree, 12 chimes sounded out from the Midnight Palace. The 12 chimes caused both Gu Lang and Zong Ze to freeze.","During a fight, Gu Lang’s words were far from enough to get through to Zong Ze, who was too engrossed in the adrenaline of the fight.","However, the 12 chimes were able to wake him up.","The crimson color retracted back to Zong Ze’s palm, and with a wave of his hand, the eight high-grade strange flames were swallowed by the Fiery Sky Hou.","A look of embarrassment and awkwardness came over Zong Ze as he said to Gu Lang, “I’m sorry, Gu Lang. I lost control again. Thankfully, the 12 chimes woke me up.”","Zong Ze was always stoic, and his current smile of awkwardness made him look slightly childish.","Gu Lang rolled his eyes dramatically.? I’ll be dead before I spar with you again. Even if I remain single forever, I will never spar with you again. Sparring with others brings us closer but sparring with you might cost me my life!","It was easy enough for Zong Ze to remove his imposing power, but it was not so easy for Gu Lang.","In the fight against Zong Ze, both of Gu Lang’s feys had used up their spiritual power.","The Cuttlefish of Days Past had used Old Days Degeneration and Flood Cage, and the Flood Cage was now fully formed."]},{"number":841,"title":"Chapter 841 - 360 Dishes","paragraphs":["Gu Lang wanted to use the Flood Cage to protect himself against the Fiery Sky Hou’s Strange Fire Eight Refinement.","Now that the Strange Eight Fire Refinement was gone, Gu Lang needed to instruct the Cuttlefish of Days Past to use its spiritual power to remove the heavy water.","Worst of all, Gu Lang had used his sacred source lifeform after he saw Zong Ze using his.","Once Gu Lang’s sacred source lifeform used its power, it could not be retracted. Even if Gu Lang did not unleash his sacred source lifeform’s power now, the sacred source lifeform would fall into a state of slumber within an hour and needed to accumulate enough energy to be able to unleash its power again.","The Arts Stage and Martial Stage couldn’t be completed within an hour.","Gu Lang felt that he had been doomed by Zong Ze.","If he participated in the Martial Arts Stage now, he was still confident of beating the disciples of the veteran and top factions, but he did not know the strength of the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye’s disciples. He could not say with confidence that he would be able to gain victory over them.","Although he had heard from the Bamboo Monarch that the Moon Empress had not had her disciple for more than a year and that her disciple was a young man, and that Chief Guard Ye had only accepted her disciple two months ago, Gu Lang could no longer use his sacred source lifeform, which was his biggest secret weapon, at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Regardless of the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye’s disciples’ powers, Zong Ze was now the most likely victor of the Martial Arts Stage.","If he did not know Zong Ze as well as he did and that Zong Ze would go all out while sparring, Gu Lang might have wondered if Zong Ze had been luring him into a trap.","When he saw Zong Ze’s apologetic expression, Gu Lang fought the urge to hit Zong Ze and instructed the Cuttlefish of Days Past to remove the Flood Cage.","Gu Lang sighed and said, “I’ll participate in the Arts Stage later on. Let’s go. After the 12 chimes, the Arts Stage and Martial Arts Stage should be starting soon. When the Martial Arts Stage begins, you better not jump onto the stage immediately. Although your spiritual power is replenished after every fight, your Fiery Sky Hou’s strange flames cannot be replenished according to the rules of the Martial Arts Stage.”","Combat-class spirit qi professionals contracted more feys as their power increased, and the process of evolution for their feys became increasingly complicated as well.","Although fey battles used spiritual power, some elements needed time to be replenished after each use.","Gu Lang was such an example.","Thus, Gu Lang could not help but issue this warning to Zong Ze, the combat fanatic.","Zong Ze felt guilty when he heard Gu Lang say that he was going to participate in the Arts Stage instead.","He knew that Gu Lang had to give up on the chance to participate in the Martial Arts Stage because of him. Hence, Zong Ze said, “Big Brother Gu Lang, if I win the Martial Arts Stage, I’ll give you the sacred source lifeform and Order of Radiant Light.”","Gu Lang’s mouth twitched. Zong Ze’s words meant that he had only heard the first half of what Gu Lang had said while the latter half had flown clean over his head.","Gu Lang was slightly older than Zong Ze, but the latter did not usually address him as Big Brother.","When he heard Zong Ze call him Big Brother, Gu Lang felt that having such a simple-minded younger brother was not so bad.","Gu Lang walked ahead and said, “Let’s go. I don’t want the sacred source lifeform or the Order of Radiant Light even if you win. You can just make me 360 plates of food using Kitchen Fragrance Palace’s secret recipes.”","Zong Ze looked slightly put off, but he soon gnashed his teeth and said, “Sure, no problem. However, there are some dishes amongst the 360 that I’m not very familiar with yet. I’ll go and learn from Master before I make them for you.”","The Kitchen Fragrance Palace’s 360 dishes were the essence of their cooking techniques. They consisted of 120 snacks, 120 vegetable dishes, and 120 banquet-style dishes.","Naturally, Zong Ze had learned how to make the dishes as Chef Supreme’s youngest disciple. In fact, Chef Supreme’s Creation Master techniques lay in the 360 dishes.","However, Zong Ze had always focused on his spirit qi professional skills and was not familiar with over ten of the 120 banquet-style dishes.","He needed Chef Supreme’s coaching to be able to produce those dishes.","A strange look came over Gu Lang’s face, and he felt that Zong Ze was rather magnanimous.","The Martial Arts Stage would have more than just the disciples of the veteran and top factions participating. A slight lapse in concentration could result in a downfall.","However, Gu Lang did not give any more advice to Zong Ze.","If Zong Ze truly met his downfall, it would be considered a milestone in his life.","Moreover, if Zong Ze’s life remained smooth-sailing, Gu Lang’s advice would be for nothing.","...","After the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage began, the disciples outside the Midnight Palace started to build up their concentration.","The truly nervous people were the leaders of the veteran and top factions who had just met with 12 members of royalty.","At that moment, there were 13 seats positioned in an arc in the inner area of the Midnight Palace.","12 of those seats had an extremely distinct figure sitting on them.","The seat in the middle was empty, but there was a mobile phone on it.","The mobile phone was in video call mode and was placed in the center of the seat.","The person on the other end of the video call would clearly see what was happening outside the Midnight Palace through the radyx crystal wall.","This scene seemed slightly comical to the people watching.","However, none of the veteran and top faction leaders dared to look at the mobile phone directly.","At that moment, a calm voice said from the phone, “Xiyue, Leaning Moon, I haven’t had the chance to meet your disciples yet. How powerful are they?”","Night Leaning Moon replied, “He’s strong, but the stages are not appropriate for my disciple to display his true power.”","The voice from the phone sounded hopeful and said, “Then I’ll have to pay close attention.”","A tone of doubt entered the voice on the phone who said, “Xiyue, I remember that you accepted your disciple six months earlier than Leaning Moon did. You’ve been hiding him away all this time, but you should be letting him go public for the competition, right?”","The Moon Empress’s face was calm and haughty, but she felt troubled.","The question posed to her put her in a dilemma because she did not know how to go about describing Lin Yuan’s power."]},{"number":842,"title":"Chapter 842 - The Reemergence of Lin Yuans Passion","paragraphs":["The Moon Empress felt that she was failing as a Master.","Although she knew that Lin Yuan had constantly been working hard, she had no clue to what extent his power had risen.","She coughed and said, “My disciple is strong.”","The Moon Empress did not elaborate further.","She wanted to take Lin Yuan with her to the Guard Ye Banquet and debut him to the public. Thus, she had not told him much about the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage.","Lin Yuan was only 18 years old, and she felt that it was unfair for him to fight against 27 or 28-year-olds.","The person on the other end of the phone coughed lightly. He was surprised that the Moon Empress had not taken the opportunity to brag about her disciple.","“This year, the prize for the Martial Arts Stage is the Order of Radiant Light. I’ve already handed it to Leaning Moon. Since this is a prize for the Guard Ye Banquet, Leaning Moon should present it.”","The voice on the other end of the call sounded calm, but it stirred the leaders of the veteran and top factions’ leaders.","Previously, it was only announced that a sacred source lifeform would be part of the prize for the Martial Arts Stage, and this was already enough to drive people crazy with yearning.","But no one imagined that on top of the sacred source lifeform, there would be the even more precious Order of Radiant Light as well.","At that moment, everyone hoped that their younger generation of disciples would be able to win the Martial Arts Stage.","However, they all knew that it was not so easy to win the Martial Arts Stage.","The Moon Empress, Chief Guard Ye, Chef Supreme, and the Bamboo Monarch’s disciples were the most likely candidates to be the victor for the Martial Arts Stage.","The gleam in the eyes of the leaders of veteran and top factions darkened slightly.","At that moment, the calm voice on the other end of the call said, “Cicada Song, you were intending on choosing a disciple at the Guard Ye Banquet. Are you still planning on doing so?”","A man seated on one of the 13 seats with a smiling face and eyes that retained joy even in his rest state said, “You might not be aware, but not only am I still planning on doing so, but even Iron Prison wants to accept a disciple now that he knows I’m doing so.”","The man with the smiling face glanced at a man with an austere and stony face seated beside him.","Cicada Song felt like Iron Prison was just a copycat.","When I said I wasn’t going to accept disciples, he didn’t accept any either. But now that I want to, he immediately wants to accept a disciple too.","As he looked at Iron Prison’s grumpy expression, Cicada Song felt that it would be torture to become Iron Prison’s disciple.","The man with smiling eyes did not know that his words had immediately caused the eyes of the leaders of the veteran and top factions behind him to light up with excitement.","There had been rumors that Cicada Song was intending on accepting a disciple, but now, the rumors were proven true.","Moreover, it was even discovered that Iron Prison was also going to be choosing a disciple at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Although it was unknown what their criteria for accepting disciples were, the chances for the various families’ disciples to become the disciples of the two members of royalty had risen significantly.","It was all but certain that the Order of Radiant Light would fall into the hands of either the Moon Empress, Chief Guard Ye, Chef Supreme, or the Bamboo Monarch’s disciples.","The other disciples might as well not compete at all.","But now that there was the chance to become the disciple of one of the members of royalty, the current disciples of the members of royalty were automatically excluded.","After all, it was impossible for two members of royalty to teach the same disciple because it would be seen as snatching each other’s disciples.","Hence, these two spots were available for the disciples of the veteran and top factions.","If any of the disciples of the veteran and top factions could become either Lord Cicada Song or Lord Iron Prison’s disciple, they would have just as much chance as the current disciples of the members of royalty to fight for future Orders of Radiant Light is whenever the opportunity arose.","With the attention of the entire Midnight Palace on him, Zuo Ming announced the rules of the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage’s rules and prizes.","Lin Yuan nodded when he heard Zuo Ming mention the prizes for the Arts Stage and Martial Stage.","The prizes for the champion of the Arts Stage and Martial Stage were just as Liu Jie had said, while the prizes for the second and third place were clearly inferior to that of the first place.","Nonetheless, the crowd was extremely interested.","When the prize for the Martial Arts Stage was announced, the crowd was stirred into an uproar.","The mentioning of the Order of Radiant Light made Gu Lang look depressed.","He was not a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence. Although he had obtained an Order of Radiant Light before, there was no limit to how many a person could have.","Gu Lang had the chance to try out to become a Radiance Envoy with his Order of Radiant Light.","However, another Order of Radiant Light would undoubtedly increase his chances of becoming a Radiance Envoy.","Gu Lang and Zong Ze became the center of attention the moment they stepped into the area outside the Midnight Palace.","As elite as Liu Jie’s status was as Chief Guard Ye’s disciple and Lin Yuan’s identity was shrouded in mystery, they had stolen the attention of the crowd for almost three hours.","Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Long Tao, and the rest had also noticed Gu Lang and Zong Ze.","Long Tao said to Lin Yuan, “The one in purple with purple bamboo embroidery on his clothes is named Gu Lang. He’s Lord Bamboo Monarch’s youngest disciple. The one in the scratched-up half-armor is named Zong Ze. He’s Chef Supreme’s youngest disciple.”","While Long Tao was introducing the two of them to Lin Yuan, the latter started to look at Zong Ze and Gu Lang with suspicion.","For some reason, Lin Yuan felt that there was a strange sacred source lifeform aura radiating from the two of them as though they had just recently used sacred source lifeforms.","At the same time, Lin Yuan was flooded with excitement.","He had not felt this fervent passion in a while.","The last time he had this feeling was in the fight with Chen Hongfeng before he had even ascended the Celestial Stairway.","As a combat-class spirit qi professional in a healing-type spirit qi professional’s skin, Lin Yuan was naturally impulsive.","Impulsive people loved to fight.","Although he had already fought once at the Allstar Match, he had dominated that match from start to end, and it had not excited him at all.","But now, Lin Yuan felt like he was finally about to have a good fight."]},{"number":843,"title":"Chapter 843 - Long Tao Lost His Confidence","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","As You Zhe watched the crowd, he said, “Now that everyone is here, there’s no need to register for the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, or Martial Arts Stage. All of you should know that you can only participate in one of the stages. Those who are participating in the Arts Stage can come with me to the breeding room to choose your topic and nurture a fey accordingly.","“Although every person’s topic is different, the topics were all chosen by the Moon Empress and Lord Bamboo Monarch. All topics have a similar difficulty level and will test your powers as a Creation Master. The person who comes out of the breeding room first shall be the champion. The Arts Stage will end once the top three exit the breeding room.”","You Zhe walked toward a long corridor, followed by the disciples of veteran and top factions who were going to participate in the Arts Stage.","Long Tao also stood up to follow.","Lin Yuan, Li Xuan, Liu Jie, Gao Feng, and Sun Ningxiang gave him some words of motivation before he left.","Long Tao also seemed to be full of confidence.","Although Long Tao had strong fighting abilities, he had more confidence in his Creation Master abilities. He knew that even though his Creation Master education could not compare to that of Lin Yuan, Zong Ze, or Gu Lang, his level was still above the other disciples of top factions.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s Creation Master skills were only below that of the Moon Empress, Bamboo Monarch, and Chef Supreme. Not even the disciples of the members of royalty who had been learning Creation Master skills since they were young could compare to Long Tao.","As the only direct descendant of Coiling Dragon’s Valley, his family had invested countless resources into his Creation Master education.","Long Tao’s self-confidence had taken a hit after he failed to become the Moon Empress’s disciple at Leaning Moon Mountain.","After returning to Coiling Dragon’s Valley, he had basically locked himself away to increase his Creation Master powers, with the exception of participating in the S Tournament.","Now, Long Tao had realized that he could use a small portion of his soul to concoct spirit fluids when he was in optimum condition.","He knew that he was approaching the gate to cross over to Class 4 Creation Master territory.","After a few more years of hard work, he would definitely become an impressive Class 4 Creation Master.","The Guard Ye Banquet with all the veteran and top factions present was sure to be an incredible event.","The top 50 factions had been invited as expected, but the veteran factions had to fight to secure one of the 100 spots available to them.","The bar for attendance to the Guard Ye Banquet was just too high.","Hence, there were not many young disciples outside the Midnight Palace.","There were the four disciples of the members of royalty, 50 disciples of top factions, and 100 disciples of veteran factions, making up 154 younger disciples in total that were standing outside the Midnight Palace.","Most of the disciples chosen to represent the veteran and top factions had Creation Master skills, and it could be said that the area outside the Midnight Palace had the highest concentration of young Creation Masters.","Nonetheless, Creation Master was a rare profession, and only about half of the young disciples in attendance had Creation Master skills.","Due to the phenomenal prize of the Martial Arts Stage, Long Tao estimated that there would only be a maximum of 30 people participating in the Arts Stage as there would be at least 40 disciples who would be mustering up the courage to try their hand at the Martial Arts Stage.","While he was thinking, Long Tao inhaled sharply when he looked toward You Zhe.","His reaction was due to seeing Gu Lang, who was also walking behind You Zhe.","Gu Lang’s actions shocked Long Tao and the other disciples of veteran and top factions who were participating in the Arts Stage.","Lin Yuan looked at Gu Lang warily. He even caught sight of a faint hint of confusion crossing You Zhe’s face, indicating that even You Zhe had not expected Gu Lang to participate in the Arts Stage.","All of Long Tao’s confidence abruptly shattered.","The second prize for the Arts Stage was an Island Whale that had not been nurtured by spirit qi and pure water-element yet, while the third prize was the Electric Crystal Turtle.","The Electric Crystal Turtle could grow electric crystals on its shell after absorbing enough electricity from storm clouds.","Although electric crystals did not have equally as pure elemental energy as heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, they could have a purity of about 75%.","Most importantly, the Electric Crystal Turtle did not need to use Creation Master resources to grow electric crystals on its shell. All it needed was to find storm clouds.","As such, the Crystal Electric Turtle was essentially a fountain of resources that did not require much maintenance.","However, Long Tao knew that not even five Electric Crystal Turtles could compare to the Island Whale that had yet to be nurtured by spirit qi and pure water element.","The distance in value between the first place and second place prize was even further than that between the second place and third place prize.","Although they were both Island Whales, the second-place prize of an Island Whale that had yet to be nurtured by spirit qi and pure water element required a significant amount of Creation Master resources as compared to the first-place prize of an Island Whale that was about to hatch.","Even Coiling Dragon’s Valley would have difficulty producing the Creation Master resources that the Island Whale would require.","An old saying had been repeated amongst top factions and veteran factions: “It’s not that impressive to have an unhatched Island Whale. It’s only impressive if you can hatch it.”","Even veteran factions that had a wealth of resources required decades to hatch one Island Whale.","The moment he saw Gu Lang, Long Tao gave up all thoughts of becoming the champion.","Although he had given up on the first place, he was going to do everything in his power to attain second place.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley would be able to hatch the Island Whale that veteran factions were unable to.","Despite already having a hatched Island Whale, the unhatched Island Whale was a strategic resource in itself.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley could even use the Island Whale as leverage to trade for resources that they needed with other veteran factions."]},{"number":844,"title":"Chapter 844 - Arts Stage and Martial Stage are Happening Concurrently","paragraphs":["Initially, Long Tao had been gunning for champion. But now, he could only strive for second place.","The disciples of veteran and top factions who had been aiming for second and third place looked as though they had just eaten bitter gourd. Their expressions had soured considerably.","All of them knew that trying to compete with the power of a Class 5 Creation Master’s disciple was the epitome of stupidity.","On the other side of the radyx wall, the Bamboo Monarch looked at Gu Lang with his brows furrowed. He did not understand what his ever-steady disciple was doing.","Given his understanding of his youngest disciple, he should be participating in the Martial Arts Stage.","A long time had passed since he accepted Gu Lang as his disciple. All the other 11 members of royalty who were present, as well as the one of the other end of the video call, had all seen Gu Lang.","Even the Moon Empress turned to look at Bamboo Monarch when she saw Gu Lang heading off to participate in the Arts Stage.","Chef Supreme, who had only intended on spectating, glanced at his youngest disciple.","When he saw the expression on Zong Ze’s face, Chef Supreme froze. He had an inkling of why Gu Lang was participating in the Arts Stage instead.","Although he felt that his guess was most likely right, he did not say it out loud.","Instead, he changed the topic and said, “Bamboo Monarch, Kitchen Fragrance Palace doesn’t have the item that you said could break your bad luck. However, I do have one bottle of Hundred Prosperity Wine left. During winter, I collected the snow from plum blossoms and used the flower buds from 100 types of prosperity flower-type feys and tempered them. This bottle has been sealed for almost 40 years. The prosperity inside might not be enough to remove your bad luck, but it can suppress it for some time.”","Before Chef Supreme sat down, he had already studied Wang Fuxiang’s body condition.","He had put a lot of effort into making the Hundred Prosperity Wine, but after sensing how troublesome her bad luck was, he could not be certain how long the Hundred Prosperity Wine would be able to suppress the bad luck.","Wang Fuxiang was standing behind the Bamboo Monarch. A look of delight came over her when she heard what he said.","When the members of royalty arrived at the Midnight Palace’s inner area, Wang Fuxiang had sensed their eyes linger on her for a moment.","The Moon Empress had looked at her for the longest time.","Wang Fuxiang could not pester the Bamboo Monarch and ask him if he had found the solution to her problem under such circumstances.","She had spent every minute and second of her long life trying to find a way to break her bad luck.","Wang Fuxiang knew the condition of her bad luck well.","After all, not even the Class 5 Creation Master Bamboo Monarch could break his bad luck and was affected by it.","Thus, Wang Fuxiang did not have much hope that her bad luck could be broken.","When she had decided to be together with Bamboo Monarch, Wang Fuxiang had accepted her eventual death.","After she heard Chef Supreme say that the Hundred Prosperity Wine could suppress her bad luck for some time, Wang Fuxiang felt that she had just received a miracle.","If her bad luck was suppressed, she would be able to live with the Bamboo Monarch normally for some time.","Wang Fuxiang thought,? It would be great if the Hundred Prosperity Wine could suppress my bad luck for a year. I might be able to have a child during that time.","The Bamboo Monarch had been confused about his youngest disciple’s decision. But now that he heard what Chef Supreme said, his attention had been completely diverted.","Just as the Bamboo Monarch was about to thank Chef Supreme, the Moon Empress shot him a frowning look.","Wang Fuxiang had been born with bad luck. Not even wine made from 1,000 types of prosperity beasts could counter her bad luck for long, much less the Hundred Prosperity Wine.","It would only be effective for two months at most.","The Moon Empress could also produce the Hundred Prosperity Wine, but her bad luck became stronger each time it was countered.","Next time, it would become even harder to suppress it.","She felt that Chef Supreme’s idea would be like bandaging a bullet hole and would not be able to solve the problem fully.","Now, the Moon Empress only wanted to watch.","She did not care about who won the Art Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage.","Soon, Lin Yuan would change into the clothes she had prepared for him and take his seat by her side.","At that time, she would officially announce Lin Yuan’s identity and tell the world who Zhao Xiyue’s disciple was.","Thus, she found the competition between young people rather boring.","You Zhe said to the young disciples behind him, “Okay, if no one else intends to participate in the Arts Stage, the final number of participants shall be fixed at 25.”","You Zhe started to walk into the long corridor.","Gao Feng watched as Long Tao disappeared into the long corridor behind You Zhe and turned to say to Lin Yuan, “I can’t believe the Arts Stage is so boring. Lin Yuan, you must be a Creation Master since you’re participating in the Martial Arts Stage. Do you think it’s fair that everyone has a different topic?”","Lin Yuan paused to think before replying, “If they’re testing Creation Master skills, this method of competition is fair.”","Before the Arts Stage took place, Lin Yuan did not know that the competition would be carried out in such a way.","This method of competition was extremely advantageous to Lin Yuan because the picking of topics allowed Lin Yuan to avoid his issue of evolving fey grades.","However, he was unsure if the Arts portion of the Martial Arts Stage would be carried out in the same manner.","Before Gao Feng could nod his head at Lin Yuan’s words, Zuo Ming said, “The Arts Stage will not end immediately, but the Martial Stage will begin now.”","Zuo Ming pointed at a large empty area in the center of the area outside the palace and said, “The Martial Arts Stage will be held here, and I will be the emergency helper. I will gauge the strength of each attack to judge if the other party will be able to handle it. If the attack is too much for the opponent to handle, I will step in to end the fight to ensure every participants’ safety. If you would like to participate in the Martial Stage, please follow me.”","Gao Feng was still nodding and was about to ask Lin Yuan more about the Arts Stage, but all his rising questions evaporated in his throat upon hearing what Zuo Ming said.","He did not expect the Arts Stage and Martial Stage to take place concurrently.","It looked like he was about to receive a good beating soon."]},{"number":845,"title":"Chapter 845 - Gao Fengs Joy Turned Into Sorrow","paragraphs":["Gao Feng only hoped that his beating would not be too severe.","It would be humiliating if he ended up being beaten black and blue. Moreover, there was a chance that he would be receiving a second beating when he returned home.","Gao Feng stood up unsteadily and felt a hand land on his shoulder.","A deep voice said into Gao Feng’s ear, “Don’t be scared. If you can’t hold on during the fight, just shake your head gently at Uncle Zuo.”","Gao Feng turned to see that Liu Jie had stood up as well.","Liu Jie was the center of attention.","When Liu Jie stood up and placed his hand on Gao Feng’s shoulder, the unassuming Gao Feng also ended up in the spotlight.","Gao Feng felt that Liu Jie was his savior, and he knew that Liu Jie had given Zuo Ming a head’s up to help Gao Feng.","Gao Feng had a boisterous personality, so he patted Liu Jie’s shoulder without much thought and pulled Liu Jie closer to him.","Liu Jie allowed himself to be pulled and stood shoulder to shoulder with Gao Feng.","The picture that Gao Feng and Liu Jie painted of two buddies caused the blood of the people outside the palace to boil.","The crowd remembered that Gao Feng and Chief Guard Ye’s disciple did not seem to know each other, yet now they were acting like actual brothers.","The young disciples who had wanted to join the group but could not muster the courage to do so regretted their timidness now.","Even if they failed to join the group and could not stand side by side with Chief Guard Ye’s disciple like Gao Feng was going now, just being able to say a few words to Chief Guard Ye’s disciple would have earned them their elders’ favor and allowed them to climb to a higher position in their family.","A square-faced man was staring at Gao Feng from inside the Midnight Palace. He frowned when he saw Gao Feng standing and smiling.","The square-faced man was Gao Feng’s father, Gao Pei.","Gao Pei sighed and said, “It looks like I’ve been too lenient with Gao Feng.”","Although Gao Pei did not think that Gao Feng had any hope of being accepted as the disciple of one of the members of royalty, Gao Feng was still his only son who would eventually inherit the Gao family.","It was now imperative to leave a good impression on the 13 members of royalty.","As Gao Pei looked at Gao Feng, he felt that all the advice he had given Gao Feng back home had been for naught.","While Gao Pei moped, Night Leaning Moon said, “The one wearing the standard Spirit Guards mask is my disciple.”","Night Leaning Moon smiled under her veil as she looked at Liu Jie.","It had only been two months since Night Leaning Moon accepted Liu Jie as her disciple.","In the last two months, Night Leaning Moon had been consistently helping Liu Jie to increase his power. She had not been a Master for long and had not had time to pay attention to Liu Jie’s life yet, so she did not know who his friends were.","She only knew that Liu Jie cared considerably for Lin Yuan and that he cared to the extent of it being his faith.","Now that she saw him with other people of his age, Night Leaning Moon felt rather happy.","Night Leaning Moon knew that Liu Jie had spent three years in a dark place. At least now, looking at him, she knew that his personality had not atrophied due to that dark time.","Although she rarely spoke, Night Leaning Moon said to the people behind her, “The boy with my disciple should be one of your sons, right? I look forward to seeing his performance in the Martial Stage.”","Gao Pei had been thinking of how he should teach Gao Feng a good lesson so that he would remember not to be so smiley all the time.","But now that he knew that the person that was standing beside his son was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple, Gao Pei’s heart started to beat wildly.","He blinked as he screamed internally.? That’s my son! Good job!","However, Gao Pei was confused because he had never heard Gao Feng mention that he was acquainted with Chief Guard Ye’s disciple.","Given his son’s personality, he should have constantly been yapping about it.","Before Gao Pei could express his joy, he heard what Chief Guard Ye had said next.","Her words troubled Gao Pei.","He had insisted on his son participating in the Martial Stage because he wanted Gao Feng to know that his team of feys had serious limitations.","When they were at home, Gao Pei would tell Gao Feng about the issue with his team of feys multiple times.","However, he could never win in an argument with his son.","Thus, he had wanted Gao Feng to participate in the Martial Stage to get a good taste of the weakness that came from his limitations.","He should be proud that his son had been mentioned by Chief Guard Ye, who also said that she was looking forward to his performance.","However, Gao Pei’s expression was becoming increasingly unnatural.","What kind of performance will my son put on?","Chief Guard Ye’s words had placed the limelight on Gao Feng.","When Gao Feng stepped up to the platform and was beaten to a pulp, all the hopes that Chief Guard Ye had pinned on him would be dashed.","While Gao Pei was wrapped up in his concerns, Gao Feng and Liu Jie had arrived behind Zuo Ming.","Liu Jie walked up to Zuo Ming and whispered something, to which Zuo Ming nodded and said, “There are a total of 75 participants for the Martial Stage. If no one else is joining, I shall announce the Martial Stage’s rules. The Martial Stage will be starting now.”","Zong Ze already knew that Liu Jie was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple.","As Zong Ze gazed at Liu Jie, he looked eager to launch into battle and took a step forward.","But soon, he awkwardly hit the back of his head and told himself not to be impulsive.","If he participated in the Martial Stage, he would not be able to participate in the Martial Arts Stage.","Since no one else stepped forward, Zuo Ming said, “Then, the Martial Stage shall officially begin. I will choose a person to stand on the Martial Stage, and the rest can choose to challenge whenever they please. When everyone has used their chance to challenge a fight, the Martial Stage will come to an end. The last person standing on the Martial Stage will be the victor while the second and third place will be decided based on the number of consecutive wins.”","When the younger generation of disciples heard what Zuo Ming said, their expressions shifted.","The rules for the Martial Stage were slightly unusual.","The last person standing would be the victor, while the second and third place would be decided based on the number of consecutive wins. This meant that one should enter the stage later to ensure that they would not tire themselves out in previous fights.","The disciples of veteran and top factions that were present knew how strong each other was as well as what abilities their feys had.","Hence, anyone standing on the Martial Stage would become a living target that would be easily kicked off the stage by a new challenger.","As such, the real question was when was the right time to enter the Martial Stage.","While the others were contemplating when they should step onto the stage, Gao Feng was swimming in delight.","He felt that as long as he waited till Liu Jie stepped onto the stage, he could just surrender.","There was no way that Liu Jie would reject his surrender, and he could save himself a beating.","While Gao Feng was dancing internally with joy, a gust of wind dragged him away.","By the time he came to his senses, he had found himself on the Martial Stage."]},{"number":846,"title":"Chapter 846 - Zuo Ming Does Something Bad With Good Intentions","paragraphs":["Gao Feng stood at the center of the Martial Stage with a look of utter dumbfoundedness.","He had panicked slightly when the gust of wind had dragged him. But now that he stood at the center of the stage, it finally hit him what had happened.","Zuo Ming had chosen him to be the first person to enter the Martial Stage.","Gao Feng’s previous delight had turned into intense anxiousness that caused his face to scrunch together, and he almost cried out in despair.","Liu Jie looked at Gao Feng standing awkwardly on the stage and blinked his eyes.","He had only told Zuo Ming a simple line.","“Uncle Zuo, if Gao Feng nods at you and surrenders, just take it as he’s forfeiting and let him exit the stage.”","Liu Jie’s instruction should not have any issues, but that was before he learned about the Martial Stage’s rules.","When Zuo Ming analyzed the meaning behind Liu Jie’s words, he knew that Gao Feng was not strong. If so, he could not understand why Gao Feng would participate in the Martial Stage.","But since Liu Jie had intentionally brought it up, Zuo Ming would do his best to see the task through.","The rules of the Martial Stage made it so that those who entered the stage later would be stronger.","Thus, Zuo Ming wanted Gao Feng to be the first to enter so that he could win a few battles despite his lack of power.","When he saw Liu Jie looking at him, Zuo Ming shot him a smile and nodded.","Liu Jie would have face-palmed if he was not wearing the standard Spirit Guards mask.","As he looked at the stunned Gao Feng onstage, Liu Jie decided to be the first to step up to challenge Gao Feng.","He would be able to lead Gao Feng to demonstrate his maximum power.","Liu Jie knew that Gao Feng was purely a support-type spirit qi professional.","When Gao Feng used up all his support-type feys, it would seem reasonable for him to surrender.","Liu Jie did not intend on summoning the Insect Queen in the Martial Stage because it would evolve, activating the sea of insects and going into full battle mode.","If he fought in such a way, there would be no point in him wearing the standard Spirit Guards mask.","It would be easy for others to identify him through the Insect Queen and sea of insects.","Although there was more than one fairy-type source-type lifeform like the Insect Queen in existence, it was impossible for two Insect Queens to have the same abilities.","Liu Jie had intended on using the Insect Queen’s new power of controlling carcinoma feys to fight in the Martial Stage to test his power as ‘the final weapon’.","The carcinoma feys would only have the greatest effect after several fights on the Martial Stage.","If his spiritual power could be replenished after every fight in the Martial Stage, it would not be difficult for him to fight consecutive battles.","He was not afraid even if someone discovered during a fight that he could control carcinoma feys through the Insect Queen because he had only shown one of the eight Dead Soul Demon Insects during the confrontation with Miao Zhuo.","Just as Liu Jie was about to step up to the Martial Stage, someone else beat him to it.","Liu Jie became nervous for Gao Feng.","Zuo Ming did not know what Liu Jie was thinking. When Zuo Ming saw someone step up to the Martial Stage, he said, “Let the first stage of the Martial Stage begin. The rules of the fight shall be the same as those on Star Web’s Celestial Stairway. Healing-type spirit qi professionals and support-type spirit qi professionals can move back and summon feys first.”","Gao Feng hurriedly said, “I’m a support-type spirit qi professional! I would like to put some distance between us!”","Gao Feng moved backward as he took a deep breath. He faced the chubby man in front of him with a look of resolution.","Although he did not want to get beaten up on the Martial Stage, now that he was here, he was not going to be a sitting duck.","He did not know who the chubby man was, but judging from the icon on his spirit qi clothes, Gao Feng knew that he was not a disciple of a top faction.","The thought of him, a disciple of a top faction, getting beat up by the disciple of a veteran faction made Gao Feng determined to lose with dignity.","The most dignified way to lose was to prove his worth on the Martial Stage.","Gao Feng waved his hand, and two large light green lilies bloomed by his feet.","The two large light green lilies spurted spirit liquid-like fountains, and the entire Martial Stage was enveloped in a large amount of spirit qi.","Although the spirit qi did not increase the concentration of spirit qi on the Martial Stage, it did kick up a gust of spirit qi.","At that moment, a large hibiscus bloomed in front of the two lilies.","The hibiscus produced a breeze that molded the two fountains of spirit liquid into threads that became a current of spirit qi which circled above the hibiscus.","Suddenly, the spirit qi that was flowing in all directions retracted and gathered in front of Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the feys that Gao Feng had summoned.","The Breeze Hibiscus was Gao Feng’s original fey, but the two Spirit Fountain Lilies had been traded from Lin Yuan for the Floating Island Whale and three young Elemental Shellfish.","Gao Feng had also obtained a Yellow Spring Lily from Lin Yuan that he had not summoned yet.","He had told Lin Yuan about the two Willpower Runes that he had comprehended. The Breeze Hibiscus was Platinum VII/Fantasy II.","Neither of the Spirit Spring Lilies was Fantasy Breed, but they were Silver X/Legend.","Since their grades had not evolved, Gao Feng must be suppressing their grades on purpose.","It was likely that Gao Feng wanted to evolve them to Fantasy Breed. There was no other reason to suppress their grades.","This meant that the Yellow Spring Lily had to already be Fantasy Breed.","When Lin Yuan checked on the feys that Gao Feng had summoned, all the younger generation disciples outside the Midnight Palace had a ‘Are you kidding me?’ look on their faces."]},{"number":847,"title":"Chapter 847 - Glacier Submerged Shark","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Although the three feys that Gao Feng had summoned were not weak, they lacked fighting power.","Gao Feng was not planning on killing his opponent’s feys by oversupplying them with spiritual power, right?","Even if Gao Feng had lost his mind, that plan would never work.","When a fey was full of spiritual power, abilities that replenished spirit qi would not work on it.","This was common sense, and there was no way that Gao Feng was unaware of it.","Thus, his actions were confusing the rest of the young disciples.","Even the top and veteran faction leaders inside the Midnight Palace turned to look at Gao Pei when they saw what Gao Feng was doing.","Night Leaning Moon looked at Gao Feng on the Martial Stage with amusement. She had said that she was looking forward to Gao Feng’s performance on the Martial Stage, but he was demonstrating purely support-type abilities, and she could not see a way to make use of them.","Gao Feng raised his hand and was about to summon the Yellow Spring Lily when his hands stopped.","The Yellow Spring Lily was his secret weapon.","He had not even told his father that he had contracted the Yellow Spring Lily, and after a moment’s contemplation, he decided not to display the Yellow Spring Lily on the Martial Stage.","It would have been fine if the Yellow Spring Lily could save him from his miserable situation, but as it stood, summoning the Yellow Spring Lily would not increase his chances of winning in the slightest.","At that moment, the grumpy-looking Iron Prison glanced at Cicada Song and said, “You also contracted two of the three feys that that boy is using. It seems like you’re fated.”","Cicada Song did not react to Iron Prison’s words and shook his head slightly.","Cicada Song was a support-type spirit qi professional. In fact, he was the ultimate softcore support-type spirit qi professional.","But when he saw the feys that Gao Feng had summoned, he felt that Gao Feng was not smart.","To be the best softcore support-type spirit qi professional, one had to be soft while strategic in a way that would best make up for the softness.","It was only possible to be a softcore support-type spirit qi professional if one had an irreplaceable strategic plan.","Cicada Song had not responded to Iron Prison’s words, but the leaders of top and veteran factions behind them were all stirred up.","Out of the 12 members of royalty and elderly person on the other end of the phone, Iron Prison and Cicada Song were the two that attracted the most attention from the leaders due to their intention to accept disciples.","With the word ‘fated’, the crowd immediately started to guess.","However, Gao Pei did not have a hint of happiness on his face.","He had always been displeased with the path that Gao Feng had chosen.","He was not impressed by the feys that Gao Feng had summoned, and he did not think that his son would catch the eye of Cicada Song.","The corner of Zuo Ming’s mouth twitched as he looked at Gao Feng, and he stole a glance at Liu Jie.","When he saw the feys that Gao Feng summoned, Zuo Ming knew that his actions that came out of good intentions had ended up backfiring.","The chubby man standing opposite Gao Feng was delighted when he saw the feys that Gao Feng had summoned and stepped forward with a broad grin on his face.","Wang An was participating in the Martial Stage to prove himself to his elders and give him a leg up over his siblings back home.","He had decided to step up to challenge Gao Feng first because he knew that Gao Feng was a support-type spirit qi professional.","However, he had not known what feys Gao Feng had contracted, and it was only now that he discovered that Gao Feng was one of the rare softcore support-type spirit qi professionals.","Now, Gao Feng was completely at his mercy, and Wang An could use the power of Gao Feng’s three flowers.","Wang An waved his hand with a loud chuckle and summoned the four feys he had contracted.","Since he had been chosen to attend the Guard Ye Banquet, Wang An had to have some tricks up his sleeves. The strongest fey he summoned was the Platinum IX/Fantasy I Blizzard Tongue Shellfish.","The second most powerful was the Platinum IV/Fantasy I Glacier Submerged Shark.","The remaining two feys were Silver X/Legend, just like Gao Feng’s Spirit Spring Lilies.","The feys that Wang An had summoned were much stronger than those that Gao Feng had summoned.","Wang An knew that he had to come out the gate running and use all his power in one attack if he wanted to leave the best impression of himself.","With Zuo Ming around as the emergency helper, Wang An did not have to hold back at all. He did not need to be afraid that his attack would injure Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan’s expression changed when he saw the feys that Wang An had summoned. Wang An’s fey of the highest level was the Platinum IX/Fantasy I Blizzard Tongue Shellfish.","However, the strongest fey was the Platinum IV/Fantasy I Glacier Submerged Shark.","The Glacier Submerged Shark was an extremely rare deep-sea fey and was the rarest shark-species fey that existed in the north deep seas.","The explosion of frigid air expunged from the Glacier Submerged Shark could instantly form a glacier.","Moreover, the Glacier Submerged Shark that Wang An had contracted had impressive exclusive skills.","The first exclusive skill was Bite of Ice Layer, which allowed the Glacier Submerged Shark to hide under a layer of ice and use all the power in its body to shatter the ice.","The second exclusive skill was Ravenous Frigidity which allowed the Glacier Submerged Shark to consume the cold qi from other ice-type feys to increase its own attacking strength.","When Lin Yuan saw these two exclusive skills, he knew that the Glacier Submerged Shark could fight above its grade.","Although Bite of Ice Layer would use all the power in the Glacier Submerged Shark’s body for one attack, feys that could fight above their grade had extremely great potential.","At that moment, Lin Yuan inhaled sharply because he saw the Platinum IX/Fantasy I Blizzard Tongue Shellfish open its shell to reveal its soft flesh.","Wang An instructed the Platinum IV/Fantasy I Glacier Submerged Shark to use Ravenous Frigidity to bite the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish’s flesh.","Lin Yuan suddenly understood what Wang An was trying to do.","Wang An wanted the Glacier Submerged Shark to consume the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish’s flesh before releasing the strongest blow of Bite of Ice Layer."]},{"number":848,"title":"Chapter 848 - This Boy is Rather Fated With Me","paragraphs":["The people present were all going to go all the way in order to display their powers without regret. However, Wang An’s actions were going overboard.","This was not Star Web, and the Glacier Submerged Shark could do real damage to the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish by eating it.","Wang An was being extremely cruel to his fey.","Lin Yuan would never be so barbaric to his feys.","Wang An’s actions were meant to secure victory.","From the way Wang An did not even blink before he ordered the Glacier Submerged Shark to eat the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish, it was clear that this was not the first time that it was happening.","Wang An only stopped the Glacier Submerged Shark from eating when the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish entered a near-death state.","Gao Feng frowned when he saw what Wang An did.","He did not like the way that Wang An was treating his feys, but at the same time, a gleam appeared in Gao Feng’s eyes.","“Glacier Submerged Shark, use Bite of Ice Layer!” yelled Wang An.","The moment Wang An issued his order, the entire Martial Stage was covered in a layer of hard ice.","The Glacier Submerged Shark dove under the ice, and shadows appeared under the ice.","It seemed as though the shadow would break through the ice at any time and launch a lethal attack on Gao Feng.","Zuo Ming was also ready to protect Gao Feng, feeling that the first match of the Martial Stage was all but settled.","Just as the shadow under the ice sped toward Gao Feng, the latter waved his hand and whispered, “Yellow Spring Lily, use Soul Washing Spring Soup and Yellow Spring Change.”","Gao Feng’s orders made Zuo Ming hesitate.","When Zuo Ming scrutinized the battle settings, he decided against stepping in to save Gao Feng.","The thunderous sound of ice cracking rang out, and an icy mist enveloped Gao Feng, hiding him from view.","After the ice mist dispersed, the crowd saw that Wang An’s Glacier Submerged Shark had collided with the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish.","Since the Bite of Ice Layer had used all the energy in the Glacier Submerged Shark, it was now completely devoid of fighting power.","There were two huge punctures in the Glacier Submerged Shark that was lying on the ground, and it was clear that the punctures had come from the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish’s two sword-like protrusions.","The Blizzard Tongue Shellfish had also been heavily injured.","Its shell had been reduced to pieces after the Glacier Submerged Shark chomped on it, exposing the flesh inside.","However, the Platinum IX/Fantasy I Blizzard Tongue Shellfish managed to survive because it was born with strong defensive abilities and was of a higher grade than the Glacier Submerged Shark.","Now that the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish’s flesh was exposed, Gao Feng’s four flowers emerged.","Gao Feng was covered in the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish’s secretions and looked rather pathetic, but he did not stop there. He ordered the barely surviving Blizzard Tongue Shellfish to use Cold Ice Snow Spikes on the two Silver X/Legend by Gao Feng’s feet.","At that moment, Wang An was frozen in shock by the recent development. He did not understand how the Blizzard Tongue Shellfish had recovered and why it was protecting Gao Feng.","With only the two Silver X/Legend feys, there was no way that Wang An could defend himself against the Cold Ice Snow Spikes.","Zuo Ming appeared on the Martial Stage in a flash and broke apart the Cold Ice Snow Spikes before looking at the withered yellow lily in Gao Feng’s arms in amazement. “For the first match, the incumbent participant wins! Gao Feng now has one consecutive win.”","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Yellow Spring Lily that Gao Feng had suddenly summoned to turn the tables of the fight.","[Fey Name]: Yellow Spring Lily","[Fey Species]: Pink core-species/lily species","[Fey Grade]: Platinum (5/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy I","Abilities:","[Core Heart Fragrance]: The petals will release a strong fragrance that will turn into spirit qi and replenish the depleted spirit qi when absorbed by the target.","[Full of Pollen]: The pollen in the center of the petal will absorb spirit qi daily, and the pollen full of spiritual power can be released to increase the power of an ability.","[Yellow Spring Eye]: A yellow spring eye will be applied to a target, and the Yellow Spring Lily will transfer spiritual power to the target through the yellow spring eye to replenish the target’s spiritual power.","[Yellow Spring Change]: When a target with a yellow spring eye applied on it is in a near-death state, the yellow spring eye will enter the target’s body and sacrifice itself to completely heal the fey.","[Parasite Revival]: When all the spiritual power in the Yellow Spring Lily is used up, it will turn into a seed that can be planted in a fey of a similar type. It will absorb the spiritual power from the fey to recover itself.","Exclusive Skill:","[Enter Spirit Plant]: The roots will wrap around another plant of the same type to extract a large amount of spiritual power that can be transferred to the petals to increase the effectiveness of the abilities.","[Wash Soul Spring Soup]: The Yellow Spring Lily can revive and control a fey in a near-death state through the soul-washing abilities in its pollen. The effects will last till the fey re-enters a near-death state.","Lin Yuan could not help but hit his thigh when he saw the Yellow Spring Lily’s True Data. The exclusive skills that the Yellow Spring Lily had obtained after evolving to Fantasy Breed were too fantastic.","When Gao Feng had first obtained the Yellow Spring Lily, it had been Bronze X/Epic.","As such, Lin Yuan knew about the Yellow Spring Lily’s exclusive skill Enter Spirit Plant.","However, he did not expect that Wash Soul Spring Soup would allow the Yellow Spring Lily not only to revive feys of the same side from a near-death state but opponent feys as well. It was also able to control the opponent’s feys in the process.","As long as he had the Yellow Spring Lily, Gao Feng was an extremely capable softcore support-type spirit qi professional.","Gao Feng checked his hands, and a beam spread across his face.","First, he waved at Liu Jie before waving to Lin Yuan and screaming, “I actually won!”","The person who was the surest of Gao Feng’s loss had been Gao Pei because he did not know that Gao Feng had the Platinum V/Fantasy I Yellow Spring Lily.","While Gao Pei was consumed with shock, Cicada Song looked at Iron Prison. His smiling eyes were also carrying a different emotion.","“You’re right. This boy is rather fated with me.”"]},{"number":849,"title":"Chapter 849 - The Moon Empress Recommendation","paragraphs":["While the man with smiling eyes spoke, he tapped the armrest of his chair. Iron Prison, who knew Cicada Song well, could immediately tell that Cicada Song was overjoyed.","Cicada Song’s words made the leaders of the top and veteran factions look at Gao Pei with astonishment and envy.","Gao Pei’s shock was now mixed with unspeakable elation.","Although Cicada Song was always smiling and there seemed to be a constant gleam of happiness in his eye, he seemed very unapproachable to the top factions’ leaders.","When Iron Prison had said that Gao Feng seemed fated with Cicada Song, Gao Pei had almost scoffed.","Fathers knew their sons best. Gao Pei felt that no one could know Gao Feng better than he did.","However, Gao Feng had summoned a fey that not even his father was familiar with.","Gao Pei felt that he needed to give Gao Feng a good beating when they returned home.","This brat was actually hiding something from his own father!","Suddenly, Gao Pei looked stunned.","He thought back to several months ago when Gao Feng had said that he wanted to use some of the family’s resources to trade for a Bronze/Epic fey that he could contract. He had taken an Island Whale that could not be hatched and three young Elemental Shellfish.","When he had asked Gao Feng a few days later what fey he had obtained, Gao Feng had summoned the two Spirit Spring Lilies, and Gao Pei had slapped him.","At that time, Gao Feng seemed to have more to say to Gao Pei but had been interrupted by Gao Pei’s beating.","Now, Gao Pei felt awkward.","Nonetheless, Gao Pei straightened his back and smiled in response to the looks of envy that the top and veteran faction leaders were shooting at him.","Gao Pei was already used to receiving looks of envy from veteran factions.","However, the Gao family had always been in the lower ranks of the top factions, and it had only been in recent years that they had expanded into deep-sea resources and started to climb up the ranks.","Thus, the top 20 leaders of top factions never paid much attention to him.","Now, as he basked in their looks of envy, Gao Pei felt that his son was incredible!","Of course, all of Gao Feng’s skills were thanks to his father.","Although Night Leaning Moon had said that she was looking forward to Gao Feng’s performance, she had not expected Gao Feng to truly surprise her.","Night Leaning Moon praised Gao Feng by saying, “No hubris or rush, and he caught the best opportunity. If he receives proper training, he can definitely become a top softcore support-type spirit qi professional.”","She looked at Cicada Song while she spoke. She seemed to be recommending Gao Feng to Cicada Song.","Before Cicada Song could respond, the Moon Empress who hardly spoke said, “The Breeze Hibiscus gathers spirit qi while the Spirit Spring Lilies are the fountains for the spirit qi. The Yellow Spring Lily is the main weapon that increases the team’s mistake tolerance. This team of feys forms a basic fey system. Cicada Song, if you train him properly, even if he doesn’t become a Radiance Envoy, it’s very likely that he could become one of the 10 Radiance Knights.”","The Moon Empress’s words stunned everyone present, including Cicada Song.","Cicada Song did not understand why the cold and distant Moon Empress was complimenting Gao Feng.","Gao Feng had potential, and Cicada Song had a good impression of him as well.","However, Cicada Song did not think that Gao Feng was good enough to warrant a compliment from the Moon Empress.","Nonetheless, the Moon Empress’ words made Cicada Song think.","All of the five Radiance Envoys had to be extremely well-rounded combat-class spirit qi professionals.","A softcore support-type spirit qi professional like Gao Feng would never be able to become a Radiance Envoy no matter how strong he became. However, the Radiance Knights did not need to be as well-rounded.","If Gao Feng could contract a suitable sacred source lifeform, it was not impossible for him to become a Radiance Knight in the future.","Gao Pei was now the center of envy in the Midnight Palace. There had already been three members of royalty who had praised his son.","These compliments about his potential were seen as more valuable than compliments about power.","The other veteran and top factions were slightly disappointed. They had been happy that the two royalty members were intending to accept disciples.","But after one fight on the Martial Stage, one of the spots seemed to have been taken up.","The Moon Empress watched as Gao Feng waved at Lin Yuan, and she could not help but smile warmly.","She had said what she said because the Yellow Spring Lily’s exclusive skills did have strategic significance but also because she knew that Gao Feng was Lin Yuan’s friend.","The Moon Empress had been one of the latest amongst the members of royalty to accept a disciple.","Moreover, her disciple was the youngest amongst all the members of royalty’s disciples.","Thus, Lin Yuan was at a disadvantage when he fought against the others.","Apparently, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie were a team.","If Gao Feng could become Cicada Song’s disciple, he would become another member of Lin Yuan’s team.","The more members of the team with impactful influence, the more power Lin Yuan would have.","Hence, the Moon Empress had said what she said with Lin Yuan’s future in mind.","But in the end, it was up to Cicada Song whether he was going to accept Gao Feng as his disciple or not.","Gao Feng was still overwhelmed with the joy from his victory. The other young disciples participating in the Martial Stage were eager to jump onto the stage to crush Gao Feng under their feet.","However, it was still too early to enter the stage, and they were afraid of being kicked off in the next fight after defeating Gao Feng.","None of them were idiots. Once someone demonstrated strong powers, no one weaker would dare to step up onto the stage.","After Zuo Ming instructed a person wearing the standard Spirit Guards uniform to replenish Gao Feng’s spiritual power, Zuo Ming announced, “The next challenger can now step up.”","Liu Jie stepped onto the stage with one step.","Gao Feng was extremely touched to see Liu Jie step onto the stage because he knew that Liu Jie was doing so to save Gao Feng a beating.","Gao Feng felt a great sense of relief.","Luckily, during his conversation with Liu Jie, he had heard that the latter needed to fight a few fights before his battle formation could be fully formed.","Otherwise, Gao Feng would have blamed himself if Liu Jie was kicked off the Martia Stage early on because of him."]},{"number":850,"title":"Chapter 850 - Liu Jies Formation","paragraphs":["Zuo Ming was surprised to see Liu Jie enter, but it did not hold him back from announcing the start of the second fight.","He felt that the Chief Guard must have helped Liu Jie to increase his power after accepting him as her disciple.","Hence, his power had to be on another level from when he was just a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Zuo Ming was really looking forward to seeing the Young Liege display his power.","After Liu Jie entered the Martial Stage, many of the participants let out gasps of shock.","His identity had been revealed during the confrontation with Miao Zhuo.","Now that he was entering the second fight, the other participants felt that all hope was lost.","Gao Feng did not immediately give up and surrender. Since Liu Jie said he needed a few fights to build his formation, Gao Feng would help him lay the groundwork.","Naturally, Gao Feng did not voice his intentions out loud. Instead, he blinked at Liu Jie and said, “Give me a few minutes to recover myself.”","He blinked at Liu Jie again before bending down to plant the Breeze Hibiscus and Spirit Spring Lilies in the ground.","Next, he said to the slightly wilted Yellow Spring Lily, “Yellow Spring Lily, use Parasite Revival.”","After Gao Feng issued his order, the Yellow Spring Lily wilted even more before it turned into a seed and fell beside one of the Spirit Spring Lilies.","The seed planted itself in the Spirit Spring Lily’s head and started to absorb the Spirit Spring Lily’s spiritual power.","A healthy sprout grew from the Yellow Spring Lily’s seed.","Shortly after, Gao Feng instructed the Breeze Hibiscus to manipulate the spirit qi released by the other Spirit Spring Lily and direct the spirit qi into the Spirit Spring Lily that had the Yellow Spring Lily’s seed planted in it.","When the Breeze Hibiscus’s spirit qi was about to reach the end, the newly grown Yellow Spring Lily separated from the Spirit Spring Lily’s leaf.","Unbeknownst to Gao Feng, he had just demonstrated his potential to Cicada Song again.","Gao Feng’s Spirit Spring Lilies were only Silver X/Legend, but if their power was raised, the Yellow Spring Lily might even produce flower buds when its seed was planted on one of the Spirit Spring Lilies.","If the Yellow Spring Lily produced flower buds, it indicated that it had recovered to peak condition and would be able to use Yellow Spring Change again.","The Yellow Spring Lily was a fey that could increase a team’s mistake tolerance and was a very important strategic factor.","Now that Gao Feng had proved that he could increase his team’s mistake tolerance as well as strategic advantage, Cicada Song’s look of hesitation vanished and was replaced with his usual smile.","With his heart at ease, he started to watch the Martial Stage for the pure enjoyment of it.","When Liu Jie had seen Gao Feng wink at him, he immediately understood what Gao Feng was trying to do.","Frankly, Liu Jie did not need to build his formation now because he was extremely confident in his powers.","Nonetheless, since Gao Feng wanted to do this for him, Liu Jie was not going to waste the chance that Gao Feng was offering him.","Liu Jie gave a thumb’s up, and 30 Shield Ladybugs landed on the Martial Stage.","As Lin Yuan watched the fight unfold, he managed to get a sense of the level of power that Liu Jie had attained.","Given that the Shield Ladybugs that Liu Jie had summoned had already reached Diamond X, Lin Yuan knew that Liu Jie could now roll grades.","As such, the Insect Queen must have reached Diamond X, which was a level that was only available to B-rank spirit qi professionals.","However, Lin Yuan could not check what level of Fantasy Breed the Insect Queen was now because a Dimensional Light Moth was flitting above Liu Jie’s head.","The Dimensional Light Moth was one of the carcinoma feys that Liu Jie controlled.","The Dimensional Light Moth was also Diamond X/Legend, just like the Dead Soul Demon Insect.","This was the maximum level of carcinoma fey that the Insect Queen could currently control.","The Dimensional Light Moth ate dimensional walls and left dimensional rifts after its meals.","If the Dimensional Light Moth did not eat too much of the dimensional wall, it would create a Class 1 dimensional rift.","But if it ate uninhibitedly, it would likely lead to the opening of a Class 3 dimensional rift.","However, not even the Dimensional Light Moth had enough room in its stomach to eat enough to create Class 4 and Class 5 dimensional rifts.","The Dimensional Light Moth was just as dangerous as the Dead Soul Demon Insect that Liu Jie had summoned.","Moreover, the Dimensional Light Moth’s abdomen was a mini dimensional zone.","Liu Jie’s Insect Queen was hiding in the Dimensional Light Moth at that very moment, and it would not be discovered as long as the Dimensional Light Moth was not killed.","Liu Jie’s actions stunned most of the disciples who were watching him.","It did seem astonishing for 30 Diamond X Shield Ladybugs to appear right in front of Liu Jie.","Most people could contract five or six feys, and it seemed ridiculous for 30 feys to be summoned at once.","The Shield Ladybug was a defense-type insect-species fey with little attacking power.","Nonetheless, it was not easy to kill all the 30 Shield Ladybugs.","However, Liu Jie did not seem to be done as an elegant and slender purplish-black bee appeared in Liu Jie’s palm.","“Blade Queen Bee, go produce Blade Worms,” murmured Liu Jie.","The Blade Queen Bee shot off toward the neatly lined up Shield Ladybugs and stung the eye of each of the Shield Ladybugs.","Less than a minute later, eggs were laid in all 30 Shield Ladybugs.","The Blade Queen Bee weakly returned to Liu Jie’s palm, and it looked like it was completely drained.","All the disciples who were planning on participating in the Martial Arts Stage had reached at least Class 3 Creation Master. Thus, they immediately recognized that both the Dimensional Light Moth and Blade Queen Bee were carcinoma feys."]},{"number":851,"title":"Chapter 851 - Iron Prisons Standard for Disciple Acceptance","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The sight of the Dimensional Light Moth and Blade Queen Bee made most people’s hairs stand on end.","Although the disciples of veteran and top factions were well-experienced, they had never seen a spirit qi professional command carcinoma feys in battle.","The Dimensional Light Moth and Blade Queen Bee Liu Jie had summoned on the Martial Stage along with the Dead Soul Demon Insect meant that Liu Jie had at least three carcinoma feys.","As such, Liu Jie’s existence seemed to be a disaster in itself.","However, the crowd could not understand how Liu Jie had obtained the 30 Shield Ladybugs.","Liu Jie was clearly controlling them, or else there was no way that they would be lining up in front of Liu Jie military-style like they were doing now.","The 30 Shield Ladybugs’ shells had started to vibrate at an increasing pace.","This vibrating movement made the goosebumps rise on the spectators’ skin, but nothing strange seemed to be happening to the Shield Ladybugs.","It was as though the vibrations were not directly happening to them.","Suddenly, the heads of the 30 Shield Ladybugs cracked open like watermelons, and purplish-black worms with coarse fur crawled out.","Almost immediately after, the 30 Shield Ladybugs all died.","The worms that had crawled out of the Shield Ladybugs’ bodies started to quickly consume the Shield Ladybugs’ corpses.","Less than two minutes later, the Shield Ladybugs, which were about as large as a table each, were completely eaten by the worms.","When the worms were done eating, 30 startling cries erupted in unison.","The bodies of the worms started to expand until each became six meters long, two meters tall, and three meters wide. They became Blade Worms that had black blades jutting from all over their bodies.","Lin Yuan frowned because the Blade Worms that the Blade Queen Bee birthed from the bodies of other feys would be several grades weaker than the host feys’ had been.","However, these Blade Worms that had grown from the Shield Ladybugs not only did not decrease in grade, but they became even more intimidating.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Blade Queen Bee resting on Liu Jie’s palm.","[Fey Name]: Blade Queen Bee","[Fey Species]: Stinging-bee species/ancestral-bee species","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Insect-species/spiritual-type","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Flash Wings]: Flap the wings at the target while flashing away to dodge.","[Cursed Bee Venom]: Every additional injection of poison into the enemy will increase the effectiveness of the curse. The cursed target will start to age, and the weakened skin will lower the target’s defense.","[Merciful Cry]: The Blade Worms that heard the Blade Queen Bee’s special sound will become bloodthirsty, and the protein in their bodies will rapidly turn into black blades to increase the Blade Worms’ attacking power.","[Dissolution Infection]: The lethally injured Blade Worms will enter a state of dissolution and start releasing psychotoxins. The Blade Worms will double their power for five seconds and die immediately afterward.","[Faster Hatching]: Energy will be injected into eggs before they are planted in a target’s body to quicken the hatching of the insects.","[Queen’s True Self]: The queen will be subsumed into a Blade Worm, and the dormant fighting model inside the queen will be engaged into fighting mode.","Exclusive Skill:","[Vicious Poison Queen Bee]: Allow a batch of hatchlings to kill each other, and the final surviving hatchling that grows into the Blade Worm will not have a decreased grade.","Lin Yuan could not help but let out a sigh of amazement.","Once a carcinoma fey was nurtured by a spirit qi professional and left its previous messy state behind to gain intelligence and exclusive skills, it would become so terrifying that its wild versions would not be able to hold a candle to it.","Liu Jie’s Insect Queen was the leader of the insect colony, while the Blade Queen Bee was the general.","Most of the Blade Queen Bee’s abilities could increase the Blade Worms’ combat power. Now, Lin Yuan also knew why the 30 Blade Worms’ grades had not fallen.","If Morbius was not still sleeping, Lin Yuan would have complained about the name of the Blade Queen Bee’s exclusive skill to it.","Vicious Poison Queen Bee sounded a little odd.","The Blade Queen Bee could also use its psychotoxin to its full potential, and it enabled it to have a curse factor.","Lin Yuan was most interested in the Queen’s True Self because it would give the Blade Queen Bee immense solo fighting power.","He felt that it was similar to Chimey’s Radiant Body.","When he witnessed Liu Jie instantly building his battle formation and the 30 savage Blade Worms, Gao Feng could not help but gulp and retract his feys.","Gao Feng turned to Zuo Ming and said, “Lord Zuo Ming, I admit defeat.”","Zuo Ming did not find this strange at all and allowed Gao Feng to exit the stage after getting a nod from Liu Jie.","Gao Feng stepped off the stage, but no one dared to step up after seeing Liu Jie’s formation.","Everyone present knew that Liu Jie was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple, and the time was not right for them to unleash their full powers.","Besides the 30 Blade Worms, Liu Jie had yet to summon the Orchid Petal Knife Mantis that the Dead Soul Demon Insect controlled.","The Dead Soul Demon Insect was a carcinoma fey that could injure souls.","Moreover, since Liu Jie was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple, it was impossible for him not to have contracted a sacred source lifeform.","Thus, an interesting scene emerged.","After three minutes, no one dared to step onto the Martial Stage to face Liu Jie.","Zuo Ming raised his head to look into the palace. It was clear that he was waiting for Night Leaning Moon to issue instructions.","At that moment, the formal voice from the other end of the phone said, “Leaning Moon, your disciple has a really interesting combat style. It’s raising my spirits. However, it won’t do if no one steps up to challenge him.”","Night Leaning Moon nodded slightly.","The Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage were being held to witness the power of the disciples of top factions and veteran factions.","If no one entered the stage, they could not see any display of abilities.","Just as Night Leaning Moon was about to issue an instruction to Zuo Ming, Iron Prison spoke first.","Iron Prison circulated his spiritual power while speaking, causing his voice to travel through the radyx crystal wall to reach the ears of the people outside the palace.","“I’m not a Creation Master, and it would be a mistake for me to accept a Creation Master as my disciple. As such, I’ve decided to pick my disciple from the Martial Stage.. Whoever beats Chief Guard Ye’s disciple shall become my disciple.”"]},{"number":852,"title":"Chapter 852 - The Moon Empress and Iron Prisons Bet","paragraphs":["When Iron Prison projected his voice to the area outside the Midnight Palace using his spiritual power, Cicada Song’s smile vanished.","He turned to look at Iron Prison with an expression of speechlessness.","Cicada Song had always wondered what was going on inside Iron Prison’s head.","Half a year ago, he had incited the Moon Empress to step in in the area outside the Royal Capital because of a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master.","Now, he announced that the person who could beat Night Leaning Moon’s disciple would become his disciple.","Cicada Song did not even know where to begin to criticize Iron Prison’s impulsive actions.","Given Cicada Song’s understanding of Iron Prison, he knew that Iron Prison had no intention of going against Night Leaning Moon.","However, others would see his simple-minded behavior as provoking Night Leaning Moon.","How could the disciple that had been trained by Night Leaning Moon be so easily defeated?","Cicada Song had nagged Iron Prison numerous times in vain to not be so impulsive and to think about the consequences before he acted.","Unfortunately, Iron Prison would only nod while allowing Cicada’s song to go in from one ear and exit from the other.","Night Leaning Moon was slightly kinder than the Moon Empress, but she was far from good-tempered.","While Cicada Song was thinking, Night Leaning Moon coldly snapped, “Hehe, Iron Prison. I had no idea that you have such high expectations for accepting disciples. Sorry to disappoint you, but I don’t think you’ll be able to find a disciple from the Guard Ye Banquet after all.”","Night Leaning Moon raised an eyebrow and did not look at Iron Prison despite clearly addressing him.","She was clearly derisive of Iron Prison.","Night Leaning Moon did not think that someone like him who could not think before he spoke should not even be allowed into the Midnight Palace.","However, he was a member of royalty, and she could not kick him out.","Iron Prison was slightly stunned, and a wary look appeared on his grumpy countenance. He did not understand why Night Leaning Moon was suddenly targeting him.","Usually, it was the Moon Empress who targeted him instead of Night Leaning Moon.","When he heard Night Leaning Moon say that he would not be able to find a disciple from the Guard Ye Banquet, Iron Prison replied without much thought, “Since I’m intent on finding a disciple, there’s no way I’ll fail.”","Cicada Song kept his gaze locked on Iron Prison the entire time while he spoke.","He knew that Iron Prison was not intentionally affronting Night Leaning Moon and was only providing a natural response to Night Leaning Moon.","However, his words sounded like a provocation.","Night Leaning Moon also knew about Iron Prison’s flaws and usually spoke up for him in front of the Moon Empress.","She normally would have ignored him, but she had only recently accepted her disciple. Yet, Iron Prison was calling him incapable, as though he would be defeated easily.","It was despicable for Iron Prison to obtain a disciple from her disciple’s defeat.","Night Leaning Moon frowned to think before easing her brows and saying, “If so, I would like to make a bet with you. If someone beats my disciple on the Martial Stage, I’ll gift you a material worthy of creating a valuable weapon. It’ll also be my congratulatory gift to you for accepting a disciple. However, if no one is able to defeat my disciple and you fail to find a disciple, you’ll have to give me the Disaster Insect Nest’s body.”","Although Iron Prison did not have a shred of emotional intelligence, he now knew why Night Leaning Moon was targeting him.","Alas, he also cared about his pride.","If they were in an imperial court meeting, he might have given in because he would not have felt any shame in front of his friends.","After all, he always gave in after clashing with the Moon Empress.","Unfortunately, they were now in the presence of so many leaders of veteran and top factions. Thus, Iron Prison did not have it in him to give in this time.","However, he was reluctant to part with the Disaster Insect Nest’s body.","It would be fine if he won, but if he lost, he would be losing a 6 Stars sacred source lifeform material that could be made into a precious weapon.","Iron Prison contemplated before saying, “A bet has to be fair. Since you want to take the Disaster Insect Nest’s body from me, you’ll also have to offer a material from a 6 Stars sacred source lifeform.”","Night Leaning Moon scoffed and nodded.","With that, the bet was official.","Cicada Song looked at Iron Prison and wondered if he was truly an idiot.","The Martial Stage was not as prestigious as the Martial Arts Stage, and Night Leaning Moon was definitely well aware of her disciple’s powers.","It would have been fine if Iron Prison had been the one to initiate the bet, but Night Leaning Moon had been the one to suggest it instead.","Iron Prison must be recklessly fearless to accept such a bet.","Iron Prison was wondering which fellow would be powerful enough to help him win his bet when the Moon Empress said to him, “Iron Prison, since you’re in a gambling mood, let me join in too. I heard that you recently gained a sacred source lifeform. How about using that as the stake for our bet?”","The Moon Empress’ words made Iron Prison’s face fall. The value of an uncontracted sacred source lifeform could not compare to that of a dead 6 Stars sacred source lifeform.","A dead sacred source lifeform was still dead and could only provide value when it was made into a precious weapon.","However, an uncontracted sacred source lifeform was like an empty canvas, and Iron Prison dared not use it as a stake.","Additionally, he had only agreed to Night Leaning Moon’s bet because of his pride.","As such, he could reject the Moon Empress’ bet without any qualms.","Just as Iron Prison was about to reject her, the Moon Empress said, “I also know that you have two feys that are stuck at a certain level. If I lose, I can help them break through. I’ll use my own resources to do so.”","The Moon Empress’ words unnerved Iron Prison.","Although both Iron Prison and the Moon Empress were members of royalty, he would never say something so bold.","The only people in the Radiance Federation that were bold enough to say such words were the Moon Empress, Bamboo Monarch, and Chef Supreme.","Bamboo Monarch was trapped by a woman’s bad luck now and could no longer say such words with confidence.","At Iron Prison’s level, his feys should have already formed a perfect combat system. Hence, if his two weakest feys could break through and transform, his entire system would become united.","No matter how slim the chances were, Iron Prison could not reject this opportunity."]},{"number":853,"title":"Chapter 853 - Attrition Battle","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Iron Prison knew that even if he approached Moon Empress for help and provided his own resources, she would normally never agree to help him evolve his feys.","As simple-minded as he was, Iron Prison knew that the Moon Empress was annoyed by him.","“It’s a deal!”","All the veteran and top faction leaders behind the members of royalty shivered.","Was this the world of the bigshots? What a boring and unpretentious world!","The stakes for casual bets turned out to be things like precious weapons and sacred source lifeforms!","Veteran factions would never be able to get their hands on sacred source lifeforms, and only the strongest experts in the top factions had sacred source lifeforms.","...","While Iron Prison, the Moon Empress, and Night Leaning Moon were making their bets, the uncertain disciples participating in the Martial Stage were immediately motivated by Iron Prison’s words.","Liu Jie frowned slightly under his mask on the stage because he knew that a mad clamor to challenge him would soon ensue thanks to what Iron Prison had stated.","However, he was not nervous about this. Rather, the chaos was exactly what he wanted.","It was only through facing strong opponents that Liu Jie would be able to discover the true extent of his power.","Shortly after, someone stepped onto the Martial Stage.","Zuo Ming immediately announced the start of the third match.","The third person to enter the Martial Stage looked at the 30 ferocious Blade Worms in front of Liu Jie and felt that he had jumped the gun.","However, Iron Prison’s words had been an effective motivator for impulsion.","The young man summoned his feys.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the three tiger-species feys that the young man had summoned.","Tiger-species feys had similar potential to dragon-species feys, but compared to dragon-species feys that had a variety of types, tiger-species feys were much rarer.","Two of the three tiger-species feys summoned by the young man had reached Fantasy Breed, and the strongest one had reached Diamond I/Fantasy I.","It was clear that he was much stronger than Wang An. In fact, he would even be able to beat three Wang Ans.","Technically, the three tiger-species feys were as strong as Liu Jie’s 30 Diamond X Blade Worms.","The Blade Queen Bee’s Vicious Poison Queen Bee could prevent the Blade Worms’ grades from falling, but every transformed Diamond X Blade Worm would become Flawless quality.","This meant that every Diamond X Blade Worm had the power of a Platinum III/Fantasy I fey.","The moment the three tiger-species feys were summoned, the 30 Platinum III/Fantasy I Blade Worms immediately clashed against them.","The Diamond I/Fantasy I tiger-species fey was undoubtedly much stronger than Zhou Luo’s Lava Dragon Lizard.","However, the Lava Dragon Lizard was a defense-type fey that relied on its armor to defend against the Blade Worms’ attacks.","Zhou Luo had been able to use the Lava Dragon Lizard to defeat so many Blade Worms because its ability Unbreakable Iron Bones allowed it to increase its defense after sustaining each attack and because Lin Yuan had given Zhou Luo many fire-type and earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","These allowed Zhou Luo to use the pure elemental energy through the Lava Dragon Lizard’s Shield Regeneration to increase its endurance during battle.","The tiger-species feys were power offense-type feys that had a relatively weak defense.","Every time that the tigers’ claws slashed toward the Blade Worms, the claws would shatter upon contact on the black blades protruding from the Blade Worms’ bodies.","Such damage was insignificant to the Diamond I/Fantasy I tiger-species feys.","But because of the Blade Queen Bee’s Cursed Bee Venom, the tiger-species feys were cursed by the psychotoxins every time damage was dealt to the blades.","As he watched the battle unfold, Liu Jie waved his hand, and five more Shield Ladybugs emerged from the Dimensional Light Moth’s body.","The Shield Ladybugs joined the battle to protect the Blade Worms against the tiger-species feys’ attacks.","The violent tiger-species feys were slowly losing their edge to the insect colony.","When Liu Jie instructed the Blade Queen Bee to use Dissolution Infection on a heavily injured Blade Worm that could no longer fight, a large amount of psychotoxins sprayed all over the tiger-species feys.","Under the burden of the psychotoxins and layers of curses, the tiger-species feys’ bodies had started to weaken.","Soon, the tiger-species feys crashed to the ground under the Blade Worms’ attacks.","When the young man saw that his feys could no longer fight and had nothing else that would threaten Liu Jie, he chose to surrender.","After the young man stepped off the Martial Stage, one of the Blade Worms was dead while seven were lying on the ground in a severely injured state, and the remaining 22 had also sustained damage.","The five Shield Ladybugs that had entered the battle at a later time had been torn to shreds by the sharp claws.","Liu Jie was not frazzled after the battle and continued to stand calmly behind the Blade Worm.","This scene excited the rest of the disciples of veteran and top factions who were participating in the Martial Stage.","A few young men who Du Shuo led exchanged looks with each other. They had all witnessed the battle that had just concluded.","Although the weaker disciples of veteran and top factions did not have the power to defeat Liu Jie, they could cause damage to Liu Jie’s colony of Blade Worms.","Judging from the state of Liu Jie’s feys, the Blade Worms’ injuries could not be healed by the Blade Queen Bee, and the latter would need a long time before it could produce eggs again.","There would not be any more chances for the Blade Queen Bee to produce a second batch of eggs. Hence, an attrition battle was the best choice for defeating the Blade Worms.","The young men that Du Shuo was leading dispersed and walked toward different participants.","These young men came from a high-ranked top faction, and they were quickly able to persuade the other participants of the Martial Stage to ally with them.","The weaker participants stood no chance of beating Liu Jie, so they were the best choice of people to wear down the Blade Worms."]},{"number":854,"title":"Chapter 854 - Hypha Tapeworm","paragraphs":["The stronger participants would be able to step up to challenge anytime to claim victory over Liu Jie.","It had been easy to convince them because all of the strong young disciples wanted to be the disciple of a member of royalty.","Most of the weaker disciples were from veteran factions and could be convinced as long as they were promised enough benefits for it to be a win-win situation.","Zuo Ming looked displeased when he noticed this but did not comment on it.","Although they were clearly ganging up on Liu Jie like how a group of gamers would team up to beat a Boss in a game, such actions were not against the Martial Stage’s rules.","As Chief Guard Ye’s left-hand manager, Zuo Ming had the tolerance that was befitting of his position.","He could not go after the other disciples just because they were ganging up on Liu Jie.","Soon, the disciples of veteran factions that had been on the fence started to muster their courage as, one by one, they stepped onto the Martial Stage.","Liu Jie ordered the Blade Queen Bee to use Merciful Cry and Dissolution Infection on the Blade Worms on the ground that had not died but had lost all their fighting power.","Usually, Liu Jie would have to use about three to four Blade Worms against each opponent.","Now that he was faced with an endless stream of opponents, the number of Blade Worms dropped precipitously, and the eyes of the watching participants lit up.","However, this did not hinder Liu Jie in the least.","By the time he beat the eighth fighter, all 30 Blade Worms had died.","The corpses of the Blade Worms littered the Martial Stage and made it look like the scene of a brutal massacre.","When the ninth challenger stepped onto the Martial Stage, Liu Jie gave a thumbs up, and a black ball appeared by his feet.","The ball looked like it was formed from a long insect that was currently in peristalsis.","This shocked the participants who had just entered the Martial Stage and caused the hearts of the watching hopeful disciples of veteran factions to sink.","When Zuo Ming announced the start of the battle, Liu Jie lowered his head to say to the writhing black ball, “Use Fluid Hypha, Long Body Split, Degeneration Control, and Decaying Bacteria.”","Liu Jie issued four commands in a row, and the black ball immediately spat out a large amount of purple fluids.","The sticky purple fluid was like a living creature that also seemed to be able to stretch endlessly. In a second, the purple fluid covered the entire Martial Stage.","Soon, numerous small black threads grew out of the thin, sticky layer.","The black threads were like furry veins that transported the purple sticky fluid around.","While the purple sticky fluid was stretching and expanding, it covered the dead Blade Worms and Shield Ladybugs.","The 30 dead Blade Worms and Shield Ladybugs immediately started to change after the sticky fluid covered them and the black threads tunneled into the bodies of the dead Blade Worms and Shield Ladybugs.","A moment later, an armor made of the sticky purple fluid and black threads grew on the bodies of the Blade Worms and Shield Ladybugs.","The armor made the bodies significantly larger.","Next, black bubbles grew on the armor, and when popped, they formed fluid that looked like small flowers and emitted the stench of decay.","At that moment, the writhing black ball by Liu Jie’s feet disappeared while the 30 Blade Worms and 5 Shield Ladybugs shakily got to their feet and resumed their military-like line up in front of Liu Jie.","These terrifying- and gruesome-looking Blade Worms and Shield Ladybugs were now much stronger than when they were alive.","As such, Liu Jie’s opponent did not even have the time to retaliate against the insect colony and was kicked off the Martial Stage in a few minutes.","The challenger that had just been kicked off the Martial Stage’s feys was in a sorry state. The large terrifying dragon-species fey barely had an uninjured patch of flesh on its body, and the wounds made by the blades were decaying.","The two healing-type spirit qi professionals wearing the standard Spirit Guards mask took a while before they managed to heal the decaying terrifying dragon-species fey.","At that moment, Du Shuo, who was at the center of Liu Jie’s opponents, said, “That’s the Hypha Tapeworm!”","Du Shuo’s words dashed all the challengers’ hopes.","The veteran and top faction disciples all knew what kind of fey the Hypha Tapeworm was.","With the Hypha Tapeworm in action now, the battle attrition plan had been reduced to a joke.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Hypha Tapeworm.","[Fey Name]: Hypha Tapeworm","[Fey Species]: Hooked-mouth species/roundworm-species","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Insect/Dark","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Fluid Hypha]: A sticky fluid will be produced that can cover an area. The bacteria pockets in the sticky fluid will break apart quickly to form webs of hypha.","[Long Body Split]: The Hypha Tapeworm will tunnel into the Fluid Hypha and start to split itself. Each split section can be planted in any small insect.","[Degeneration Control]: Flesh that is dead due to bacterial infection will be covered in bacteria pockets that contain vicious poison. When the bacteria covers a degenerating surface, the tapeworms that have been created from the split sections can enter the dead host to control it.","[Decaying Bacteria]: The bodies of the hosts being manipulated will be covered in strong corrosive bacteria that will spread to the cells of healthy flesh that it comes into contact with and cause the cells of the healthy flesh to start to decay.","[Degenerating Body Integration]: When a degenerating body is damaged, the ladybugs that are produced will sacrifice their body as nutrients to feed and integrate the bacteria. The tapeworms produced from the split sections will control the degenerated body.","[Double Parasite]: When in the presence of other parasitic-type lifeforms and insects, the degenerating body, bacteria, and tapeworms formed from split sections can be sacrificed to increase the parasitic-type lifeform’s power. If the parasitic-type lifeform is injured, it can draw energy from the sacrificed entities to heal itself.","Exclusive Skill:","[Degenerating Body’s Reproduction]: The bacteria will alter the reproductive and gender cells in the degenerating body to allow the degenerating body to produce new creatures through splitting its sections.","Lin Yuan’s eyes widened, and he felt that Liu Jie had yet to demonstrate the Hypha Tapeworm’s true power.","Liu Jie looked down from the Martial Stage and spoke in a booming voice."]},{"number":855,"title":"Chapter 855 - Retreating From Battle","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“The next battle will involve my soul, and I won’t be able to control my powers. Once you’re hit, you’ll still end up suffering even after being treated.”","A faint silhouette appeared on Liu Jie’s shoulder.","The flower-like silhouettes formed an elegant small orchid-shaped praying mantis.","When the elegant small praying mantis appeared, the faces of the other participants of the Martial Stage fell.","Liu Jie had already summoned three carcinoma feys during his fights—the Dimensional Light Moth, Blade Queen Bee, and Hypha Tapeworm.","However, from the earlier confrontation, the crowd already knew that the Hypha Tapeworm was actually the fourth carcinoma fey that Liu Jie had revealed.","During the confrontation, Liu Jie had revealed the Dead Soul Demon Insect, but he had yet to summon it during battle until now.","The Dead Soul Demon Insect’s attacks mainly targeted souls. Hence, it was extremely difficult to defend against its attacks.","Not everyone could handle the pain of a soul injury. As such, the challengers who were about to launch an attrition battle now wanted to back out.","The Hypha Tapeworm’s appearance proved that it would be useless to try the tactic of an attrition battle to take down Liu Jie.","The challengers assessed their own powers and determined that it would be a struggle for them to defeat the revived insect colony.","Moreover, they did not know if Liu Jie still had other carcinoma feys that he had yet to summon.","The gazes of the remaining challengers of the Martial Stage were grim, while the disciples who planned on participating in the Martial Arts Stage also had amazement in their eyes.","The participants of the Martial Stage were mostly not Creation Masters. Those that were were only Class 2 at best.","It would be difficult for them to use that level of power to check on the Diamond X/Legend Hypha Tapeworm.","Meanwhile, the Creation Masters who were participating in the Martial Arts Stage were all Class 3 and above. Thus, they were able to check on the Hypha Tapeworm’s abilities and exclusive skills.","They realized that the Hypha Tapeworm’s abilities could be used in conjunction with the Dead Soul Demon Insect to create a mutually supporting relationship.","The Dead Soul Demon Insect was currently controlling the Orchid Petal Knife Mantis, but the Dead Soul Demon Insect had yet to bind itself to the Orchid Petal Knife Mantis’ body.","In other words, the Orchid Petal Knife Mantis’ body was just a set of clothes for the Dead Soul Demon Insect that could be switched out at any time.","The Hypha Tapeworm’s Double Parasite allowed the Dead Soul Demon Insect to implant itself in any Blade Worm or Shield Ladybug that had been infected by bacteria.","Additionally, the Dead Soul Demon Insect’s Parasitic Dead Soul Seed allowed the Dead Soul Demon Insect to shuttle through every insect in the insect colony.","During any clash during a battle, the Dead Soul Demon Insect would be able to materialize on a target at any time to suck out its soul.","Moreover, there was no way to defend against the Dead Soul Demon Insect’s Exploding Dead Soul Bullets.","Even if the damage from the explosion could be defended against, it was likely that a soul seed could be implanted in the opponent fey or even the spirit qi professionals’ brains.","Since the Dead Soul Demon Insect was a carcinoma fey, its potential to create terror could not be scoffed at.","Once a soul seed was implanted in the brain, the lifeform’s life would be in the Dead Soul Demon Insect’s hands.","Miao Zhuo may possess an item to protect his soul, but the Dead Soul Demon Insect’s bite meant to suck out his soul had not been deterred at all.","Clearly, the Dead Soul Demon Insect had a powerful grip on souls.","None of the challengers wanted to end up with an injured soul like Miao Zhuo.","Besides the spirit qi professionals who admitted that they could not beat Liu Jie’s insect colony, even those who had the power to fight against Liu Jie did not have anything to protect their souls. Thus, all their motivation was quashed, and they shriveled into despondence.","Gao Feng walked to Lin Yuan’s side after leaving the Martial Stage. When he saw Liu Jie’s increasingly strong insect colony, he patted Lin Yuan’s shoulder and said, “Lin Yuan, the Young Liege is way too powerful! I can’t imagine anyone being able to defeat him.”","As he heard Gao Feng’s tone of marvel, Lin Yuan smiled. He was glad for Liu Jie’s increasing power.","Lin Yuan knew that Liu Jie had eight carcinoma feys under his control, and he had already summoned half of them.","Liu Jie had sealed off the Insect Queen’s abilities from the beginning of the battles and hid it in the Dimensional Light Moth’s body.","He had only instructed the Insect Queen to produce the 30 Shield Ladybugs to act as the Blade Queen Bee’s hosts for the Blade Worms.","Later, he had instructed the Insect Queen to produce 5 Shield Ladybugs to increase the Blade Worms’ defense.","If Liu Jie released the Insect Queen and used it in conjunction with the Hypa Tapeworm and Dead Soul Demon Insect, his power would be multiplied to an unimaginable level even if the Blade Queen Bee could no longer produce eggs.","The Insect Queen had reached Diamond X/Fantasy, and every insect-type fey that it produced would be Diamond X/Flawless.","Just the thought of a sea of Diamond X/Flawless insects was horrifying.","However, Lin Yuan could not agree with what Gao Feng had said.","As strong as Liu Jie was, he was not at an invincible level.","If Lin Yuan stepped onto the Martial Stage, one blast of the Spirit Essence Explosion would destroy Liu Jie’s insect colony.","Lin Yuan’s use of Spirit Essence Explosion only used a small amount of spirit qi and did not use up much spiritual power.","The Dead Soul Demon Insect’s attacks on the soul would also be useless on Lin Yuan because he had contracted a sacred source lifeform.","The sacred source lifeforms that had formed marrow contracts with spirit qi professionals usually went on to live in the spirit qi professional’s soul and acted as the best wall of defense for the soul.","Moreover, Lin Yuan also had the Myth III Vicious Poison Law that could perfectly counter the Hypha Tapeworm’s Decaying Bacteria.","Liu Jie had not displayed his full power yet, and Lin Yuan did not know how strong Liu Jie’s sacred source lifeform was.","To determine who would win between Liu Jie and Lin Yuan, it would depend on whether Liu Jie was able to handle Lin Yuan’s secret weapon, the Dark Death World’s Night Crow Wither Attack.","While Gao Feng marveled at Liu Jie’s power, he watched the reactions of the other challengers.","Suddenly, a strange idea struck him."]},{"number":856,"title":"Chapter 856 - 50 Surrenders","paragraphs":["If Liu Jie continued to win and emerged as the final victor of the Martial Stage, Gao Feng would be able to win second place with his one win.","Gao Feng could not help but start giggling with glee.","It was impossible to surrender the chance to challenge the Martial Stage without fighting. Otherwise, Gao Feng would not have been so nervous in the beginning.","The 10th challenger took one step onto the Martial Stage and surrendered without even summoning any feys.","After admitting defeat, the 10th challenger looked anxiously at Liu Jie as though he was afraid that Liu Jie would not agree to the surrender.","Liu Jie was not a cruel person, so he did not object to the surrender.","Once the first challenger admitted defeat, a string of challengers clambered to step onto the stage to surrender as well.","A total of 75 disciples of veteran and top factions were participating in the Martial Stage. After the wave of surrenders, less than 10 challengers were left.","Among those who were left was Du Shuo, who had insulted Liu Jie but ended up being saved by Liu Jie.","Du Shuo was like the head of the remaining challengers.","Du Shuo took a deep breath as he looked at Liu Jie on stage and walked onto the Martial Stage.","When Zuo Ming saw Du Shuo step onto the stage, he scoffed and announced, “The 61st battle of the Martial Stage shall begin.”","Liu Jie had not had to move a muscle for the past 50 matches. All he had done was nod in agreement to the challengers’ surrenders.","This made Liu Jie feel like he was just standing on the stage like a silly block.","Liu Jie was slightly taken aback when he saw his current opponent because he not only knew this opponent but also had a prior confrontation with him.","As good-natured as Liu Jie was and even though he had told Zuo Ming not to do anything to Du Shuo, Liu Jie had still been left with a bad impression of Du Shuo.","Just as he was about to instruct his insect colony to strike, Du Shuo shouted across the Martial Stage, “Young Liege, please stay your hand. I would like to take this opportunity to apologize to you. I should not have run my mouth and insulted you. You were kind enough to forgive me and did not punish me for my transgression, but I still feel that it’s necessary for me to apologize to you.”","Du Shuo maintained his bow the entire time he was speaking and only lifted his head once he was done, with a look of sincerity in his eyes.","He was truly grateful that Liu Jie had decided against punishing him. Otherwise, he would have already been chased out of the Midnight Palace.","Moreover, Du Shuo also knew that the confrontation outside the Midnight Palace had taken place in front of many veteran and top factions. There was no way he could hide the incident, and his elders would eventually find out that he had spoken out of turn against Chief Guard Ye’s disciple.","Rather than waiting to receive punishment from his elders when they found out about his mistake, it was better for him to admit it now and take responsibility for the entire incident so as to not implicate Fang He.","If he was lucky enough to receive Liu Jie’s forgiveness, his punishment would be lighter when he returned to Furnace Stone Metal.","Liu Jie’s masked face was composed after he heard what Du Shuo said.","“No problem. I didn’t take the matter to heart, and there’s nothing to forgive. I hope we’ll have more opportunities to interact in the future.”","Du Shuo clenched his fists and looked at Liu Jie with gratitude.","From Liu Jie’s words, it was clear that Liu Jie did not hold any grudges about the confrontation, so it was as though the confrontation had never happened.","Essentially, there would be no need for Du Shuo to receive punishment from his elders when he returned home.","Liu Jie’s last words had been an olive branch, meant to express his hope of turning from enemies to friends.","However, Du Shuo knew that despite being a main member of one of the ten top factions, his status was far below Liu Jie’s.","Du Shuo admired Liu Jie’s magnanimity, and he thought back to how he had come up with the attrition battle tactic to gang up on Liu Jie.","“Young Liege, I was planning on using the attrition battle tactic to attack your Blade Worm colony and reduce their numbers, but I didn’t expect that your insect colony only grew stronger,” said Du Shuo awkwardly.","Liu Jie gave a nonchalant smile. Without the attrition battle, he would not have been able to build his battle formation as easily as he had.","Zuo Ming had been annoyed when he noticed Du Shuo and his peers persuading the other challengers to use the attrition battle tactic against Liu Jie.","However, Zuo Ming did not expect Du Shuo to be so honest as to tell Liu Jie about the attrition battle tactic.","This slightly changed the way that Zuo Ming viewed Du Shuo.","At that moment, Zuo Ming saw Gu Lang walking out of the long corridor leading to the Art Stage’s location.","Zuo Ming was utterly astonished.","He knew better than anyone how difficult the Art Stage was because he had checked through every topic being tested.","The topics were meant to be tedious so as to test the Creation Masters’ overall skills, and none of the questions should be completed with ease.","In order to ensure that the Arts Stage and Martial Stage ended at the same time, the Arts Stage’s topics also necessitated a large final production quantity.","The Martial Stage was about to end, but that was because Liu Jie had been the second person to enter the Martial Stage and had been dominating it since then.","Moreover, 50 of the challengers had surrendered immediately, and it had only been half an hour since the Martial Stage began.","This meant that Gu Lang had only taken half an hour to complete his topic for the Arts Stage.","This speed was unimaginable!","No wonder Gu Lang was Lord Bamboo Monarch’s disciple!","The Bamboo Monarch did not look surprised at all to see Gu Lang finish the Arts Stage first.","Nonetheless, the Bamboo Monarch still felt it was a shame that Gu Lang was not participating in the Martial Arts Stage.","The Bamboo Monarch was the one who had set the rules for the Martial Arts Stage, and he had made it so that it would be suitable for his disciple’s fighting style of fighting with waves of attacks.","Gu Lang made a beeline for Zong Ze.","When he saw the way that Zong Ze was staring intensely at the Martial Stage, Gu Lang could not help but knock on Zong Ze’s half-armor.","Gu Lang sighed when he realized that his knocking had not woken Zong Ze up from his trance at all.","Although Zong Ze was strong, his battle fanaticism would likely be a disadvantage to him in the future.","Gu Lang knew that he would not be able to change Zong Ze’s personality, but he truly hoped that someone who could would appear.","Otherwise, the impulsive Zong Ze would never be able to work in a team and would never be able to become a Radiance Envoy."]},{"number":857,"title":"Chapter 857 - The Last Battle","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Everyone had noticed that Gu Lang had returned after completing the Arts Stage.","The disciples of veteran and top factions who were participating in the Martial Arts Stage let out sighs of relief when they saw Gu Lang.","Gu Lang’s participation in the Arts Stage was bad news for the other participants of that stage but a blessing to the participants of the Martial Arts Stage.","Lin Yuan looked at Gu Lang and thought,? Long Tao should also be out soon.","When they had been chatting, Long Tao had told Lin Yuan what his secret weapon as a Creation Master was. It was the Dragon Gall Three-Leafed Insect that he had contracted when he was young.","After consuming the gallbladder of a dragon-species fey, the Dragon Gall Three-Leafed would secrete oil that could increase the speed of spirit fluid concoction but could not increase the homogeneity of the spiritual ingredients.","The Dragon Gall Three-Leafed Insect was a great asset in such competitions.","Long Tao was already a pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master, but he could not compete with Gu Lang even with the Dragon Gall Three-Leafed Insect.","It was clear how strong Gu Lang was, evidence of the level that Class 4 Creation Masters were at.","Lin Yuan felt a stone of pressure land on his shoulders when he remembered that he was going to compete against Zong Ze’s Creation Master powers later.","He knew that given his Creation Master powers, he would not be able to compete with a Creation Master even with Genius helping him in various ways.","As such, he would just have to try his luck to see if he would be able to pick a topic that was suitable for him.","Du Shuo had already summoned his feys on the Martial Stage, which were the Diamond VII/Fantasy II Radium Sea Lion and Diamond III/Fantasy I Dragon Horned Blowfish.","Du Shuo had definitely contracted more than two feys, but any fey below Diamond grade would immediately be infected by the sticky fluid that the Hypha Tapeworm released.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Radium Sea Lion and Dragon Horned Blowfish and immediately knew why Du Shuo had the courage to take on Liu Jie in a fight.","Du Shuo had also used the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ pollen to roll grades as it was impossible for someone his age to become an A-rank spirit qi professional.","The Radium Sea Lion lived up to its name and spent its day eating radium, which even Myth Breed feys could not make a scratch on.","It took a long time to absorb the radium to increase its defense.","Although the Radium Sea Lion was a power offense-type fey, it had a light layer of radium on its skin that provided it with greater defense than the other feys of the same grade had.","Lin Yuan was more familiar with the Dragon Horned Blowfish.","If the Dragon Horned Blowfish could evolve to Myth Breed and unlock its ancient-whale bloodline, there was a high chance that it could evolve into the Jade-Gray Whale.","Three laws on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt came from Jade-Gray Whales.","The Diamond VII/Fantasy II Radium Sea Lion was undoubtedly stronger than the Diamond III/Fantasy II Dragon Horned Blowfish.","However, Du Shuo would be relying on the Dragon Horned Blowfish’s exclusive skill.","[Protection of Water]: By sacrificing its horn, the power of the bloodline within can call to water elements to create a protective layer that will protect a target from spiritual and soul attacks.","While the Protection of Water was in effect, Du Shuo would not have to worry about the Dead Soul Demon Insect’s threat and could use brute strength to fight against the insect colony.","When Lin Yuan was using True Data to check, Du Shuo loudly ordered, “Dragon Horned Blowfish, use Protection of Water!”","The slightly gray Dragon Horned Blowfish turned into the color of the ocean, and its large horn turned from dark brown to brilliant gold.","Two gold and blue shields appeared around the horn, and one of the shields flew over to cover the Radium Sea Lion that was charging toward the insect colony while the other shield sheltered the Dragon Horned Blowfish and Du Shuo.","The Dragon Horned Blowfish focused on activating the Protection of Water, and Du Shuo started instructing the Radium Sea Lion during the battle.","At that moment, the Orchid Petal Knife Mantis that was initially on Liu Jie’s shoulder landed on his palm.","The Dead Soul Demon Insect turned into a shadow of a soul and vanished without a trace from the Orchid Petal Knife Mantis’ body and went into either one of the Blade Worms or Shield Ladybugs.","Liu Jie gave a thumbs-up and said to the Dimensional Light Moth, “Dimensional Light Moth, spit out all the Shield Ladybugs in your stomach.”","The Dimensional Light Moth flew in front of the Blade Worms and Shield Ladybugs and contracted its abdomen once before releasing 10 Shield Ladybugs.","The Dimensional Light Moth contracted its abdomen ten times in total, and 100 Shield Ladybugs immediately surrounded the charging Radium Sea Lion, which halted its steps.","This development stunned Du Shuo, who felt that this method of defending using an insect colony seemed familiar.","There were now a total of 135 Shield Ladybugs.","He had no idea where these Shield Ladybugs came from.","Although Liu Jie was not a Creation Master and did not know how Protection of Water worked, he had already ambushed the Radium Sea Lion using the Dead Soul Demon Insect.","The ambush had not been successful due to the Radium Sea Lion’s protective layer.","Liu Jie looked crestfallen when he saw this.","If the Dead Soul Demon Insect’s attack was unsuccessful, Liu Jie would have to summon more insect-species carcinoma feys or even the Insect Queen in order to defeat Du Shuo.","But with his abundance of combat experience, Liu Jie had noticed that a small portion of the Dragon Horned Blowfish’s horn had turned into powder.","Liu Jie smiled behind his mask and circulated the spiritual power in his body before issuing a final order to the insect colony, “Hypha Tapeworm, use Double Parasite. Dead Soul Demon Insect, use Demon Soul Training and Exploding Dead Soul Bullets.”","After Liu Jie issued his order, one of the Blade Worm’s bodies expanded, and the black hypha started to move wildly while intermittent soul shadows appeared around it.","The Blade Worm that was transforming charged toward the Radium Sea Lion and exploded right before it made contact with the Radium Sea Lion."]},{"number":858,"title":"Chapter 858 - Settling the Debt","paragraphs":["A flood of soul shadows lunged at the Radium Sea Lion, but it seemed to be unbothered.","However, the Dragon Horned Blowfish let out a wail of pain, and its golden horn became 10% shorter.","Even without Liu Jie’s continued orders, the battle proceeded.","More Blade Worms underwent the same changes as they clashed against the Radium Sea Lion.","The Shield Ladybugs that were killed after they had surrounded the Radium Sea Lion had been infected by the hypha and rose to their feet once again.","The continuous self-explosions gave Du Shuo zero time to react.","By the time Du Shuo realized what was happening, the Dragon Horned Blowfish’s horn was only 10% of its original length, and it looked as though it would be completely gone after one more attack.","Du Shuo hurriedly shouted, “I admit defeat!”","When the last word left Du Shuo’s lips, the Blade Worms stopped short right in front of the Radium Sea Lion, and the insect colony stopped fighting.","The insect colony’s chaos and sacrifice had secured another victory for Liu Jie.","Du Shuo had been thinking about becoming Iron Prison’s disciple, but now that he had experienced Liu Jie’s power first-hand, he gave up on that pipe dream.","He called back the Dragon Horned Blowfish and Radium Sea Lion, grinned at Liu Jie, gave a thumbs-up, and said, “Young Liege, your strength is astounding.”","Liu Jie did not reply. Instead. he looked down at his chest.","After Du Shuo stepped down from the Martial Stage, the remaining nine participants of the Martial Stage looked relieved.","The remaining nine people realized how weak they were when they witnessed the battle between Du Shuo and Liu Jie.","Hence, they immediately gave up after stepping onto the Martial Stage.","After the last person admitted defeat, Zuo Ming looked at Liu Jie with pride.","Zuo Ming did not immediately announce Liu Jie as the winner of the Martial Stage, but everyone knew that the proud young man standing in the middle of an army of insects was the winner.","All the disciples who were present either came from veteran factions or top factions. They were also the favorite disciples of their elders and usually saw themselves as above others.","They were regarded with respect wherever they went and were accustomed to being waited on hand and foot.","At that moment, the image of that invincible young man standing on the Martial Stage was burned into the hearts of all the other disciples and taught them the true meaning of what it took to be the disciple of a member of royalty.","A blinding smile was under Night Leaning Moon’s black veil. This beam seemed out of place on her emotionless features, but it perfectly represented her current feelings.","Although she already knew how powerful Liu Jie was, she was still happy that her disciple had emerged victorious on the Martial Stage.","She was even happier than when she had achieved all that glory in her youth.","Her smile slowly faded as she turned to say to Iron Prison, “Iron Prison, I will visit you after the end of the Guard Ye Banquet to collect the Disaster Insect Nest’s body.”","Iron Prison’s face looked as grumpy as ever, but his heart was aching.","He had not managed to obtain a disciple.","Moreover, as much as it made his head ache to give the Disaster Insect Nest’s body to Night Leaning Moon, it was not much use to him anyway.","It was likely that Night Leaning Moon would give the Disaster Insect Nest’s body to her disciple because it would greatly benefit her disciple’s insect-species carcinoma feys.","It would allow the insect-species carcinoma feys to temporarily increase their power.","However, losing the bet with the Moon Empress that involved the sacred source lifeform felt like a stab to Iron Prison’s heart.","Iron Prison usually resided in the imperial court and led the royal guards.","Although he possessed overwhelming power, the royal guards belonged to the imperial court.","Despite being a member of royalty, Iron Prison did not manage his own private faction and lacked the resources that the Moon Empress, Bamboo Monarch, Chef Supreme, Chief Guard Ye, and that old man from Ostrich Logistics had.","He had not even acquainted himself with the sacred source lifeform, yet it had now become the Moon Empress’s property.","Iron Prison turned to look at the Moon Empress suspiciously.","He wondered if the Moon Empress had been gunning for his sacred source lifeform all along.","If so, the Moon Empress would have used another method to take the sacred source lifeform from him even if they had not made a bet.","“Thank you, Iron Prison. Please personally deliver the sacred source lifeform that I won to me at the Radiant Moon Palace after the Guard Ye Banquet.”","Iron Prison furrowed his brow.","It’s bad enough that I lost the sacred source lifeform! How dare the Moon Empress ask me to deliver it to the Radiant Moon Palace personally? She has crossed a line!","Just as he was about to object, the Moon Empress looked at him with a complex gaze.","“When you deliver the sacred source lifeform to the Radiant Moon Palace, I’ll take a look at your stuck feys. However, you’ll have to supply your own creation crystals.”","The Moon Empress turned her head away from Iron Prison.","Her words made Iron Prison relax his brow as a look of disbelief came over his face.","His expression of surprised delight made his grumpy face soften significantly.","As the leader of the royal guards, Iron Prison had accumulated a lot of experiences.","However, at that moment, he felt like an oblivious child and wondered if he was dreaming.","Since when did the Moon Empress start to give him gifts of her own accord? Could she be acting?","He had sought her out eight years ago with creation crystals in hand and asked her to help his feys break through.","But as he had been climbing the steps to the Radiant Moon Palace, brimming with sincerity, he was met with four moonbeam chains that chased him down Leaning Moon Mountain without even giving him the chance to reveal his intentions."]},{"number":859,"title":"Chapter 859 - Li Xuan Are You Jealous?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Iron Prison’s heart was aching, and it greatly displeased him that the Moon Empress had taken his sacred source lifeform. However, the Moon Empress was willing to look at his feys and had asked him to prepare creation crystals.","This meant that the Moon Empress was willing to help his stuck feys break through.","Compared to an increase in his own powers, losing one sacred source lifeform did not seem that important anymore.","Iron Prison did not know how he exactly felt about the Moon Empress, but he did know that he was grateful to her.","Behind the screen of the phone on the center seat of the 13 seats, an elderly man sat on a lounge chair in the imperial court.","His calm expression turned into one of surprise when he heard what the Moon Empress said. But soon, the surprise turned into gladness.","The Zhao Xiyue who had continued to do things her way even after becoming a Radiance Envoy was now a Master and was starting to take others’ feelings into consideration.","Although the elderly man had yet to see the Moon Empress’ disciple, he had heard from Cicada Song that the disciple’s name was Lin Yuan.","He also knew which disciple standing outside the Midnight Palace Lin Yuan was.","The elderly man looked at Lin Yuan curiously to see what was so special about this young man that he had managed to subtly change the Moon Empress’ personality and temperament.","All the veteran and top faction leaders outside the Midnight Palace were disappointed.","The Martial Stage had ended with Chief Guard Ye’s disciple as the winner.","The members of royalty’s promises were gold, and Iron Prison would not be accepting any disciples from the Guard Ye Banquet.","All the veteran and top faction leaders looked at Gao Pei furiously.","Gao Pei’s son had received Night Leaning Moon’s praise, the Moon Empress’ recommendation, and Cicada Song’s admission that they were fated. Hence, it was all but certain that Gao Feng would become Cicada Song’s disciple.","At that moment, an excited voice suddenly shouted from the area outside the Midnight Palace, “Yay! I’m the second-place winner of the Martial Stage!”","All the surrendered challengers shared looks when they heard Gao Feng’s voice.","Those challengers did not want to congratulate Gao Feng at all, and they agreed that he had just been lucky.","When Wang An heard Gao Feng’s voice, he almost slapped himself.","If only he had not been so eager to demonstrate his power, he would have been the second-place winner of the Martial Stage.","You Zhe walked out from the area where the Arts Stage was being held, followed by Long Tao and a girl with average features.","The girl looked to be about 24 years old, just like Long Tao.","She was holding a thick book and had a serious expression on her face. She looked like a nerd that had lost herself in her books.","However, no one was looking down on this average-looking girl.","The girl and Long Tao followed You Zhe out of the Arts Stage, meaning that she and You Zhe had finished their topics and had passed the Arts Stage.","Along with Gu Lang, who had returned to the area outside the Midnight Palace some time ago, three people had already completed the Arts Stage.","This meant that the Arts Stage was over.","However, they did not know who between Long Tao and the average-looking girl had attained second and third place.","After You Zhe led Long Tao and the average-looking girl out of the long corridor, the disciples of the veteran and top factions who had not managed to complete their topics walked out of the area where the Art Stage was being held with long faces.","Once the Arts Stage ended, the challengers who had yet to finish their topic lost their chance.","Long Tao immediately saw Gu Lang smiling and chatting with Zong Ze when he stepped out of the long corridor.","Long Tao’s expression faltered, but he did not look surprised at all.","He had already predicted early on that Gu Lang would finish before him, and he was anxious to find out how long it had taken Gu Lang to finish his topic for the Arts Stage so that he could know how much it differed from his own time.","You Zhe turned to walk towards Zuo Ming after he led Long Tao and the average-looking girl to the area outside the Midnight Palace.","Zuo Ming and You Zhe were only in charge of hosting the Arts Stage and Martial Stage, but they did not have to announce the results.","When the Guard Ye Banquet started, the challengers who had won would receive the honor of personally receiving their prizes from Chief Guard Ye.","The average-looking girl was about to find a place to sit to read the thick book she was carrying when Long Tao grabbed her hand.","She was flustered and looked at Long Tao in confusion.","Nonetheless, she stopped walking and remained standing by his side.","Although she did not speak, her expression seemed to be asking Long Tao why he had stopped her.","Gao Feng had been excitedly waiting for Long Tao to ask him what his topic for the Arts Stage had been.","The Martial Arts Stage would be carried out in the same way as the Arts Stage and Martial Stage had been.","The Martial Arts Stage was the combination of both the Arts Stage and Martial Stage.","Lin Yuan was going to participate in the Martial Arts Stage, and asking Long Tao about his topic would give Lin Yuan some sort of assurance.","However, Gao Feng did not expect Long Tao to grab the girl’s wrist.","“Lin Yuan, do you think Long Tao is interested in the girl who came out with him?”","Lin Yuan did not know how to respond and opted to touch the stray hair on the back of his head.","When the almost unassuming Li Xuan heard what Gao Feng said, he started to sputter and cough violently before saying, “Don’t worry, there’s no way that Long Tao would be interested in her.”","Li Xuan sounded so certain because he knew Long Tao well.","Long Tao had always placed emphasis on looks. One had to know that Li Xuan had been a chubby child. His looks had only improved to an acceptable level when he was six years old, and it was only then that Long Tao started to play with him.","Long Tao had always been strict about male’s appearances, much less female.","Although Long Tao was no longer as appearance-orientated as he used to be, there was no way that the professional Long Tao would discuss personal feelings during such an event.","Hence, Long Tao had to have another reason for grabbing the girl’s hand.","Li Xuan had a feeling that he knew why Long Tao had done so.","When Gao Feng heard Li Xuan’s resolute response, he shot Li Xuan a suspicious look and thought,? Is Li Xuan jealous?"]},{"number":860,"title":"Chapter 860 - The Martial Arts Stage Officially Begins","paragraphs":["Before Gao Feng could ponder more on it, Li Xuan said, “From the icon on the girl’s clothes, she should be from the veteran faction Heal Spirit Treatment. Heal Spirit Treatment’s road will be smooth-sailing from now on.”","Heal Spirit Treatment was a veteran faction that had a Creation Master role, but they did not do business related to nurturing feys.","They mainly focused on healing feys that had injured roots.","Their decision on what direction of Creation Master role to take was wise as it had immense potential.","But since Heal Spirit Treatment did not have any pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters, they lacked the power of strong Creation Masters that other veteran factions had.","Thus, Heal Spirit Treatment had not expanded or improved themselves in almost 20 years.","It had already been more than 10 years since Dark Clouds Bird Shrine became a top faction.","Ever since Dark Clouds Bird Shrine was promoted to a top faction, they had been working with Coiling Dragon’s Valley in equal capacities where neither had to depend on each other.","As such, Coiling Dragon’s Valley could choose another veteran faction to support.","Given this girl’s Creation Master powers, Long Tao had acknowledged Heal Spirit Treatment’s potential.","Just like Li Xuan had predicted, Long Tao issued an invitation to the girl.","“On behalf of Coiling Dragon’s Valley, I would like to officially invite Heal Spirit Treatment to come under our wing because I would like to work together to help Heal Spirit Treatment expand as quickly as possible.”","Long Tao had not spoken softly to ensure that the girl would be able to hear him clearly.","Even most of the young disciples outside the Midnight Palace had heard everything that Long Tao had said.","The disciples looked at the girl with average features with jealousy.","Long Tao had done so to assert his authority and officially declare that Coiling Dragon’s Valley wanted to support Heal Spirit Treatment.","The girl’s eyes lit up when she heard what Long Tao said, but she remembered that she did not have the authority to agree to Long Tao’s invitation.","She knew who Long Tao was. Although he was not the Young Leader of Coiling Dragon’s Valley, he was Sequence #3 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","As the only young direct descendent of Coiling Dragon’s Valley, he had the authority to represent Coiling Dragon’s Valley. However, the girl had many siblings back at Heal Spirit Treatment, and her elders had only selected her to participate in the Guard Ye Banquet because of her exceptional Creation Master skills. She had only been hoping to catch the eye of a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master that would accept her as their disciple.","But now, her talent had attracted the support of Coiling Dragon’s Valley for her family. This was definitely better than if she had just found a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master to be her Master.","Unadulterated excitement bloomed on her face, making her average features seem almost charming.","“I will need to inform the elders in my family of this. They are all inside the Midnight Palace. Is it possible to arrange a meeting between them and you after the Guard Ye Banquet to discuss your proposal?”","Long Tao smiled and replied, “Then let’s exchange contact details. My father is the one leading Coiling Dragon’s Valley at the Guard Ye Banquet. I will contact you after the banquet.”","After exchanging contact details with the girl, Long Tao walked toward Lin Yuan.","Long Tao had used the Dragon Gall Three-Leafed Insect during the Arts Stage which he had instructed to consume the secretions of a fey with the main dragon-species fey bloodline. This allowed him to reach his maximum efficiency.","Although everyone had chosen a different topic, Long Tao had been second to step out of the breeding room after completing his concoctions at maximum efficiency. Immediately after, he saw the girl follow right behind him.","No matter what secret weapons the girl had, she had proven her talent as a Creation Master.","It was natural for Long Tao to want her on his side with such talent. Supporting her veteran faction would also help Coiling Dragon’s Valley increase its overall power.","Long Tao arrived next to Lin Yuan and anxiously asked, “Brother, how long did that person take to complete the Arts Stage?”","Lin Yuan knew why Long Tao would ask this question. Hence, he had taken note of the time that Gu Lang had returned to the area outside the palace.","“Gu Lang finished the Arts Stage in 24 minutes and 36 seconds.”","Long Tao looked utterly dumbfounded by Lin Yuan’s response.","At his maximum efficiency, he had taken 47 minutes and 2 seconds. Moreover, he had used half the heart of a fey with main dragon-species fey bloodline.","Gu Lang had taken about half the time that Long Tao had taken.","This was a huge blow to Long Tao.","Although he was happy that he had achieved second place in the Arts Stage, he was leagues away from first place.","Long Tao did not know how strong Lin Yuan was as a Creation Master, but he did know that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","There was no way that Lin Yuan would have weak Creation Master powers, and he had to have his own secret weapons.","As he thought about how Lin Yuan was going to participate in the Martial Arts Stage soon, Long Tao said in a low voice, “Brother, the topics for the Arts Stage were drawn from the bronze beast head in front of the breeding room. Lord Zuo Ming checked through all the topics, and all spirit fluids in the participants’ fey storage boxes had to be handed to Lord Zuo Ming before we were allowed to enter the breeding rooms to look at our own topics. Next, we informed the Spirit Guard outside the breeding room of what our topic entailed and told him what materials we needed. My topic was to evolve three Gold X Freezing Water White Crocodiles to Platinum grade.”","After listening to Long Tao’s recounting, Lin Yuan immediately realized how difficult the Arts Stage’s topics were.","It was not difficult for Class 3 Creation Masters to evolve Gold feys to Platinum. The issue was with the short time limit.","If Lin Yuan had chosen that topic and instructed Genius to concoct the spirit fluids, it would only need one Grade 3 Freezing Lake Potion to evolve three pinnacle Gold Freezing Water White Crocodiles to Platinum.","However, it would take Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls at least two hours to concoct one bottle of Freezing Lake Potion, even if it used Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","If Lin Yuan used spirit qi crystals to evolve one of the Gold X Freezing Water White Crocodiles to Platinum grade, he would need to use 10 of them.","If he only used spirit qi crystals, he would require 30, and he did not have so many on hand.","Thus, Lin Yuan would have to give up if he chose such a topic.","At that moment, You Zhe announced, “Since both the Arts Stage and Martial Stage have officially come to an end, the Martial Arts Stage shall begin now.”"]},{"number":861,"title":"Chapter 861 - Stringent Competition Rules","paragraphs":["When he heard what You Zhe said, the excited Zong Ze, who just saw Liu Jie monopolize the battlefield, eagerly rushed to follow You Zhe.","Zong Ze’s actions immediately intimidated the Martial Arts Stage’s challengers.","Zuo Ming coughed and said, “Previously, I only announced that the first place prize for the Martial Arts Stage is a sacred source lifeform and the Order of Radiant Light, but I haven’t revealed what the second and third place prizes are. The second-place prize is the chance to have your fey nurtured by Chef Supreme. He will either nurture a Bronze/Epic fey or help the winner’s fey to break through using spiritual ingredients prepared by the winner themselves.”","All the disciples of the veteran and top factions started breathing raggedly when they heard Zuo Ming announce what the second prize for the Martial Arts Stage was.","Even the leaders of the top factions and veteran factions could not help but start to pant.","Although the second prize was not as good as the first, it would be highly beneficial for any faction.","Before the crowd could marvel even more at the second prize, Zuo Ming said, “The third prize is 100 drops of Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar provided by the Moon Empress. 90 of the drops will be able to cleanse all the impurities in a body while the other 10 drops will be able to cleanse all the impurities in a soul.”","Zuo Ming’s words stirred up the crowd again.","It had been rumored that the Moon Empress’ Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia had transformed, and that was probably why 10 of the drops could cleanse the impurities in a soul.","After cleansing the impurities in a soul, the ability to comprehend willpower would be increased, and the soul would also become purer.","A pure soul was a prerequisite for contracting a sacred source lifeform.","It was very dangerous to try to contract a sacred source lifeform with a soul that was not pure enough.","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow started to twitch when he heard the third prize because he did not expect his Master would be the one to supply it.","When he saw how hungry the others looked when the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar was mentioned, Lin Yuan awkwardly touched his chin.","When he had drunk the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar, he had taken bowlfuls each time.","There was even once when he had drunk two bowls.","After Zuo Ming finished announcing the prizes for the Martial Arts Stage, You Zhe said, “The Martial Arts Stage will proceed in a similar fashion to the Arts and Martial Stages. However, the finals will be different. No matter how many people participate in the Martial Arts Stage, only the top three will compete in the finals. The third-place finisher of the Arts Stage component will be confirmed as the third-place winner of the Martial Arts Stage, while the top two will compete in the Martial Stage component to decide who the final first and second places will be.”","You Zhe’s words caused fear to slither into the hearts of the young disciples participating in the Martial Arts Stages.","Besides Long Tao, who had chosen to maximize his advantage and participated in the Arts Stage despite having enough power to participate in the Martial Arts Stage, most of the participants in the Martial Arts Stage were more outstanding than the participants of the Arts and Martial Stages.","As long as a Creation Master had sufficient combat-class powers and could comprehend Willpower Runes, it would be difficult for a combat-class spirit qi professional who only had combat-class powers to stand out.","Creation Masters could use their abilities to assess their opponent’s feys, albeit their assessing abilities would not be able to compare to True Data.","Before the fight began, the Creation Masters would already be able to start controlling the situation.","However, the Martial Arts Stage rules were too surprising, and many people started to make guesses about how the finals would be held.","Although this seemed tedious, it would be able to better discern who the person with the best Creation Master and combat powers was.","The rules for the Martial Stage were too tough as the top three places were basically decided based on the results of the Arts Stage component.","Only the two people with the strongest Creation Master powers would be able to duke it out in the Martial Stage component.","Although Creation Master powers generally held more value than combat powers, did it really have to be so biased?","The third-place winner of the Martial Arts Stage only had to participate in the Arts Stage portion and did not have to fight at all.","As such, many who had participated in the Arts Stage now regretted their choice.","If they had known the Martial Arts Stage’s rules, they would have definitely tried for the Martial Arts Stage instead.","However, Long Tao did not regret choosing the Arts Stage.","Long Tao knew that he had achieved his best result as the second-place winner of the Arts Stage.","If he had known about the rules of the Martial Arts Stage and participated in the Martial arts Stage, Gu Lang would also have chosen to do the same.","Gu Lang, Zong Ze, and Lin Yuan, who were the disciples of Class 5 Creation Masters would definitely have emerged as the top three winners of the Martial Arts Stage.","But at the same time, Long Tao would have been the champion of the Arts Stage if Gu Lang had decided to participate in the Martial Arts Stage instead.","This thought did make his heart ache slightly.","The Martial Arts Stage’s stringent rules gave pause to many people.","Moreover, Zong Ze had already gone up to Zuo Ming before the rules were even announced to indicate his intention to participate in the Martial Arts Stage.","All the disciples who had wanted to challenge the Martial Arts Stage looked crestfallen, especially those with weak Creation Master powers but strong combat powers.","The rules for the Martial Arts Stage had immediately killed off their chances.","Thus, even after a few minutes, none dared to walk up to stand behind Zuo Ming.","The entire scene became awkward.","A voice sounded out from the other end of the phone placed on the seat. “The Arts Stage and Martial Stage showed me the Creation Master skills and combat powers of the younger generation. The youngsters in the Radiance Federation sure are becoming stronger. They’re sure to become formidable. But the Martial Arts Stage is about to begin, and I can’t see any courage. Why is that?”"]},{"number":862,"title":"Chapter 862 - Lin Yuan is My Disciple!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The other 12 members of royalty did not react to the elderly man’s voice.","However, even the leaders of veteran and top factions felt that the rules for the Martial Arts Stage had crossed a line.","But the first person to stand behind Zuo Ming would become the brave person that the elderly man had been referring to.","The elderly man said to the Moon Empress, “Xiyue, where’s your disciple?”","The Moon Empress rolled her eyes.","What does my disciple have to do with you? My disciple is the best. He’s just too young.","She did not plan on asking Lin Yuan to participate in the stages.","Just as she was about to reply, she was abruptly overcome with bewilderment because she noticed her precious disciple making a move.","Lin Yuan took a deep breath and thought,? The rules for the Martial Arts Stage prove how important Creation Master powers are. But regardless, I have to participate in the Martial Arts Stage for the sacred source lifeform and even more so for the Order or Radiant Light.","When Lin Yuan had been preparing for the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, he was lacking power.","At that time, Lin Yuan had only had a Silver I/Fantasy I Jasmine Lily, but the Moon Empress had already mentioned the Radiance Envoys to him.","When Lin Yuan had first heard about the Radiance Envoys, the term imprinted itself into his mind.","As he continued to grow his power, he could now pass the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection and become a member even with his eyes closed.","Thus, he was now setting his sights on becoming a Radiance Envoy.","The Order of Radiant Light would be a great asset for him on the road to becoming a Radiance Envoy.","Lin Yuan nodded at Liu Jie, Long Tao, Gao Feng, Li Xuan, and Sun Ningxiang before walking toward Zuo Ming.","No one besides this small group knew that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple, but the others did know that Chief Guard Ye’s disciple cared about this young man a lot.","When they saw that Lin Yuan was going to participate in the Martial Arts Stage, the disciples of the veteran and top factions were extremely stunned.","Most of the people present had seen the Allstar Match and knew that Lin Yuan was talented in combat.","But due to the nature of the Martial Arts Stage, the competition was not favorable to fighting skills. Unless one could place amongst the top two, there would be no opportunity to demonstrate their fighting abilities.","The people present were not unskilled like Meng Xu was.","Besides the unlucky Gao Feng, anyone who was present would be able to finish off Meng Xu in three moves.","Thus, the disciples of veteran and top factions had always regarded Lin Yuan as being merely talented rather than powerful.","Lin Yuan had just turned 18 years old and looked young. Thus, everyone assumed that he was around 17 years old.","His Creation Master powers should not be that strong at such an age even if he started training in the womb.","When it came to Creation Master powers, accumulation over time was just as important as talent. After all, not every Creation Master could be a genius like the Moon Empress, who had become a Class 5 Creation Master before she reached 40 years old.","When the challengers who wanted to participate in the Martial Arts Stage saw how casually Lin Yuan went to stand behind Zong Ze, they wondered if he was aiming to clinch the second-place winner of the Martial Arts Stage by counting on everyone else not having the courage to participate. They would not let him do that!","Hence, many challengers also started to follow after Lin Yuan.","The Moon Empress did not expect Lin Yuan to be brave enough to participate in the Martial Arts Stage.","But this was also good because it would allow Lin Yuan to spar with other outstanding young people and give her a good chance to witness her disciple’s power.","The Bamboo Monarch, Chef Supreme, Night Leaning Moon, Iron Prison, and Cicada Song all turned their gazes onto the Moon Empress.","They had all seen Lin Yuan before.","The Bamboo Monarch, Cicada Song, and Iron Prison turned to look at Chef Supreme with amusement.","They did not expect that the Moon Empress’s disciple would fight against the Chef Supreme’s youngest disciple. They wondered who was stronger.","Someone exclaimed, “Isn’t this Little Yuan?”","The voice sounded like it belonged to a fierce woman.","A man’s voice said, “Yingying, that’s really Little Yuan! He’s actually participating in the Martial Arts Sequence. Let’s take him to Kitchen Fragrance Palace after the Guard Ye Banquet so he can try my new red braised meat recipe.”","Zhang Yingying and Li Changlin had been chatting with Wang Fuxiang and had not been paying attention to the Martial Stage.","They only looked over when they heard the voice from the phone mention the Martial Stage and were surprised to see Lin Yuan.","All the veteran and top factions leaders turned to look at Chef Supreme.","The young man who had stunned everyone at the Allstar Match turned out to be deeply connected to Chef Supreme in some way.","From the way Li Changlin and Zhang Yingying spoke, it seemed as though they regarded this young man as their own child.","Chef Supreme’s first disciple Li Changlin usually did not bother with anyone else. Yet, he was now taking the initiative to cook red braised meat for this young man.","This was big news!","Although the leaders of the veteran and top factions dared not show too much emotion in front of the members of royalty like how Li Changlin and Zhang Yingying did, they could talk normally.","Even some leaders had made bets on how many fights Liu Jie would win during the Martial Stage.","During that time, the topic of Lin Yuan’s identity had also been brought up.","The Moon Empress had heard their discussion, and a ball of unspeakable fury rose up within her.","Lin Yuan is my disciple! Chef Supreme’s first disciple and daughter had just bumped into him by coincidence when they eloped, and they became neighbors. How dare you link him to Chef Supreme instead of asking Chef Supreme if he even has the courage to take Lin Yuan under his wing!?","Mystic Moon and Cold Moon started to break out in cold sweat.","They knew the Moon Empress well, and she would never be able to stay calm in such circumstances."]},{"number":863,"title":"Chapter 863 - You Smell Great!","paragraphs":["At that moment, Lei Zhan, who was representing the Five Thearch Soldiers, was standing next to Long Tu and said, “Old Long, that boy can’t be over 18 years old. Let’s make a bet on whether he’ll be able to make it amongst the top 10 of the Martial Arts Stage.”","Long Tu quickly glanced at the Moon Empress as he inwardly cursed Lei Zhan for being stupid.","Lei Zhan was the second most powerful person in the Five Thearch Soldiers, but his character was flippant and was not the most intelligent.","But normally, not even shrewd people dared to trick Lei Zhan.","From Lei Zhan’s question, Long Tu knew that he had not been paying close attention to the Martial Arts Stage’s rules at all.","The Arts Stage component of the Martial Arts Stage would come to an end once the top three emerged. There would be no top ten to speak of.","How would Lei Zhan determine who the 4th to 10th places were?","Moreover, only 11 people were standing behind Zuo Ming currently. Thus, betting that the Moon Empress’ disciple would come into the top 10 was the same as betting whether he would escape coming in last place!","Before Long Tu finished scolding Lei Zhan, a killing aura rose from one of the seats.","Long Tu, an emperor-class expert, felt as though he had been pressed to the bottom of the ocean and was struggling to breathe.","Lei Zhan, a thearch-class expert, was about to circulate his spiritual power when he felt that his spiritual power seemed to be clogged and that it was only moving at 10% of its usual rate.","This floored Lei Zhan because this imposing aura had exceeded anything that he had ever experienced.","At that moment, a cold voice hissed in Lei Zhan’s ear.","Although the voice was soft, he felt his entire ear go numb.","“Do you want to make bets because you also have a sacred source lifeform? Why don’t I bet with you instead?”","Lei Zhan immediately knew that the terrifying aura had come from the Moon Empress. He snapped his mouth shut awkwardly as he tried to figure out how he had offended the Moon Empress.","He had come to the Royal Capital on a mission. He needed to go to Leaning Moon Mountain to ask for her help and ask if she would trade for some Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls with him.","The Five Thearch Soldiers had few Creation Master resources to start with, and it would help them greatly to be able to obtain some Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","But for whatever reason, he had incurred the Moon Empress’ wrath.","Despite being a thearch-class expert, Zhan Lei hurriedly bowed and said, “I’m not betting anymore. Moon Empress, I won’t bet anymore. Frankly, I’m not usually a gambler.”","The Moon Empress scoffed and retracted her terrifying aura.","Her sudden outburst had left the entire Midnight Palace in silence.","Night Leaning Moon turned to look at Lei Zhan and felt that he was extremely gullible. He had wanted some fun but ended up falling to his doom.","...","Zuo Ming looked at the 11 challengers standing behind him and loudly asked, “Does anyone else want to participate in the Martial Arts Stage?”","No one else stepped forward, and Zuo Ming turned to walk toward the area where the Arts Stage had been held.","As Lin Yuan walked behind Zuo Ming, his head ached at the thought of having to rely on luck to pick his topic.","He hated things that depended on luck.","Suddenly, his eyes lit up. Although he did not have any special spiritual ingredients that could increase his luck, he did have the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds that could remove one’s bad luck.","Although he would not have good luck on his side while he picked his topic for the Arts Stage component, he would at least not have any bad luck either.","The Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds had been growing continuously in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and had already blooded twice. Lin Yuan had collected all the pollen from the first time it had bloomed.","He took out a brocade box with the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds’ first batch of pollen.","He needed to swallow the pollen for it to take effect, so he pinched a small amount and put it in his mouth.","At that moment, Zong Ze froze and sniffed deeply. He felt that there was an oddly faint fragrance in the air that seemed to soothe his fiery craving for battle.","Zong Ze had always known that he was a battle fanatic that could never control himself when the opportunity for combat arose.","It was because he liked to test his skills through fighting and because the second year after he became Chef Supreme’s disciple, he had been cursed by an expert’s sacred source lifeform when they went to the outskirts to train.","Although his Master had killed that expert in the end and made a precious weapon out of the sacred source lifeform’s body, the curse had not been removed, and it remained imprinted on his body.","Eventually, the curse became a stain of bad luck that fused with his soul.","This curse of bad luck had always weighed on Zong Ze’s heart.","By the time Zong Ze turned his head, Lin Yuan had already kept away the brocade box with the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen.","Zong Ze continued sniffing like a dog until he reached Lin Yuan’s shoulder and started to walk in tandem alongside Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan felt rather strange when he saw Zong Ze walking next to him.","He had heard Long Tao say that Zong Ze did not like physical contact, so why was he acting so intimate with him?","When Zong Ze saw Lin Yuan looking at him, he instinctively said, “You smell great!”","Lin Yuan’s mouth fell open, and he stared at Zong Ze in shock.","He hastily put some distance between himself and Zong Ze and followed more closely behind Zuo Ming.","Zong Ze immediately realized that his words had been ambiguous.","Just as Zong Ze was about to catch up to Lin Yuan, he stopped himself.","The Arts Stage component was about to begin, and they would not be able to say much anyway. Hence, Zong Ze decided to wait until the Martial Arts Stage was over.","At that time, he would properly get to know that young man who had a smell that could soothe him."]},{"number":864,"title":"Chapter 864 - The Second Role","paragraphs":["As Lin Yuan walked behind Zuo Ming in the long corridor, he arrived at another area in the Midnight Palace.","Many small rooms here looked like the breeding rooms and observation rooms at the third level of the Creation Master Association.","Lin Yuan could not tell how many of those rooms there were, but the area looked to be at least 300 meters in length.","With the pattern of one room and the adjacent one left empty, there had to be at least 60 rooms.","There was a carving of a different beast head carved on each door and the head a dragon-species fey in each beast head’s mouth.","Lin Yuan silently sighed to himself.","Just how much does Chief Guard Ye hate dragon-species feys?","When they arrived at a bronze statue of a beast head, Zuo Ming lifted it and allowed the challengers to pick topics from it.","Zuo Ming walked over to Lin Yuan, who was the first person behind him with the bronze statue in hand.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to hand the bronze statue to Lin Yuan, Zong Ze walked up to receive the bronze statue and said to Lin Yuan, “Here, pick a topic.”","Lin Yuan thanked Zong Ze and dipped his hand into the mouth of the bronze statue to pick up one of the sheepskin scrolls inside.","He pulled out the scroll and looked at Zong Ze suspiciously. Zong Ze’s actions were clearly a gesture of courtesy, and this sudden friendly attitude made Lin Yuan wary.","After Lin Yuan thanked him, Zong Ze’s hard expression softened into a smile, and he thought to himself,? It looks like my slip of words didn’t anger Lin Yuan. He wouldn’t have thanked me if he did.","Zong Ze reached into the bronze statue and took out a sheepskin scroll before returning the bronze beast head statue to Zuo Ming.","Zuo Ming did not find it weird that Zong Ze had extended a friendly hand to Lin Yuan. It was normal for two disciples of members of royalty who were of the same age to become close.","However, the other challengers who were curious about Lin Yuan, who Liu Jie cared so much about, became even more curious. They did not understand what was so special about this young man that he would be so friendly with Chef Supreme’s disciple after Chief Guard Ye’s disciple had stood up for him.","All of them were green with envy!","There were only 11 participants in the Martial Arts Stage, and the topics were quickly picked.","Zuo Ming checked the time and said, “The time will start now. All of you can choose a breeding room each. You can look at your topics when you enter the breeding room and hand it to the Spirit Guard outside the room. The Spirit Guard will help to prepare your ingredients, and they’ll leave immediately after handing you your ingredients. They won’t bother you during the competition.”","Zuo Ming started to record the time.","Every participant entered a breeding room of their choice.","Although Lin Yuan did not know what topic he had chosen, he quickly picked a breeding room.","There were only a total of 154 young disciples outside the Midnight Palace. Excluding the 25 that participated in the Arts Stage and 75 that participated in the Martial Stage, there were a total of 54 challengers who could have participated in the Martial Arts Stage.","After the 54 challengers had found out about the Martial Arts Stage’s stringent rules, only 11 decided to participate in the Martial Arts Stage.","All 11 participants were the cream of the crop, and they were full of confidence in their powers.","Even if Lin Yuan did not manage to emerge as the winner of the Arts Stage component, he was resolved to be second place.","He was not going to waste a second.","After he entered the breeding room, Lin Yuan nodded to the Spirit Guard outside his room and unrolled his scroll to see what his topic was.","All his solemness was instantly replaced with ease.","The sheepskin scroll read: Evolve 5 Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits from Bronze/Elite to Bronze/Flawless and recover one Bronze/Normal Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit from its life-threatening injuries. Finally, evolve that Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit to Bronze/Flawless as well.","Lin Yuan had used the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds’ first batch of pollen to remove his bad luck before he picked this topic. This meant that his own luck had directed him to pick this topic.","Before Lin Yuan had nurtured the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds by accident, he had never believed in the existence of luck because it was too flimsy and intangible.","But since the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds could remove bad luck, it proved the existence of bad luck in the world.","Since there was bad luck, there had to be good luck.","Now that he had experienced the effect of luck, Lin Yuan decided to acquire more feys that could improve his luck when he returned to the Return from Faraway Mansion.","The three Mountain River Eternal Life Carp were also lucky feys.","However, the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp’s luck was directed at animals and insects. Their exclusive skills did not have much effect on spirit qi professionals and could only make the lives of spirit qi professionals more comfortable.","Lin Yuan wanted to find lucky feys that could improve the luck of spirit qi professionals. He had seen some when he was browsing in the Rare Lifeform Pavilion.","They had astronomical price tags and were bought up almost immediately after Lin Yuan spotted them.","These expensive lucky feys in the Rare Lifeform Pavilion had low levels, while the high-level ones were all in the hands of the major factions. Nonetheless, feys that could improve luck were very rare. No matter how expensive they were, no faction dared to use these feys as their role.","Usually, factions expanded to second or even third roles once their first role had progressed to a certain level.","For example, when the Sun family was in its prime, they also had Condense Healing on top of Condense Fairy Orchard.","Lin Yuan could now perfectly sustain Sky City’s Creation Master role on his own."]},{"number":865,"title":"Chapter 865 - Lin Yuan’s Topic","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Besides allowing those who had the Fate Letter to custom-order a Bronze/Epic fey, Sky City was also working with the Sea Bliss Clan, Condense Fairy Orchard, and the Azure Guard.","Master Duan Li was still providing Lin Yuan with free labor, but their deal would be done in a month, and Master Duan Li would no longer need to work hard at concocting Platinum Water Potions for him anymore.","Master Hong Shen was the only Class 4 Creation Master in the Return from Faraway Mansion. However, his time was occupied with researching the basement’s construction with Hu Quan and helping Zhang Xiaobai and the rest to evolve their feys.","Master Hong Shen was only human. After he was done evolving feys for Zhang Xiaobai and the rest, he would be busy with evolving the Angelfish of Bliss’s grades.","Thus, the Return from Faraway Mansion’s Creation Master role would be stagnant for the foreseeable future. Lin Yuan the machine was fully capable of providing all of Sky City’s Creation Master resource needs.","Lin Yuan suddenly felt that Sky City could capitalize on his Creation Master techniques to use luck as his role and create a new direction to develop in.","The Spirit Guard outside Lin Yuan’s room had been taken aback by Lin Yuan’s young age, and he had watched Lin Yuan’s expression as he opened the scroll.","This made the Spirit Guard slightly curious because the young man not only did not frown when he saw his topic but even looked more relieved.","During the Arts Stage, the room that this Spirit Guard had been in charge of had also been picked.","However, when that challenger looked at their topic, they immediately furrowed their brow and a look of despair came over their face.","The Spirit Guard looked at the young man as he walked up to him, handed him the sheepskin scroll, and said, “Sorry to inconvenience you.”","The Spirit Guard received the sheepskin scroll and checked the topic before heading off to make preparations.","He was sure that the only reason this young man did not look depressed was that he had already resigned himself to his fate.","The topic chosen was the one that tested a Creation Master’s ability to evolve a fey’s grade the most.","Lin Yuan watched as the Spirit Guard walked over to the enormous cabinets in the breeding room.","The cabinets had over 1,000 drawers in total, and the Spirit Guard reached down to open a drawer on the bottom right corner and took out a Diamond fey storage box from within. He gave the Diamond fey storage box to Lin Yuan before walking out of the room.","His movements had been so agile that it had taken him less than half a minute to finish reading the question and retrieve the ingredients.","Lin Yuan emptied out everything inside the Diamond fey storage box onto the work table and saw five purple-eyed Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits staring curiously at him. Their floppy ears sparked with bright electricity every few moments.","Besides the five healthy Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits, there was also an extremely weak one that was curled into a ball.","Its ears lay limply and were charred black. It was clear that it was seriously injured.","Lin Yuan ascertained that it was about to die after checking on the injured Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit’s condition.","This was the Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit mentioned in the sheepskin scroll that Lin Yuan needed to heal.","Although the Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit had a cute expression, could be kept as a pet, and had long soft ears that could be wrapped around one’s neck to keep warm, it was a very violent and combative fey.","The severely injured Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit had to have been hit by the recoil of electricity after using its abilities and caused its roots to be damaged.","Other than the six Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits, there was also a large pile of a variety of rare spiritual ingredients in the Diamond fey storage box.","Not many spiritual ingredients were required to evolve and heal the Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits, so the extra spiritual ingredients could only be there to increase the difficulty.","Lin Yuan picked the Silver Anesthetic Leaf that was commonly used by Creation Masters and healing-type spirit qi professionals.","Despite being favored by Creation Masters and healing-type spirit qi professionals, the Anesthetic Leaf could not heal feys but could put feys to sleep when consumed so as to reduce the pain of treatment.","After Sky City started expanding toward the Creation Master direction, the Anesthetic Leaf was a must-have for Lin Yuan when he was nurturing feys.","In order to save time, Lin Yuan always nurtured feys in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Without the Anesthetic Leaf, the more intelligent feys would have remembered what the Spirit Lock spatial zone looked like, and Lin Yuan did not want this to happen.","First, he fed the six Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits the Anesthetic Leaves, and they quickly fell asleep.","Next, Lin Yuan summoned Genius, which immediately stretched out its five voluminous tails.","Genius scampered up to Lin Yuan’s shoulder and nudged its face against Lin Yuan’s cheek as it said, “Yuan, Chimey is going to live-stream tonight. I was helping it to decorate its live-streaming room.”","This raised a question in Lin Yuan’s mind. What was wrong with Chimey’s live-streaming room that Genius needed to help decorate it?","But before Lin Yuan could ponder further, he said to Genius, “Genius, pick out the spiritual ingredients that can evolve and heal these six Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits.”","Lin Yuan placed his hand on the injured Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit’s charred ears and circulated his spiritual power to inject a large amount of pure spiritual power into the Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit’s body.","Shortly after, the Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit was healed and its quality evolved to Bronze/Flawless.","Lin Yuan had only used six minutes so far.","Whenever Lin Yuan evolved feys to Epic quality, he spent most of the time at the stage of evolving feys from Flawless to Epic.","It did not require much spirit qi to evolve feys to Flawless quality, and Lin Yuan could do it even when he was not in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","From the moment he had seen the topic, Lin Yuan knew what the person who had set the question was trying to achieve."]},{"number":866,"title":"Chapter 866 - The Young Have Always Emerged as Heroes!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan also knew how normal Creation Masters would approach this topic.","Other Creation Masters would first heal the injured Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit before evolving the other Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits from Normal to Elite quality.","Next, they would concoct a Grade 3 spirit fluid bottle specifically meant to evolve Bronze grade feys from Elite to Flawless.","It would take some time to concoct a Grade 3 spirit fluid bottle.","It was easy for Class 3 Creation Masters to concoct a Grade 3 spirit fluid for one fey, but it would be a true test of their power to concoct enough spirit fluid for six feys.","Genius would take at least two hours to concoct enough Grade 3 spirit fluids to evolve six feys, and the slightest mistake would result in complete failure.","Yet, Lin Yuan had completed his topic in 17 minutes and 40 seconds.","Lin Yuan stored the spiritual ingredients that Genius had picked out into the Spirit Lock spatial zone before walking out of the breeding room to see Zuo Ming.","Zuo Ming quickly walked up to greet Lin Yuan because he thought an issue had arisen while he was competing.","Most Creation Masters would waste some spiritual ingredients while concocting spirit fluids. However, an extra set of spiritual ingredients had been prepared for the Arts Stage component of the Martial Arts Stage.","Zuo Ming thought,? Is the Radiant Moon Palace’s Young Lord coming to ask me to prepare another set of spiritual ingredients? If so, I’ll be in a hard spot .","A mistake must have been made if there was any wastage during the concoction of spirit fluids. It would be impossible to come in amongst the top few in the Arts Stage component in such a situation.","Just as Zuo Ming was about to ask Lin Yuan what had happened, Lin Yuan said in a clear and bright voice, “Senior Zuo Ming, I’ve finished my topic.”","Lin Yuan waited for Zuo Ming to assess his results.","Zuo Ming hurriedly recorded the time and was absolutely shocked.","It hasn’t been that long! Only 18 minutes since I started recording the time! Is it even possible to complete a topic set by the three Class 5 Creation Masters so quickly? Even Lord Bamboo Monarch’s disciple took 24 minutes.","However, Zuo Ming dared not suspect Lin Yuan and quickly said, “Young Lord, let me take a look.”","Normally, it should be the Spirit Guard who had prepared Lin Yuan’s spiritual ingredients that checked Lin Yuan’s results.","Due to the difficulty of the test, the Spirit Guards only returned to stand guard outside the breeding rooms after 20 minutes.","Thus, only Zuo Ming was available to check Lin Yuan’s results at the moment.","When Zuo Ming entered the breeding room, he immediately saw the six sleeping Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits.","The Silver Anesthetic Leaf had strong effects, and the Hanging Ear Electric Rabbits would sleep for at least two hours.","Zuo Ming carefully checked every Hanging Ear Electric Rabbit until he was sure that they had all reached Bronze/Flawless.","He suppressed his astonishment and said, “Lord Lin Yuan, I’ve confirmed your results of the Arts component of the Martial Arts Stage. You are in first place.”","Lin Yuan nodded and said with a smile, “Senior Zuo Ming, I’m going to the area outside the palace to prepare for the Martial component of the Martial Arts Stage.”","Zuo Ming hurriedly nodded and watched in utter shock as Lin Yuan disappeared down the long corridor.","He pinched his leg, and the pain reminded him that he was not dreaming.","He asked himself how old the Moon Empress’ disciple actually was more than once. It was too unbelievable for someone of his age to have this level of Creation Master powers.","Everyone inside and out of the Midnight Palace was waiting with bated breath to see who would be the first to step out of the long corridor and take first place of the Arts Stage component of the Martial Arts Stage.","However, they were also all sure that Chef Supreme’s disciple would be the one to attain that top spot.","At that moment, a relaxed young man with a sunny disposition strolled out of the long corridor.","His gait had such sureness of footing that it gave a warm feeling to all that saw him.","But when they saw the young man’s figure, a string of gasps erupted from inside and out of the Midnight Palace.","The most dumbfounded of them all was the Moon Empress.","Although the Moon Empress had stopped watching the Martial Arts Stage as a mere spectacle when Lin Yuan decided to participate, she never expected that he would come out as one of the top few.","The moment that she saw Lin Yuan, the Moon Empress was stunned.","The immature and stubborn young man had not only exceeded her expectations by ranking amongst the top few of the Arts Stage component but had even emerged first.","In spite of her shock, the Moon Empress’ already straight posture became ramrod straight.","She looked around until her gaze landed on Chef Supreme, and she seemed to be saying, “Did you see that? My disciple is number one!”","The Moon Empress was not in the habit of showing off and maintained her ‘still waters run deep’ composure even after becoming a Class 5 Creation Master.","But now that Lin Yuan had distinguished himself amongst the young cream of the crop, she was even happier than when she had earned her own achievements.","At that moment, a stern voice cried out, “The young have always emerged as heroes! Xiyue, this young man really lives up to the title of your disciple.”","The Moon Empress did not immediately agree. Instead, she said, “Even if he wasn’t my disciple, his impressive abilities are undeniable.”","The Moon Empress could not help but be amazed as she thought,? I was already impressed when he gave me the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. Who would have thought that he would surprise me again just two days later?","The Moon Empress was well aware of what level of power was required to complete the Arts Stage component’s topic.","From near Chef Supreme’s seat, a forceful voice shouted out, “Changlin, Xiao Lin won first place in the Arts Stage component. He’s much better than your junior disciple! My father will definitely be dragging him back into the kitchen when they return!”"]},{"number":867,"title":"Chapter 867 - The Enraged Chef Supreme","paragraphs":["Li Changlin said with stupefaction, “No matter what happens during the Martial Stage component, Xiao Yuan’s win in the Arts Stage component will have secured him a spot amongst the top 2 in the Martial Arts Stage. When we return, ask your father to give up his last Spirit Savory Pig so that I can cook it for Xiao Yuan.”","Chef Supreme’s expression immediately darkened when he heard what his daughter said.","He had picked up on the way that the Moon Empress was looking at him.","Frankly, Chef Supreme was also shocked that Lin Yuan had been able to finish his topic in under 20 minutes.","It would have been fine if Cold Moon and Mystic Moon had complimented their Young Lord, but why was his daughter singing his praises as well? She had even said that he was much stronger than Zong Ze. Moreover, why was his training of Zong Ze in Creation Master powers called being dragged into the kitchen?","The Creation Master technique he had patented involved using cooking methods to combine spiritual ingredients perfectly.","The way one perfectly combined spiritual ingredients was a kind of expression of their attitude toward life.","The Bamboo Monarch was the only Class 5 Creation Master that used traditional techniques to concoct spirit fluids.","The Moon Empress used her own special method of utilizing moonbeams to refine spiritual ingredients’ aura, essence, and appearance. She combined all these different factors to produce a type of fragrance like she was engineering fragrance.","Chef Supreme remembered how thoughtful his daughter had been when she was young. But from the moment he had accepted Li Changlin as his disciple, Li Changlin started taking Chef Supreme’s daughter around to all sorts of places. Nothing good came out of their being together.","While Chef Supreme was ragging on Li Changlin, Li Changlin started to speak.","What Li Changlin said made Chef Supreme’s already darkened expression turn pitch black.","See! See! All that rascal Li Changlin does is give me a headache. He actually wants my daughter to convince me to give up my last Spirit Savory Pig. He’s trying to coerce his wife to steal from his own Master and father-in-law. I only have one Spirit Savory Pig left. How can you ask me to give it up? Kitchen Fragrance Palace will have no more of its signature fey!","Gu Lang would never ask the Bamboo Monarch to cut down the entire Purple Bamboo Forest, and Lin Yuan would never cut down the two Silver Stamen Golden Luster Cassias.","Chef Supreme was really at his wits’ end when it came to his first disciple.","When he had scolded Li Changlin a few days ago, his daughter had immediately stormed out.","If he had said even more, his daughter might actually run away with Li Changlin again.","The veteran and top faction leaders had heard what the Moon Empress and the person with the stern voice had said.","It now dawned upon them who Lin Yuan actually was.","However, they were not surprised that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple. Nothing could be more surprising than when an 18-year-old young man had been able to beat Chef Supreme’s disciple to finish first place in the Arts Stage component of the Martial Arts Stage.","Chef Supreme’s youngest disciple was already 23 years old.","Lin Yuan seemed to be four or five years younger than Zong Ze from their appearances.","Now, it seemed appropriate that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","As Lin Yuan walked over to rejoin his group of friends, the veteran and top faction leaders looked toward Long Tu and the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Long Tu and the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine did not look shocked, and it was clear that they already knew about Lin Yuan’s identity.","The other top and veteran factions were extremely jealous that Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had formed a connection with the Moon Empress’ disciple.","None of the other veteran and top faction leaders wanted to spare Gao Pei even a glance.","Gao Pei was the biggest winner at the Guard Ye Banquet. Not only was his son a part of the group, but he also seemed even closer to the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye’s disciples than Long Tao and Li Xuan were.","Moreover, Gao Feng had caught the eye of Cicada Song and was likely to be announced as","Cicada Song’s disciple in the Guard Ye Banquet.","Gao Pei must have amazing luck to have such a son.","As for Sun Ningxiang, the veteran and top faction leaders were torn.","There had been rumors that there had been some changes to the Sun family, and it was likely that they would fall from the ranks of top factions.","But now, it seemed that there was more than met the eye to Condense Fairy Orchard.","Many top factions intending to prey on top factions were now in turmoil.","At that moment, Zong Ze walked out of the long corridor, and Chef Supreme’s expression lightened.","It had already been about 23 minutes since the Arts Stage component had begun, and it was expected that Zong Ze would emerge at such a time.","When he saw Zong Ze, the Bamboo Monarch, who had been mostly silent since Gu Lang entered the Arts Stage, said, “The two fellows set to participate in the Martial Stage component have arrived.”","The Bamboo Monarch turned to look at the Moon Empress.","He had seen Zong Ze’s powers for himself during all the time that Zong Ze had been around Gu Lang.","The Martial Stage component would demonstrate how powerful the Moon Empress’ disciple was when it came to battle.","...","Gao Feng lunged at Lin Yuan and wrapped him in a bear hug.","When Gao Feng patted someone on the shoulder, the person would feel like a block had hit them.","During the hug, Lin Yuan felt like a tank was crushing him.","After being squeezed by Gao Feng, Liu Jie hastily pulled them apart when he saw Lin Yuan’s red face.","Long Tao, Li Xuan, and Sun Ningxiang also approached them.","Gao Feng chuckled and said, “Congratulations, Brother! You’re the first to complete the Arts Stage component!”","Lin Yuan smiled but not because he had won the Arts Stage component."]},{"number":868,"title":"Chapter 868 - Zong Zes Friendliness","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan knew clearly that he had been able to win first place in the Arts Stage component because of luck. He could have come in last place if he had chosen any other topic.","Lin Yuan could not help but be happy when such genuine friends surrounded him.","After Long Tao congratulated Lin Yuan, he looked at Zong Ze and frowned.","He turned to say to Lin Yuan, “Lin Yuan, how well do you understand Zong Ze’s powers?”","Lin Yuan shook his head. He was completely clueless about Zong Ze powers.","However, he was not worried about this because he would be able to use True Data during the fight with Zong Ze to check on Zong Ze’s feys and completely understand everything about those feys.","Although Zong Ze was a Creation Master and could also check on Lin Yuan’s feys, Lin Yuan had no intention of summoning his feys during the Martial Stage component.","Thus, Zong Ze’s Creation Master abilities would be rendered useless during the battle.","Since he was one fight away from becoming the champion of the Martial Arts Stage and his opponent was Zong Ze, Lin Yuan felt that it was time to use the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","Now that he knew that Lin Yuan did not know about Zong Ze’s powers, Long Tao thought back to the time in Radiance Sacred Hall when he had fought against Zong Ze and said with a grim expression, “Zong Ze has mostly contracted fire-type feys and uses brute strength. Most importantly, you’ll have to watch out for his sudden explosive power.”","Long Tao did not elaborate any further because the fight in Radiance Sacred Hall had been secret and because some time had passed since Long Tao and Zong Ze fought.","Zong Ze’s power had definitely increased significantly.","Long Tao was afraid of giving Lin Yuan a misconception of Zong Ze’s powers if he told Lin Yuan about their previous fight.","If that happened, Long Tao could become the reason for Lin Yuan’s defeat.","Hence, Long Tao only gave Lin Yuan a general description and advice.","Long Tao had nearly been burned to ashes by that flood of ferocious fire.","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up when he heard what Long Tao said.","It was great news for Lin Yuan if Zong Ze mainly used fire-type feys.","Due to the laws in the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, Lin Yuan had gained resistance to various elements. He was most resistant against dark-type and second-most resistant against fire-type.","There was the Icy Flames Law that the Gild Flames Dragon Lice had comprehended. The Law Crystal fragments had been supplied by Duan He when he first joined Sky City.","Although the Gilt Flames Dragon Lice’s Law Crystal had not been complete, it was about 70 or 80% complete.","The unlucky Gilt Flames Dragon Lice had to have been killed by the Thunderwave Sky Chaos Snail and Six-Headed Sea Demon Snake. Otherwise, its Law Crystal would have remained so complete.","Hence, Lin Yuan had an advantage in the fight against Zong Ze.","If Zong Ze’s feys were not of the same type as the laws that were carved on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, Lin Yuan would have to be very careful when he used Spirit Essence Explosion even if he used all the combat skills and fighting abilities that had been recorded in the Radiance Federation.","During such close combat, it would not be feasible to use the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Spatial Shift to shift a space full of spatial energy to another dimension.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s Spatial Shift would be better suited to shifting a large explosive attack.","Lin Yuan would not be able to afford to flippantly use up so much spiritual power for a one-time usage of Spatial Shift.","Now that he understood Zong Ze’s fey types, Lin Yuan felt a sense of assurance.","“Big Brother Long, I will be careful.”","When Long Tao looked into Lin Yuan’s eyes, he saw no panic but rather resolute confidence.","Long Tao knew that Lin Yuan’s powers were beyond his imagination, and he could not help but look forward to the battle between Zong Ze and Lin Yuan.","Zong Ze walked over to Gu Lang, and his gaze drifted over to Lin Yuan.","Gu Lang asked with a mock smile, “What’s wrong? Has your confidence taken a hit? Are you—”","Gu Lang stopped speaking because he noticed that Zong Ze did not look disappointed, rather exhilarated.","There was also a faint spark of passion in his eyes.","“Big Brother Gu Lang, I met someone who can curb my obsession for fighting today.”","Gu Lang was completely confused.","Zong Ze’s bad luck from his curse was a secret that never left the walls of Kitchen Fragrance Palace.","After Chef Supreme had realized that he could not remove Zong Ze’s bad luck, he did not seek help from the Bamboo Monarch and the Moon Empress.","Thus, Gu Lang had no clue why Zong Ze was such a fanatic about battling.","Zong Ze grabbed Gu Lang and said, “Let’s go. We should introduce ourselves to him.”","Before Gu Lang could react, he was already being pulled by Zong Ze over to where Lin Yuan was.","Even after he regained his senses, Gu Lang did not wrench his arm free of Zong Ze’s grip. He felt that it was normal to introduce himself.","It was necessary for him to get to know the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye’s disciple as they would be interacting a fair amount in the future.","However, Gu Lang did not understand why the cold Zong Ze would take the initiative to introduce himself.","Could it be that Zong Ze felt a sense of camaraderie with the Moon Empress’ disciple after the Arts Stage component?","Zong Ze pulled Gu Lang over to Lin Yuan and saw Gao Feng with his hand on Lin Yuan’s shoulder.","Zong Ze felt the eyes of everyone in Lin Yuan’s group on him, and he said, “My name is Zong Ze.”","Zong Ze strode forward and inserted himself between Gao Feng and Lin Yuan.","Gao Feng moved aside and assumed that Zong Ze and Lin Yuan were already acquainted.","The content Zong Ze started sniffing and realized that the fragrance that could suppress his bad luck was not present."]},{"number":869,"title":"Chapter 869 - Come Over to Say It","paragraphs":["Zong Ze tilted his head and stepped closer to Lin Yuan.","Since Zong Ze was taller than Lin Yuan, it looked like he was smelling Lin Yuan’s hair to see if it smelled bad.","Even in his weak state back in the Xia Region, Lin Yuan would still shower every day no matter how tired he was. This had not changed despite him being stronger now.","Moreover, he had used the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar to cleanse his body of impurities. His hair would not smell bad even if he did not shower for the rest of his life.","Suddenly, he thought about how Zong Ze had said that he smelled great.","At that moment, Lin Yuan realized that Zong Ze had been referring to the smell of the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen.","Lin Yuan looked at Zong Ze strangely.","The Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen was special in that only those afflicted by bad luck could detect its scent.","The stronger the bad luck, the more appealing the scent of the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen.","When Lin Yuan ate the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen, he did not smell anything at all. There was only a slightly spicy sting in his throat.","Could Zong Ze also have bad luck on him? ?wondered Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan picked up a small amount of pollen from the Spirit Lock spatial zone that had fallen on the work table and crushed it between his fingers.","He immediately saw a look of excitement cross Zong Ze’s face and Zong Ze’s sniffing intensified. He looked almost like a dog.","Now that he had tested it, Lin Yuan had confirmed his guess.","Zong Ze did have bad luck stuck to him.","Judging from how sensitive Zong Ze was to the pollen, his bad luck had to be quite severe.","Zong Ze was an unfriendly person and did not say anything much after he inserted himself into Lin Yuan’s group.","Gu Lang was a warm person. After his pointed efforts to extend his friendship, Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Long Tao, Li Xuan, Gao Feng, and Sun Ningxiang all started chatting comfortably with him.","The other young disciples of veteran and top factions were even more envious of this group now.","Zheng Kaiyuan was addressed as ‘Second Young Master’ wherever he went in Indigo Azure City. But ever since Miao Zhuo had been kicked out, Zheng Kaiyuan had lost his main source of support and had to be cautious in everything that he did.","He initially intended on participating in the Martial Stage. But in his panic, he decided against joining in the end.","Before the Guard Ye Banquet, Miao Qi had instructed him to stick by Miao Zhuo’s side.","Now that such a serious matter had happened to Miao Zhuo, he would be implicated no matter how much Miao Qi adored him.","The Miao family would even abandon the Zheng family out of rage.","As he thought about the situation that awaited him in the near future, Zheng Kaiyuan mustered up his strength and walked toward Lin Yuan’s group.","He wanted to ask Chief Guard Ye’s disciple if he could forgive Miao Zhuo and because he felt that his friendly nature might give him a chance to join the group and become friends with Chief Guard Ye, Chef Supreme, and the Bamboo Monarch’s disciples.","Zheng Kaiyuan felt his legs tremble with every step. The group that he was approaching had a status so high that he would never be able to compare to them.","Not even Miao Zhuo, who Zheng Kaiyuan had to keep his head lowered around, could compare to those young men’s status.","Otherwise, Miao Zhuo would not have suffered a soul injury after making the slightest mistake.","Zong Ze immediately frowned when he saw Zheng Kaiyuan walking over.","The cold and distant Zong Ze always hated people approaching him at such events. Hence, his expression started to become colder. He would have yelled at Zheng Kaiyuan to get lost if this was any other time.","Zong Ze was unaware of the confrontation that had taken place outside the palace and did not know what kind of relationship Zheng Kaiyuan and Lin Yuan had.","If Zheng Kaiyuan turned out to be Lin Yuan’s friend, Zong Ze’s explosion of anger would be seen as rude. As such, Zong Ze suppressed his annoyance,","Liu Jie instinctively stepped in front of Lin Yuan when he saw Zheng Kaiyuan approaching.","He had not forgotten about how he and the rest of Lin Yuan’s group had been attacked outside Indigo Azure City.","Jiao Hanzhong had been from the Zheng family’s third lineage and technically did not have a direct connection to Zheng Kaiyuan.","However, Zheng Kaiyuan had been the one who sent Nightmare VI. This had led to the enmity between Zheng Kaiyuan and them.","If they were not currently outside the Midnight Palace and it was inappropriate for Liu Jie to publicly attack Zheng Kaiyuan despite being the Midnight Palace’s Young Liege, Zheng Kaiyuan would have been a dead man.","Zheng Kaiyuan was about to tentatively greet the group and was surprised by Chief Guard Ye’s disciple’s standoffishness.","Could it be because of that confrontation?","Miao Zhuo had been the main instigator of the confrontation, and all he had done was stand next to Miao Zhuo.","When Lin Yuan saw Zheng Kaiyuan timidly walking over, he immediately knew what Zheng Kaiyuan wanted to do.","A knowing smile appeared on Lin Yuan face, and he gestured to Zheng Kaiyuan, saying, “If you have something to say, come over to say it,”","Zheng Kaiyuan’s timidness turned to surprised happiness.","Liu Jie looked at Lin Yuan in confusion as he did not understand what Lin Yuan was trying to do.","Lin Yuan and Zheng Kaiyuan quickly exchanged contact information and did not engage Zheng Kaiyuan any further.","After his identity was announced at the Guard Ye Banquet, the Miao family would definitely try to come up with ways to apologize to him and Liu Jie.","Lin Yuan had not rejected Zheng Kaiyuan’s attempt to talk to him and even exchanged contact details because he wanted the other disciples of veteran and top factions to get the wrong idea that he and Zheng Kaiyuan had formed a connection. He also wanted to give the Miao family a way to contact him so that he would be able to sit and wait for them to walk into his trap.","There was more than one way to defeat one’s enemies. A conniving poisonous scheme always produced a more devastating effect than a direct confrontation.","At that moment, Zuo Ming and You Zhe led the rest of the Martial Arts Stage’s participants out of the long corridor to the area outside the palace.","Lin Yuan took a deep breath, for he knew that the real battle was about to begin."]},{"number":870,"title":"Chapter 870 - Rhine Lifeforms Sheng Yin","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","A tall girl followed right behind Zuo Ming and You Zhe.","She looked to be about 25 years old, had mature features, an elegant figure, and seemed to be pondering a question as she walked.","She quickened her pace to catch up to You Zhe and asked, “Lord You Zhe, how long did the first and second place winners of the Arts Stage component take to finish their topics?”","You Zhe told her tall girl how long Lin Yuan and Zong Ze had taken.","The entire area outside the Midnight Palace had quietened when Zuo Ming and You Zhe emerged from the long corridor.","The girl was not far from Lin Yuan, and the area outside the Midnight Palace was rather quiet. As such, Lin Yuan clearly heard what she had said.","His eyebrow twitched.","In spite of her mature features, the tall girl had a very child-like and high-pitched voice.","Lin Yuan could sense strong ripples from the tall girl’s vitality.","He found the ripples of vitality to be extremely familiar.","Whenever Lin Yuan used the Jasmine Lily’s Vitality Imprint, his body became the conductor of the enormous amount of vitality and would continue to radiate vitality even after all the vitality in the Vitality Imprint had been depleted.","The tall girl must have used some sort of secret weapon while completing her topic for the Arts Stage component.","If Lin Yuan’s calculation was accurate, she had taken 39 minutes and 27 seconds to complete the topic.","This meant that she had been three minutes quicker than Long Tao. Evidently, she possessed strong Creation Master powers.","The tall girl was wearing green spirit qi clothes that had hundreds of images of healing-type feys on them.","The images did not seem to be printed with any pattern, but they made the green spirit qi clothes stand out in a charming way.","Lin Yuan knew that this tall girl came from the top faction Rhine Lifeform from the icons on her collar.","Rhine Lifeform had unquestionable authority and respect in the Radiance Federation.","Every three years, there was a re-ranking of top factions.","In the last century, Rhine Lifeform had remained securely amongst the top three, and the furthest they had ever fallen was from first place to third place.","Rhine Lifeforce’s Rhine Guild Club was the champions of last year’s S Tournament.","Long Tao noticed Lin Yuan staring at the tall girl from Rhine Lifeforce and said, “That girl’s name is Sheng Yin. She’s the young disciple with the most potential in Rhine Lifeforce and the one carrying the entire younger generation of Rhine Lifeforce on her back. Although she isn’t in the Radiance Hundred Sequence, she is well known amongst the young disciples and leads Rhine Guild Club’s team during tournaments. Despite never fighting, she handles all of the Rhine Guild Club’s combat strategies.”","Lin Yuan immediately thought of Shi Xu.","Shi Xu was Sequence #8 in the Radiance Hundred Sequence and a member of the Rhine Guild Club’s main team.","“Given Sheng Yin’s age and power, she’s definitely up to the standard of the Radiance Hundred Sequence. However, she has never entered the selection. If she did, White Devil would never be crowned as the strongest healing-type spirit qi professional in the Radiance Hundred Sequence. Rumor has it that Sheng Yin possesses an Order of Radiant Light. Taking into consideration the limitations of healing-type spirit qi professionals’ abilities, Sheng Yin can very well become one of the ten Radiance Knights even if she fails to become a Radiance Envoy,” said Long Tao with a hint of fear in his voice.","Lin Yuan sensed that Long Tao saw Sheng Yin as his rival and made a mental note of her name.","After the disciples following Zuo Ming and You Zhe dispersed, the girls crowded around Sheng Yin.","Sheng Yin smiled sweetly and greeted every girl around her. She seemed to be very popular.","According to the Martial Arts Stage’s rules, she had officially achieved third place in the Martial Arts Stage and did not need to participate in the Martial Stage component.","She would be able to receive the third-place prize of 90 drops of Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar that could cleanse a body’s impurities and 10 drops that could cleanse a soul’s impurities.","All the attention inside and out of the Midnight Palace was now focused on Lin Yuan and Zong Ze.","Lin Yuan felt his passion rising within him.","He had spent the last few months increasing his power and secret weapons for the sake of the impending battle.","In contrast to Lin Yuan’s passion, the battle fanatic Zong Ze was extremely calm now after smelling that special fragrance.","For some reason, Zong Ze was completely entranced by this special fragrance. Or rather, he really liked the feeling of standing next to this young man.","The final battle of the Martial Arts Stage would be between him and Lin Yuan, and he would probably be unable to smell this fragrance during the fight.","At that time, his bad habit would flare up again, and the thrill of battle would completely and uncontrollably consume him.","After Zong Ze had completed his topic for the Arts Stage component, he had naturally assumed that he had secured first place.","It was only afterward that he found out that the first place had already been snatched from him. Hence, Zong Ze was focused on someone else for once and wanted to know who the first-place winner was.","He did not expect the winner to have been that young man with the scent that could soothe his bad luck.","In a way, Zong Ze felt that a special kind of fate connected him and Lin Yuan.","Nonetheless, he was a very competitive person and was determined to make a comeback after his loss during the Arts Stage component.","Zuo Ming walked toward the area where the Martial Stage had been held and announced, “The Arts Stage component of the Martial Arts Stage has officially ended. Lord Lin Yuan and Lord Zong Ze, please come onto the Martial Stage to complete the Martial Stage component of the Martial Arts Stage.”","Zuo Ming’s words made the veteran and top factions’ young disciples inhale sharply when they heard Zuo Ming address Lin Yuan as ‘Lord Lin Yuan’."]},{"number":871,"title":"Chapter 871 - Life-Changing Fire Beast (Source Fire)","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Moreover, Lin Yuan had been mentioned before Zong Ze. This meant that Zuo Ming was silently indicating that Lin Yuan had a higher status than Zong Ze.","Everyone present started to make guesses about Lin Yuan’s identity again.","Many disciples of top factions had heard from their elders that the Moon Empress’ disciple might be making an appearance at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Now, it seemed as though Lin Yuan was definitely the Moon Empress’ disciple.","The veteran factions’ disciples were still unsure about Lin Yuan’s identity.","Although the news had not been leaked, the veteran factions’ disciples had heard that the blood moon that had risen a few months ago had had something to do with the Moon Empress’ mysterious disciple.","Zong Ze stepped toward Zuo Ming, but a thought seemed to strike him moments later that made him halt his steps and turn around.","Although he did not explicitly invite Lin Yuan, he was clearly waiting for him to go up together.","Since Zong Ze had already joined the group, Long Tao, Li Xuan, Gao Feng, and Sun Ningxiang cheered on Zong Ze despite being closer to Lin Yuan.","Liu Jie did not move from Lin Yuan’s side as he gave Lin Yuan some words of encouragement.","Liu Jie’s actions made Gu Lang raise an eyebrow in surprise.","For the sake of appearances, the best choice was to encourage both parties. However, the fact that Liu Jie only cheered Lin Yuan on meant that he was extremely biased toward Lin Yuan and that they had a very good relationship.","Gu Lang had only recently gotten to know Lin Yuan and was closer to Zong Ze.","Nonetheless, Gu Lang still said, “Zong Ze, Lin Yuan, good luck to the both of you! Zong Ze, if you lose to Lin Yuan due to a lack of skill, why don’t you personally cook a feast for us at Kitchen Fragrance Palace?”","Zong Ze glared at Gu Lang for a second. He felt that Gu Lang was taking advantage of him. However, he was more than happy to treat Lin Yuan to a meal.","But when he thought about how he had caused Gu Lang to give up on the Martial Arts Stage, Zong Ze nodded in agreement.","Long Tao, Gao Feng, Li Xuan, and Sun Ningxiang had been completely excluded. They did not have a high enough status to be invited to a place like Kitchen Fragrance Palace.","“If Zong Ze loses to Lin Yuan, he’ll have to fulfill his promise of cooking the Kitchen Fragrance Palace’s 360 dishes. I’ll invite the two of you to try Zong Ze’s cooking. He might be cold and distant, but his cooking skills are unrivaled,” said Gu Lang.","Liu Jie looked indignant behind his mask.","No one cooks better than me! Lin Yuan always sings endless praises of my food. I’ll have to find a chance to compete with Zong Ze.","Due to his special sacred source lifeform, Liu Jie could not use his sacred source lifeform during a fight against Zong Ze.","If Zong Ze made the first move with his sacred source lifeform, he would not be able to fight back.","But if they competed in cooking, there was no guarantee that Zong Ze would win even if he was Chef Supreme’s disciple.","He was the man who had all the stomachs in Return from Faraway Mansion wrapped around his finger.","Before Zheng Kaiyuan had come to the Guard Ye Banquet, what he wanted the most was to steal the spotlight.","But as he stood amongst this group that had all eyes on them, he felt heavy pressure resting on his shoulders.","The people who cared the most about status were the most aware of the burden that came with it.","Every look from the top factions’ young disciples was like an additional sandbag of pressure on Zheng Kaiyuan’s back. He broke out in cold sweat but raised his head as high as he could to try to look like he fit in with the group.","When he saw everyone cheering on Lin Yuan and Zong Ze, Zheng Kaiyuan hastily joined in.","But one sour look from Zong Ze and Zheng Kaiyuan anxiously backed away.","He remembered that it was Lin Yuan who had called him over, so he bravely stuck by Lin Yuan’s side.","The sharp-tongued Zheng Kaiyuan stammered, “Lo... Lord Lin Yuan, good... good luck.”","Lin Yuan looked deeply into Zheng Kaiyuan’s eyes. This gaze from Lin Yuan made Zheng Kaiyuan feel flustered for some reason.","A young man’s pleasant voice said by Zheng Kaiyuan’s ear, “You have to do your best too.”","Do his best and become a conveyor belt for communication.","People were destined to become frivolous after they gained a step up in society.","To those who had a low status, they would become envious. To those who were of a higher status, they would become resentful.","If the leader of the Miao family personally approached Zheng Kaiyuan, the latter would gain indisputable authority in the Miao family and Zheng family.","Lin Yuan had been observing Zheng Kaiyuan from the moment he called him over to join the group and knew that he was by no means a humble person.","He was not afraid that Zheng Kaiyuan would go crazy with power in the Miao family and Zheng family. In fact, he was afraid that Zheng Kaiyuan would not be crazy enough.","In the end, Lin Yuan would not even need to lift a finger to finish off Zheng Kaiyuan.","Once a building became tall enough, it would not even need to be pushed to collapse.","The higher the tower, the more seriously hurt the person standing atop of it would become when the tower collapsed.","Lin Yuan wondered what kind of horrible fate awaited Zheng Kaiyuan from the Miao family and the Zheng family.","Resentment turned into a monstrous creature when it reached its peak.","Lin Yuan was always good to his friends, but he felt that no amount of brutal torture was enough for his enemies.","As he stood opposite Zong Ze on the Martial Stage in front of everyone, Lin Yuan took a deep breath and focused his entire body into a combat-ready state.","Now that Zong Ze was apart from Lin Yuan, his obsession for combat bubbled up again.","After Zuo Ming announced the start of the battle, Zong Ze immediately summoned two feys.","One of the feys was a small palm-sized orange mouse that did not enter the combat area after it was summoned. Instead, it climbed up to Zong Ze’s shoulder and started squeaking as though it was watching a show.","The other fey was an enormous viscous granular creature that constantly changed its shape.","In the short time after it was summoned, the enormous viscous granular creature had already changed into the shape of seven or eight different beasts.","Every time it changed its shape, the viscous creature would release the aura that was unique to that beast."]},{"number":872,"title":"Chapter 872 - These Flames Are Far From Being Strong Enough!","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan instinctively used True Data to check on the small orange mouse and the shapeshifting viscous granular creature.","[Fey Name]: Fiery Sky Hou","[Fey Species]: Furry-species/toothed-beast species","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Fire","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy V","Abilities:","[Swallow Fire]: Swallow strange flames to increase its own fire element and change it according to the characteristics of the strange flames it had swallowed.","[Flame Laser]: Pure fire-elemental energy will be condensed into a laser that will be fired from the eyes. The target hit by the laser will feel as though they are on fire.","[Tempering of Fire]: The energy in the strange flames can be extracted to temper any kind of flame and evolve it. The body will also be strengthened while the flames are being tempered.","[Flame of Revival]: All fire-elemental energy will be condensed into flames that have the ability to burn vitality.","[Group Fire Heart Flames]: By giving up flames with special abilities, a fire that can burn the mind and spirit will be produced that can be used on a target. When the target’s mind and spirit are almost burned up, flames will erupt from inside the target.","[Flame Conduction]: Fire energy can be transferred onto other fire-type feys and trigger spontaneous transformation.","Exclusive Skill:","[Strange Flames Eight Refinement]: The eight flames can become the flames of roots that will be released as an attack on a target. The eight flames will continuously layer over each other to produce an eight-timed attack.","[Dreamland of Fire]: All the flames in the body will be activated, and every flame will become a tile that creates a territory. The effects of the flames will be magnified while in the territory.","...","[Fey Name]: Life-Changing Fire Beast (Source Fire)","[Fey Species]: Elemental-species/elemental-genus","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Fire/Source","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy III","Abilities:","[Metal Refinement]: Swallow metal and refine it with fire to form sticky lava.","[Beast Shape Naturalization]: After swallowing the bloodline energy from a beast, the lava creature’s powers will increase, and the shapeshifted lava creature can use different fire attacks based on the bloodline characteristics.","[Beast Bloodline Fusion]: All the different beast bloodlines can be combined to use all the different abilities.","[Fire of Change]: After the Life-Changing Fire Beast sustains a lethal attack, it can be revived as long as it receives a supply of fire-elemental energy.","[Burst of Flames]: Fire-elemental energy can be spewed out by consuming metal. When burning a target, the fluid metal will be hardened into a weapon that can be used to attack the target.","[Transformation Festival]: The Life-Changing Fire Beast will sacrifice half the fire-elemental energy in its body to trigger the second exclusive skill, Lava Demon God.","Exclusive Skill:","[Separation of Flames]: After sustaining a lethal attack, the Life-Changing Fire Beast will split its body that can be made into a new body after using the bloodline of the beast feys stored in its body. The number of times the Life-Changing Fire Beast’s body can be split is dependant on the number of bloodlines in its body.","[Lava Demon God]: Pure flame energy can be used to trigger the fusion of all the beast fey bloodlines in the Life-Changing Fire Beast’s body and result in the evolution of a lava monster. The Lava Demon God can attack a target with complete accuracy.","While Lin Yuan was checking on the two feys’ attributes, the enormous lava creature had become a 4-meter-long and 2-meter-tall tiger that roared and charged toward him.","When the tiger roared, it released blazing fire-elemental energy that burned all the air on the Martial Stage.","If Zuo Ming had not set up a barrier, the top and veteran factions’ young disciples would also have been burned.","Every young disciple, including Liu Jie, let out a gasp of astonishment.","Although Zong Ze had already started attacking, Lin Yuan still had not summoned any feys.","Just as the blazing fire-elemental energy was about to swallow Lin Yuan, even louder gasps of shock sounded out.","Despite having been groomed to have proper manners since they were young, the veteran and top factions’ disciples could not help but curse.","“Damn! Lord Zong Ze summoned feys and started attacking the instant that Lord Zuo Ming announced the start of the match. Why hasn’t Lin Yuan summoned any feys?”","“Crap! This blazing fire-elemental energy can even melt Platinum metal-type spiritual ingredients. Is Lin Yuan going to be burnt to a crisp?”","Sun Ningxiang and Gao Feng did not anticipate such an aggressive attack from Zong Ze. They were now in a state of panic as they continued to watch the fight unfold.","When he saw Lin Yuan about to be consumed by the flames, Liu Jie moved on instinct and was about to charge onto the Martial Stage.","At that moment, a pair of hands landed on his shoulder, and Gu Lang said in a gentle voice, “Don’t be controlled by your emotions. As the Young Liege of the Midnight Palace, don’t you trust in Lord Zuo Ming’s ability to control the situation? If Lin Yuan is really in trouble, I’m sure that Lord Zuo Ming will be the most anxious of us all.”","Liu Jie clenched his fist and gnashed his teeth as he continued to watch the fight.","Just like how anxious Liu Jie was, the Moon Empress was also supremely shocked when she saw the sea of flames flowing toward Lin Yuan.","However, she composed herself when Lin Yuan raised his fist and smashed down toward the tiger-shaped fey formed from the Life-Changing Fire Beast.","Lin Yuan was completely unaffected by the scorching flames, as though he had not felt the heat at all.","After Lin Yuan’s punch, the enormous tiger-shaped fey flew backward like a cannon and crashed against the Suzerain hades etutitsorp floor.","Lin Yuan cartwheeled until he was right in front of Zong Ze, who was engrossed in the fervent battle. He smiled and said, “If you want to harm me, these flames are far from being strong enough.”"]},{"number":873,"title":"Chapter 873 - Snake Change Medusa","paragraphs":["The veteran and top factions’ disciples that were initially scared for Lin Yuan were now in shock.","“Oh my God! Is Lin Yuan a fey in human form? How can he blast away such a huge lava tiger while remaining unscathed? Although Lord Zuo Ming’s barrier blocks the full heat of the flames, the Life-Changing Fire Beast is still a Diamond X/Fantasy III source-type lifeform. Moreover, Lord Zong Ze was the one who evolved the Source Fire into this Life-Changing Fire Beast.”","A chain of gasps was let out from the area outside the Midnight Palace, the most concentrated sounds coming from the cluster of female disciples who were standing around Sheng Yin.","All the young female disciples selected to attend the Guard Ye Banquet were princesses in their own right. They had all proven themselves better than their male counterpart disciples, and their families had invested a lot into them.","Although they had no shortage of male suitors, they were always more attracted by men that were more outstanding than themselves.","The eyes of everyone outside the Midnight Palace were fixed on the Martial Stage.","Regardless of their background, the two finalists of the Martial Arts Stage were seen as more powerful than the winners of the Arts Stage and Martial Stage.","Both Lin Yuan and Zong Ze had above-average looks and unique charms.","With his crimson half-armor, cold countenance, and obsession for battle, Zong Ze was full of wild savagery.","Lin Yuan was normally calm, but his occasional radiant smile was bright enough to blind. Moreover, he had a refreshing and natural aura that made the 24- and 25-year-old women want to reach out to pat him.","“Sister Sheng Yin, I can’t believe Lord Zong Ze is at a disadvantage right from the start.”","Sheng Yin immediately replied, “This isn’t proof of anything because they’re still feeling each other out. Zong Ze is definitely more powerful than this.”","In spite of her high-pitched voice, she sounded firm.","She thought back to two years ago when Gu Lang had invited her to a Class 3 marsh dimensional rift to help out as a healing-type spirit qi professional.","Before the mission had started, Sheng Yin had already been aware that the goal was to capture the Snake Change Medusa.","No matter how high the Snake Change Medusa’s grade evolved to, it would remain as a dimensional lifeform with a half-human form.","Normally, spirit qi professionals could not form contracts with dimensional lifeforms unless the dimensional lifeform had undergone a special mutation.","The Snake Change Medusa was a dimensional lifeform that spirit qi professionals could contract.","After mutating, the Snake Change Medusa turned into a snake and looked like any other snake-species fey. But since it had the powers of Medusa, it was extremely powerful and rare.","Gu Lang had been extremely interested in the Snake Change Medusa at that time. However, he did not expect its bloodline to be exceptionally powerful. Before it evolved, it had already reached Suzerain.","After evolving, the Snake Change Medusa would no longer be a dimensional lifeform. Thus, it would not be repelled by the dimensional rift or cause the dimensional rift to evolve.","Since it had been two years ago, she had been completely overwhelmed by the power of the Suzerain Snake Change Medusa.","Back then, Sheng Yin had seen a deadly fire.","Thousands of columns of flames had risen toward the sky as blinding crimson light flashed intermittently. The Suzerain Snake Change Medusa had been burnt almost to ashes and was finally stored away by Gu Lang in a fey storage box.","That was the first time that Sheng Yin had been dumbfounded by the power of someone around her age.","Ever since that time, Zong Ze had become Sheng Yin’s idol.","Nonetheless, not even Sheng Yin knew what secret weapon Lin Yuan possessed that gave him strong fire resistance.","Although Zong Ze had not used his full strength, the heat of the Diamond X/Fantasy III","Life-Changing Fire Beast’s flames were not to be looked down upon.","These flames would be able to incinerate any fey below Diamond/Fantasy. Even feys of the same level as the Life-Changing Fire Beast would not be able to escape unscathed.","As a Creation Master, Sheng Yin was certain that Lin Yuan was not a fey, nor did he have the bloodline of a fey. This was because she could not detect any fey aura or beast patterns from him.","He was a regular human spirit qi professional. This proved that the power he was wielding all came from the feys he had contracted.","One of Lin Yuan’s feys must have enabled him to have such strong resistance against fire.","Their brief interaction did not allow Sheng Yin to study him carefully enough.","A young girl’s voice sounded out from near Sheng Yin’s ear, “Sister Sheng Yin, I’m declaring that henceforth, Lin Yuan shall be my darling! His cartwheel was too cool!”","At that moment, Sheng Yin inhaled sharply and noticed why something had seemed to be off.","Although his strong resistance to fire was due to his fey, the fighting strategies and combat skills were all of his own.","Could this young man be a martial arts genius?","During the Spirit Qi Awakening era, it was a complete waste of time to train in combat skills and fighting strategies.","The noise from the crowd had reached a crescendo, yet Lin Yuan and Zong Ze looked to be completely unaffected.","Despite being affected by his bad luck, which caused him to become a battle fanatic, Zong Ze remained clear-headed.","In fact, his mind became even more active while he was fighting.","He had attacked Lin Yuan because he knew that the latter would be able to handle it. However, he had not anticipated that Lin Yuan would receive the attack in such a manner and even launch a counterattack.","Zong Ze really liked the feeling of being around Lin Yuan and the fragrance that seemed to follow Lin Yuan.","Additionally, with his love of battle, Zong Ze felt that being able to spar with Lin Yuan was a blessing from heaven.","As such, Zong Ze’s focus intensified, and he said to Lin Yuan, “Since you don’t think my flames are strong enough, the real blaze is about to light up!”"]},{"number":874,"title":"Chapter 874 - Unspeakable Miracle","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zong Ze said softly to the orange mouse on his shoulder, “Fiery Sky Hou, use Flame Conduction!”","The small orange mouse was set on fire, and the image of two orange flames appeared on the small mouse’s forehead while another flame image appeared on the body of the fallen Life-Changing Fire Beast.","Suddenly, the temperature on the Martial Stage spiked, and even Lin Yuan could feel the pressure of the heat pressing down on him.","Beads of sweat pooled all over Lin Yuan’s body.","However, this level of heat was still bearable for Lin Yuan, and he was not worried about the rising heat at all.","Lin Yuan had yet to use the Myth III Icy Flames Law that was carved on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","All of Lin Yuan’s current resistance to fire was due to the effects of having contracted the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","After he used True Data to check on the Fiery Sky Hou and Life-Changing Fire Beast, Lin Yuan decided not to use the Icy Flames Law’s fire resistance.","Because of the Life-Changing Fire Beast, the battle between Lin Yuan and Zong Ze was destined to go on for some time.","Now that Lin Yuan was a B-rank spirit qi professional, he was the same rank as Zong Ze and could go all out in this fight.","Lin Yuan saw this fight as a test of his power. He had gathered many secret weapons but had not had the chance to use or train any of them. As such, he had no idea what the true extent of power his secret weapons had.","This was not advantageous for a spirit qi professional.","Zong Ze’s Life-Changing Fire Beast emerged from the Source Fire’s evolution, which was a source-type lifeform just like the Source Sand.","However, from the information on True Data, the conditions for contracting the Source Fire had been extremely different from the conditions to contract the Source Sand.","The Source Fire had consumed a large amount of metal spiritual ingredients to gain its viscous lava body.","The Life-Changing Fire Beast had used Beast Shape Naturalization to trigger the bloodlines in its body to turn into the tiger-form.","As the flames on its body increased, the enormous lava tiger roared again and charged toward Lin Yuan.","Just like how Zong Ze had not used his full power, Lin Yuan’s punch had also only been a test of his power.","Spirit Essence Explosion inflicted damage through the accumulation and explosion of spirit qi—the purer the spirit qi, the more explosive the attack.","Lin Yuan’s spirit qi had reached a significantly high level of purity.","This time, Lin Yuan did not skimp on the spiritual power and focused a large amount of spiritual power into his left fist.","His muscles reacted on instinct, and his agile body allowed him to move at a sharp angle to dodge the large lava tiger’s aggressive attack while simultaneously landing a heavy blow on the large lava tiger’s chin.","Lin Yuan’s strike decimated the large lava tiger’s shape, and his overwhelming power blasted a hole in the large lava tiger’s fluid body.","The clearly injured large lava tiger let out a savage roar, and a lava antelope with long sharp antlers burst forth from the hole and charged at Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s right fist seemed to have anticipated the impending attack and sailed forward to strike against the lava antelope’s antlers.","The lava antelope flew backward.","The crushed large lava tiger and lava antelope split apart, and a lava wolf leaped forth.","Lin Yuan knew that the result of the Life-Changing Fire Beast using Beast Shape Naturalization and Separation of Flames.","As long as the Life-Changing Fire Beast had enough beast fey bloodlines, the Life-Changing Fire Beast would be able to constantly deflect damage.","Lin Yuan took a deep breath and relaxed all the muscles in his body.","He leaped into the air and waved his fist as he attacked.","Liu Jie could not help but gulp. He did not expect the ever-happy Lin Yuan to fight in such a violent manner.","Zong Ze took Lin Yuan’s attacks seriously. Although the Life-Changing Fire Beast could use Separation of Fire to deflect damage, Zong Ze could still sense the terrifying power from Lin Yuan’s fist.","Even if Zong Ze instructed the Life-Changing Fire Beast to split into the large lava tiger, lava antelope, and lava wolf to dodge Lin Yuan’s fists, Lin Yuan was agile enough to follow up with a successive attack.","Lin Yuan had also been able to dodge all of the large lava wolf, lava antelope, and lava wolf’s attacks. He was unaffected by heat and could avoid all the physical attacks from the beasts that the Life-Changing Fire Beast turned into.","This was a huge problem for Zong Ze. Lin Yuan was like a slippery eel that he could not grab hold of.","A few more clashes took place.","Lin Yuan punched the lava water buffalo, and it turned into a shapeless pile of lava that did not turn into another beast.","Lin Yuan, who was dripping buckets of sweat, said, “It looks like your Life-Changing Fire Beast absorbed the bloodlines of eight beast feys.”","Even while talking, his attacks were clean and flawless.","He mercilessly slammed his fists down on every inch of the Life-Changing Fire Beast.","The eight piles of lava rolled around on the ground but could not take the shape of any beasts.","It was clear that it was seriously injured.","After his relentless attacks, Lin Yuan was now completely out of spiritual power.","His attacks had impacted not just the Life-Changing Fire Beast but also the hearts of the top and veteran factions’ disciples who were watching.","The previously noisy area outside the Midnight Palace was now pin-drop silent, and everyone was staring at Lin Yuan as though he was some kind of unspeakable miracle.","Zong Ze smiled when he saw the extraordinary passion on Lin Yuan’s face. He did not seem to be worried about the Life-Changing Fire Beast’s injuries at all.","“Every punch of yours should require 0.05% of a B-rank spirit qi professional’s spirit qi. You’ve made 21 punches and should be completely out of spirit qi by now. Life-Changing Fire Beast, use Fire of Change!”","At that moment, the imprint on the small orange mouse on Zong Ze’s shoulder became brighter, and a faint orange flame lit up around the imprint on the Life-Changing Fire Beast."]},{"number":875,"title":"Chapter 875 - The Blue Poison Flame Puppet That Fell on the Martial Stage","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","From the moment the orange flames lit up, the shapeless pile of lava quickly turned into the large lava tiger.","The other seven piles of lava flew toward the large lava tiger and sunk into its body with another roar.","It was as though Lin Yuan’s previous attacks had been useless.","Lin Yuan swung his fists around. Recently, he had been so busy with nurturing feys that he had not had the chance to stretch his limbs. He felt much more comfortable now after moving his body.","After hearing what Zong Ze said, Lin Yuan softly replied, “You’re right. After 21 punches, all my spirit qi should have been used up.”","While Lin Yuan was speaking, something seemed to unlock within him.","Solid spiritual power flowed from inside Lin Yuan’s body and whipped up a hurricane on the Martial Stage.","Suddenly, Zong Ze felt the spiritual power in his body was no longer circulating as quickly. He frowned and looked at Lin Yuan in disbelief as he said, “Spirit Suppression!”","When spiritual power was released, a kind of pressure was exerted.","But even the explosion of spiritual power from A-rank spirit qi professionals did not result in a noticeable pressure.","But now, Zong Ze could clearly sense pressure being exerted on his spiritual power. He could not imagine how much spiritual power was circulating inside Lin Yuan’s body.","Due to Zuo Ming’s barrier, no one else besides Zong Ze could feel the pressure coming from Lin Yuan.","However, everyone had clearly heard what Zong Ze had said.","Lin Yuan’s activation of the Spirit Qi Imprint was not without sacrifice.","But the sacred source lifeform prize was worth it for Lin Yuan to be unable to use the Spirit Qi Imprint for a long time afterward.","Moreover, there was also the Order of Radiant Light.","Today, Lin Yuan was going to go all out and put everything he had into this fight.","Zong Ze sensed the change in Lin Yuan’s body and immediately issued a new order to the Life-Changing Fire Beast.","“Life-Changing Fire Beast, use Beast Bloodline Fusion!”","The large lava tiger immediately returned to its original shapeless blob. The pile of lava squirmed and grew larger along with the increase of fire-elemental energy. Finally, it became an enormous beast with the features of eight different beasts that immediately lunged at Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan dispelled the Spirit Qi Imprint. Now that he had sufficient spiritual power, Lin Yuan did not hold back and gathered all the spirit qi he had into his fists.","His fists were wrapped in spirit qi, and the air around his fists started to ripple.","But just as Lin Yuan was about to leap toward the Life-Changing Fire Beast, he felt a distinct rise in the temperature of the flames around the Life-Changing Fire Beast’s body.","If he did not use the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt now, his future would be a painfully fiery one. Hence, Lin Yuan activated the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt the moment that the Life-Changing Fire Beast charged at him.","The second after he activated the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, he felt as though he had returned to the state he had been in when he first stepped onto the Martial Stage.","He could not feel the surrounding heat at all.","Lin Yuan sighed to himself.","This truly is the power of a Myth III law!","When Lin Yuan clashed against the Life-Changing Fire Beast, Zong Ze yelled, “Life-Changing Fire Beast, Burst of Flames!”","Zong Ze had also contracted a sacred source lifeform. Thus, he sensed the aura of a sacred source lifeform from Lin Yuan when he activated the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","Zong Ze did not find this strange as he had long guessed that Lin Yuan should have contracted a sacred source lifeform. In truth, it put Zong Ze at ease that Lin Yuan had used his sacred source lifeform so soon, and he used his Creation Master abilities to check on Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform’s abilities.","After Zong Ze issued his order to the Life-Changing Fire Beast, the fire-elemental energy around it poured forth. Yet, Lin Yuan still did not flinch.","At that moment, the Life-Changing Fire Beast turned into a hedgehog that shot out small balls of lava.","Although the small balls of lava cooled in the air, they became various red weapons.","Lin Yuan immediately jumped back and used various techniques to avoid the flying weapons, including striking with several punches.","After the rain of weapons, Lin Yuan was still unharmed.","Lin Yuan did not sense that anything was strange.","Everyone, including Zong Ze, saw the silhouette of a woman superimposed on Lin Yuan. This silhouette was ten meters tall and had its eyes closed as its skirt billowed. Its arms seemed to be wrapping around Lin Yuan.","The silhouette seemed to be in a protective posture.","The appearance of this silhouette shattered the short-lived silence in the area outside the Midnight Palace.","“That has to be a sacred source lifeform! Is this sacred source lifeform the reason Lin Yuan can emerge from the rain of weapons unscathed?”","The young disciples outside the Midnight Palace who were watching the fight started to discuss in earnest.","Meanwhile, Gu Lang and Sheng Yin were silent because they realized that their Creation Master powers were insufficient to check on Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform.","The sacred source lifeform’s powers had blocked all their investigative abilities.","Zuo Ming’s barrier could not block the sacred source lifeform’s aura, and Gu Lang was certain that Lin Yuan’s aura was the same as that of his sacred source lifeform.","However, Lin Yuan’s resistance to fire and fighting skills had been displayed before the sacred source lifeform was summoned.","Unlike Gu Lang, who was observing the battle from an external standpoint, Zong Ze had summoned a fairy-type source-type lifeform with blue flames around its body the moment that Lin Yuan had dodged the rain of weapons.","The blue flames around the fairy-type source-type lifeform retracted right after it was summoned and were transferred into the gem on the fairy-type source-type lifeform’s forehead.","At the same time, the Life-Changing Fire Beast used Transformation Festival and activated the dormant Lava Demon God.","The Life-Changing Fire Beast turned into the mouth of a volcano as it spat out boulders of lava.","The boulders of lava turned into different beasts that galloped toward Lin Yuan’s half of the Martial Stage.","While Lava Demon God was in action, the gem on the fairy-type source-type lifeform’s forehead shone brighter until it eventually shot a brilliant laser at Lin Yuan.","There was absolutely no time or opening for Lin Yuan to dodge.","But what happened next utterly stupefied Zong Ze.","Not only was Lin Yuan once again unharmed, but the Blue Poison Flame Puppet that he had summoned was now severely injured.. Its blue eyes were completely dull, and its wings stopped flapping as it collapsed on the hades etutitsorp floor of the Martial Stage."]},{"number":876,"title":"Chapter 876 - Zong Zes Guess","paragraphs":["Zong Ze stared at the dull-eyed and motionless Blue Poison Flame Puppet for a moment before his head snapped toward Lin Yuan.","The Blue Poison Flame Puppet was a special offense-type source-type lifeform, and the blue flames around its body had a large amount of fire poison.","The Blue Poison Flame Puppet’s fire poison could immediately fill a target’s cells and dry them up, leaving the target in a dehydrated state. The ferocious flames would then reduce the dehydrated target to ashes.","The Blue Poison Flame Puppet was also skilled at spiritual combat. The laser it had shot out was its combat ability, Blue Marvelous Laser.","However, after the Blue Marvelous Laser was shot out, the recoil seriously injured the Blue Poison Flame Puppet.","This was why it immediately fell into a near-death state after releasing the laser once.","Spiritual recoil usually only happened to feys with weak spiritual energy and strong combat power.","Although the Blue Poison Flame Puppet was only Diamond VIII/Fantasy II and could not compare to the Life-Changing Fire Beast in terms of grade and quality, its type was Fire/Spiritual, and its spiritual power was three times stronger than the Life-Changing Fire Beast.","It could use its spiritual attacks to inflict great damage on the Life-Changing Fire Beast.","Judging from how strong the recoil was, Lin Yuan’s spiritual energy had to be at least five times stronger than the Blue Poison Flame Puppet.","However, Zong Ze felt that Lin Yuan should not have such strong spiritual energy.","If Lin Yuan really had such strong spiritual energy, he could nurture hundreds or even thousands of feys.","If he had really contracted that many feys, he only needed to summon all of them at once, and no one would be able to defeat him and his army.","This immense amount of spiritual energy seemed to be impossible, given the limitations that came with being human.","At the moment that the Blue Poison Flame Puppet’s laser had shot toward Lin Yuan, it had formed a momentary connection with Lin Yuan’s own spiritual energy.","During the fleeting connection, the Blue Poison Flame Puppet had experienced a terror that it had never felt before.","It was as though the Blue Poison Flame Puppet was a subordinate that had committed a grievous mistake.","The Blue Poison Flame Puppet that Zong Ze had contracted had an elite bloodline. From the moment it had hatched, it had two sets of wings.","Besides the legendary Myth Breed source-type lifeform with three sets of wings, the Blue Poison Flame Puppet’s bloodline was the most elite amongst source-type lifeforms.","Even Chef Supreme had said that it was very likely that the Blue Poison Flame Puppet would be able to grow a third set of wings if it was continuously nurtured.","Fairy-type source-type lifeforms were special lifeforms. They could hold their own against the might that came with the bloodlines of dragon-species feys and phoenix-species feys.","They might even be seen as unaffected by fey bloodlines.","But when it came to fairy bloodlines, fairy-type source-type lifeforms with a more elite bloodline held strong authority on fairy-type source-type lifeforms with less elite bloodlines.","Zong Ze had made use of this advantage countless times during battle.","Zong Ze started to guess to himself.? Could Lin Yuan have a fairy-type source-type lifeform with three sets of wings?","But as soon as this thought entered his mind, Zong Ze dismissed it as ridiculous.","Lin Yuan was a B-rank spirit qi professional. Even if he had used rolling grade on his own feys, the highest level of fey he could possess was Diamond X/Fantasy V.","It was unheard of for a fairy-type source-type lifeform below Myth Breed to have three sets of wings.","Chef Supreme had done significant research into fairy-type source-type lifeforms. As such, Zong Ze was more knowledgeable than others about the importance of their bloodlines.","If Lin Yuan had a fairy-type source-type lifeform with three sets of wings that was below Myth Breed, it would be even more precious than a sacred source lifeform.","Additionally, judging from Lin Yuan’s unharmed state, Zong Ze guessed that Lin Yuan also had a strong resistance against poison.","Fire poison was different from burns. The first was poison-type damage due to fire-type elements, while the other was pure burn damage.","From the moment Zong Ze had become a combat-class spirit qi professional, he had never felt so dejected during a battle.","As a spirit qi professional that was affiliated with fire-type and was limited by his talent, all the feys he contracted were fire-type feys.","Now that his most advantageous fire-type attacks had dampened in impact, this was a huge blow to Zong Ze’s fighting ability.","After Zong Ze checked on Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform, he felt as though he had learned all his Creation Master skills for nothing.","This was not the first time Zong Ze checked on another person’s sacred source lifeform. He was even able to check on Chef Supreme’s sacred source lifeform.","However, Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform was blocked by thousands of barriers of different strengths, and he could not get a single sense of it.","He started to guess that Lin Yuan’s resistance to spiritual damage could be due to his sacred source lifeform’s abilities.","In contrast to Zong Ze’s solemn expression, Lin Yuan was looking at the fallen Blue Poison Flame Puppet with a strange expression.","Zong Ze’s attack had been flawless, and Lin Yuan should not have been able to dodge it even with all the combat skills and fighting abilities in his body.","However, Zong Ze’s mistake was in using a spiritual attack.","Genius was a functional-type fey and did not have any combat skills. However, it did have a sea of spiritual energy that it used to memorize all the information in the world.","This mountain of spiritual energy would be unaffected by spiritual attacks.","Lin Yuan’s spiritual energy and Genius’ spiritual energy were connected through Spiritual Energy Expansion, and the Blue Poison Flame Puppet’s attack had merely scratched the connection between Lin Yuan and Genius’ spiritual energy.","The scratch was insignificant in the grand scheme of things.","Lin Yuan did not even feel a sting from the Blue Poison Flame Puppet’s laser.","If he had known that the Blue Poison Flame Puppet’s attack would have fire poison, Lin Yuan would have evolved the Myth II Vicious Poison Law to Myth III.","This sudden attack on Zong Ze’s part had resulted in the loss of one of his feys. This was extremely good news to Lin Yuan."]},{"number":877,"title":"Chapter 877 - Wilfulness Thanks to Spirit Qi!","paragraphs":["The veteran and top factions’ disciples who were watching were also astonished by the recent development.","They did not understand why the fairy-type source-type lifeform that Zong Ze had just summoned was now seriously injured.","Gu Lang’s expression was grim as he stared at Lin Yuan. The longer he looked, the more he felt like there was a thick fog lingering around Lin Yuan, blurring his image even more with every passing second.","Zong Ze had only contracted the Blue Poison Flame Puppet two years ago.","During the several times they had sparred, Gu Lang had been at a big disadvantage due to the Blue Poison Flame Puppet.","Yet, this troublesome fey had turned into Lin Yuan’s advantage over Zong Ze.","After the recent development, Gu Lang formed the same idea as Zong Ze and felt that Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform had the ability to defend against spiritual energy.","Zong Ze returned the barely-breathing Blue Poison Flame Puppet and Life-Changing Fire Beast to the spiritual spatial zone with a wave of his hand.","The Blue Poison Flame Puppet could no longer fight, and Lin Yuan had nullified the Life-Changing Fire Beast’s attack. It would only be a waste of Zong Ze’s spiritual power to continue to sustain the Life-Changing Fire Beast in its Lava Demon God state.","Zong Ze looked at Lin Yuan and said, “You’re really strong. But I’m going to use my ultimate move now.”","Instead of growling due to being in the heat of battle, Zong Ze’s voice was filled with joy. But not even Zong Ze was aware of this.","Lin Yuan smiled brightly and said, “Same here. I’m also going to use my ultimate move.”","While he was speaking, Lin Yuan looked at the Fiery Sky Hou on Zong Ze’s shoulder with pity.","True Data had stated that the Fiery Sky Hou’s Group Fire Heart Flames was an ability that was directed at the spirit and mind.","The Fiery Sky Hou had yet to enter the battle and had only applied Flame Conduction on the Life-Changing Fire Beast.","Lin Yuan guessed that the Fiery Sky Hou was one of Zong Ze’s secret weapons.","If the Fiery Sky Hou used Group Fire Heart Flames on him, it would also be hit by recoil and be forced to exit the battle.","From then, another one of Zong Ze’s secret weapons would have fallen.","But after experiencing what had happened to the Blue Poison Flame Puppet, it was unlikely that Zong Ze would use Group Fire Heart Flames on Lin Yuan.","However, the presence of the Fiery Sky Hou also allowed Lin Yuan to experience the peak power of the younger generation of disciples.","Zong Ze turned to say to Zuo Ming, “Senior Zuo Ming, please pay close attention to my next attack from the moment it’s released from my hands.”","A look of seriousness came over Zuo Ming.","“Lord Zong Ze, I will make sure to pay close attention to everything that happens on the Martial Stage and react as soon as possible to be best of my judgment.”","At first, Zuo Ming sounded normal, but his voice soon turned cold and hoarse.","Due to the barrier, Zong Ze and Lin Yuan did not sense this change in Zuo Ming’s aura. However, the other veteran and top factions’ disciples felt as though a different world had crept up on them in the area outside the Midnight Palace.","This new world was barren, as though every living creature had decayed.","When the crowd looked at Zuo Ming, they saw a thick yellow armor covering him from head to toe.","Numerous sharp spikes protruded from the armor, and a long curly tail extended from his back.","One look at the thick and long tail was enough to sense its terrifying power, and it seemed as though the power encapsulated in the tail was enough to shatter the barren world that had been built outside the Midnight Palace.","Although he could not sense Zuo Ming’s aura, Lin Yuan had noticed the changes in his appearance.","Lin Yuan immediately knew that Zuo Ming had a fey that could ward his body.","This was not the first time that Lin Yuan had come across a spirit qi professional with a fey that could ward bodies. Xin Ying also had one.","Lin Yuan let out a sigh of relief because this change in Zuo Ming meant that Lin Yuan could now use all his power without holding back.","Zong Ze ordered the Fiery Sky Hou, “Fiery Sky Hou, use Strange Flames Eight Refinement.”","The Fiery Sky Hou on Zong Ze’s shoulder jumped into the air, and hard golden hair grew all over its body.","The moment the hard golden hair grew out, they were immediately set on fire with eight different colored flames.","The Fiery Sky Hou swallowed all these eight colored flames, which combined and turned transparent.","The Fiery Sky Hou opened its mouth, and twin-colored flames shot out toward Lin Yuan.","At that moment, someone below the stage yelled, “Wow! It’s eight different high-class strange flames! Not even Suzerain feys can sustain the damage from eight high-class strange flames!”","As Zong Ze’s opponent, Lin Yuan had immediately understood what the eight flames were.","Now that he was faced with such an attack, Lin Yuan decided to test the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Spatial Shift.","He did not summon the Ethereal Jellyfish because its moist body would definitely dry up due to the high temperature on the Martial Stage. Thus, Lin Yuan used his own body to release Spatial Shift.","However, the Ethereal Jellyfish was only Diamond X/Legend and had yet to evolve to Fantasy Breed.","The greatest power it wielded would be that of a Platinum X/Fantasy I fey.","Although Spatial Shift could provide a strong defense against elemental damage by moving the elemental energy in a set area to another dimension, the amount of elemental energy it could shift was limited. The set area would be broken if there was too much elemental energy.","Hence, Lin Yuan was not using Spatial Shift once. Instead, he used it 50 times against the Fiery Sky Hou’s rampaging combined attack of eight strange flames.","Besides, Lin Yuan was using the Spirit Qi Imprint and had an endless well of spiritual power.","Lin Yuan was now being utterly wilful because of all the spirit qi he had.","The crowd watched as the two strange flame attacks shot toward Lin Yuan and vanished."]},{"number":878,"title":"Chapter 878 - The Unsheathed Sacred Sword","paragraphs":["Before the crowd could even react, the Fiery Sky Hou’s next attack was right in front of Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan had used True Data to check on the Fiery Sky Hou, he found out that the Strange Fire Eight Refinement used eight strange fires to cause successive damage.","As such, Lin Yuan was already prepared.","He also continued to multiply the number of times that he used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Spatial Shift. First 30 times, then 60 times, 120 times, 240 times, 480 times, 960 times, 1,920 times, and 3,840 times.","All of the Fiery Sky Hou’s eight attacks disappeared almost as soon as they were launched.","This stunned Zong Ze, who looked at Lin Yuan with incredulity,","The veteran and top factions’ disciples could no longer hold back as they started to chant Lin Yuan’s name.","Lin Yuan was strong, and so was Zong Ze.","However, Zong Ze’s power had always been obvious, and the abilities of his feys were clear.","Unexpectedly, Lin Yuan’s series of moves had broken the other disciples’ perspectives. They never imagined that a battle could be fought in this way.","If Lin Yuan’s power all came from his feys, the veteran and top factions’ disciples could not help but wonder how strong those feys would be if they were summoned. After all, the effects of feys’ abilities were reduced when used by the spirit qi professional without summoning the fey.","Lin Yuan would have laughed awkwardly if he knew what the disciples were thinking.","If he summoned Blackie, Genius, and the Ethereal Jellyfish, they would all quickly be burnt to ashes by Zong Ze.","He had been able to stand his ground on the Martial Stage for as long as he had because of the resistance that the laws on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt had afforded him.","This resistance was not applicable to the other feys he had contracted.","Although it appeared astonishing that Lin Yuan had been unaffected by Strange Fire Eight Refinement, he himself was well aware of the difficulties.","Despite using the Spirit Qi Imprint, using Spatial Shift close to 7,600 times had drained all of the spirit qi accumulated in the Spirit Qi Imprint.","Lin Yuan’s store of spiritual power was now running low.","After a moment’s bewilderment, Zong Ze reached out his hand in front of him.","Scarlet light appeared out of Zong Ze’s palm, and Lin Yuan immediately sensed the aura of a sacred source lifeform.","Zong Ze looked up at the Fiery Sky Hou and instructed, “Dreamland of Fire!”","The Fiery Sky Hou looked up to the sky and let out a loud cry that reverberated throughout the area outside the Midnight Palace.","Balls of strange fire shot out of the Fiery Sky Hou’s body and turned into tiles of various colors.","The tiles formed a wall of fire around the Martial Stage.","Small flames levitated in the air inside the wall. Lin Yuan knew that the small flames were the remnants of fire left after the strange fire was absorbed.","Hundreds of thousands of small flames were hanging in the air within the Dreamland of Fire.","The flames tangled around each other and formed a miniature world of fire.","Inside the Dreamland of Fire, Lin Yuan felt an unspeakable heat and burning pain despite activating the Icy Flames Law and Cold Flames Law.","Lin Yuan’s skin burned excruciatingly due to the effects of the fire-type elements, and even his sweat was laced with blood.","Zong Ze closed his eyes as he presided over the world of flames.","When the crowd saw Lin Yuan oozing blood, they assumed that this was the end for him.","He was young, and his sacred source lifeform was already in use.","However, the sacred source lifeform could not continue protecting him.","At that moment, Lin Yuan reached out his hand toward Zong Ze. But instead of spreading out his palms, he made a grabbing gesture.","The woman’s silhouette behind Lin Yuan solidified, and the woman opened her eyes.","The moment her eyelids parted, the silhouette disappeared, and a long sword appeared in Lin Yuan’s hand.","The image of the woman with the billowing skirt was carved on the blade of the sword, and there seemed to be a mystical world within the skirt.","Seeing the sword in Lin Yuan’s hands stirred up the people inside and out of the Midnight Palace.","With amused surprise, the serious and calm voice said, “This is really exciting. That fellow far exceeds my expectations.”","The Moon Empress’ eyes shone, and it was clear that her mind was not at ease.","Cold Moon and Mystic Moon could not see her eyes. Otherwise, they would immediately notice that strong emotions were coiling within her.","All the experts in the Midnight Palace who had contracted sacred source lifeforms could sense that the sacred source lifeform radiating from Lin Yuan had not changed. Although it had changed its form, it was still a sacred source lifeform.","However, veteran and top faction leaders who did not have sacred source lifeforms looked at Lin Yuan in shock before glancing back at the Moon Empress.","They did not understand how this young man could have contracted two sacred source lifeforms.","Chef Supreme looked at the Moon Empress with slight shock and said, “Moon Empress, you’ve taught your disciple well.”","The Moon Empress’ expression shifted, and she gave Chef Supreme a side-eyed look. She felt that he was always targeting her.","The Moon Empress had no memory of teaching Lin Yuan anything else besides their bi-weekly question-and-answer session. Thus, despite being complimentary words, the Moon Empress felt that Chef Supreme was provoking her.","The Moon Empress’ heart ached as she watched Lin Yuan being burned and snapped at Chef Supreme, “Unlike you, whose disciples always cause trouble.”","Chef Supreme looked taken aback as he reflected on his words. He did not think that he had said anything offensive.","Could the Moon Empress be angry that Lin Yuan was not performing well?","Zong Ze lifted his outstretched hand, and the red light in his palm greatly resembled the flames burning within the world of flames.","In a flash, Lin Yuan unsheathed the sacred sword."]},{"number":879,"title":"Chapter 879 - Heaven Crimson Fire, Crimson Flame Heaven","paragraphs":["The mostly silent Bamboo Monarch gazed at Lin Yuan with a look of marvel.","The Bamboo Monarch was different from Chef Supreme. Chef Supreme had only met Lin Yuan a few weeks ago at the Radiant Moon Palace, but the Bamboo Monarch had already met Lin Yuan half a year ago at the outskirts of the Royal Capital.","Lin Yuan had been in a sorry state. He had been standing behind the Moon Empress, bloodied all over, and had almost been killed by Cheng Wu.","At that time, he had seemed young and weak.","In a mere six months, that young and weak boy had grown so much.","“Moon Empress, your disciple’s sacred source lifeform is fascinating. I can tell that it’s only 2 Stars, but it seems to have more than one sacred source lifeform ability.”","The Bamboo Monarch was one of the three Class 5 Creation Masters and was much better at checking on sacred source lifeforms than Zong Ze and Gu Lang were.","From the moment that Lin Yuan had activated his sacred source lifeform, the Bamboo Monarch checked on it.","Just like other low-class Creation Masters, the Bamboo Monarch could sense the thousands of levels of blocks around the sacred source lifeform.","The blocks prevented the Bamboo Monarch’s spiritual energy from penetrating. But when he activated his willpower, the law that came from the willpower, and the world that came from the law, the Bamboo Monarch realized that they could cleanly penetrate the surface layer of blocks.","But after breaking through the first few hundred weak blocks, the Bamboo Monarch’s world hit a much thicker block.","This thick block was much stronger than all the previous weak blocks combined.","It was easy for the Bamboo Monarch to use world power to break through this block, but he was uncertain if his intrusion would affect Lin Yuan.","If his checking affected Lin Yuan somehow, the Moon Empress would not let him off scot-free. Thus, he fought down his curiosity and asked the Moon Empress instead.","However, she did not reply to his question and instead said, “Chef Supreme’s disciple’s sacred source lifeform is at 3 Stars and is almost at 4 Stars. It’s only waiting for an opportunity to transform into 4 Stars. I think that this fight between Zong Ze and Lin Yuan is a great opportunity.”","The Moon Empress did not want to discuss Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform with the Bamboo Monarch.","The woman’s silhouette behind Lin Yuan had been his sacred source lifeform, and so was this sword.","These two sacred source lifeforms with entirely different appearances shared the same aura and were definitely one sacred source lifeform.","This meant that Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform had two forms. Not even the Moon Empress had ever encountered such a situation.","Previously, the Moon Empress had noticed that Lin Yuan had the ability to hide his spirit qi professional rank.","Now, she realized that this had to be an effect of his sacred source lifeform’s blocking.","Moreover, before the Moon Empress thoroughly studied Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform, she could not be certain where his fire and poison resistance, spiritual defense, and attacking style came from.","Nonetheless, the Moon Empress had always reiterated one principle to Lin Yuan, which was to keep his secret weapons to himself.","This was why the Moon Empress never asked about Lin Yuan’s powers.","She had sensed the Bamboo Monarch checking on Lin Yuan. Luckily, he had stopped before drilling too deep. Otherwise, the Moon Empress would have had to stop him by force.","Chef Supreme was still confused about why the Moon Empress had snapped at him. But given her temperament, he did not give it much thought.","When he heard the Moon Empress praise Zong Ze, Chef Supreme said, “If Zong Ze can really use this battle to evolve his sacred source lifeform’s Stars and transform it from child to adolescent stage to gain new abilities, I’ll be grateful to Lin Yuan for providing Zong Ze with this opportunity.”","Liu Jie sensed the change in Lin Yuan and Zong Ze’s sacred source aura and felt his own sacred source lifeform stir within him.","After communicating with his sacred source lifeform, Liu Jie discovered that Zong Ze’s sacred source lifeform had more Stars than Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform.","While Liu Jie was communicating with his sacred source lifeform, Gu Lang turned to say to Liu Jie, “Zong Ze’s sacred source lifeform is powerful, but it’s a purely offense-type sacred source lifeform. My sacred source lifeform is already 4 Stars and gained a second ability. But in a battle between sacred source lifeforms, my sacred source lifeform will be helpless against Zong Ze’s sacred source lifeform. Zuo Ming should be stepping in soon.”","At that moment, Zong Ze spoke out in a stern yet holy tone voice, “Heaven Crimson Fire, Crimson Flame Heaven!”","The flames levitating in the air inside the Dreamland of Fire seemed to become sacred as they were draped in radiant light and shot toward the red flame in Zong Ze’s palm.","These floating flames were the remnants of fire after the strange flames were swallowed.","The remnants of fire turned into raging fire-type elements that nourished the tiles of the Dreamland of Fire.","Every tile in the Dreamland of Fire was made from strange flames. After absorbing the fire-elemental energy, the fire within the tiles became more active and turned into vigorous sparks.","The temperature in the Dreamland of Fire doubled.","When Zuo Ming sensed that the temperature in the Dreamland of Fire had increased past Lin Yuan’s limit and was about to step in to protect Lin Yuan, he suddenly felt as though Lin Yuan had become a mountain that rose up amidst the flames.","It was as though he was an unflinching mountain that was unbothered by the flames.","Rigid vitality poured out of his body and breathed new life into his body that was damaged by the flames.","Lin Yuan was now using the Jasmine Lily’s Vitality Imprint.","He sighed to himself.","Although the Cold Snow Pine’s Icy Flames Law is Myth III and has resistance against both ice and fire, it’s clearly more resistant against ice.","Lin Yuan felt that if only there was a Myth III purely fire law carved on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, he would have been pressed to use the Jasmine Lily’s Vitality Imprint."]},{"number":880,"title":"Chapter 880 - Wipe Away Your Saliva","paragraphs":["When he saw Lin Yuan’s damaged skin being healed, Zuo Ming awkwardly backed out of the Martial Stage. He felt that he had seen his fair share of life experiences.","This bigshot’s disciple seemed to have endless secret weapons!","Every secret weapon had the ability to turn the tables of the battle.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan felt the active strange flames beneath him turn vivacious.","The crimson flame in Zong Ze’s palm seemed to be the gravitational center that pulled half of the tiles of the Dreamland of Fire apart.","The broken tiles flew toward the crimson flame, which expanded into a country with flames crossing all over it.","Zong Ze shook his wrist and threw out this crimson country.","While the crimson country was forming in Zong Ze’s palm, Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Zong Ze’s sacred source lifeform.","The name of Zong Ze’s sacred source lifeform was Heaven Crimson Fire, and its current ability was to instantly transform the fire qualities of strange flames into Fire Flame Laws.","The crimson country that Zong Ze had just flung out was a complete Fire Flame Law that had been formed from 10,000 fire qualities.","Although this law would only have an effect for a second, its power was true.","At his age, where most were still trying to gain control of Fantasy Breed feys and willpowers, Zong Ze’s use of laws was at a level that was a far cut above the rest.","However, Lin Yuan felt that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was the true master of willpowers and laws.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen now had the Dark Death World to play with.","Lin Yuan injected the Myth III Dream-Eating Law into the sacred sword.","This was the first time that Lin Yuan was using the Sacred Sword Wielding Quen’s Sacred Sword Form.","The ordinary sacred sword in Lin Yuan’s hand turned grayish-black, and a grayish-black mist rose from the blade.","Hidden in the mist was a bat that was ready to consume dreams.","Lin Yuan raised the sword and sliced downward. All the grayish-black mist gathered at the top of the sword.","The crimson flame in Zong Ze’s palm was the center of the Dreamland of Fire, and the country formed by the Heaven Crimson Fire was detached from the Dreamland of Fire.","The dreamy grayish-black mist at the tip of Lin Yuan’s sword could now compete with the Crimson Flame Country.","The bat in the mist was now screaming toward the world of flames.","Lin Yuan swung his sword and flung out the Myth III Dream-Eating Law.","When the Dream-Eating Law clashed against the Country of Fire, black and red tangled with each other, and all the young disciples who were watching, including Gu Lang, could not clearly see what was happening on the Martial Stage.","A moment later, the clashing colors dispersed and revealed the doggedly panting Lin Yuan and Zong Ze. It was clear that both of them were seriously affected by the attacks.","The spectating veteran and top factions’ disciples all had gaping mouths and widened eyes as they stared in disbelief at the two people on the Martial Stage.","An elegant and skilled-looking girl next to Sheng Yin could not help but say, “Holy shit, is that level of damage even possible from young disciples? Could they be monsters?”","Lin Yuan and Zong Ze’s attacks had been so overwhelming that the entire area outside the Midnight Palace was left in silence.","As such, the girl’s words were clearly heard by everyone.","The girl next to Sheng Yin looked aghast with embarrassment.","It was fine to say such things to her friends, but not in such a public setting.","Although her words did not have any negative meaning, they were considered disrespectful to Zong Ze and Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was fine, but Zong Ze was Chef Supreme’s disciple.","She had called Zong Ze a monster.","If someone took what she said and ran, she would be in trouble.","The girl peeped around at her surroundings and realized that no one was looking at her.","Everyone’s eyes were securely fixed on the two shining men. It was only then that the girl let out a sigh of relief.","When she saw a few men from top factions that she thought were handsome staring at the two people on the Martial Stage with admiration, the girl abruptly lost all fancy for these supposedly handsome men.","The girl went back to looking at Zong Ze and Lin Yuan, and she was in a dilemma.","Both of them were so outstanding that she did not know who to like.","If only they were together, they would seem...","The girl smiled and heard someone say, “Qianhui, are you hungry? Wipe away your saliva.”","Zhuang Qianhui quickly shut her jaw and swallowed. But she did not expect to let out a loud slurping noise.","The rigid vitality within Lin Yuan flowed and healed all his injuries.","When the grayish-black and crimson had clashed, he had seemed to be on equal footing as Zong Ze.","However, he knew that he was the one who had suffered.","During the clash, his body was burned by the Fire Flames Law and only managed to hold on thanks to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s resistance to fire and the sea of vitality.","The Fire Flames Law was only Myth I at the most. Even if the Fiery Sky Hou’s Dreamland of Fire doubled in power, it would still be below Myth II.","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan’s Dream-Eating Law was Myth III and should have been able to defeat the Fire Flames Law.","However, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt laws were vastly different from the Heaven Crimson Fire’s laws.","The law that Lin Yuan just used was not a complete Dream-Eating Law but the energy from a Myth III Dream-Eating Law.","After some recuperation, Lin Yuan would be able to use the Myth III Dream-Eating Law to launch the same attack.","The complete law produced by the Heaven Crimson Fire was gone once it was used. The explosive power in a complete law could not be compared to the energy in a law."]},{"number":881,"title":"Chapter 881 - Sacred Source! Transformation into Adolescence!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan finally discovered what level of damage the Myth III laws on the Sacred Source Wielding Queen’s skirt could cause.","One strike could generate the power of a Suzerain/Myth I fey.","Although it was weaker than Lin Yuan had expected, he was still very satisfied. After all, this power could be re-used after a cooling down period.","He had made an assessment before he used the Dream-Eating Law. The Myth III laws on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt were the Vicious Poison Law, Icy Flames Law, and Dream-Eating Law.","Lin Yuan could use any of these laws to attack Zong Ze.","But once he used the energy from these laws, he would no longer be able to receive their respective resistances.","If he used the Icy Flames Law, Lin Yuan would immediately be burnt to a crisp.","He also did not feel safe enough to use the Vicious Poison Law because Zong Ze’s Blue Poison Flame Puppet had the ability to use fire poison.","Although the Blue Poison Flame Puppet was now in a near-death state and had been stored away, Lin Yuan could not be certain that Zong Ze did not have a way to heal the Blue Poison Flame Puppet’s injuries and bring it back into the battle.","It was also possible for Zong Ze to have other feys that could use fire poison that he had yet to summon.","Thus, he had decided that the Dream-Eating Law was the best choice.","Zong Ze closed his eyes and seemed to have entered a trance.","The sacred source aura emanating from his body seemed to become more concentrated.","However, this change in sacred source aura was like a blooming flower that needed time to unfurl its petals.","Zuo Ming’s expression hardened, and he immediately realized that Zong Ze’s sacred source lifeform was now transforming into its adolescent stage.","For sacred source lifeforms to increase their Stars, they only had to accumulate their specific required resources.","But for sacred source lifeforms to transform and grow to the next development stage, they needed an opportunity.","This opportunity was extremely rare and required the same fate that spirit qi professionals needed to comprehend Willpower Runes.","If the opportunity was not seized for some reason, there was no telling when the next opportunity would appear.","At that moment, Zong Ze was experiencing one of those opportunities.","If Lin Yuan attacked Zong Ze now, Zong Ze would not be able to defend himself, and Lin Yuan would become the champion of the Martial Arts Stage with ease. Meanwhile, Zong Ze would lose this precious opportunity.","The 13 members of royalty set the rules of the Martial Stage, and they were insistent that the competition had to be fair.","It could not be stopped just because something was happening to Zong Ze. Thus, Zuo Ming was stuck between a rock and a hard place.","Chef Supreme shot up from his seat.","Zong Ze’s Heaven Crimson Fire had already reached 3 Stars but had yet to transform to its adolescent stage because the right opportunity had not arisen. It had been stuck at this stage for more than a year.","For someone like Zong Ze, who was constantly climbing the mountain of ambition to become stronger, he could not afford to waste a year.","Chef Supreme was about to yell for the fight to stop on Zong Ze’s behalf.","He felt that the opportunity for the Heaven Crimson Fire to transform was much more important than the prize of the sacred source lifeform and Order of Radiant Light.","Lin Yuan took a few steps back until he reached the edge of the Martial Stage.","Although he did not say anything, the intentions of his actions were clear.","Lin Yuan was going to wait for Zong Ze’s Heaven Crimson Fire to finish transforming before continuing the fight.","His decision made not only the other disciples but even the members of royalty look at him in a different light.","The Dreamland of Fire continued to burn, and a pillar of light brighter than the raging flames shot out of Lin Yuan’s body.","Lin Yuan swung the sacred sword twice, and the sparks erupted out of the blade.","After the Heaven Crimson Fire transformed to its adolescent stage, it would gain a second ability and Zong Ze’s power would be raised.","If all he wanted was to win the prize, this was the best time for Lin Yuan to strike.","If Zong Ze were his enemy, Lin Yuan would have rushed up and launched a lethal attack without hesitation.","But Zong Ze was not his enemy but his opponent.","Since Zong Ze was Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang’s junior disciple, he was linked to Lin Yuan in a way.","Half a minute later, Zong Ze opened his eyes.","When he opened his eyes, it was revealed that they had turned the same shade of crimson as the flame in his palm.","This crimson was neither reminiscent of blood nor evil. Rather, it carried the charisma and might of the highest elite.","Zong Ze looked at Lin Yuan with gratitude and was about to raise his hand to Zuo Ming to indicate his surrender when he saw Lin Yuan step forward to his initial position.","“Zong Ze. let’s continue our fight. I believe that if I had been in your position, you wouldn’t have attacked me either.”","Zong Ze realized that Lin Yuan was right. But nonetheless, it had been him who had been in that vulnerable state.","However, he was not a sentimental person and was the type to keep his feelings of gratitude to himself.","He felt that a man should wait for the right time to return the favor.","Zong Ze looked at Lin Yuan and said, “Then, I shall go ahead and use the Heaven Crimson Fire’s strongest attack.”","The flame in Zong Ze’s palm engulfed the entire Martial Stage.","Mysterious flame runes appeared above the Martial Stage and combined together to form a door.","The crimson door slowly started to open.","While Zong Ze was activating the Heaven Crimson Fire, Lin Yuan was not idle either.","A red beam of elemental energy shot toward the Fiery Sky Hou with a flick of his hands.","The Fiery Sky Hou, which had been focused on sustaining the Dreamland of Fire, entered a blissful and dazed state.","The red beam started to rapidly drain the Fiery Sky Hou’s vitality and transferred it into Lin Yuan’s Vitality Imprint."]},{"number":882,"title":"Chapter 882 - Master, I Won","paragraphs":["The Jasmine Lily’s vitality drain would not immediately seriously affect the Diamond X/Fantasy V Fiery Sky Hou.","Lin Yuan was not aiming for the Jasmine Lily to inflict damage on the Fiery Sky Hou but to use the Jasmine Lily’s Heal to gain control over the Fiery Sky Hou.","The Jasmine Lily’s ability to exert control would not put the target in a negative state but rather leave the target in a blissful state.","The target would feel as though all its burdens were melting away.","As such, the target fey would not be resistant to such an effect.","When the red light landed on the Fiery Sky Hou’s body, the Dreamland of Fire crumbled.","The crowd remembered that strange match during the Allstar Match.","In spite of the disappearance of the Dreamland of Fire, the temperature on the Martial Stage had not fallen at all. Instead, the temperature was climbing.","The high temperature was due to the Heaven Crimson Fire.","Even so, Lin Yuan had achieved his goal.","He had aimed to destroy the Dreamland of Fire to prevent it from supporting the Heaven Crimson Fire.","Lin Yuan clutched the sacred sword and activated his strongest secret weapon, the Dark Death World’s Night Crow Wither Attack.","Several angels in crimson armor and with wings of flames appeared through the crimson door.","Lin Yuan sensed that the angels were formed from fire elements and were not actual feys.","The concentrated fire elements gathered together to imbue the angels with intelligence.","When the 21st angel stepped through the crimson door, Zong Ze trembled. He had used up every drop of spiritual power in his body.","Zong Ze issued an order, and the 21 flame angels raised their sabers and swords made of flames and charged toward Lin Yuan.","While Zong Ze was summoning the angels, Lin Yuan’s side of the Martial Stage became shrouded in darkness.","The darkness was not overwhelmed by the savage flames. Rather, it steadily consumed the territory that was engulfed by the flames.","At that moment, Night Leaning Moon coughed and said, “This is the power of darkness from a dark-type world.”","The expressions of the other members of royalty changed when they heard what Night Leaning Moon said. It was clear that they had also sensed the change in Lin Yuan’s power.","Even Long Tu, the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, and the top and veteran faction leaders were looking at Lin Yuan with disbelief.","Even if he was the Moon Empress’ disciple, he should not have been able to harness the power of laws to such a level at his age.","While the veteran and top faction leaders were staring in bewilderment, Night Leaning Moon said, “Although it’s the power of a dark-type world, it should only have the power of a Suzerain/Myth III fey. It looks like the winner of the battle has been decided.”","Night Leaning Moon’s words made the veteran and top faction leaders break out in a sweat, and they thought to themselves,? Chief Guard Ye, this power of worlds is already extremely impressive in itself!","Most of the veteran and top faction leaders had yet to reach the level of worlds.","Lin Yuan was in complete control of the darkness as he deftly wielded his sword.","A total of 28 night crows flew out of the sword and proceeded to fly around Lin Yuan.","The crows occasionally landed on the sacred sword’s blade as though they were waiting for Lin Yuan’s orders.","Lin Yuan had gained substantial sword skills after using the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass to pick up combat skills and fighting strategies.","He had not trained in the slightest, but he had become a master of every technique.","A night crow collided against a flame angel with a wave of his sword and changed into a black wither imprint.","The 21 flame angels fought valiantly, but Lin Yuan swung and hit all of them with clean accuracy.","Lin Yuan raised the sacred sword and said softly, “Sword Skill, Night Crow Wither Attack.”","The 28 night crows returned to the blade before separating again like they were a blooming withered flower and collided against the 21 flame angels.","14 wither imprints appeared on each flame angel, and they started to wither into decaying flickers of flames.","As the night crows continued to swarm, one of the flame angels had 56 wither imprints on it.","This flame angel was now truly withering, and it dropped like a stone onto the hades etutitsorp floor. It continued to decay until not even a spark of fire was left.","Soon, the rest of the flame angels also started to truly decay.","Lin Yuan panted as he continued to hold onto the sacred sword. Besides the other two Myth III laws on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, Lin Yuan had used every weapon in his arsenal.","The night crows shimmered with dark mystic every time they collided against the flame angels.","After defeating all 21 flame angels, the 28 night crows became translucent and flew around the powerless Zong Ze, signaling that Lin Yuan had won.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to signal to Zuo Ming, someone in the crowd shouted his name.","Soon after, people all over the area outside the Midnight Palace started shouting his name.","Lin Yuan was stunned to hear the cacophony of voices calling his name. He turned his head and was met with the sight of sincere congratulations and amazement in the eyes of these cream of the crop disciples.","When he saw how they were looking at him, Lin Yuan knew that he had won their acknowledgment with his own power.","But instead of basking in these cheers, Lin Yuan turned to look toward the inner palace that was blocked by the radyx crystal wall and smiled brightly.","Although he could not see the Moon Empress, his smile was solely meant for her.","The 100 Flower Brocade Pearls had been Lin Yuan’s proof of his growth, and this battle on the Martial Stage where Lin Yuan had demonstrated his full power was also his way of proving his fighting abilities to her.","“Master, I won,” murmured Lin Yuan.","He knew that his actions could be seen as arrogant to the other members of royalty.","However, all Lin Yuan wanted to do was to show his Master, who had been protecting him all this time, how delighted he was.","Lin Yuan lowered his head and looked at the sacred sword in his hand, and said under his breath, “Lin Yuan, you won.”"]},{"number":883,"title":"Chapter 883 - Hes Better Than Me","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Lin Yuan told himself that he won, a wistful expression appeared on his face.","Back when he had been running the spirit lifeform store on his own in the Xia Region, Lin Yuan struggled to even move an Usnea.","He had had to grit his teeth and push himself every time he buried energy ores with the Usnea.","A Normal quality Usnea that was not even a fey was not heavy. However, the Usnea’s roots were thick, and a big pot was required for the Usnea to grow well.","Combined with the soil, one pot of Usnea weighed about 12.5 kilograms. It had been a huge struggle for Lin Yuan, who at the time did not even have spirit qi.","Lin Yuan would need to pant and rest every time after lifting one Usnea onto the shelf. That was how he would spend his days.","At that time, Lin Yuan’s dream and motivation had been to properly run his store and earn enough to keep food in his stomach and support Chu Ci through her education.","Since she was his sister, Lin Yuan would overcome any obstacle in order to pay for her education.","Although running the small store would not allow him to provide Chu Ci with strong feys, it would have been possible for him to save up to buy her a defense-type fey.","But who would have thought that he would be standing amidst cheers and applause on the Martial Stage during the Guard Ye Banquet as the winner eight months later?","Lin Yuan felt that his entire journey had been a miracle.","Although luck had played a major role, Lin Yuan still wanted to go back to comfort his past self.","In the past eight months, Lin Yuan had not stopped to rest at all and spent all his free time in the Spirit Lock spatial zone evolving feys.","Regular people would not always be regular, and victors would not be satisfied with their achievements.","Lin Yuan did not look down on himself. However, he felt that he could no longer describe himself as a regular person.","But no matter what, he would remain the same person he always was.","The last eight months were just the beginning, a stepping stone that allowed him to gain more power and broaden his horizons.","While Lin Yuan was lost in his thoughts, he suddenly felt someone grab his limbs and lift him up into the air.","He looked down to see Liu Jie, Gao Feng, Long Tao, and Li Xuan.","Given all the combat skills and fighting abilities that he had gained, Lin Yuan only needed to roll over, and he would be able to land back on the ground safely.","But instead of doing that, he smiled and enjoyed being celebrated by his friends. He felt his tightly wound nerves loosen and relax.","Gu Lang did not immediately follow Liu Jie, Gao Feng, Long Tao, and Li Xuan onto the stage, but he eventually made his way up as well.","He walked over to Zong Ze and said calmly, “Your loss was inevitable. Even if you used the Heaven Crimson Fire at the beginning to release a sea of flames, you still wouldn’t have won. If Lin Yuan had used his final move right at the start, you also wouldn’t have been able to fight back because Senior Zuo Ming would have stepped in to protect you and declare you the loser.”","From the moment the fight ended, Zong Ze’s eyes had been fixed on Lin Yuan.","After he heard what Gu Lang said, Zong Ze replied, “He’s better than me! But I’m thankful for him. Without him, my Heaven Crimson Fire would not have been able to grow to adolescence. If I had missed this opportunity, I don’t know when the next one would appear.”","Gu Lang was stunned when he heard what Zong Ze said. After so many years of friendship, he knew that Zong Ze was stubborn from the inside out.","He never expected someone as arrogant as Zong Ze to admit that someone was better than him.","Because of this fight, the Heaven Crimson Fire had evolved to 4 Stars and grew to its adolescent stage. Zong Ze’s power was about to skyrocket, and he would be able to use resources to further increase the Heaven Crimson Fire’s Stars.","During the fight, Zong Ze had noticed that Lin Yuan started to become affected by the fire-elemental energy even with his strong resistance to fire after Zong Ze summoned his sacred source lifeform.","Lin Yuan had relied on his unknown source of vitality to continuously heal his injuries.","If the Heaven Crimson Fire’s Stars had been higher, Lin Yuan’s resistance to fire and waves of vitality would not have been so impactful.","Just as Gu Lang was about to comfort Zong Ze, he saw Zong Ze marching over to Lin Yuan.","Zong Ze inserted himself amongst Liu Jie, Gao Feng, Long Tao, and Li Xuan. Gu Lang could not help but be troubled by this scene.","It was already extremely out of character of Zong Ze to have taken the initiative to introduce himself to Lin Yuan.","How were they already so close after one fight?","Sheng Yin sighed as she gazed at Lin Yuan being lifted into the air.","No matter what Lin Yuan’s background was, he now had an Order of Radiant Light and had the opportunity to become either a Radiance Envoy or Radiance Knight.","In recent years, Sheng Yin had been working hard to become a Radiance Knight.","She knew that it was unrealistic for her to aim to become a Radiance Envoy with her purely healing-type abilities.","Now that Lin Yuan had the Order of Radiant Light, she had another strong competitor.","If Lin Yuan aimed to become a Radiance Envoy, someone would fall through the ranks and increase the competition for aspiring Radiance Knights.","If Lin Yuan failed to become a Radiance Envoy, he would take up one of the spots to become a Radiant Knight.","There were still two years to go before the selection for Radiance Envoys and Radiance Knights. It would be easy for Lin Yuan to clinch one of the Radiant Knight spots even if he did not increase in power at all in the next two years.","As the pressure continued to weigh down on Sheng Yin’s back, Zhuang Qianhui said, “Sister Sheng Yin, I’ve decided! Lin Yuan shall be my man from now on! I’ll get my father to approach Lin Yuan for marriage the moment I return home.”","Sheng Yin stared in shock at Zhuang Qianhui and said solemnly, “Qianhui! You can’t just approach anyone for marriage. Where will your father even go to find Lin Yuan?”","Sheng Yin always knew that Zhuang Qianhui was spoiled. Not only was she used to being a princess, but she was also ditzy to boot.","But was she really so silly?","As such, Sheng Yin wanted to test to see if Zhuang Qianhui had guessed Lin Yuan’s identity."]},{"number":884,"title":"Chapter 884 - Moon Dew Revival Pill","paragraphs":["When Zhuang Qianhui heard what Sheng Yin said, she immediately looked wary.","“Sister Sheng Yin, I know you like Lord Zong Ze. Don’t change your feelings so easily! Lin Yuan is mine! I don’t know where my father can go to approach Lin Yuan for marriage, but Big Brother Li Xuan looks close with Lin Yuan. He has to know where Lin Yuan lives! All I have to do is ask him.”","Sheng Yin gently sighed.","Zhuang Qianhui was the direct descendant of the top faction Spirit Jam Orchard and had to have heard the news that the Moon Empress would be appearing at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Apparently, Zhuang Qianhui was hung up on Lin Yuan because of Lin Yuan himself.","The Guard Ye Banquet was going to begin soon. If Lin Yuan really was the Moon Empress’ disciple, he would be announcing his identity.","After he announced his identity, Zhuang Qianhui’s father would definitely not have the courage to go up to Leaning Moon Mountain to ask for Lin Yuan’s hand in marriage no matter how babied Zhuan Qianhui was at home.","It looked like Zhuang Qianhui’s affections could only remain one-sided.","...","When the Moon Empress saw Lin Yuan’s smile and read his lips that had uttered ‘Master, I won’, she felt a surge of warmth flood her heart.","The warmth rose so high within her that it caused tears to well up in her eyes.","She quickly closed her eyes and spent the next minute trying to curb her surging emotions.","The other 11 members of royalty were all surprised to see her doing this.","Besides the incident from a decade ago, they had never seen her in such an emotional state before.","The Moon Empress was always a cold person. Evidently, Lin Yuan held unimaginable weight in her heart.","The other members of royalty who also had disciples did not find the Moon Empress’ strange behavior shocking. If their disciples had won the Martial Arts Stage, they would be equally as proud and happy.","The Moon Empress opened her eyes after a minute. She remembered that the first time she had cried was when that old fogey had died.","At that time, she had been determined to never cry a second time. She never expected that her resolve would be broken without her even noticing.","As she watched Lin Yuan being lifted into the air, the Moon Empress could no longer hold back her smile as she turned to say to Mystic Moon, “Mystic Moon, that set of clothes is difficult to get into. Go and help him. Also, give this to him. Tell him to eat it to recover from his battle injuries.”","The Moon Empress handed a brocade box to Mystic Moon.","Mystic Moon took the brocade box and made a sound of acknowledgment before turning to walk out of the palace.","Mystic Moon had also wanted to go and see Lin Yuan. The Moonbeam Coronation Costume without coronation patterns that the Moon Empress had prepared for Lin Yuan was really difficult to put on. After all, it came with 300 accessories.","If Lin Yuan was left alone to figure out where to place the accessories, he would not even be done putting the Moonbeam Coronation Costume on by the next day.","Initially, Lin Yuan had felt fine as he was tossed up into the air by Liu Jie, Gao Feng, Long Tao, and Li Xuan.","However, Gao Feng was very strong. If Lin Yuan did not use his skills to keep himself balanced, he would have been quickly thrown to the ground by Gao Feng.","Now that Zong Ze had joined in, Lin Yuan was shocked by how much stronger Zong Ze was than Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan looked suspiciously at Zong Ze. Was he trying to get revenge after losing the Martial Arts Stage?","He felt like a rice cake that Gao Feng and Zong Ze were pounding.","Lin Yuan reached his limit when his backside went numb.","He hastily wrenched himself free and gracefully landed on the ground.","After chatting with some people, Lin Yuan took his phone out of the Diamond fey storage box and saw that he had two missed calls from Mystic Moon.","He hurriedly called Mystic Moon. When he learned why Mystic Moon was looking for him, Lin Yuan turned to Liu Jie and said, “We have to go to the Night Words Pavilion to change our clothes.”","Mystic Moon said that he was waiting at the Night Words Pavilion during the call. This was Lin Yuan’s first time at the Midnight Palace, and he did not know where the Night Words Pavilion was.","Liu Jie nodded and replied, “I’ll ask Uncle You to take us there.”","Lin Yuan exchanged a few more words with some people in the crowd and arranged to meet them again during the Guard Ye Banquet before he went with Liu Jie to see You Zhe.","Everyone in the small group knew Lin Yuan and Liu Jie’s identities. Although they were not certain what Lin Yuan meant by changing clothes, they knew that it definitely had something to do with the Guard Ye Banquet.","When You Zhe saw Lin Yuan and Liu Jie making a beeline for him, he immediately said, “Mystic Moon already called me. Let’s go to the Night Words Pavilion.”","You Zhe turned to Liu Jie and said, “Young Liege, the Guard Ye Banquet will begin in an hour. Let me help you put on the Night Clear Water Coronation Costume.”","Liu Jie was about to reject the offer when he suddenly remembered all the accessories inside the brocade box. He decided against putting on the Night Clear Water Coronation Costume on his own and replied, “Sorry to inconvenience you, Uncle You.”","Lin Yuan spotted Mystic Moon from afar as they walked toward the Night Words Pavilion.","Mystic Moon immediately walked up to greet Lin Yuan and said, “Young Lord, the Moon Empress wanted me to give this to you. She said that it’ll heal your battle injuries.”","As the Moon Empress’ Moon Envoy, Mystic Moon was just as proud that Lin Yuan had won the Martial Arts Stage.","He gave the brocade box to Lin Yuan and congratulated him as he said, “Young Lord, congratulations on winning the Martial Arts Stage.”","Mystic Moon was never present during the Moon Empress and Lin Yuan’s question-and-answer sessions. He also did not know exactly what the Moon Empress had taught Lin Yuan.","However, he had marveled more than once at the rate that Lin Yuan was improving.","Lin Yuan received the brocade box with a smile and said, “Thank you, Uncle Mystic.”","He opened the brocade box and saw one brownish-black pill.","From the moment he opened the box, a strong medicinal smell entered his nose.","Lin Yuan immediately felt his entire body and soul being soothed when he breathed in the medicinal smell."]},{"number":885,"title":"Chapter 885 - The Fourth Azure Envoy and News of the Class 6 Rift","paragraphs":["Since Mystic Moon did not look inside the brocade box, he did not know what the Moon Empress had given to Lin Yuan.","The moment he saw what was inside, Mystic Moon started to cough and splutter.","The Moon Empress was showering buckets of love on the Young Lord as usual.","Lin Yuan did lose a substantial amount of vitality during the Martial Stage component of the Martial Arts Stage. However, that rigid vitality had clearly been one of Lin Yuan’s secret weapons, and he seemed unaffected after using it.","Yet the Moon Empress was willing to give one Moon Dew Revival Pill, which could heal shattered souls and bring back people from the brink of death, to Lin Yuan just so he could recover from his battle.","This was too ridiculous!","Nonetheless, the Moon Empress would always lather Lin Yuan with such outrageous affection.","You Zhe gulped when he saw the Moon Dew Revival Pill.","The Moon Dew Revival Pill was unique to the Moon Empress, and she was the only person in the world who had it.","According to rumors, various Creation Breed plant-type feys were used as spiritual ingredients and mixed with the Sacred Cry Moon Beast’s tears to create the Moon Dew Revival Pill.","Although Chef Supreme and the Bamboo Monarch were also Class 5 Creation Masters, they were unable to create the Moon Dew Revival Pill without the recipe and the Sacred Cry Moon Beast’s tears.","Even Chief Guard Ye had to make a personal trip to the Radiant Moon Palace in order to obtain the Moon Dew Revival Pill. Yet now, the Moon Empress was casually giving it to Lin Yuan.","This was too frivolous!","While You Zhe was leading them to the Night Words Pavilion, he had already checked Lin Yuan’s injuries for fear that he had sustained hidden injuries during the fight.","But after thoroughly checking Lin Yuan’s condition, You Zhe realized that Lin Yuan was still as healthy as an ox.","He did not even have a scratch on him. It was clear that he had drunk his fill of Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar.","Although Lin Yuan did not know what this pill was, he used True to learn its effects.","He could not bring himself to consume such a precious pill.","After all, he did not have any injuries that needed to be healed by the pill.","Lin Yuan anxiously said to Mystic Moon, “Uncle Mystic, let me set this pill aside for now. I still haven’t finished eating the Diamond Smooth Crystal-Thread Jujube powder that Master gave me.”","Mystic Moon nodded and did not insist on Lin Yuan eating the Moon Dew Revival Pill because he saw no rush in eating it another day when Lin Yuan found it really necessary to do so.","After Lin Yuan kept away the brocade box with the Moon Dew Revival Pill, he took out the box with the Moonbeam Coronation Costume.","When he opened the box, he could not help but gasp in amazement at its beauty.","Mystic Moon quickly took the box from Lin Yuan and said, “Young Lord, take off the spirit qi clothes you’re currently wearing. It’ll be a rush to finish putting on the Moonbeam Coronation Costume in an hour.”","Lin Yuan hastily disrobed. He was in the presence of men and did not have anything to be ashamed about.","Mystic Moon immediately started helping Lin Yuan put on the Moonbeam Coronation Costume while You Zhe did the same for Liu Jie with the Night Clear Water Coronation Costume.","Both the Moonbeam Coronation Costume and Night Clear Water Coronation were equally challenging to put on.","Thankfully, Mystic Moon and You Zhe were extremely familiar with how to put the coronation costumes on.","While Mystic Moon was helping him to put on the Moonbeam Coronation Costume, Lin Yuan gently touched the plum flower patterns on his collar.","He realized that the plum flower patterns were not embroidered but rather seemed to be part of the fabric itself.","The plum flower petals even seemed to have the firmness of fresh flower petals. Lin Yuan could not help but be curious about how this was possible.","Mystic Moon noticed Lin Yuan’s actions and said with a smile, “Young Lord, these flower petals come from a Creation Breed plum flower fey. Once the other accessories are attached, these plum flower patterns will no longer be as obvious as the radiant pearl sash will cover them up. These plum flower petals are just the foundation to embellish the beauty of the radiant pearls. Otherwise, these plum flower petals have no place on the Moonbeam Coronation Costume.”","As he listened to Mystic Moon talk about the Moonbeam Coronation Costume, Lin Yuan suddenly felt as though it became much heavier.","He dared not imagine how much the Moonbeam Coronation Costume was worth.","The flowers of petal-type feys were their most valuable feature, yet a Creation Breed petal-type fey’s petals were still unworthy of being on the Moonbeam Coronation Costume.","This level of opulence was unimaginable.","Lin Yuan finally understood why he had not been able to learn anything about the Moonbeam Coronation Costume from True Data.","Morbius had not reached Fantasy Breed and could not check on Creation Breed feys.","It was just like how Lin Yuan could check on the Moon Dew Revival Pill’s effects but not what spiritual ingredients it was made of.","However, Lin Yuan did not know what the radiant pearls were. He assumed that he still did not have the authority to interact with something like that.","...","The veteran and top faction leaders were waiting for the Guard Ye Banquet to begin officially.","They were also silently listening to the conversation between the 13 members of royalty with rapt attention.","The Spacetime Elder, who had been silent until now, said to the other 12 members of royalty, “Did you hear that the Azure Envoys of the Azure Federation have decided who the fourth Azure Envoy will be?”","Night Leaning Moon, the Bamboo Monarch, Chef Supreme, and the Moon Empress frowned. Clearly, they had not heard the news.","But since the news had come from the Spacetime Elder, the news could only be true.","Both the Azure Federation and Radiance Federation were part of the three major factions and were connected by the Radiance Azure Waterway.","The federations traded an immense amount of resources with each other. Hence, news about the fourth Azure Envoy was truly important.","The calm voice from the phone said, “Spacetime Elder, stop showing off. You went to the Azure Federation recently, so it’s only natural that you know more about the happenings there than us.”","The Spacetime Elder replied hurriedly, and it was obvious that he greatly respected the man on the other end of the phone.","“Ten days ago, a young person from one of the Azure Federation’s 12 Class 5 families awakened two beast patterns. One of the beast patterns is from a Class 5 family, while the other is from a Class 4 family. Apparently, this young girl used to be ill.”","The calm voice replied, “It’s strange that the two beast patterns cohesively exist in her body without clashing with each other! There sure are more and more interesting young people! The news of the Class 6 dimensional rift will also be officially announced during the banquet later.”","The veteran and top faction leaders were immediately overcome with elation when they heard the calm voice over the phone."]},{"number":886,"title":"Chapter 886 - The Class 6 Dimensional Rift and the Abyssal World","paragraphs":["As the leaders of veteran and top factions, all they thought of was how to better expand their families and gain more resources.","A family needed resources to sustain their martial force, operations, and expansion.","Besides the veteran and top faction leaders whose juniors stood a chance of becoming a Radiance Envoy or Radiance Knight, the others merely regarded the news about the Azure Federation’s fourth Azure Envoy as another piece of passing information.","However, the news about the Class 6 dimensional rift made the hearts of the veteran and top faction leaders start to pound wildly.","In Class 5 dimensional rifts, dimensional lifeforms would enter the main world through the rift and start to attack. Spirit qi professionals could enter the dimensional rift after killing the dimensional lifeforms that had exited and search for resources within the dimensional rift as well as source-type lifeforms and sacred source lifeforms in the dimensional hub.","But in Class 6 dimensional rifts, the line between the main world and the dimensional world was blurred.","After the opening of a Class 6 dimensional rift, there would not be as many dimensional lifeforms pouring out as compared to a Class 5 dimensional lifeform.","However, the power of the dimensional lifeforms was not guaranteed.","A Class 6 dimensional rift was connected to the entire dimensional world.","Once a dimensional rift was opened, a dimensional membrane was created within the layers of the rift.","Due to this dimensional layer, the lifeforms inside the dimensional world would not feel the draw of the dimensional rift or be able to see the dimensional rift.","But one careless step into the dimensional rift and the lifeform would be sent to the main world.","The lifeforms inside the dimensional world had varying powers. Some were as strong as Bronze feys, while others were as strong as Creation Breed feys.","There had only been one Class 6 dimensional rift in the history of the Radiance Federation, and it had been connected to the abyssal world.","When that Class 6 dimensional rift had opened, two Class 10 lifeforms which were as powerful as Creation Breed feys, had happened to be fighting.","Luckily, the Class 6 dimensional rift had opened in the remote and desolate Scorching Desert.","The Scorching Desert was about 10,000 kilometers away from the nearest populated city, but the tremors from the fight between the two Class 10 lifeforms had been felt in the city.","The fight had also seriously affected the shape of the Scorching Desert and caused the temperature to rise significantly. The center of the desert had been melted into flowing lava.","It was only when the Spirit Guards and Chief Guard Ye had arrived to help that the Class 10 lifeforms were finally quelled.","Chief Guard Ye had sent out 20 Guard Envoys to seal off the Class 6 dimensional rift while Chief Guard Ye personally ventured into the abyssal world.","She had killed all the lifeforms within a 1,000-kilometer radius of the dimensional rift inside the abyssal world before ordering the 20 Guard Envoys to stand guard inside the dimensional rift to stop the lifeforms from spilling out to the main world.","Risk always went hand in hand with benefits.","Although unpredictable risks accompanied the Class 6 dimensional rift, the benefits that could be reaped far outweighed those risks.","The dimensional world connected to the Class 6 dimensional rift was an enormous treasure trove.","A dimensional world had much more resources than a dimensional rift. If resources could be mined from a dimensional world through a Class 6 dimensional rift, it would allow a faction to fill their pockets rapidly and push them up to another level.","Due to the uniqueness of a Class 6 dimensional rift, their existence was like a second world that was connected to the Radiance Federation.","Factions could be constructed within a Class 6 dimensional rift and expanded into the dimensional world.","The factions in the main world could be connected to the factions in the dimensional rift to transport resources from the dimensional world to the main world.","Naturally, sufficient power was required for this to be sustainable.","Moreover, that Class 6 dimensional rift was an abyss dimensional rift, and abyssal lifeforms were not vegetarian.","Since Class 6 abyss dimensional rifts were connected to the entire dimensional world, if they were also opened in other federations, experts from other federations would also be able to enter the abyssal world through those Class 6 dimensional rifts.","Class 6 dimensional rifts were the chance for all the major federations to compete in the same playing field.","The gears in the minds of the veteran and top faction leaders were all turning quickly.","Did that member of royalty mean to say that the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift in the desert that had been sealed close to a decade ago was about to open?","If so, that would be amazing news.","At that moment, Zuo Ming arrived inside the Midnight Palace and anxiously whispered a few words into Night Leaning Moon’s ear while placing one hand behind her back.","The chime of a clock once again reverberated throughout the Midnight Palace.","Night Leaning Moon stood up and said, “It’s time for the Guard Ye Banquet. Let’s prepare ourselves for it.”","She circulated her spiritual power, and water-like spiritual power flowed into the hades etutitsorp floor of the Midnight Palace. At the same time, the aura of an everlasting lonely night rippled out of Night Leaning Moon’s body.","The leaders and young disciples of the veteran and top factions suddenly felt the floor under them change shape rapidly.","The entire Midnight Palace seemed to be full of mechanisms as it split, spliced, and re-shaped itself.","Soon, the area outside and inside the Midnight Palace were combined together to form a large hall.","The 13 seats of the members of royalty were now placed all around the hall, and each had a few chairs behind them. These new chairs were only slightly shorter than the 13 original chairs. The number of chairs behind each of the 13 seats was different where some had many, while others only had a few, and there were even some of the original seats with no chairs behind them.","It was clear that the number of the new seats was intentional.","A few seats had also appeared in the center of the hall, and they were even shorter than the seats behind the 13 original seats.","Every seat in the center of the hall had an empty space behind it that could fit one or two people.","A large stage covered in complete Law Crystals appeared in the center of the stage.","Balls of high-class strange fire Burning Sun Sacred Fire hung above the stage.","The leaders and young disciples of veteran and top factions were momentarily stunned."]},{"number":887,"title":"Chapter 887 - My Disciple Cant Be Left Standing","paragraphs":["The Bamboo Monarch marveled at the newly created hall and said, “Leaning Moon, your Class 5 Spirit Craftsman abilities are truly impressive. Every time I witness it, I have the urge to ask you to re-do my Xiang Bamboo Pavilion.”","Night Leaning Moon shot the Bamboo Monarch a strange look and replied, “Are you looking to change the name of your house from the Purple Bamboo Pavilion to the Xiang Bamboo Pavilion?”","The Bamboo Monarch coughed lightly and thought,? Given her emotional intelligence, it’s no wonder that the Moon Empress didn’t pick her to be a Moon Envoy. I’m clearly trying to curry favor with the beauty behind me. Can’t Night Leaning Moon see that?","He could not say those words out loud for fear of being attacked by Night Leaning Moon.","The veteran and top faction leaders suddenly discovered that Chief Guard Ye was a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman.","There were many more Class 5 Spirit Craftsmen in the Radiance Federation than Class 5 Creation Masters.","There were a similar number of pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters as Class 5 Spirit Craftsmen, both groups had about 100 people.","They had all sought out Class 5 Spirit Craftsmen for help to create items before.","However, most Class 5 Spirit Craftsmen did not have Chief Guard Ye’s skill of fitting the entire Midnight Palace with mechanisms.","Spirit Craftsmen were just like Creation Masters in that there was no level beyond Class 5.","But it was clear that Chief Guard Ye’s Spirit Craftsman powers were much higher than other Class 5 Spirit Craftsmen.","The aura of an everlasting lonely night suddenly retracted back into Night Leaning Moon’s body.","At that moment, an image appeared on the backs of all the seats.","The images were the 13 members of royalty’s coronation patterns and the veteran and top factions’ family crests.","As the host of the Guard Ye Banquet, Night Leaning Moon flashed herself onto the stage and said in a cold voice, “Everyone, the Guard Ye Banquet is officially starting. Please take your seats.”","Night Leaning Moon flashed herself back into her seat.","Cicada Song placed the phone in its rightful seat before flashing himself into his own seat.","After the 13 members of royalty took their seats, the veteran and top faction leaders also took their rightful seats while the young disciples stood behind their elders.","Zong Ze, Gu Lang, Li Changlin, Zhang Yingying, Xia Chen, and Wang Fuxiang sat behind the members of royalty.","In a flurry of movement, everyone was in their seats.","Cold Moon and Zuo Ming stood behind the members of royalty like stationed guards.","The veteran and top factions’ leaders and young disciples noticed that out of all the members of royalty, only the seats behind Chief Guard Ye and the Moon Empress were still empty.","The only people absent were the winner of the Martial Stage Liu Jie and the winner of the Martial Arts Stage Lin Yuan.","Those who had guessed Lin Yuan’s identity were now certain that they had been right, while those who had not known about Lin Yuan’s identity were astonished.","At that moment, four people walked out of the long corridor at the back of the hall.","The veteran and top faction leaders were simultaneously dumbfounded. Even the members of royalty besides Chief Guard Ye and the Moon Empress were stunned.","Their gazes swung between the two young men walking out of the long corridor and the Moon Empress and Night Leaning Moon.","A voice in the center area of the hall exclaimed, “What? Why is Lin Yuan wearing a coronation costume? Coronation costume—”","Before Gao Feng could finish speaking, he realized that he had misspoken.","Gao Feng stole a glance at his father and saw him viciously glaring back at him.","Gao Pei’s glare made Gao Feng clear his throat in discomfort.","However, he also noticed Gao Pei’s lips curling upward and his expression lifting as though he was frozen in a smile.","Gao Feng thought,? What’s up with my father’s weird expression?","Suddenly, Gao Feng felt himself being lifted up by a gentle wind of spiritual power.","By the time he regained his senses, he found himself standing in front of a smiling man.","The man was dressed in an elegant light green coronation costume that had faint cicada patterns on it.","The cicada patterns intersected each other, forming an extremely sophisticated image.","An unknown glittery silk thread threaded through the coronation costume to form two large trees with a few cicadas around them.","The sight of these cicadas was enough to calm Gao Feng down, and he seemed to be able to hear the soft humming of cicadas.","Wasn’t this person Cicada Song, one of the three members of royalty who spent most of his time in the imperial court?","Gao Feng jumped in fright. He had no clue why Cicada Song had picked him out of the crowd.","Could my slip of tongue have angered Cicada Song? Is he going to punish me?","Gao Feng remembered his father telling him that Cicada Song’s smiley face made him seem approachable, but he was actually the most unapproachable member of royalty.","Every member of royalty had their own role to play. For example, Chief Guard Ye was in charge of the Spirit Guards, while the Spacetime Elder was in charge of Ostrich Logistics.","Every member of royalty held special authority and responsibilities.","Cicada Song’s role was to govern the City Lords of the 36 cities, and he had the power to dismiss any of the 36 City Lords.","The veteran and top factions were all interacting within the 36 cities. Thus, none of them dared to cross Cicada Song.","While Gao Feng was busy being nervous, Cicada Song softly said, “Young fellow, I know your name is Gao Feng. You don’t have to be nervous.”","Cicada Song stood up and shouted over to Chief Guard Ye, “Chief Guard Ye, please prepare a seat for my disciple. Your disciples are all sitting. My disciple can’t be left standing.”"]},{"number":888,"title":"Chapter 888 - Where is Master!?","paragraphs":["Cicada Song’s proclamation immediately stunned Gao Feng.","Gao Feng instinctively stuck his fingers into his ears to clean them out in case he had misheard.","However, he suddenly remembered how inappropriate it was for him to clean out his ears right in front of Cicada Song.","Cicada Song reached out to adjust Gao Feng’s collar and said, “What’s wrong? Don’t you want to be my disciple?”","Gao Feng snapped out of his confused trance. He was not stupid and would never reject Cicada Song’s public invitation to be his disciple.","Nonetheless, Gao Feng did not understand which part of him was worthy enough for Cicada Song to want to accept him as a disciple.","It could not be because of his father or even his grandfather.","Gao Feng thought hard about this question and realized that it had to be because of his performance on the Martial Stage.","This was the only possible explanation.","The Breeze Hibiscus and Spirit Spring Lily were definitely not enough to catch the attention of Cicada Song.","Hence, it had to be because of the secret weapon that he had not even told his father about, the Yellow Spring Lily.","From the moment Gao Feng had seen the Yellow Spring Lily, he decided to use the Elemental Shellfish and Island Whale to trade for it.","Moreover, he had been delighted by the exclusive skill that the Yellow Spring Lily had attained after evolving to Fantasy Breed.","Gao Feng could not help but be grateful to Lin Yuan.","Although he had used his own resources to trade for the Yellow Spring Lily, if Lin Yuan had not produced the Yellow Spring Lily in the first place, Gao Feng would not have been able to trade for it.","Lin Yuan was the blessing that had given him the opportunity to change his life!","While Gao Feng was thinking, he was still alert enough to hastily nod and say, “I want to, I’m willing!”","Night Leaning Moon frowned when she heard what Cicada Song said and seemed annoyed.","The Guard Ye Banquet was meant for her and Xiyue to debut their disciples, so she felt that Cicada Song’s sudden acceptance of Gao Feng as his disciple was stealing the thunder.","Night Leaning Moon already knew that Cicada Song wanted to accept Gao Feng as his disciple, but she had assumed that he would contact the Gao family privately after the Guard Ye Banquet.","She never expected him to make such a public announcement.","But regardless of her displeasure, she injected spiritual power into the floor, and the mechanisms behind Cicada Song’s seat shifted to produce another chair.","Cicada Song dragged Gao Feng over to the new chair before returning to his own seat.","Although he had just accepted Gao Feng as his disciple, he was already acting in such a considerate manner.","Iron Prison could not help but be envious of Cicada Song’s acceptance of a disciple, but none of the disciples’ performance on the Martial Stage had been noteworthy.","The only young disciples who had had the chance to show off their fighting power were Zong Ze and Lin Yuan.","Besides Lin Yuan, Zong Ze, and Liu Jie, Iron Prison was not interested in anyone else.","Although Du Shuo had put up a good fight with Liu Jie, Iron Prison was still not interested because he felt that Du Shuo’s feys were strong but unable to form a united system. Hence, there was nothing special about him.","Gao Feng was still shaken up, but he was more excited than panicked.","Thanks to Liu Jie, he had already counted himself lucky to have won second place in the Martial Stage.","Now that he was Cicada Song’s disciple, he was no longer just lucky.","Gao Pei beamed brightly and held his head up high as he basked in the envious gazes all around him.","The veteran and top faction leaders were already aware that Cicada Song wanted to accept Gao Feng as his disciple.","After shooting jealous looks at Gao Feng, the other young disciples turned their attention to the two young men walking out of the long corridor.","The sight of the young men’s attire created shockwaves that could even be felt in the depths of one’s soul.","They were dressed in similar coronation costumes to what the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye were wearing.","A moment later, they noticed that the two young men’s coronation costumes did not have the coronation patterns.","Although Liu Jie was wearing the coronation costume, he was still wearing the standard Spirit Guard mask.","Nonetheless, Liu Jie and Lin Yuan’s charisma dominated the room, and no one could look away from the handsome men clad in ostentatious coronation costumes.","The veteran and top factions’ leaders and young disciples could not even begin to imagine how much the Moon Empress and Chief Guard Ye doted on their disciples for them to create exact replicas of their coronation costumes.","Although the other members of royalty had accepted disciples, it was unheard of for members of royalty to create replicas of their coronation costumes for their disciples to wear.","The two young men walking out of the long corridor looked majestic and distant at the same time.","The Moon Empress and Night Leaning Moon circulated their spiritual power and dragged Liu Jie and Lin Yuan to them.","The Moon Empress adjusted Lin Yuan’s pearl sash and said, “I sewed this myself two months ago. It looks like a perfect fit. However, you’re only 19 and will continue to grow. Once you’re taller, I’ll alter it for you.”","When Lin Yuan looked at the Moon Empress, he suddenly felt as though his thick yet light Moonbeam Coronation Costume was unspeakably warm.","A radiant smile appeared on Lin Yuan’s face as he said, “Master, I’ll do my best to grow taller.”","The Moon Empress suddenly felt that the mature Lin Yuan seemed rather childish at the moment.","She savored this innocence and smiled warmly back at him.","The crowd’s jaws dropped when they saw the interaction between Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress. The Moonbeam Coronation Costume that Lin Yuan was wearing was evidence of the Moon Empress’ affection for him.","However, none of them were expecting to see this warm side of the ever-cold Moon Empress.","Everyone was waiting for the Guard Ye Banquet to officially begin.","There was one person confusedly standing behind an empty seat. This person was Zheng Kaiyuan.","The Zheng family was one of the three largest veteran factions in Indigo Azure City and did not have the authority to attend the Guard Ye Banquet.","He was able to attend because his Master Miao Qi had brought him along.","He had wanted to tell Miao Qi about how Miao Zhuo had gotten into trouble.","But now, he realized that it was not just Miao Zhuo who Zuo Ming had chased out, but even Miao Qi was gone from the Guard Ye Banquet.","Zheng Kaiyuan had initially been happy that he had been able to join Lin Yuan’s group.","However, his brain was now consumed by one question— Where is Master!?"]},{"number":889,"title":"Chapter 889 - What a Good Bait!","paragraphs":["As the direct descendant of a veteran faction, Zheng Kaiyuan was no fool.","Moreover, he had spent many years by Miao Qi’s side and had received support and education from a top faction.","As such, his horizons were broader than that of other disciples of veteran factions.","He quickly assessed the situation and guessed that Miao Qi must have met with some trouble in the Midnight Palace.","She could have offended someone higher up on the pecking order than her like Miao Zhuo and had been chased out of the Midnight Palace.","If she had left of her own accord, she would have informed Zheng Kaiyuan.","However, Zheng Kaiyuan could not come up with a plausible scenario of what exactly Miao Qi could have done.","The seats in the center of the hall were positioned close to each other.","Zheng Kaiyuan was in Connected Beast Park’s seating area, and next to him was Four Beasts Territory’s seating area.","If this was any other time, he would not have dared to ask the head of the Fang family from Four Beasts Territory for information.","Zheng Kaiyuan might be in Connected Beast Park’s seating area, but he was acutely conscious of the fact that his surname was not Miao.","But he remembered that he might be in the same friend group as the Moon Empress, Chief Guard Ye, the Bamboo Monarch, and Chef Supreme’s disciples and managed to muster up the courage to walk over to the head of the Fang family.","He coughed and asked, “Senior Fang, where... Where is my Master Miao Qi?”","Zheng Kaiyuan made sure to include the word Master to emphasize his identity.","Fang Zhan could not help but be curious when he saw the hesitant young man slowly walking over to him.","Since Zheng Kaiyuan kept his body angled away from Fang Zhan, the latter could not see the Zheng family icon on Zheng Kaiyuan’s collar.","Additionally, the spirit qi clothes Zheng Kaiyuan was wearing did not look like the Hundred Beasts New Sprouts attire that Miao Zhuo had been wearing.","Thus, Fang Zhan did not immediately recognize Zheng Kaiyuan.","But when Fang Zhan heard Zheng Kaiyuan announce his identity, his gaze shifted.","Fang Zhan had just heard from his grandson Fang He about the commotion that Miao Zhuo had caused outside the Midnight Palace. This incident made Fan Zhan re-evaluate his decision to collaborate with Connected Beast Park.","He was also irked by Connected Beast Park because his grandson had almost been dragged into shouldering the blame and could have ended up being punished by Zuo Ming as well. Thankfully, Chief Guard Ye’s disciple had been gracious.","Connected Beast Park’s senior and junior both liked to start trouble.","Just as Fang Zhan was about to start berating Zheng Kaiyuan, Fang He bowed and whispered into his ear.","Fang He’s words made the way that he looked at Zheng Kaiyuan change, and his tone also became more polite.","“Your Master Miao Qi had worn spirit qi clothes that bore similar designs to Lord Bamboo Monarch’s coronation patterns. This is a form of disrespect to Lord Bamboo Monarch, and she was chased out of the Guard Ye Banquet by You Zhe.”","Fang Zhan did not go into details because he knew that saying too much could lead to one’s downfall.","This matter concerned Lord Bamboo Monarch’s personal life, and any flippant comment would be seen as an insult.","After carefully studying Zheng Kaiyuan for a while, Fan Zhan could not see any impressive traits.","If he was impressive in any way, he would have participated in the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, or Martial Arts Stage.","Fang Zhan could not see one reason why this disciple of a veteran faction had the right to be part of that special friend group.","Zheng Kaiyuan was stupefied by Fang Zhan’s words and felt the air around him grow cold.","Not only had Miao Zhuo offended the Moon Empress’ disciple and had been kicked out after having his soul injured by Chief Guard Ye’s disciple, but even Miao Qi had disrespected Lord Bamboo Monarch because of the design of her spirit qi clothes.","It was likely that Miao Qi’s position in the Miao family would plunge after this incident, and when that happened, Zheng Kaiyuan would no longer be able to enjoy his current lifestyle.","This thought made Zheng Kaiyuan’s legs go numb, and his body started to sway unsteadily.","At this moment, Fang Zhan said, “I heard that you’re connected to the members of royalty’s disciples. You can ask them for mercy on your Master’s behalf. Old Miao must be despairing now trying to come up with a way to express his apologies to the members of royalty.”","Zheng Kaiyuan froze, and his legs refilled with strength.","Fang Zhan’s words had given him new hope.","He had been shocked when Lin Yuan called him over and did not understand why Lin Yuan was being so friendly with him.","After joining the group, he had not dared to speak to the other disciples of royalty, and he was not naive enough to believe that his pleas of mercy would be effective.","However, everyone had seen the way that Lin Yuan had treated Zheng Kaiyuan. Now, Lin Yuan had been publicly declared as the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Zheng Kaiyuan could bank on Lin Yuan’s status to save himself from punishment when he returned home. He might even be able to meet with his grandfather, who never wanted to meet with him, and climb to an even higher position in the Miao family.","Even without Miao Qi, he would be able to thrive.","Lin Yuan had even exchanged contact details with Zheng Kaiyuan, and he would be able to help the Miao family to get in contact with Lin Yuan.","As he looked at the Miao family crest on the back of the chair in front of him, he felt wild ambition surge within him.","His ambition surpassed his fear, and Zheng Kaiyuan planted himself down on the Miao family’s seat.","Lin Yuan noticed what Zheng Kaiyuan did and gently tapped his fingers on the armrest of his chair.","“Zheng Kaiyuan sure is a great bait.”","Lin Yuan had been trying to come up with a way to lure Zheng Kaiyuan, but it seemed like he did not need to worry anymore. All Lin Yuan needed to do now was throw his net, and Zheng Kaiyuan would be the bait that lured the Miao family in.","The Guard Ye Banquet was in full swing, but Lin Yuan did not like such grand events.","Lin Yuan fixed his gaze on the complete Law Crystals lining the stage as he comforted the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen in the depths of his soul.","“The Law Crystals on stage aren’t ours. You can’t absorb them.”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen became disappointed.","Lin Yuan hurriedly said, “Don’t you already have many Law Source Crystals? You haven’t even finished absorbing those! If my memory serves, you prefer to absorb Law Source Crystals over Law Crystals.”"]},{"number":890,"title":"Chapter 890 - The Opening of the Abyssal World","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen said in a hurt voice, “Master, I eat Law Source Crystals every day. Isn’t it normal for me to want to have a change of taste? I’m afraid that at the rate I absorb the Law Source Crystals, I’ll soon run out and have to go hungry. ”","Lin Yuan immediately knew that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was feeling this way because there had been a period of time where it had nothing to eat. Now that it could eat Law Source Crystals every day, it was wary that its supply would run out and wanted to stock up.","Lin Yuan replied in amusement, “Don’t worry. I might not be able to always promise the same amount of Law Source Crystals, but you should have some every day. If you run out of Law Source Crystals, you’ll still have Law Crystals.”","Lin Yuan had confirmed the power of the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen during the fight with Zong Ze. Hence, he was definitely going to continue working hard at nurturing the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","He could use the laws on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt to increase his body’s resistance and the law worlds to increase his power.","He still had a fair number of Law Source Crystals, and they should be enough to evolve another Myth III law into a law world.","Amongst the three complete Myth III laws that Lin Yuan had, the Icy Flames Law could increase his body’s resistance to ice and fire, while the Vicious Poison Law could increase his resistance to poison.","The Dead Dream Law could increase Lin Yuan’s resistance to dark-type and spiritual-type elements.","Although the Dead Dream Law was a dark-type law, it attacked using dreams, which was considered a special spiritual attack.","Lin Yuan had Genius and the Dark Death World. Hence, he did not need the Dead Dream Law to increase his resistance to dark-type and spiritual-type elements.","Thus, he would not be investing any Law Source Crystals into evolving the Dead Dream Law into the Dead Dream World.","Lin Yuan hesitated between the Vicious Poison Law and the Icy Flames Law.","The Icy Flames Law had been extremely helpful during his fight with Zong Ze. If he evolved the Icy Flames Law to the Icy Flames World, Lin Yuan would no longer need to use the Jasmine Lily’s Vitality Imprint in future fights with Zong Ze.","He would also become unaffected by the Fiery Sky Hou’s Dreamland of Fire.","By evolving the Vicious Poison Law to Vicious Poison World, Lin Yuan’s resistance to poison would be greatly improved, and he might even become immune to the attacks of poison-type feys.","Poison-type feys were not the only ones that could use poison-type attacks as many plant-type feys also contained poison.","Lin Yuan was about to head to the Divine Wood Federation. As such, it seemed more beneficial to evolve the Vicious Poison Law to the Vicious Poison World.","There were not many Myth Breed poison-type feys, but those that existed were even more powerful than other feys of the same grade.","The Vicious Poison Law that came from the Aquamarine Scales Sky-Swallowing Python would provide another poison-type Sword Skill.","Since Lin Yuan had not summoned the feys that Black used, his identity as Black had not been exposed. He had managed to completely separate his different fighting abilities.","Lin Yuan felt that this distinction was advantageous.","Lin Yuan’s identity as Black would allow him to continue training on Star Web. He was also going to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s selection as Black.","With the Order of Radiant Light, Lin Yuan had gained an advantage over others in the race to become a Radiance Envoy.","It would not be too late for him to combine both his identities in the Radiance Envoy selection two years later.","Suddenly, Mystic Moon’s voice pulled Lin Yuan out of his thoughts.","“Young Lord, although the Guard Ye Banquet is already in full swing, there are still at least two hours to go before it ends. If you’re bored, I have some snacks here you can munch on to pass the time.”","Mystic Moon waved his hand and produced two glass bottles with various Diamond spirit fruits inside.","The spirit fruits had been dried and stored in Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar inside the bottles.","After absorbing the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar, the spirit fruits looked like beautiful crystals that would pique anyone’s appetite.","However, Lin Yuan waved his hand dismissively and said, “Uncle Mystic, I already ate my fill before the Martial Arts Stage, so I’m not hungry yet.”","Perhaps it was due to his experience in his previous life, but Lin Yuan felt that it was strange to eat during such an event.","Mystic Moon gave the bottles to Cold Moon instead, who created an ice needle to pick out the sweet fruits from inside the bottle and happily tucked in.","Lin Yuan looked toward the center of the hall and saw that Night Leaning Moon had stepped onto the stage.","The veteran and top faction leaders looked anxious and excited.","Lin Yuan had a feeling that these veteran and top faction leaders knew what announcements were going to be made. Otherwise, there was no reason for them to already be excited.","While Lin Yuan started guessing what the announcements could be about, Night Leaning Moon said, “Besides officially introducing my and the Moon Empress’ disciples and giving a chance for the younger generation to display their powers, this Guard Ye Banquet is being held because the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift in the Scorching Desert has been further secured and stabilized after much effort. It has now become a permanent tunnel that connects to the abyssal world.”","The veteran and top faction leaders became even more excited.","Lin Yuan was slightly shocked by the news.","He had only heard of Class 5 dimensional rifts before, and this was the first time that he was hearing of a Class 6 dimensional rift.","The Moon Empress noticed Lin Yuan’s confused expression and provided him with an explanation.","Lin Yuan finally found out what the Class 6 dimensional rift was all about from her explanation.","It turned out that once a Class 6 dimensional rift became a permanent door to the dimensional world, the main world could enter at any time to harvest resources from the dimensional world.","This was great news for the main world.","Lin Yuan felt that the opening of the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift was lucky because the water dimensional world was the most difficult to access out of the five dimensional worlds."]},{"number":891,"title":"Chapter 891 - The Crying Mother of Bloodbath","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Even if spirit qi professionals utilized special feys to breathe underwater, the effects were limited.","The water world was an endless sea that had countless water world dimensional lifeforms swimming in it.","Spirit qi professionals were unable to venture too deeply into the water world. Once they ran out of oxygen, even the strongest spirit qi professionals would have to stay in the water world forever.","The bodies of water world dimensional lifeforms were useless to spirit qi professionals. If the water world dimensional lifeforms were removed from the water world, they would become burdens to the spirit qi professional.","The stench of rotting water world dimensional lifeforms was unbearable.","The subterranean world was much stronger than the water world. It had a large amount of metal spiritual ingredients which could be used to create different items and nurture feys.","As such, the metal spiritual ingredients were beneficial to spirit qi professionals.","However, it was just as difficult to explore the subterranean world as it was to explore the water world.","The subterranean world’s environment was not friendly to spirit qi professionals.","In order to explore the subterranean world, one needed a fey that could provide light. This seemed like a waste of skills to most people.","There were also more dangers in the subterranean world than just subterranean dimensional lifeforms as earthquakes and rock slides were also common. Once an earthquake or rock slide occurred, the exploring spirit qi professional would definitely lose their life.","The abyssal and alien insect worlds were much less dangerous than the water and subterranean worlds.","The abyssal world seemed more suitable for spirit qi professionals to venture into because their lifeforms were powerful but few in number.","A spirit qi professional team might be able to launch an attack into the alien insect world, but the flood of alien insects would easily overwhelm the team.","Strange flames could also be found in the abyssal world. Many lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals required strange flames, and a large supply of strange flames from the abyssal world would be able to increase the power of lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals in the main world.","Although alien insects were also a rare resource that was comparable to strange flames, the flesh of alien insects was much less valuable than the flesh of abyssal dimensional lifeforms.","Abyssal monsters could be separated to produce spiritual ingredients, but they were of little use to Creation Masters.","Hence, abyssal monsters were the most expensive dimensional lifeform.","However, Lin Yuan felt that the most suitable dimensional world for exploration was the rare marsh world.","The marsh world had a similar environment to the main world.","Although the marsh world had marsh in its name, less than 60% of the world was marshland, and the remaining 40% was land.","The marsh world consisted of many small islands floating in a marsh.","The lifeforms in the marsh world were amphibious, but there was a large amount of earth-type elements in the marsh. Spirit qi professionals would be able to use earth-type feys in the marsh world.","The earth-type feys would be able to use the pure earth-type elements to combine the small islands into a large earth mass.","Although the marsh world was damp, it was very suitable for nurturing damp and climbing-type feys, insect-species feys, and plant-type feys.","Despite most of the dimensional lifeforms in the marsh dimensional rift having similar value to water world dimensional lifeforms, some marsh dimensional lifeforms such as the Medusa had earth-shattering value.","While Lin Yuan was thinking, Night Leaning Moon said, “The Class 6 abyss dimensional rift that opened in the Scorching Desert is now available to all veteran and top factions. However, all the factions will have to pool their resources in order to sustain the opening. Every faction that enters the abyssal world will have to provide 10 mid-grade strange flames per day.”","After Night Leaning Moon finished speaking, Lin Yuan could clearly see the yearning bursting forth from the expressions of the veteran and top factions.","Evidently, they all wanted to expand their factions into the abyssal world.","Compared to the benefits of expanding into the abyssal world, 10 strange flames per day was nothing.","Hence, the price for a month in the abyssal world was 300 strange flames.","300 strange flames may seem like a lot, but as long as a faction dispatched enough people, it should be easy to collect more than enough.","Most of the major factions in the Radiance Federation had expanded to a respectable extent, and further expansion would result in them fighting over valuable resources with each other.","The opening of the abyssal world was a chance for the factions to break into another area for expansion.","The abyssal world was much larger than the abyssal world.","Just as Lin Yuan was thinking about whether to expand Sky City into the abyssal world, Genius said to Lin Yuan through their spiritual link, “Yuan, your phone has been ringing for five minutes in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. There have already been eight calls. Is it an emergency?”","Lin Yuan quickly summoned his phone from the Spirit Lock spatial zone and saw that the calls had all come from the Mother of Bloodbath.","He did not want to answer a call at this time, but since it came from the Mother of Bloodbath, Lin Yuan had a bad feeling about it.","The Mother of Bloodbath knew that he was attending the Guard Ye Banquet with Liu Jie and would not call him over a trivial matter.","Moreover, this was when Endless Summer could evolve to Creation Breed.","Lin Yuan anxiously picked up the call.","It was a severe matter for Myth Breed feys to undergo the Trial of World Creation to evolve to Creation Breed.","He picked up the call and heard the ever-calm Mother of Bloodbath sobbing on the other end.","“Lin Yuan, Sister Summer is in the remote area 3,000 kilometers away from the Royal Capital to prepare to undergo the Trial of World Creation. Although she used pure law power to evolve the Enlightenment Law, it’s much harder to evolve than other laws.. When the first trial descended, Sister Summer was seriously injured. I’m afraid that she won’t be able to handle the next two trials!”"]},{"number":892,"title":"Chapter 892 - Im With Master","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan clenched his fist tightly as distress flooded him, and he thought,? I can’t believe I guessed right.","Lin Yuan had seen several Myth Breed feys undergo World Cleansing, and each time, the fey had almost stepped through death’s door.","The dangers of the World Cleansing could not hold a candle to that of the Trial of World Creation.","The World Cleansing was like inching by death’s door, while the Trial of World Creation was like barging through Hell.","The dangers and difficulty of the Trial of World Creation were the reasons why there were so few Creation Breed feys.","Many pinnacle emperor-class experts had spent over 10 years building their power to enable their feys to undergo the Trial of World Creation. However, they were still unwilling to send their feys to undergo the Trial of World Creation for fear of the dangers.","Not every emperor-class expert could handle the possible loss of their fey after the failure of the Trial of World Creation.","If the emperor-class experts were adamant on their feys evolving to Creation Breed, they would spend a large sum to seek help from a thearch-class expert with Creation Breed feys.","Even with the help of a thearch-class expert, there was no guarantee that the fey would be able to safely overcome the Trial of World Creation.","There would always be feys that failed to overcome the Trial of World Creation.","The journey of evolution was like a pyramid. The feys on the lower levels would have to put their lives on the line in order to climb up to the peak.","The law of nature maintained a constant number of living creatures. This balance could only be the result of a cycle of birth and death.","The Moon Empress had explained Creation Breeds and the Trial of World Creation in detail to Lin Yuan in a previous question-and-answer session.","The World Cleansing was the first test that a fey had to overcome. The fey that was able to sustain the World Cleansing would gain a deeper understanding of its own law.","The World Grace would significantly improve a fey’s law.","The Trial of World Creation used the power of world cleaving to splice the complete law in a pinnacle Myth III fey. After three trials of splicing, the broken laws would become strangely connected to form a law world.","Thus, the first obstacle of the Trial of World Creation was the pain of law splicing.","Although this pain would lead to a new lease of life, law power was the foundation of Myth Breed feys.","Additionally, there were two other trials that the fey would have to undergo while sustaining the pain of law splicing. Even for gifted feys, it was extremely difficult to handle.","After the three trials in the Trial of World Creation, the Creation World Ley Line would descend.","When the Creation World Ley Line was fused with the law world, all the injuries sustained during the Trial of World Creation would be healed.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s call put Lin Yuan in a tough spot.","If it was an issue with resources such as a lack of Law Crystals with pure law power, Lin Yuan would be able to supply them easily.","Even if Lin Yuan had trouble supplying the resources, he would find a way to solve the shortage.","Unfortunately, this issue concerned the Trial of World Creation, and he would only be able to help Endless Summer safely overcome the Trial of World Creation if he had enough power.","Hence, he had no choice but to ask the Moon Empress for help.","Although Lin Yuan had always relied on his own hard work to improve himself, this determination was not as important as Endless Summer’s life.","Lin Yuan quickly tried to comfort the Mother of Bloodbath. “Don’t get yourself too worked up. I gave you some of the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles. Do you still have them?”","The Mother of Bloodbath sobbed and replied, “I have them. I’ve been keeping them in a Diamond fey storage box.”","It took the three tentacles out of the red crystal-cluster earring Diamond fey storage box.","Lin Yuan sighed in relief when he heard that the Mother of Bloodbath still had the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles.","According to the Mother of Bloodbath, Endless Summer was in a remote area 3,000 kilometers outside of the Royal Capital.","Without the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles, he would not know where to find the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer even with the Moon Empress’s help.","There was a half an hour interval in between each splice in the Trial of World Creation, and eight minutes had already passed since the Mother of Bloodbath had called Lin Yuan.","This meant that there were still 22 minutes to go before the next splice, which was enough time for Lin Yuan to use the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles to make several return trips.","Endless Summer must have sensed that it had broken through a barrier while using Law Crystals to temper the Enlightenment Law and dragged the Mother of Bloodbath to a remote area in a fit of delight to undergo the Trial of World Creation.","Lin Yuan had been greatly looking forward to Endless Summer evolving to Creation Breed.","Endless Summer had used a large number of Law Crystals and became anxious when it could not break through.","Lin Yuan sighed. Endless Summer was so carelessly taking on the Trial of World Creation because of all the pressure he had put on it.","While he was thinking, Lin Yuan said to the Mother of Bloodbath, “Good job holding on to the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles. I’ll find a way to come over to help you now.”","He thought about how the Mother of Bloodbath was wailing and went on to say, “I’m with Master.”","He had added the last line in an attempt to put the Mother of Bloodbath at ease.","After hearing what Lin Yuan said, the Mother of Bloodbath’s choking sobs seemed to quell.","If Lin Yuan can seek help from the Moon Empress, Sister Summer will definitely be able to safely overcome the Trial of World Creation.","Even though the Mother of Bloodbath’s fright had decreased, it still could not relax.","When Endless Summer had sustained the first blow from the Trial of World Creation, the Mother of Bloodbath had tried to help take some of the damage."]},{"number":893,"title":"Chapter 893 - Kill Food Worm","paragraphs":["Although the Mother of Bloodbath had only helped to take a small portion of the damage, it had sustained a serious internal injury.","The Mother of Bloodbath felt as though its internal organs were tangled with each other, and it was extremely excruciating.","The pain was so severe that the Mother of Bloodbath could no longer maintain its human form.","The Mother of Bloodbath fought through the pain and looked at Endless Summer’s pained expression after almost being split in two from the first splice.","Although Endless Summer had also sustained a serious injury, it remained conscious.","At that moment, Endless Summer felt unspeakable regret.","Endless Summer had been caught up in its desire to evolve to Creation Breed. It felt that it had not been of much help to Lin Yuan ever since it became Lin Yuan’s Protector. Rather, it had been Lin Yuan who had been continuously helping it.","Since it was part of Sky City’s main fighting power, it had learned through the various confrontations with the Zheng family and Connected Beast Park that it would be extremely beneficial to Sky City if it evolved to Creation Breed.","Once it evolved to Creation Breed and gained thearch-class powers, Sky City would have the martial force to compete with top factions.","Despite already anticipating a major struggle, Endless Summer had never seen other feys experience the Trial of World Creation.","It did not expect its anticipations and reality to be so far apart.","The part that made Endless Summer feel the worst was that its carelessness had affected the Mother of Bloodbath.","The Mother of Bloodbath had been stained by the aura of the Trial of World Creation when it had taken on some of the damage from the first blow of the Trial of World Creation. Although the Mother of Bloodbath had already escaped as far from the Trial of World Creation as possible, it would continue to be attacked by the Trial of World Creation due to the aura of the Trial of World Creation.","It was only Suzerain/Myth II now, and there was no way that it would be able to handle the attacks from the Trial of World Creation.","The Trial of World Creation Cloud was preparing to launch its second strike, and Endless Summer was filled with sorrow.","Endless Summer had used almost all its strength to prevent the spliced Enlightenment Law from being dispersed and did not have the strength to manipulate the Enlightenment Law to defend against the second attack or use the power of the second attack to temper the spliced Enlightenment Law in order to connect the pieces.","At that moment, the Mother of Bloodbath flew up to Endless Summer and shouted, “Sister Summer, Lin Yuan is with the Moon Empress. He’ll be here to help soon. You should collect the Enlightenment Law for now so that it won’t be dispersed. There are still 20 minutes before the Trial of World Creation’s second attack. That’s enough time for Lin Yuan to arrive using the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles.”","Before Endless Summer could let out a sigh of relief, something changed.","Black and brown energy with the energy of lightning shot out of the ground and hit the Trial of World Creation Cloud in the sky.","A brown and black furry worm tunneled out of the ground.","Even with only half its body out of the ground, it was already 30 meters tall when it straightened its body.","It was truly an enormous fey.","When the black and brown energy struck the Trial of World Creation Cloud, it was like water that had fallen into a pot of oil.","The Trial of World Creation Cloud immediately started to thrash wildly.","The second attack that should only arrive in 20 minutes was rapidly winding up.","Streaks of red lightning flashed within the cloud, and it seemed that the Trial of World Creation’s second attack would be launching in less than five minutes.","The abrupt development made the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer’s hearts plunge.","They sensed that this brown and black furry worm had reached Suzerain/Myth III.","Although it had not reached the pinnacle, it was close to that level.","The sight of the Myth III insect-species fey made the Mother of Bloodbath’s expression change drastically from hope to devastation.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s devastation did not come from the brown and black worm’s grade but because it was the notorious Kill Food Worm.","The Kill Food Worm was very gifted and could consume almost any Law Crystal.","Despite only being able to consume a small amount of law energy with different roots, any consumption was considered impressive.","Usually, it was rare for a fey experiencing the Trial of World Creation in a remote area to be attacked by other feys.","The only feys that would possibly attack were feys that had comprehended the same type of laws.","It was extremely stupid to pick a fight with a Myth Breed fey for no reason.","Feys focused all their energy whenever they were trying to overcome the World Cleansing or Trial of World Creation.","If the fey committed suicide instead of overcoming the World Cleansing or Trial of World Creation, it would pull other feys in the vicinity into its suicidal attack.","However, the Kill Food Worm was different from other Myth Breed feys.","The Kill Food Worm was unintelligent, and some spent their entire lives only eating and fighting.","As an insect-species fey, the Kill Food Worm could not take human form even when it reached Myth III. The biggest reason was that it was still the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s larva even when it reached Suzerain/Myth III.","After the Kill Food Worm absorbed enough Law Crystals and reached pinnacle Suzerain/Myth III, it would spit out silk to build a cocoon to wrap itself inside.","After the Kill Food Worm finished transforming inside the larva, it would immediately undergo the Trial of World Creation.","Amongst all the feys in the world, only a few with elite bloodlines would definitely be able to overcome the Trial of World Creation without any dangers.","One of those feys was the Kill Food Sky Butterfly that could flawlessly sustain the three attacks of the Trial of World Creation.","The sturdy Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s cocoon would split open when its law evolved to the law world.","The Creation Breed Kill Food Sky Butterfly would break out of its cocoon and fly up into the sky."]},{"number":894,"title":"Chapter 894 - Villain? What Kind of Villain Do You Want to Become?","paragraphs":["The Mother of Bloodbath could not figure out why a fey as rare as the Kill Food Worm would appear at such a deserted area.","It was just like encountering a whale in a pit of manure.","The Kill Food Worm did not give the Mother of Bloodbath any time to react before it continued attacking the Trial of World Creation Cloud.","The terrifying Kill Food Worm greedily eyed the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer as though it had decided to make them into its snacks.","The Mother of Bloodbath knew that Endless Summer needed to invest all its energy into gathering the spliced Enlightenment Law, so it was the only one that could defend against the Kill Food Worm’s attacks now.","Otherwise, the Trial of World Creation Cloud’s second attack would arrive sooner than they expected.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s true form was the size of a small mountain, and it lunged toward the Kill Food Worm as it activated Eyes of Senluo, Execution Sting, and Eight Direction Blood.","The Eyes of Senluo helped the Mother of Bloodbath to anticipate the Kill Food Worm’s movements and dodge the imminent attacks.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s eight legs dived down toward the Kill Food Worm. At that moment, the brown law power in the Kill Food Worm throbbed around its body and prevented the Mother of Bloodbath from piercing its body.","Instead, the Mother of Bloodbath used the chance to inject its own blood qi into the Kill Food Worm’s body and used Blood Control to temporarily control the Kill Food Worm’s movements. This led to the Kill Food Worm’s attack missing.","In this moment of peril, the Mother of Bloodbath immediately activated the External Blood Bone, and three Red Water Blood Snakes emerged from the Mother of Bloodbath’s red shadow.","The Red Water Blood Snakes collided against the Kill Food Worm.","Since the Red Water Blood Snakes had fused with the Mother of Bloodbath’s fallen fangs, they were the Mother of Bloodbath’s strongest attack weapons.","However, the three Red Water Blood Snakes attacks only left three bottle cap-sized holes in the Kill Food Worm’s body.","This was an insignificant injury to the enormous Kill Food Worm.","The Mother of Bloodbath watched as the three holes in the Kill Food Worm healed, and it hurriedly seized the opportunity to inject its blood qi through the healing holes into the Kill Food Worm’s body.","It circulated the power of its Blood Law and used Blood Control to temporarily control the Kill Food Worm again.","The Mother of Bloodbath manipulated the Kill Food Worm to release its stored energy into the ground underneath it because the Mother of Bloodbath knew that over 30 meters of the Kill Food Worm’s body were still underground.","This attack was meant to use the Kill Food Worm’s own energy to attack itself.","While Blood Control was in effect, the Mother of Bloodbath jumped out of the way.","The Kill Food Worm howled in pain, and a large patch of earth became brown mud that emanated a strange stench.","The Mother of Bloodbath knew that the mud was a result of the Kill Food Worm’s blood oozing out of its body and mixing with the earth.","Now, the Kill Food Worm was livid, and it tunneled fully out of the ground. It coiled its body and was about to shoot toward the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer when an old woman riding on a huge avian-type fey appeared in the sky.","She angrily yelled, “Dominate Sky Snake Dove, stop the Kill Food Worm!”","The large avian-type fey whipped its tail, and a huge snakehead emerged from the long feathers.","The snakehead opened its mouth and shot out multiple chains.","The chains locked up the Kill Food Worm. No matter how much the Kill Food Worm struggled, it could not break free from the chains.","The silver-haired old woman arrived next to the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer in the blink of an eye.","She studied them for a moment before pursing her lips and saying, “I came to capture the Kill Food Worm that had escaped from Insect Valley Cage. Who would have thought that I would run into this pleasant surprise? I can’t believe there are two uncontracted Myth Breed feys here.”","The silver-haired old woman’s words made the Mother of Bloodbath’s expression turn grim.","It had assumed that the old woman had come to save it and Endless Summer. It did not expect the Kill Food Worm to belong to the old woman.","Nonetheless, the old woman’s methods had shocked the Mother of Bloodbath.","Usually, when the Mother of Bloodbath activated the three Red Water Blood Snakes using External Blood Bone, they would be able to fight for an extended period against three feys of the same grade.","But due to the Kill Food Worm’s elite bloodline, the Mother of Bloodbath had only managed to make three small holes in the Kill Food Worm’s body.","However, this old woman had controlled the Kill Food Worm with one move.","Obviously, the old woman was a thearch-class expert.","The Mother of Bloodbath did not want to start trouble because any new development could cause the Trial of World Creation’s attacks to descend prematurely.","As such, it could only pray that Lin Yuan would arrive in the next five minutes.","From the old woman’s calculative gaze, the Mother of Bloodbath did not think that it was likely that she would be willing to help Endless Summer overcome the Trial of World Creation.","The Mother of Bloodbath also regretted immediately fusing the Crescent Moon Radiant Sunlight tablet that the Moon Empress had given it with its Blood Law.","Otherwise, it would now be able to use the power of combining the Crescent Moon Radiant Sunlight tablet and its Blood Law to help Endless Summer safely overcome the Trial of World Creation.","However, the Crescent Moon Radiant Sunlight tablet was now fully fused with the Blood Law, and it would not be able to use the Crescent Moon Radiant Sunlight tablet even if it sacrificed its life.","The silver-haired old woman pointed two fingers at the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless","Summer and said, “The both of you should know who I am. Now, I’m going to give you a precious opportunity. Join my Cage of Brahma Insects, and I’ll help that tree transform into Creation Breed.”","Neither the Mother of Bloodbath nor Endless Summer knew who this old woman was. They had been by Lin Yuan’s side from the moment they left the Endless Forest and had not met many other experts.","However, they had heard of the Cage of Brahma Insects.","The Cage of Brahma Insects was one of the top three factions in the Radiance Federation, along with Rhine Lifeform and Whale Ocean Commerce.","These three factions securely held the top three positions for many years.","The Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer did not expect the old woman to be from Cage of Brahma Insects.","However, they declined her proposition without hesitation.","Lin Yuan had saved their lives, and they would never betray Lin Yuan even if it killed them.","The silver-haired old woman did not expect these two Myth Breed feys in such a dangerous situation to reject her proposition. Her expression hardened, and she sneered coldly. “If you don’t join Cage of Brahma Insects, I won’t mind becoming a villain.”","At that moment, the space beside the Mother of Bloodbath rippled, and the silhouette of a young man stepped out of the spatial fluctuation.","The young man casually asked the old woman, “Villian? What kind of villain do you want to become?”"]},{"number":895,"title":"Chapter 895 - Biting the Hand That Fed You","paragraphs":["The silver-haired old woman instinctively answered, “I don’t want to start any trouble. I can just wait for them to die from the Trial of World Creation to collect their Law Crystals.”","While she spoke, the old woman’s eyes widened as she noticed that the young man’s clothes seemed familiar.","Realization dawned on her.","Isn’t this the Moon Empress’ Moonbeam Coronation Costume!?","The old woman had interacted with the Moon Empress several times before and had even been to Leaning Moon Mountain once to seek the Moon Empress’ help in nurturing feys.","She had been to the Radiant Moon Palace multiple times to beg for the Law Crystals that the Dominate Sky Snake Dove needed to evolve to Creation Breed.","Although she had spent a large amount of rare spiritual ingredients and Law Crystals, the old woman was still extremely grateful to the Moon Empress.","The Dominate Sky Snake Dove’s snakehead had been injured in the World Cleansing during its evolution from Myth II to Myth III, which prevented it from using body weaponization.","However, the Moon Empress had healed this injury on top of helping the Dominate Sky Snake Dove to evolve to Creation Breed.","But why was this young man wearing the Moon Empress’ coronation costume?","At the old woman’s level, she had seen more of the world than most people.","The quality of Lin Yuan’s Moonbeam Coronation Costume told her that it was not a cheap knockoff because only the Moon Empress possessed most of the spiritual materials on the Moonbeam Coronation Costume.","The old woman did not believe that someone would be brave enough to secretly recreate the Moonbeam Coronation Costume because it was grievously disrespectful to the Moon Empress.","She carefully studied the Moonbeam Coronation Costume that Lin Yuan was wearing and noticed that it did not have the moonbeam coronation patterns.","This indicated that this was not the Moonbeam Coronation Costume.","However, this realization did not set the old woman at ease. Rather, it made her more nervous because she was certain that this young man was somehow connected to the Moon Empress.","This thought made the old woman break out in a cold sweat.","Lin Yuan stepped out of the spatial fluctuation and hurriedly took out a gold toad-shaped bag.","The gold toad-shaped bag looked like a small living gold toad.","This was the precious weapon made out of the Jeweled Cave Golden Toad’s skin and stomach that had been Chef Supreme’s greeting gift to Lin Yuan.","The golden toad opened its mouth, and an amiable-faced man appeared in the spatial fluctuation in front of Lin Yuan.","The old woman immediately bowed deeply to this man.","“Greetings, Lord Mystic Moon.”","The silver-haired old woman had bowed so low and was dripping with sweat that a few drops of sweat splattered onto the dry ground.","Mystic Moon did not bother with this bowed old woman even though her enormous Creation Breed Dominate Sky Snake Dove was flying just overhead them.","He glanced at the Trial of World Creation Cloud and said to Lin Yuan, “Young Lord, the interior of your precious weapon sure is comfortable. Please leave the issue of the Trial of World Creation to me.”","Lin Yuan was looking at the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer, who were in sorry states, and said to Mystic Moon, “Sorry to trouble you, Uncle Mystic.”","The Mother of Bloodbath was still in its true form. Many parts of its body had been pierced, and it looked pathetic at the moment.","Although the Mother of Bloodbath had strong recovery abilities and the puncture wounds were already starting to heal, the Mother of Bloodbath was still covered in blood.","After seeing the Mother of Bloodbath’s injuries, Lin Yuan looked toward the 30-meter-long worm. He was sure that the Mother of Bloodbath’s injuries had been a result of this worm’s sharp fur.","Endless Summer’s injuries were much more severe as it had almost been split in half by the Trial of World Creation’s attack.","If Endless Summer had not moved its double tree cores, they might have been reduced to ashes by the Trial of World Creation’s attack.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s sensing allowed Lin Yuan to learn that pieces of the Enlightenment Law were floating around Endless Summer.","Lin Yuan anxiously thought,? Luckily I arrived in time, or else Endless Summer would be in big trouble.","The Trial of World Creation’s first attack had already been enough to basically split Endless Summer’s body in two.","It would be impossible for Endless Summer to safely overcome the Trial of World Creation’s second attack with such injuries.","When the silver-haired old woman heard Mystic Moon address Lin Yuan as ‘Young Lord’, she immediately knew who Lin Yuan was.","The Moon Empress did not have any offspring. Hence, the only person in the Radiant Moon Palace who had the right to be called Young Lord by Mystic Moon was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","However, the Guard Ye Banquet was taking place right at this time. The Moon Empress’ disciple should be attending the Guard Ye Banquet now, so why was he in this remote area 3,000 kilometers outside of the Royal Capital?","The silver-haired old woman did not believe that Lin Yuan would be here for a casual stroll.","Clearly, he had brought Mystic Moon here to help the tree overcome the Trial of World Creation.","Unexpectedly, she had accidentally allowed the Kill Food Worm to escape and caused the Trial of World Creation to speed up. She had recklessly provoked the Moon Empress’ disciple!","The old woman’s head hung even lower as guilt and fear pressed down on her.","Unlike other top factions, Cage of Brahma Insects had become a top faction over a century ago.","Still, with more knowledge also came more fear, and the old woman’s fear of the Moon Empress shook her to the bone.","Moreover, the Moon Empress had helped the old woman before. Yet, the old woman had caused trouble for the Moon Empress’ disciple.","She was basically biting the hand that had fed her.","Compared to guilt, the silver-haired old woman felt much more terror.","In spite of Mystic Moon’s amiable and gentle appearance, he was extremely merciless when it came to the members of the major factions.","She could not bear to imagine what consequences awaited her after this Trial of World Creation was over.","The Mother of Bloodbath forced itself to transform into a human and ferociously glared at the old woman.","A look of defeat crossed the Mother of Bloodbath’s face.","Although it was Lin Yuan’s Path Protector, Lin Yuan always protected it during the key moments.","As she looked at Lin Yuan, the Mother of Bloodbath could not help but feel a wave of warmth soothe its heart.","It was as though no problem in the world could not be solved with Lin Yuan around."]},{"number":896,"title":"Chapter 896 - Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly","paragraphs":["When Endless Summer saw Lin Yuan rushing over with Mystic Moon, all its worries melted away.","With renewed focus, it went back to gathering the broken Enlightenment Law.","With Mystic Moon around, it could just do its best to gather the Enlightenment Law and await the next two trials of the Trial of World Creation.","Endless Summer sighed to itself.? Lin Yuan has now granted me two opportunities to save myself. I’ll never be able to repay Lin Yuan even if I give up my life. All I can do is spend the rest of my life fulfilling my duty of protecting Lin Yuan and Sky City.","At that moment, the chained-up Kill Food Worm struggled wildly and let out a cry.","It continuously spewed brown and black energy at the chains around its body. But despite its best efforts, the Kill Food Worm could not get free of its binds. Instead, it had ended up injuring itself further.","The Kill Food Worm’s cry made the old woman want to scream vulgarities.","She was already trying to make her presence less noticeable. Yet, this Kill Food Worm was out to incur the Young Lord of the Radiant Moon Palace and Mystic Moon’s ire again.","The silver-haired old woman felt that the Kill Food Worm she had valued so much was now her bad luck charm.","The Kill Food Worm could not be contracted before it evolved to the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","Moreover, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly was a butterfly-species fey that continuously tried to become more beautiful. It would only submit to a butterfly-species fey that its genetic model deemed to be beautiful enough. The Kill Food Sky Butterfly would then service that beautiful fey for the rest of its life.","The silver-haired old woman had put so much effort into nurturing the Kill Food Worm because Cage of Brahma Insects had once nurtured a Blue Flash Butterfly that mutated into the Purple Light Goddess Butterfly.","The Blue Light Goddess Butterfly was one of the most beautiful butterfly-species feys. Amongst butterfly-species feys, the purple ones were considered more elite than the blue ones. The Purple Light Goddess Butterfly would even earn the protection and adoration of the Blue Light Goddess Butterfly.","The old woman felt that this Purple Light Goddess Butterfly would be able to gain the acknowledgment of the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","However, the mutated Purple Light Goddess Butterfly could not compete with the genetically improved Blue Flash Purple Butterfly.","This was the difference between nature and nurture.","It was rumored that the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly would evolve into the Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly, which had the ability to win over the entire butterfly colony.","Even the three most elite bloodlines of the butterfly-species fey would succumb to the Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly. However, the old woman did not know if this rumor was true.","As the Kill Food Worm continued to struggle violently, the silver-haired old woman made a decision. She felt that this was the only way to earn the Young Lord of the Radiant Moon Palace’s forgiveness.","The old woman had noticed how this young man in the Moonbeam Coronation Costume had the authority to order Mystic Moon around.","She shook her hand, and a tree core that emanated strong plant energy appeared in her hand.","The silver-haired old woman timidly padded over to Lin Yuan with her head lowered and presented the tree core to him with both hands.","“Lord, this is the tree core from the Creation Breed Sky-Covering Weeping Willow. If this little tree... I mean Lord Tree uses this tree core, it might be able to transform further after evolving to Creation Breed.”","The silver-haired old woman had lived long enough and was also a thearch-class expert. Hence, she knew how to handle most situations.","She had not done anything to the tree or spider yet, so there was still a chance to salvage the situation.","Giving up the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow made the old woman feel like she was being stabbed.","But if it would save her from being blamed by the Young Lord of the Radiant Moon Palace for provoking him before she fully understood the situation, sacrificing this Sky-Covering Weeping Willow would be worth it.","She might even be able to use the opportunity to curry favor with the Young Lord.","The old woman did not put all her eggs into the basket of this Sky-Covering Weeping Willow.","Lin Yuan narrowed his eyes at the old woman.","She had kept her head lowered, but thearch-class experts had strong perceptions. As such, she did not miss Lin Yuan’s eyes on her, and her chest throbbed.","Mystic Moon had been waiting for the Trial of World Creation’s second attack to help Endless Summer over it. However, it was not such a simple matter.","Although it was possible to do so, Endless Summer would not be able to use the Trial of World Creation’s attack to temper the spliced Enlightenment Law.","Mystic Moon needed to receive the Trial of World Creation’s second attack and split it into hundreds of smaller attacks that could refine the Enlightenment Law one by one.","The Trial of World Creation Cloud would be launching the second attack in less than a minute. Bright silver patterns appeared all over Mystic Moon’s exposed skin, and a wave of power that seemed powerful enough to attack the Trial of World Creation Cloud radiated from him.","An unspeakable might was intermixed with this wave of power.","This might was similar to that of dragon-species feys but much stronger than the might that Lin Yuan had experienced from main dragon-species feys.","In fact, they were leagues apart.","The aura emanating from Mystic Moon made the Dominate Sky Snake Dove anxiously transform into its human form, and it landed on the ground in a prone position.","Even the thrashing Kill Food Worm dared not move. However, it was not as submissive as the Dominate Sky Snake Dove as it stole glances at Mystic Moon.","Mystic Moon saw the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core and said to Lin Yuan, “Young Lord, this Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core will be of great help to Endless Summer. Endless Summer was lucky enough to fuse with a Lifeform Sacrificial Fire and grow a new tree core. The new tree core formed a special cycle with its previous tree core.”","Mystic Moon scoffed and said, “With double tree cores, it’s no wonder that it overestimated itself as being able to overcome the Trial of World Creation.”","Although Mystic Moon spoke to Lin Yuan amicably, he was not warmly looking at Endless Summer.","In Mystic Moon’s eyes, Endless Summer was a trouble-starting burden that did not know how to stay within its capabilities."]},{"number":897,"title":"Chapter 897 - Silver Beast Stretching Across the Sky","paragraphs":["Mystic Moon had been feeling sympathy for Lin Yuan the entire time he was in the Jeweled Cave Golden Toad.","They had left when it was almost time for the prize presentation of the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage.","The prize presentation should have been Lin Yuan’s moment of glory.","Unfortunately, Lin Yuan had no choice but to rush over to help Endless Summer undergo its Trial of World Creation.","It would take some time for Endless Summer to finish using the attack that had been split into hundreds of smaller attacks to temper the Enlightenment Law.","By the time Lin Yuan waited for Endless Summer to overcome the Trial of World Creation and rushed back to the Midnight Palace, the Martial Arts Stage’s prize presentation would be over.","Although the Moon Empress would be standing in his stead and he would still be able to accept all the prizes, Mystic Moon still felt that Lin Yuan had lost a moment to bask in his well-deserved spotlight.","Still, given Mystic Moon’s understanding of Lin Yuan, it was not unexpected for Lin Yuan to have made such a decision because he was a warm person that prioritized those he cared about.","Mystic Moon went on to say, “The Sky-Covering Weeping Willow is able to grow branches and foliage large enough to cover the sky because of the vast plant vitality and germination powers in its tree core.","“Even Creation Breed plant-type feys can’t consume the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core. If greed got the better of them and they tried to consume the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core, the plant-type fey would explode after being exposed to the plant energy in the tree core.","“Technically, Endless Summer should also be unable to absorb the tree core. But because of the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire, it’s now possible for Endless Summer to consume the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core. With the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire and the Trial of World Creation’s cleansing to provide balance, Endless Summer might be able to have three tree cores and form a triple-core cycle.","“A fey’s bloodline transforms drastically when it evolves to Creaton Breed. Endless Summer’s transformation will be even more radical with three tree cores. There’s even a possibility of the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire and Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodlines combining to form a completely new type of fey.”","Mystic Moon’s explanation had been clear. Currently, Lin Yuan’s True Data was still unable to check on the spiritual ingredients inside a Creation Breed fey’s body.","But from Mystic Moon’s explanation, Lin Yuan now knew how important the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core was for Endless Summer since it even concerned the possible elevation of its bloodline.","Since the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core was so beneficial to Endless Summer, Lin Yuan was definitely going to obtain it.","The increase in Endless Summer’s power would also increase Sky City’s fighting power.","When Lin Yuan had arrived, he had asked this old woman what kind of villain she wanted to become.","If the old woman had said that she was going to attack the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer, Lin Yuan would have asked Mystic Moon to take down the old woman. He would not even have given the old woman a chance to plead for mercy.","Killing only led to an endless cycle of further killing. This principle had held true since the start of time.","Lin Yuan had allowed the old woman to live this long because she had decided against attacking the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer in the end.","At that moment, the silver-haired old woman lifted her head. Her sweat-covered face made her look rather pathetic.","“Young Lord, I went through much trouble to get my hands on the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core, and I’ve held onto it for decades. It’s the most precious treasure in Cage of Brahma Insects,” said the old woman with utmost respect.","Mystic Moon scoffed and said, “Why am I unaware that you’re a member of the Radiant Moon Palace? Otherwise, what gives you the right to call him Young Lord?”","Mystic Moon’s cold eyes made the old woman’s expression shrivel up.","Ever since Mystic Moon had released his terrifying aura, the Dominate Sky Snake Dove had not dared to move a muscle. It was unknown what level of Creation Breed Mystic Moon had reached. Maybe, he had even reached a higher level.","The old woman anxiously stammered, “L... Lord, I didn’t attack at all. I only came to retrieve the Kill Food Worm that had escaped. The Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core is my way of apologizing for my careless provocation. I’m willing to take full responsibility for the Kill Food Worm causing the Trial of World Creation Cloud to release the second attack prematurely. You can have the Kill Food Worm and deal with it as you see fit.”","The old woman’s voice had been rather hoarse due to her heartache and fear.","The Kill Food Worm had been the old woman’s most precious treasure. If she could not use it to seek the Moon Empress’ disciple’s forgiveness, Cage of Brahma Insects would punish her severely for her mistake.","If the Moon Empress caught wind of this incident and became enraged, Cage of Brahma Insects would immediately be pushed out of the ranks of the top three top factions that it had been occupying for the past century.","There was even a chance that they would fall so low that they would become stuck between the level of veteran faction and top faction like Condense Fairy Orchard.","Despite being one of Cage of Brahma Insects’ Elders who had seen it being built from the ground up, she would become a sinner in their eyes.","All the glory she had worked hard her entire life to achieve would have been flushed down the toilet with her own two hands. The anguish would be worse than actually dying.","At that moment, the young man stretched out his bony hands to receive the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core from her.","He tossed the tree core to the tree that was undergoing the Trial of World Creation and shouted, “Endless Summer, try to use the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire to temper the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core and combine it with the tree cores in your body. If it’s possible, try to unlock the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline during the Trial of World Creation and use your own bloodline to absorb the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline.”","Endless Summer had been devoting all its energy to gathering the spliced Enlightenment Law. It could feel all the vitality in its body seeping out, making it weaker with every passing second.","It had not been paying attention to the silver-haired old woman and Mystic Moon’s words.","But when Endless Summer heard Lin Yuan’s shout, it managed to force itself to catch what he said, and it saw a tree core with overwhelming plant energy sailing over to it.","Endless Summer manipulated its roots to shoot out of the ground and caught the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core.","Endless Summer’s body that had almost been split in half shook as it summoned the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire tree core and its original tree core.","It pressed the three tree cores together and used the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire tree core to cover the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core.","The moment that the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire tree core came into contact with the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core, the pinkish-purple leaves turned to ash and limitless vitality radiated from Endless Summer’s withered branches.","At that moment, the Trial of World Creation Cloud released its second attack.","At the same time, bright silver patterns appeared all over Mystic Moon’s forehead, face, and palms. His eyes turned dark silver, and an enormous silver beast soon stretched across the sky."]},{"number":898,"title":"Chapter 898 - Silver Dragon Pearls","paragraphs":["Countless stars should be decorating the cloudless sky in the dead of night, .","However, the Trial of World Creation Cloud was blocking all the stars, exposing the lonely silver moon that hung in the sky.","An enormous silent silver beast stretched across the sky.","The silver light glinting off the large silver beast’s body that intermixed with the silver moonbeams gave all who saw it a feeling of absolute nobility.","The main dragon-species fey aura that radiated from the giant silver beast suddenly swelled.","The huge silver beast opened its mouth and spewed out spiritual energy that seemed strong enough to shatter the earth.","Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath were terrified when they sensed the immensely powerful spiritual energy. However, they were unaffected by it, unlike the silver-haired old woman.","A silver pearl materialized within the immense spiritual energy, and the bowed old woman collapsed to the ground. The Dominate Sky Snake Dove that was crawling on the ground looked like a dove that was about to be roasted.","A putrid stench entered Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath’s nostrils, and they could not help but frown.","When Lin Yuan looked toward the direction of the stench, he could not help but be rendered speechless. Mystic Moon had pressured the Creation Breed Dominate Sky Snake Dove into immobility.","This was too embarrassing!","Given the old woman’s current state, Lin Yuan knew that the silver pearl that Mystic Moon spat out was a deadly weapon that he had spared Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath from.","The old woman mumbled to herself, “I can’t believe Lord Mystic Moon has reached the level of being able to produce dragon pearls!”","It was clear that the old woman was dumbfounded.","This was the first time that Lin Yuan had heard of dragon pearls.","The most valuable part of main dragon-species feys was their essence blood. Lin Yuan had never heard of them being able to produce dragon pearls.","In a previous conversation with the Moon Empress, Lin Yuan had discovered that Mystic Moon was a fey instead of a human.","Could the dragon pearls result from a special change to Mystic Moon’s bloodline?","Genius was almost done learning all the Class 4 Fey Observer, Spiritual Ingredient Analyst, and Scholar knowledge.","According to Genius’ knowledge, Lin Yuan did not see anything related to dragon pearls.","The Mother of Bloodbath was currently staring at the enormous silver beast gliding in the sky. When it sensed Lin Yuan’s look of curiosity, it said, “Legend has it that once a dragon-species fey’s bloodline reaches the level above main dragon, its essence blood can be turned into pearls. I always assumed that it was just another legend, but I can’t believe it’s true! It looks like Lord Mystic Moon has surpassed the level of Creation.”","While the Mother of Bloodbath was giving Lin Yuan the explanation, it became acutely aware of how weak it was.","The Mother of Bloodbath had always been extremely proud. But ever since it became Lin Yuan’s Path Protector, it had been humbled time and time again.","This person by Lin Yuan’s side had already surpassed Creation, yet it was not only leagues away from Creation Breed. It was not even Myth III yet.","Lin Yuan inhaled sharply. He looked up in disbelief at the giant silver beast in the sky and instinctively used True Data to check Mystic Moon’s true form.","What he saw floored him.","In previous occasions where he had tried to check on Creation Breed feys, Lin Yuan could always see how many exclusive skills they had even though he could not see what their abilities and exclusive skills were exactly.","The kneeling Dominate Sky Snake Dove and the two light green snakes outside the Moon Stable had four exclusive skills.","Lin Yuan could tell if a fey was truly Creation Breed from the number of exclusive skills it had.","However, Mystic Moon’s True Data information turned out completely blank.","At that moment, Lin Yuan was sure that Mystic Moon was not just a Creation Breed fey.","However, Lin Yuan had no clue what level Mystic Moon had reached.","Mystic Moon’s powers had exceeded Lin Yuan’s expertise.","All he wanted to know now was whether the Moon Empress was stronger.","Lin Yuan felt that he had been underestimating the Moon Empress’s powers.","Suddenly, the huge silver beast with silver dragon pearls flying around it coughed lightly, and the collapsed old woman started vomiting blood.","The blood was dark, and it was clear that it was the result of an internal injury.","The seriously injured old woman realized that she had made a mistake by daring to check on Mystic Moon’s abilities.","A faint smile spread across her pale face as she sensed her injuries.","She knew that although Lin Yuan had not said anything, his acceptance of the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core was his way of saying that he had forgiven her.","Although Lin Yuan had forgiven her, it did not mean Mystic Moon had done so as well.","From Mystic Moon’s attitude toward Lin Yuan, it was clear that Mystic Moon did not just adore Lin Yuan as his Young Lord but also as his junior.","This was because there was a hint of warmth on top of respect in Mystic Moon’s voice as he spoke to Lin Yuan.","Her instinctive action of checking on Mystic Moon’s abilities should not have led to such serious consequences.","In other words, Mystic Moon’s attack served as a punishment for overstepping her boundaries and offending Lin Yuan.","Now that she had been attacked, this matter was put to rest. She would not need to worry about Mystic Moon pursuing this matter in the future.","A dragon roar rang out as Mystic Moon launched dragon pearls at the crimson Trial of World Creation Cloud. It shook the heavens and made people feel as though they had been plunged into a desolate area.","The Trial of World Creation’s second attack looked like a red millipede next to the silver dragon pearls’ silver light.","As the silver dragon pearls continued to circle the silver dragon, Mystic Moon turned back into its human form.","The captured second attack of the Trial of World Creation appeared in his palm with a wave of his hand.","He did not immediately break down the attack for Endless Summer as he intended on waiting until after Endless Summer finished absorbing the plant energy from the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core.","At that time, Endless Summer would not need to use all its energy to gather the broken Enlightenment Law and would be able to use the Trial of World Creation’s attacks to temper the Enlightenment Law."]},{"number":899,"title":"Chapter 899 - The Evolution of Endless Summers Bloodline","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The healed Endless Summer would be able to use the Trial of World Creation’s energy to temper the Enlightenment Law while gathering the spliced Enlightenment Law.","The groundwork was laid for Endless Summer to have a smoother journey.","The Lifeform Sacrificial Fire tree core lit up with green flames that burned the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core.","The plant energy in the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core flowed out copiously, and a green spot appeared in Endless Summer’s tree branch that had almost been split in two.","A sprout grew from the green spot.","Endless Summer’s withered branches seemed to be nurturing the sprout by continuously squeezing what little nutrients they had out of them into the newly grown sprout.","Soon, Endless Summer turned into ashes that scattered all over the ground.","The tiny sprout was growing rapidly.","1 meter, 10 meters, 30 meters, 50 meters, 100 meters, 300 meters, stopping only when it reached 500 meters.","Previously, 30 Lin Yuans would be able to wrap their arms around all of Endless Summer’s branches.","But now, not even 100 Lin Yuans would be enough.","The 500-meter tall giant tree was full of fresh foliage, and the leaves ranged from the size of a sesame seed to the size of a palm.","The tree branches spreading out of the tree were the breath of spring that contrasted against the desolate ground.","The leaves were countless, and summer was endless.","Spots of purple appeared amongst the lush green freshness.","The flower buds dotted the bows, and hundreds of small flowers bloomed all over the tree in the blink of an eye.","All the flowers weighed down heavily on the branches.","The fallen flowers rained down on Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath.","When Mystic Moon saw Endless Summer’s verdant state, the silver dragon pearls in his hand spun and drew out a scarlet lightning bolt that shot toward Endless Summer.","Endless Summer hurriedly used its flowers to defend against the scarlet lightning bolt.","The flowers detached themselves from the branches and made contact with the scarlet lightning bolt.","Now that Endless Summer was flourishing again, it could gather the broken Enlightenment Law and defend itself.","When he saw Endless Summer in defensive mode, Mystic Moon hastily said, “Don’t defend yourself. The Trial of World Creation that I’ve separated out won’t hurt you. You should use these bolts of energy to temper the Enlightenment Law. It’s the only way that you’ll be able to repay the Young Lord for coming all this way.”","Endless Summer maneuvered out of the defensive stance and allowed the scarlet lightning bolts to strike itself.","Although this attack from the Trial of World Creation would not harm Endless Summer, it did cause a wave of flowers to fall and bury Lin Yuan underneath.","The Mother of Bloodbath hurriedly plucked Lin Yuan out of the avalanche of flowers.","Lin Yuan awkwardly scratched his head as the Mother of Bloodbath carried him out of the flower pile.","The silver-haired old woman leaped up into the air and looked at Endless Summer with envy.","She did not believe that there was a fey in the world that had an easier time evolving to Creation Breed than Endless Summer.","Mystic Moon was using his overwhelming power to help Endless Summer.","Every time the scarlet lightning bolt struck Endless Summer, a rain of flowers fell.","With each rain of flowers, more flowers bloomed on the tree.","Time flew by as Endless Summer continued to temper the Enlightenment Law. Each time the scarlet lightning bolt struck Endless Summer, it took three minutes for it to absorb the energy.","However, the Trial of World Creation did not wait for them. By the time Endless Summer tempered the Enlightenment Law for the 10th time, the Trial of World Creation’s third attack suddenly struck.","Mystic Moon did not even glance at the third attack as he waved the silver dragon pearls in his hand.","The third attack was like another scarlet millipede that was pulled toward the dragon pearls.","Endless Summer had become accustomed to the crimson lightning bolts. As such, Mystic Moon increased the rate that the crimson lightning bolts were released.","Three minutes became 2.5 minutes, which became 1.5 minutes until it finally shortened to 30 seconds.","Now that Endless Summer could hold out against more lightning bolts, it could sense that its spliced Enlightenment Law was linked.","The linked Enlightenment Law turned into a world full of the power of enlightenment.","Mystic Moon nodded in acknowledgment of Endless Summer’s talent.","As Endless Summer continued to use the power of the Trial of World Creation to temper the Enlightenment Law, Mystic Moon said, “There should be 300 more lightning bolts of the Trial of World Creation. It’s a waste for you to use this power to temper the Enlightenment World. Why don’t you try using this power to temper the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core into your own tree core?”","Endless Summer tried to direct the power of the Trial of World Creation toward the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core.","Previously, Endless Summer had been using the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire to extract the plant energy inside the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core in order to weaken the strength of the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline. This would make it easier for Endless Summer to consume the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline.","As a plant-type fey, Endless Summer could sense that the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline was much stronger than its own. Thus, it would be a struggle for it to consume the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline.","The power from the Trial of World Creation’s 300 bolts would be its best chance to do so.","Endless Summer was extremely careful. First, it used its own tree core and the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire tree core to envelop the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core.","Next, it used the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire tree core to increase the power of its original tree core so as to counter the power of the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline.","The bolts of energy from the Trial of World Creation slowly broke down the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline. Endless Summer absorbed a small amount of the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline each time.","Endless Summer planned on using the 300 bolts to absorb the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s entire bloodline.","This was a smart decision as the plan was feasible and easy to carry out.","Endless Summer’s body started to grow again.","From 500 meters, it became 600 meters, then 800 meters, until it finally reached 1,000 meters.","At this point, Endless Summer’s growth rate slowed, but it still continued to rise.","Endless Summer’s original branches had been tightly spaced together, and its leaves clustered together.","Even though Endless Summer used to be 500 meters tall, its tree crown had not been very large.","But after consuming the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s bloodline, Endless Summer’s branches extended far and wide.","The elongated branches made Endless Summer’s tree crown look three times larger than it was before."]},{"number":900,"title":"Chapter 900 - Arrival of the Creation World Ley Line","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Besides the main branch that was thick and sturdy, the other branches were all more slender and pliable.","It looked just like a gigantic weeping willow.","Endless Summer was now 1,200 meters tall, and each hanging vine was at least 800 meters long.","These swaying vines had pinkish-purple flowers blooming up and down their entire lengths.","Previously, Endless Summer seemed to be able to sustain an eternal summer. But now, it could sustain an endless thriving summer.","The swaying vines and delicate flowers that gently drifted down created a romantic scene.","Lin Yuan knew that as long as Endless Summer circulated its spiritual power, every soft pinkish-purple flower would turn into a deadly weapon.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen sensed the overwhelming world power radiating from Endless Summer. Lin Yuan was thrilled by this because Sky City had finally gained a thearch-class expert.","Previously, Sky City was just a lamb that happened to be sitting on a pile of resources. But now, Sky City was a lion that could properly protect its resources.","The appearance of the Enlightenment World indicated that Endless Summer had evolved to Creation Breed, and Lin Yuan would no longer be able to check on it with True Data.","After absorbing the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core, Endless Summer was much more powerful than before.","Lin Yuan turned to look at the silver-haired old woman who dared not heal herself despite being seriously injured. Lin Yuan waved his hand, and a green pillar of light landed on the old woman to heal her injuries.","The silver-haired old woman suddenly found her wounded organs being healed by the green pillar of light to the point that she no longer felt any pain.","She gazed at Lin Yuan with gratitude as she thought,? He truly is the Moon Empress’ disciple! What magnanimity! Given his status, he could have let me off without healing me.","Talent and luck were things that one was born with, although it could also be said that power was the product of hard work.","However, this world was extremely pragmatic.","The disciples of rising factions were always more powerful than the disciples of regular families, while the disciples of veteran factions were always more powerful than the disciples of rising factions. One skilled disciple from a top faction should have no problems taking on four or five skilled disciples from veteran factions.","Power was what defined strength, but it was not representative of how worthy the person was of being respected.","Magnanimity and class were completely separate from power.","This young man seemed to be overflowing with magnanimity and benevolence. At the very least, he was a bright, kind, and calm person.","Nonetheless, he could also be someone who frequently did good deeds and would never stroke his ego.","Frankly, Lin Yuan did not think much of his decision to heal the old woman.","She never had any intention to attack Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath. Moreover, as much as the Kill Food Worm that had escaped had caused trouble for Endless Summer’s evolution to Creation Breed, the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow she had provided in compensation had also been of great help to Endless Summer.","It was extremely rare to find such a beneficial item at Endless Summer’s level.","The old woman was also willing to hand the Kill Food Worm over to Lin Yuan as a show of sincerity.","Lin Yuan was not an ungrateful person. But once he finished healing the old woman, he went back to watching Endless Summer.","Endless Summer had finished going through the Trial of World Creation. The Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core, the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire tree core, and Endless Summer’s original tree core surrounded Endless Summer’s branches.","It was clear that the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core had also become a part of Endless Summer’s triple-core cycle.","Lin Yuan held his breath as he waited for the Creation World Ley Line to arrive.","He had heard from the Moon Empress that feys would not be able to finish absorbing the World Cleansing and World Cleansing’s ley lines. A bit would be left that would fall to the ground and nourish the lifeforms that were present.","Naturally, Lin Yuan would not fight over Endless Summer’s Creation World Ley Line.","However, he intended on using the Pure Land of Bliss to collect the leftover Creation World Ley Line.","If he had not arrived, Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath would be dead, and the other lifeforms in the area would have also been turned into ash.","Now that he had arrived, every one of Endless Summer’s flowers contained concentrated vitality and plant energy.","The fallen flowers nourished the ground and benefited all the lifeforms present. Thus, Lin Yuan did not feel guilty at all about collecting the last vestiges of the World Creation Ley Line.","He had already injected the Source Sand deep into the ground and instructed it to dig a deep trench around Endless Summer for the Pure Land of Bliss to appear underground later.","Endless Summer, the Mother of Bloodbath, Mystic Moon, and the old woman had all seen what Lin Yuan had done.","The Mother of Bloodbath, Endless Summer, and Mystic Moon knew that he was Black.","It would be too ostentatious for the Pure Land of Bliss to appear aboveground, but it would be unnoticeable if it appeared under the Source Sand.","Both the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer had seen the Pure Land of Bliss, and it was fine if Mystic Moon also found out.","However, Lin Yuan did not want the silver-haired old woman to see because she was an outsider.","Lin Yuan did not know if the old woman would connect the Source Sand to Black, but he was not worried because even if she made the connection, she would never dare to spill his secret.","It was also likely that the old woman would take the initiative to shush other people who were suspicious of Lin Yuan’s identity for fear that she would be blamed for the leak.","It had taken a long time for Endless Summer to finish using the Trial of World Creation to temper the Enlightenment Law.","When Lin Yuan had arrived, the moon was still hanging high up in the sky. But now, the sun was rising in the east.","The golden rays lit up the horizon as the sun slowly rose toward the middle of the sky and consumed the last residual darkness.","At that moment, the Trial of World Creation Cloud dispersed to reveal a golden light brighter than the sun.","Lin Yuan felt that this golden light resembled a gold spine that seemed to be able to evolve the ley line of a mountain.","Lin Yuan knew that this was the Creation World Ley Line.","If the Creation World Ley Line was buried in a law world, the law world’s evolution would be improved.","Just as the golden ley line was about to descend on Endless Summer’s tree crown, Lin Yuan activated the Pure Land of Bliss.."]}]);
